n ötürü öldürüldüğü kendisine sorulduğu zaman;","indonesian":"karena dosa apa dia dibunuh?","french":"pour quel péché elle a été tuée.","german":"wegen welcher Sünde es getötet wurde,","bengali":"কি অপরাধে তাকে হত্যা করা হয়েছিল?","spanish":"por qué pecado las mataron,","malay":"Dengan dosa apakah ia dibunuh?","bosnian":"zbog kakve krivice je umorena,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/9"}},{"verse_key":"81:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha assuhufunushirat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the pages are spread [i.e., made public]","pickthall":"And when the pages are laid open,","yusuf_ali":"When the scrolls are laid open;","urdu":"اور جب اعمال نامے کھولے جائیں گے","turkish":"Amel defterleri açıldığı zaman;","indonesian":"Dan apabila lembaran-lembaran (catatan amal) telah dibuka lebar-lebar,","french":"Et quand les feuilles seront déployées,","german":"und wenn die Blätter aufgeschlagen werden","bengali":"যখন ‘আমলনামা উন্মোচিত হবে,","spanish":"cuando los registros [de las obras] sean repartidos,","malay":"Dan apabila surat-surat amal dibentangkan;","bosnian":"i kada se listovi razdijele,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/10"}},{"verse_key":"81:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha assamao kushitat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the sky is stripped away","pickthall":"And when the sky is torn away,","yusuf_ali":"When the world on High is unveiled;","urdu":"اور جب آسمان کا پردہ ہٹا دیا جائے گا،","turkish":"Gök yerinden oynatıldığı zaman;","indonesian":"dan apabila langit dilenyapkan,","french":"et le ciel écorché,","german":"und wenn der Himmel abgezogen wird","bengali":"যখন আকাশের আবরণ অপসারিত হবে,","spanish":"cuando la bóveda celeste desaparezca,","malay":"Dan apabila langit ditanggalkan dari tempatnya;","bosnian":"i kada se nebo ukloni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/11"}},{"verse_key":"81:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha aljaheemu suAAAAirat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when Hellfire is set ablaze","pickthall":"And when hell is lighted,","yusuf_ali":"When the Blazing Fire is kindled to fierce heat;","urdu":"اور جب جہنم دہکائی جائے گی","turkish":"Cehennem alevlendirildiği zaman;","indonesian":"dan apabila neraka Jahim dinyalakan,","french":"et la fournaise attisée,","german":"und wenn die Hölle angefacht wird","bengali":"জাহান্নামের আগুন যখন উদ্দীপিত করা হবে,","spanish":"cuando el fuego del Infierno sea avivado,","malay":"Dan apabila neraka dinyalakan menjulang;","bosnian":"i kada se Džehennem raspali,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/12"}},{"verse_key":"81:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجَنَّةُ أُزْلِفَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha aljannatu ozlifat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when Paradise is brought near,","pickthall":"And when the Garden is brought nigh,","yusuf_ali":"And when the Garden is brought near;-","urdu":"اور جب جنّت قریب لے آئی جائے گی،","turkish":"Cennet yaklaştırıldığı zaman;","indonesian":"dan apabila surga didekatkan,","french":"et le Paradis rapproché,","german":"und wenn der (Paradies)garten nahe herangebracht wird,","bengali":"এবং জান্নাত যখন নিকটর্বতী করা হবে,","spanish":"y cuando el Paraíso sea acercado.","malay":"Dan apabila Syurga didekatkan;","bosnian":"i kada se Džennet približi –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/13"}},{"verse_key":"81:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّآ أَحْضَرَتْ","transliteration":"AAalimat nafsun ma ahdarat","translations":{"sahih_international":"A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it].","pickthall":"(Then) every soul will know what it hath made ready.","yusuf_ali":"(Then) shall each soul know what it has put forward.","urdu":"اُس وقت ہر شخص کو معلوم ہو جائے گا کہ وہ کیا لے کر آیا ہے","turkish":"İnsanoğlu önceden ne hazırladığını görecektir.","indonesian":"setiap jiwa akan mengetahui apa yang telah dikerjakannya.","french":"chaque âme saura ce qu’elle a présenté.","german":"wird eine (jede) Seele erfahren, was sie vorgebracht hat.","bengali":"তখন প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তিই জানবে সে কি নিয়ে এসেছে।","spanish":"En ese momento sabrá cada alma el resultado de sus obras.","malay":"(Setelah semuanya itu berlaku), tiap-tiap orang akan mengetahui tentang amal yang telah dibawanya.","bosnian":"svako će saznati ono što je pripremio."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/14"}},{"verse_key":"81:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلْخُنَّسِ","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bilkhunnas","translations":{"sahih_international":"So I swear by the retreating stars -","pickthall":"Oh, but I call to witness the planets,","yusuf_ali":"So verily I call to witness the planets - that recede,","urdu":"پس نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں","turkish":"Gündüz sinip geceleri gözüken gezegenlere and olsun;","indonesian":"Aku bersumpah demi bintang-bintang,","french":"Non!... Je jure par les planètes qui gravitent,","german":"Nein! Ich schwöre bei den sich Verbergenden,","bengali":"কিন্তু না, আমি প্রত্যাবর্তনকারী তারকাপুঞ্জের শপথ করছি!","spanish":"Juro por los astros","malay":"Oleh itu, Aku bersumpah dengan bintang-bintang yang tenggelam timbul;","bosnian":"I kunem se zvijezdama – koje se skrivaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/15"}},{"verse_key":"81:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"ٱلْجَوَارِ ٱلْكُنَّسِ","transliteration":"Aljawari alkunnas","translations":{"sahih_international":"Those that run [their courses] and disappear [i.e., set]","pickthall":"The stars which rise and set,","yusuf_ali":"Go straight, or hide;","urdu":"پلٹنے اور چھپ جانے والے تاروں کی","turkish":"Gündüz sinip geceleri gözüken gezegenlere and olsun;","indonesian":"yang beredar dan terbenam,","french":"qui courent et disparaissent,","german":"den Dahinziehenden und sich wieder Zeigenden","bengali":"যা গতিশীল ও স্থিতিবান;","spanish":"que recorren sus órbitas,","malay":"Yang beredar, juga yang tetap pada tempatnya;","bosnian":"koje se kreću i iz vida gube,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/16"}},{"verse_key":"81:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا عَسْعَسَ","transliteration":"Wallayli itha AAasAAas","translations":{"sahih_international":"And by the night as it closes in","pickthall":"And the close of night,","yusuf_ali":"And the Night as it dissipates;","urdu":"اور رات کی جبکہ وہ رخصت ہوئی","turkish":"Kararmaya başlayan geceye and olsun;","indonesian":"demi malam apabila telah larut,","french":"par la nuit quand elle survient,","german":"und bei der Nacht, wenn sie anbricht,","bengali":"শপথ রাতের যখন ওর আবির্ভাব হয়,","spanish":"y [juro] por la noche cuando extiende su oscuridad,","malay":"Dan malam, apabila ia hampir habis,","bosnian":"i noći kad ona veo diže,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/17"}},{"verse_key":"81:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"وَٱلصُّبْحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ","transliteration":"Wassubhi ithatanaffas","translations":{"sahih_international":"And by the dawn when it breathes [i.e., stirs]","pickthall":"And the breath of morning","yusuf_ali":"And the Dawn as it breathes away the darkness;-","urdu":"اور صبح کی جبکہ اس نے سانس لیا،","turkish":"Ağarmaya başlayan sabaha and olsun ki,","indonesian":"dan demi subuh apabila telah menyinsing,","french":"et par l’aube quand elle exhale son souffle.","german":"und bei dem Morgen, wenn er Atem schöpft:","bengali":"আর উষার যখন ওর আবির্ভাব হয়,","spanish":"y [juro] por la mañana cuando extiende su luminosidad,","malay":"Dan siang, apabila ia mulai terang;","bosnian":"i zorom kada diše –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/18"}},{"verse_key":"81:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍ كَرِيمٍ","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlu rasoolin kareem","translations":{"sahih_international":"[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger [i.e., Gabriel]","pickthall":"That this is in truth the word of an honoured messenger,","yusuf_ali":"Verily this is the word of a most honourable Messenger,","urdu":"یہ فی الواقع ایک بزرگ پیغام بر کا قول ہے","turkish":"Bu Kuran, arşın sahibi katında değerli, güçlü, sözü dinlenen ve güvenilen şerefli bir elçinin getirdiği sözdür.","indonesian":"sesungguhnya (Alquran) itu benar-benar firman (Allah yang dibawa oleh) utusan yang mulia (Jibril),","french":"Ceci [le Coran] est la parole d’un noble Messager,","german":"Dies sind wahrlich die Worte eines edlen Gesandten,","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই এই কুরআন সম্মানিত বার্তাবহের আনীত বাণী।","spanish":"que [el Corán] es la palabra [de Dios transmitida] por un emisario noble,","malay":"Sebenarnya Al-Quran itu, sungguh-sungguh Kalamullah (yang disampaikan oleh Jibril) Utusan yang mulia,","bosnian":"Kur'an je, zaista, kazivanje Izaslanika plemenitog,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/19"}},{"verse_key":"81:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"ذِى قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِى ٱلْعَرْشِ مَكِينٍ","transliteration":"Thee quwwatin AAinda theealAAarshi makeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position],","pickthall":"Mighty, established in the presence of the Lord of the Throne,","yusuf_ali":"Endued with Power, with rank before the Lord of the Throne,","urdu":"جو بڑی توانائی رکھتا ہے، عرش والے کے ہاں بلند مرتبہ ہے","turkish":"Bu Kuran, arşın sahibi katında değerli, güçlü, sözü dinlenen ve güvenilen şerefli bir elçinin getirdiği sözdür.","indonesian":"yang memiliki kekuatan, memiliki kedudukan tinggi di sisi (Allah) yang memiliki Arasy,","french":"doué d’une grande force, et ayant un rang élevé auprès du Maitre du Trône,","german":"Besitzer von Kraft und beim Herrn des Thrones in Ansehen,","bengali":"যে সামর্থশালী, আরশের মালিকের নিকট মর্যাদাসম্পন্ন,","spanish":"dotado de poder y distinción ante el Señor del Trono.","malay":"Yang kuat gagah, lagi berkedudukan tinggi di sisi Allah yang mempunyai Arasy,","bosnian":"moćnog, od Gospodara Arša, cijenjenog."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/20"}},{"verse_key":"81:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"مُّطَاعٍ ثَمَّ أَمِينٍ","transliteration":"MutaAAin thamma ameen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy.","pickthall":"(One) to be obeyed, and trustworthy;","yusuf_ali":"With authority there, (and) faithful to his trust.","urdu":"وہاں اُس کا حکم مانا جاتا ہے، وہ بااعتماد ہے۔","turkish":"Bu Kuran, arşın sahibi katında değerli, güçlü, sözü dinlenen ve güvenilen şerefli bir elçinin getirdiği sözdür.","indonesian":"yang di sana (di alam malaikat) ditaati dan dipercaya.","french":"obéi, là-haut, et digne de confiance.","german":"dem man dort gehorcht und (der) vertrauenswürdig (ist).","bengali":"যাকে সেখানে মান্য করা হয় এবং যে বিশ্বাসভাজন।","spanish":"El obedecido [por otros ángeles] y el digno confidente [de la revelación].","malay":"Yang ditaati di sana (dalam kalangan malaikat), lagi dipercayai.","bosnian":"kome se drugi potčinjavaju, tamo pouzdanog!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/21"}},{"verse_key":"81:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجْنُونٍ","transliteration":"Wama sahibukum bimajnoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And your companion [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ) ] is not [at all] mad.","pickthall":"And your comrade is not mad.","yusuf_ali":"And (O people!) your companion is not one possessed;","urdu":"اور (اے اہلِ مکّہ) تمہارا رفیق مجنون نہیں ہے","turkish":"Arkadaşınız (Muhammed) asla deli değildir.","indonesian":"Dan temanmu (Muhammad) itu bukanlah orang gila.","french":"Votre compagnon (Mohammed) n’est nullement fou.","german":"Und euer Gefährte ist kein Besessener.","bengali":"এবং তোমাদের সহচর উন্মাদ নয়,","spanish":"[Sabed que] su compañero [el profeta Muhámmad] no es un loco,","malay":"Dan sebenarnya sahabat kamu (Nabi Muhammad) itu (wahai golongan yang menentang Islam), bukanlah ia seorang gila (seperti yang kamu tuduh);","bosnian":"A drug vaš nije lud:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/22"}},{"verse_key":"81:23","ayah":23,"arabic":"وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ بِٱلْأُفُقِ ٱلْمُبِينِ","transliteration":"Walaqad raahu bilofuqialmubeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And he has already seen him [i.e., Gabriel] in the clear horizon.","pickthall":"Surely he beheld Him on the clear horizon.","yusuf_ali":"And without doubt he saw him in the clear horizon.","urdu":"اُس نے اُس پیغام بر کو روشن اُفق پر دیکھا ہے۔","turkish":"And olsun ki, o, Cebrail'i apaçık ufukta görmüştür.","indonesian":"Dan sungguh, dia (Muhammad) telah melihatnya (Jibril) di ufuk yang terang.","french":"Il l’a effectivement vu (Gabriel), au clair horizon,","german":"Er hat ihn ja am deutlichen Gesichtskreis gesehen,","bengali":"সেতো তাকে স্পষ্ট দিগন্তে অবলোকন করেছে।","spanish":"lo vio [al ángel Gabriel] en el horizonte claro,","malay":"Dan (Nabi Muhammad yakin bahawa yang disampaikan kepadanya ialah wahyu dari Tuhan, kerana) demi sesungguhnya! Nabi Muhammad telah mengenal dan melihat Jibril di kaki langit yang nyata.","bosnian":"on ga je na obzorju jasnom vidio"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081023.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/23"}},{"verse_key":"81:24","ayah":24,"arabic":"وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلْغَيْبِ بِضَنِينٍ","transliteration":"Wama huwa AAala alghaybi bidaneen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen.","pickthall":"And he is not avid of the Unseen.","yusuf_ali":"Neither doth he withhold grudgingly a knowledge of the Unseen.","urdu":"اور وہ غَیب (کے اِس علم کو لوگوں تک پہنچانے) کے معاملہ میں بخیل نہیں ہے۔","turkish":"Peygamber, görülmeyenler hakkında söylediklerinden ötürü töhmet altında tutulamaz.","indonesian":"Dan Dia (Muhammad) bukanlah seorang yang kikir (enggan) untuk menerangkan yang gaib.","french":"et il ne garde pas avarement pour lui-même ce qui lui a été révélé.","german":"und er hält nicht aus Geiz das Verborgene zurück.","bengali":"সে অদৃশ্য বিষয় সম্পর্কে বর্ণনা করতে কার্পন্য করেনা।","spanish":"no oculta nada de lo que le fue revelado.","malay":"Dan bukanlah Nabi Muhammad seorang yang boleh dituduh dan disangka buruk, terhadap penyampaiannya mengenai perkara-perkara yang ghaib.","bosnian":"i, kada je u pitanju Objava, on nije škrt"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081024.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/24"}},{"verse_key":"81:25","ayah":25,"arabic":"وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَيْطَـٰنٍ رَّجِيمٍ","transliteration":"Wama huwa biqawli shaytaninrajeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"And it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].","pickthall":"Nor is this the utterance of a devil worthy to be stoned.","yusuf_ali":"Nor is it the word of an evil spirit accursed.","urdu":"اور یہ کسی شیطان ِ مردُود کا قول نہیں ہے۔","turkish":"Bu Kuran, kovulmuş şeytanın sözü olamaz.","indonesian":"Dan (Alquran) itu bukanlah perkataan setan yang terkutuk,","french":"Et ceci [le Coran] n’est point la parole d’un diable banni.","german":"Und es sind nicht die Worte eines gesteinigten Satans.","bengali":"এবং ইহা অভিশপ্ত শাইতানের বাক্য নয়।","spanish":"[El Corán] no es la palabra de un demonio maldito.","malay":"Dan sebenarnya Al-Quran itu bukanlah perkataan Syaitan yang kena rejam.","bosnian":"i Kur'an nije prokletog šejtana govor,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081025.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/25"}},{"verse_key":"81:26","ayah":26,"arabic":"فَأَيْنَ تَذْهَبُونَ","transliteration":"Faayna tathhaboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"So where are you going?","pickthall":"Whither then go ye?","yusuf_ali":"When whither go ye?","urdu":"پھر تم لوگ کدھر چلے جا رہے ہو؟","turkish":"Nereye gidiyorsunuz?","indonesian":"maka ke manakah kamu akan pergi?","french":"Où allez-vous donc.","german":"Wo geht ihr denn hin?","bengali":"সুতরাং তোমরা কোথায় চলেছ?","spanish":"¿A dónde iréis [con ese argumento]?","malay":"(Dengan yang demikian) maka ke manakah kamu hendak pergi (kiranya kamu masih menyeleweng dari jalan Al-Quran)?","bosnian":"pa kuda onda idete?!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081026.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/26"}},{"verse_key":"81:27","ayah":27,"arabic":"إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"In huwa illa thikrun lilAAalameen","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is not except a reminder to the worlds","pickthall":"This is naught else than a reminder unto creation,","yusuf_ali":"Verily this is no less than a Message to (all) the Worlds:","urdu":"یہ تو سارے جہان والوں کے لیے ایک نصیحت ہے","turkish":"Kuran, ancak aranızda doğru yola girmeyi dileyene ve alemlere bir öğüttür.","indonesian":"(Alquran) itu tidak lain adalah peringatan bagi seluruh alam,","french":"Ceci n’est qu’un rappel pour l’univers,","german":"Es ist nur eine Ermahnung für die Weltenbewohner,","bengali":"এটাতো শুধু বিশ্বজগতের জন্য উপদেশ –","spanish":"[El Corán] es un Mensaje para toda la humanidad,","malay":"Al-Quran itu tidak lain hanyalah peringatan bagi seluruh penduduk alam:","bosnian":"Kur'an je samo pouka svjetovima,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081027.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/27"}},{"verse_key":"81:28","ayah":28,"arabic":"لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمْ أَن يَسْتَقِيمَ","transliteration":"Liman shaa minkum an yastaqeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course.","pickthall":"Unto whomsoever of you willeth to walk straight.","yusuf_ali":"(With profit) to whoever among you wills to go straight:","urdu":"تم میں سے ہر اُس شخص کے لیے جو راہِ راست پر چلنا چاہتا ہو۔","turkish":"Kuran, ancak aranızda doğru yola girmeyi dileyene ve alemlere bir öğüttür.","indonesian":"(yaitu) bagi siapa di antara kamu yang menghendaki menempuh jalan yang lurus.","french":"pour celui d’entre vous qui veut suivre le chemin droit.","german":"für jemanden von euch, der sich recht verhalten will.","bengali":"তোমাদের মধ্যে যে সরল পথে চলতে চায় তার জন্য।","spanish":"para que se encamine quien quiera.","malay":"Iaitu bagi sesiapa dari kamu yang mahu tetap teguh di atas jalan (Islam) yang betul.","bosnian":"onome od vas koji hoće da je na Pravome putu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081028.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/28"}},{"verse_key":"81:29","ayah":29,"arabic":"وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"Wama tashaoona illa anyashaa Allahu rabbu alAAalameen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you do not will except that Allāh wills - Lord of the worlds.","pickthall":"And ye will not, unless (it be) that Allah willeth, the Lord of Creation.","yusuf_ali":"But ye shall not will except as Allah wills,- the Cherisher of the Worlds.","urdu":"اور تمہارے چاہنے سے کچھ نہیں ہوتا جب تک اللہ ربّ العالمین نہ چاہے۔","turkish":"Alemlerin Rabbi olan Allah dilemedikçe sizler bir şey dileyemezsiniz.","indonesian":"Dan kamu tidak dapat menghendaki (menempuh jalan itu) kecuali apabila dikehendaki Allah, Tuhan seluruh alam.","french":"Mais vous ne pouvez vouloir, que si Dieu veut, [Lui], le Seigneur de l’Univers.","german":"Und ihr könnt nicht wollen, außer daß Allah will, (Er), der Herr der Weltenbewohner.","bengali":"তোমরা ইচ্ছা করবেনা, যদি জগতসমূহের রাব্ব আল্লাহ ইচ্ছা না করেন।","spanish":"Pero sabed que solo se encaminará quien quiera Dios, Señor del universo.","malay":"Dan kamu tidak dapat menentukan kemahuan kamu (mengenai sesuatupun), kecuali dengan cara yang diatur oleh Allah, Tuhan yang memelihara dan mentadbirkan seluruh alam.","bosnian":"a vi ne možete ništa htjeti ako to Allah, Gospodar svjetova, neće!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/081029.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/81/29"}}]}},{"number":82,"data":{"surah":{"number":82,"name_arabic":"الإنفطار","name_english":"Al-Infitar","name_translation":"The Cleaving","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":82,"verses_count":19,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/082.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/082.mp3"}],"total_verses":19,"verses":[{"verse_key":"82:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنفَطَرَتْ","transliteration":"Itha assamao infatarat","translations":{"sahih_international":"When the sky breaks apart","pickthall":"When the heaven is cleft asunder,","yusuf_ali":"When the Sky is cleft asunder;","urdu":"جب آسمان پھٹ جائے گا","turkish":"Gök yarıldığı zaman,","indonesian":"Apabila langit terbelah,","french":"Quand le ciel se rompra,","german":"Wenn der Himmel zerbricht","bengali":"আকাশ যখন বিদীর্ণ হবে,","spanish":"Cuando el cielo se rompa,","malay":"Apabila langit terbelah;","bosnian":"Kada se nebo rascijepi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/1"}},{"verse_key":"82:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْكَوَاكِبُ ٱنتَثَرَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha alkawakibu intatharat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the stars fall, scattering,","pickthall":"When the planets are dispersed,","yusuf_ali":"When the Stars are scattered;","urdu":"اور جب تارے بکھر جائیں گے","turkish":"Yıldızlar dağılıp döküldüğü zaman,","indonesian":"dan apabila bintang-bintang jatuh berserakan,","french":"et que les étoiles se disperseront,","german":"und wenn die Sterne sich zerstreuen","bengali":"যখন নক্ষত্রমন্ডলী বিক্ষিপ্তভাবে ঝরে পড়বে,","spanish":"cuando los planetas salgan de sus órbitas,","malay":"Dan apabila bintang-bintang gugur bertaburan;","bosnian":"i kada zvijezde popadaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/2"}},{"verse_key":"82:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha albiharu fujjirat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the seas are erupted","pickthall":"When the seas are poured forth,","yusuf_ali":"When the Oceans are suffered to burst forth;","urdu":"اور جب سمندر پھاڑ دیے جائیں گے،","turkish":"Denizler kaynaştığı zaman,","indonesian":"dan apabila lautan dijadikan meluap,","french":"et que les mers confondront leurs eaux,","german":"und wenn die Meere gesprengt werden","bengali":"যখন সমুদ্র উদ্বেলিত হবে,","spanish":"cuando los mares se desborden","malay":"Dan apabila lautan pecah bercampur-baur;","bosnian":"i kada se mora jedna u druga uliju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/3"}},{"verse_key":"82:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْقُبُورُ بُعْثِرَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha alqubooru buAAthirat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the [contents of] graves are scattered [i.e., exposed],","pickthall":"And the sepulchres are overturned,","yusuf_ali":"And when the Graves are turned upside down;-","urdu":"اور جب قبریں کھول دی جائیں گی،","turkish":"Kabirlerin içi dışa çıktığı zaman,","indonesian":"dan apabila kuburan-kuburan dibongkar,","french":"et que les tombeaux seront bouleversés,","german":"und wenn die Gräber durchwühlt werden,","bengali":"এবং যখন কাবরসমূহ সমুত্থিত হবে;","spanish":"y cuando las tumbas se abran.","malay":"Dan apabila kubur-kubur dibongkarkan, -","bosnian":"i kada se grobovi ispreturaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/4"}},{"verse_key":"82:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّا قَدَّمَتْ وَأَخَّرَتْ","transliteration":"AAalimat nafsun ma qaddamatwaakhkharat","translations":{"sahih_international":"A soul will [then] know what it has put forth and kept back.","pickthall":"A soul will know what it hath sent before (it) and what left behind.","yusuf_ali":"(Then) shall each soul know what it hath sent forward and (what it hath) kept back.","urdu":"اُس وقت ہر شخص کو اُس کا اگلا پچھلا سب کیا دھرا معلوم ہو جائے گا۔","turkish":"İnsanoğlu, ne yaptığını ve ne yapmadığını görür.","indonesian":"(maka) setiap jiwa akan mengetahui apa yang telah dikerjakan dan yang dilalaikan(nya).","french":"toute âme saura alors ce qu’elle a accompli et ce qu’elle a remis de faire à plus tard.","german":"wird eine (jede) Seele erfahren, was sie vorausgeschickt und zurückgestellt hat.","bengali":"যখন প্রত্যেকে যা পূর্বে প্রেরণ করেছে এবং পশ্চাতে পরিত্যাগ করেছে তা পরিজ্ঞাত হবে।","spanish":"En ese momento sabrá cada alma lo que hizo de bien y de mal.","malay":"(Setelah semuanya itu berlaku), tiap-tiap orang akan mengetahui apa yang telah dikerjakan dan ditinggalkannya.","bosnian":"svako će saznati šta je pripremio, a šta je propustio."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/5"}},{"verse_key":"82:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ ٱلْكَرِيمِ","transliteration":"Ya ayyuha al-insanu magharraka birabbika alkareem","translations":{"sahih_international":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous,","pickthall":"O man! What hath made thee careless concerning thy Lord, the Bountiful,","yusuf_ali":"O man! What has seduced thee from thy Lord Most Beneficent?-","urdu":"اے انسان، کس چیز نے تجھے اپنے اُس رب کریم کی طرف سے دھوکے میں ڈال دیا","turkish":"Ey insanoğlu! Seni yaratıp sonra şekil veren, düzenleyen, mütenasip kılan, istediği şekilde seni terkip eden, çok cömert olan Rabbine karşı seni aldatan nedir?","indonesian":"Wahai manusia! Apakah yang telah memperdayakan kamu (berbuat durhaka) terhadap Tuhanmu Yang Maha Pengasih.","french":"Ô homme ! Qu’est-ce qui t’a trompé au sujet de ton Seigneur, le Noble,","german":"O Mensch, was hat dich hinsichtlich deines edelmütigen Herrn getäuscht,","bengali":"হে মানুষ! কিসে তোমাকে তোমার মহান রাব্ব (আল্লাহ) হতে প্রতারিত করল?","spanish":"¡Oh, seres humanos! ¿Qué fue lo que os engañó para que os apartarais de vuestro Señor Generoso?","malay":"Wahai manusia! Apakah yang memperdayakanmu - (berlaku derhaka) kepada Tuhanmu yang Maha Pemurah? -","bosnian":"O čovječe, zašto da te obmanjuje to što je Gospodar tvoj plemenit,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/6"}},{"verse_key":"82:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّىٰكَ فَعَدَلَكَ","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqaka fasawwakafaAAadalak","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who created you, proportioned you, and balanced you?","pickthall":"Who created thee, then fashioned, then proportioned thee?","yusuf_ali":"Him Who created thee. Fashioned thee in due proportion, and gave thee a just bias;","urdu":"جس نے تجھے پیدا کیا، تجھے نک سک سے درست کیا، تجھے متناسب بنایا","turkish":"Ey insanoğlu! Seni yaratıp sonra şekil veren, düzenleyen, mütenasip kılan, istediği şekilde seni terkip eden, çok cömert olan Rabbine karşı seni aldatan nedir?","indonesian":"Yang telah menciptakanmu lalu menyempurnakan kejadianmu dan menjadikan (susunan tubuh)mu seimbang,","french":"qui t’a créé, puis modelé et constitué harmonieusement ?","german":"Der dich erschaffen und da(bei) zurechtgeformt und wohlgebildet gemacht hat,","bengali":"যিনি তোমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর তোমাকে সুঠাম করেছেন এবং অতঃপর সুবিন্যস্ত করেছেন,","spanish":"Quien os creó, os dio forma y una conformación armoniosa,","malay":"Tuhan yang telah mencipta dan mengatur kejadianmu, lalu menjadikan anggotamu sesuai (dengan tujuan yang kerananya anggota itu diadakan), serta menjadikan (binaan tubuh badanmu) sama padan dengan kekuatannya;","bosnian":"koji te je stvorio – pa učinio da si skladan i da si uspravan –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/7"}},{"verse_key":"82:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"فِىٓ أَىِّ صُورَةٍ مَّا شَآءَ رَكَّبَكَ","transliteration":"Fee ayyi sooratin ma shaarakkabak","translations":{"sahih_international":"In whatever form He willed has He assembled you.","pickthall":"Into whatsoever form He will, He casteth thee.","yusuf_ali":"In whatever Form He wills, does He put thee together.","urdu":"اور جس صورت میں چاہا تجھ کو جوڑ کر تیار کیا؟","turkish":"Ey insanoğlu! Seni yaratıp sonra şekil veren, düzenleyen, mütenasip kılan, istediği şekilde seni terkip eden, çok cömert olan Rabbine karşı seni aldatan nedir?","indonesian":"dalam bentuk apa saja yang dikehendaki, Dia menyusun tubuhmu.","french":"Il t’a façonné dans la forme qu’Il a voulue.","german":"und dich, in welcher Gestalt Er wollte, zusammengefügt hat?","bengali":"যে আকৃতিতে চেয়েছেন, তিনি তোমাকে গঠন করেছেন।","spanish":"y os dio la más hermosa figura que quiso.","malay":"Dalam bentuk dan rupa apa sahaja yang dikehendakiNya, Ia menyusun kejadianmu.","bosnian":"i kakav je htio lik ti dao?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/8"}},{"verse_key":"82:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"كَلَّا بَلْ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Kalla bal tukaththiboona biddeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! But you deny the Recompense.","pickthall":"Nay, but ye deny the Judgment.","yusuf_ali":"Nay! But ye do reject Right and Judgment!","urdu":"ہر گز نہیں، بلکہ (اصل بات یہ ہے کہ) تم لوگ جزا و سزا کو جھُٹلاتے ہو،","turkish":"Hayır, hayır; doğrusu siz dini yalanlıyorsunuz.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali jangan begitu! Bahkan kamu mendustakan hari pembalasan.","french":"Non...! [malgré tout] vous traitez la Rétribution de mensonge;","german":"Keineswegs! Vielmehr erklärt ihr das Gericht für Lüge.","bengali":"না, কখনই না, তোমরাতো শেষ বিচারকে অস্বীকার করে থাকো;","spanish":"Pero aun así desmentís el Día del Juicio.","malay":"Sebenarnya tidak ada yang memperdayakan kamu (hai golongan yang ingkar)! Bahkan kamu sendiri tidak percayakan adanya hari pembalasan.","bosnian":"A ne valja tako! Vi u Sudnji dan ne vjerujete,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/9"}},{"verse_key":"82:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكُمْ لَحَـٰفِظِينَ","transliteration":"Wa-inna AAalaykum lahafitheen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And indeed, [appointed] over you are keepers,","pickthall":"Lo! there are above you guardians,","yusuf_ali":"But verily over you (are appointed angels) to protect you,-","urdu":"حالانکہ تم پر نگراں مقرر ہیں","turkish":"Oysa, yaptıklarınızı bilen değerli yazıcılar sizi gözetlemektedirler.","indonesian":"Dan sesungguhnya bagi kamu ada (malaikat-malaikat) yang mengawasi (pekerjaanmu),","french":"alors que veillent sur vous des gardiens,","german":"Über euch sind wahrlich Hüter (eingesetzt),","bengali":"অবশ্যই রয়েছে তোমাদের উপর সংরক্ষকগণ;","spanish":"Hay ángeles que registran vuestras obras,","malay":"Padahal sesungguhnya, ada malaikat-malaikat yang menjaga dan mengawas segala bawaan kamu,","bosnian":"a nad vama bdiju čuvari,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/10"}},{"verse_key":"82:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"كِرَامًا كَـٰتِبِينَ","transliteration":"Kiraman katibeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Noble and recording;","pickthall":"Generous and recording,","yusuf_ali":"Kind and honourable,- Writing down (your deeds):","urdu":"ایسے معزز کاتب","turkish":"Oysa, yaptıklarınızı bilen değerli yazıcılar sizi gözetlemektedirler.","indonesian":"yang mulia (di sisi Allah) dan yang mencatat (perbuatanmu),","french":"de nobles scribes,","german":"edle, die (alles) aufschreiben","bengali":"সম্মানিত লেখকবর্গ;","spanish":"nobles escribas","malay":"(Mereka adalah makhluk) yang mulia (di sisi Allah), lagi ditugaskan menulis (amal-amal kamu);","bosnian":"kod Nas cijenjeni pisari,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/11"}},{"verse_key":"82:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"YaAAlamoona ma tafAAaloon","translations":{"sahih_international":"They know whatever you do.","pickthall":"Who know (all) that ye do.","yusuf_ali":"They know (and understand) all that ye do.","urdu":"جو تمہارے ہر فعل کو جانتے ہیں۔","turkish":"Oysa, yaptıklarınızı bilen değerli yazıcılar sizi gözetlemektedirler.","indonesian":"mereka mengetahui apa yang kamu kerjakan.","french":"qui savent ce que vous faites.","german":"und die wissen, was ihr tut.","bengali":"তারা অবগত হয় যা তোমরা কর।","spanish":"que saben lo que hacéis.","malay":"Mereka mengetahui apa yang kamu lakukan.","bosnian":"koji znaju ono što radite."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/12"}},{"verse_key":"82:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍ","transliteration":"Inna al-abrara lafee naAAeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure,","pickthall":"Lo! the righteous verily will be in delight.","yusuf_ali":"As for the Righteous, they will be in bliss;","urdu":"یقیناً نیک لوگ مزے میں ہوں گے","turkish":"İyiler şüphesiz nimet içindedirler.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar berada dalam (surga yang penuh) kenikmatan,","french":"Les bons seront, certes, dans un [jardin] de délice,","german":"Die Frommen werden wahrlich in Wonne sein.","bengali":"পুণ্যবানগণতো থাকবে পরম সুখ সম্পদে;","spanish":"Los piadosos disfrutarán delicias [en esta vida y en el Paraíso],","malay":"(Gunanya catitan malaikat-malaikat itu ialah: untuk menyatakan siapa yang berbakti dan siapa yang bersalah) - kerana sesungguhnya: orang-orang yang berbakti (dengan taat dan amal kebajikan), tetap berada dalam Syurga yang penuh nikmat;","bosnian":"Čestiti će, sigurno, u Džennet,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/13"}},{"verse_key":"82:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ ٱلْفُجَّارَ لَفِى جَحِيمٍ","transliteration":"Wa-inna alfujjara lafee jaheem","translations":{"sahih_international":"And indeed, the wicked will be in Hellfire.","pickthall":"And lo! the wicked verily will be in hell;","yusuf_ali":"And the Wicked - they will be in the Fire,","urdu":"اور بے شک بدکار لوگ جہنم میں جائیں گے","turkish":"Allah'ın buyruğundan çıkanlar cehennemdedirler.","indonesian":"dan sesungguhnya orang-orang yang durhaka benar-benar berada dalam neraka.","french":"et les libertins seront, certes, dans une fournaise,","german":"Und die Sittenlosen werden wahrlich in einem Höllenbrand sein,","bengali":"এবং দুস্কর্মকারীরা থাকবে জাহান্নামে;","spanish":"mientras que los pecadores, en cambio, sufrirán tormento [en esta vida y en la otra],","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya orang-orang yang bersalah, bertempat dalam neraka yang menjulang-julang.","bosnian":"a grješnici, sigurno, u Džehennem,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/14"}},{"verse_key":"82:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Yaslawnaha yawma addeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"They will [enter to] burn therein on the Day of Recompense,","pickthall":"They will burn therein on the Day of Judgment,","yusuf_ali":"Which they will enter on the Day of Judgment,","urdu":"جزا کے دن وہ اس میں داخل ہوں گے","turkish":"Din Günü oraya girerler.","indonesian":"Mereka masuk ke dalamnya pada hari pembalasan.","french":"où ils brûleront, le jour de la Rétribution,","german":"dem sie am Tag des Gerichts ausgesetzt werden","bengali":"তারা কর্মফল দিনে তাতে প্রবিষ্ট হবে;","spanish":"y arderán en el Infierno desde el Día del Juicio,","malay":"Mereka menderita bakaran neraka itu pada hari pembalasan,","bosnian":"na Sudnjem danu u njemu će gorjeti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/15"}},{"verse_key":"82:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"وَمَا هُمْ عَنْهَا بِغَآئِبِينَ","transliteration":"Wama hum AAanha bigha-ibeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And never therefrom will they be absent.","pickthall":"And will not be absent thence.","yusuf_ali":"And they will not be able to keep away therefrom.","urdu":"اور اُس سے ہرگز غائب نہ ہو سکیں گے","turkish":"Oradan bir daha ayrılamazlar.","indonesian":"Dan mereka tidak mungkin keluar dari neraka itu.","french":"incapables de s’en échapper.","german":"und dem sie nicht abwesend sein werden.","bengali":"তারা ওটা হতে অন্তর্হিত হতে পারবেনা।","spanish":"del que no podrán salir.","malay":"Dan mereka (sentiasa berada dalam azab seksanya), tidak ghaib daripadanya.","bosnian":"i više iz njega neće izvedeni biti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/16"}},{"verse_key":"82:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma yawmu addeeni","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Day of Judgment is!","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what the Day of Judgment is?","urdu":"اور تم کیا جانتے ہو کہ وہ جزا کا دن کیا ہے؟","turkish":"Din gününün ne olduğunu sen nereden bilirsin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah hari pembalasan itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est le jour de la Rétribution ?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was der Tag des Gerichts ist?","bengali":"কর্মফল দিন কি তা কি তুমি জান?","spanish":"¿Qué te hará comprender todo lo que sucederá el Día de la Retribución?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui kedahsyatan hari pembalasan itu?","bosnian":"A znaš li ti šta je Sudnji dan,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/17"}},{"verse_key":"82:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"ثُمَّ مَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Thumma ma adraka mayawmu addeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then, what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?","pickthall":"Again, what will convey unto thee what the Day of Judgment is!","yusuf_ali":"Again, what will explain to thee what the Day of Judgment is?","urdu":"ہاں، تمہیں کیا خبر کہ وہ جزا کا دن کیا ہے؟","turkish":"Evet, din gününün ne olduğunu nereden bileceksin?","indonesian":"Sekali lagi, tahukah kamu apakah hari pembalasan itu?","french":"Encore une fois, qui te dira ce qu’est le jour de la Rétribution ?","german":"Abermals: Was läßt dich wissen, was der Tag des Gerichts ist?","bengali":"আবার বলিঃ কর্মফল দিন কি তা কি তুমি অবগত আছ?","spanish":"[¡Reflexiona!] ¿Qué te hará comprender todo lo que sucederá el Día de la Retribución?","malay":"Sekali lagi, apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui kedahsyatan hari pembalasan itu?","bosnian":"i još jednom: znaš li ti šta je Sudnji dan?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/18"}},{"verse_key":"82:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"يَوْمَ لَا تَمْلِكُ نَفْسٌ لِّنَفْسٍ شَيْـًٔا ۖ وَٱلْأَمْرُ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"Yawma la tamliku nafsun linafsinshay-an wal-amru yawma-ithin lillah","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is the Day when a soul will not possess for another soul [power to do] a thing; and the command, that Day, is [entirely] with Allāh.","pickthall":"A day on which no soul hath power at all for any (other) soul. The (absolute) command on that day is Allah's.","yusuf_ali":"(It will be) the Day when no soul shall have power (to do) aught for another: For the command, that Day, will be (wholly) with Allah.","urdu":"یہ وہ دن ہے جب کسی شخص کے لیے کچھ کرنا کسی کے بس میں نہ ہوگا، فیصلہ اُس دن بالکل اللہ کے اختیار میں ہوگا","turkish":"O gün, kimsenin kimseye hiçbir fayda sağlamayacağı bir gündür. O gün buyruk, yalnız Allah'ındır.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) pada hari (ketika) seseorang sama sekali tidak berdaya (menolong) orang lain. Dan segala urusan pada hari itu dalam kekuasaan Allah.","french":"Le jour où aucune âme ne pourra rien en faveur d’une autre âme. Et ce jour-là, le commandement sera à Allah.","german":"Am Tag, da keine Seele für eine (andere) Seele etwas (auszurichten) vermag; und der Befehl wird an jenem Tag Allah (allein) zustehen.","bengali":"সেদিন একের অপরের জন্য কিছু করার সামর্থ্য থাকবেনা; এবং সেদিন সমস্ত কর্তৃত্ব হবে একমাত্র আল্লাহর।","spanish":"Ese día nadie podrá hacer nada por nadie, porque será Dios Quien decida.","malay":"(Hari itu ialah) hari seseorang tidak dapat memberikan pertolongan sedikitpun kepada orang lain, dan segala urusan pada hari itu tertentu bagi Allah.","bosnian":"Dan kada niko nikome neće moći nimalo pomoći, toga Dana će vlast jedino Allah imati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/082019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/82/19"}}]}},{"number":83,"data":{"surah":{"number":83,"name_arabic":"المطففين","name_english":"Al-Mutaffifin","name_translation":"The Defrauding","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":86,"verses_count":36,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/083.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/083.mp3"}],"total_verses":36,"verses":[{"verse_key":"83:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَيْلٌ لِّلْمُطَفِّفِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun lilmutaffifeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Woe to those who give less [than due],","pickthall":"Woe unto the defrauders:","yusuf_ali":"Woe to those that deal in fraud,-","urdu":"تباہی ہے ڈنڈی مارنے والوں کے لیے۔","turkish":"İnsanlardan, kendileri bir şeyi ölçerek aldıkları zaman tam alan; ama onlara bir şeyi ölçüp tartarak verdiklerinde eksik tutan kimselerin, vay haline!","indonesian":"Celakalah bagi orang-orang yang curang (dalam menakar dan menimbang)!","french":"Malheur aux fraudeurs,","german":"Wehe den das Maß Kürzenden,","bengali":"মন্দ পরিণাম তাদের জন্য যারা মাপে কম দেয়,","spanish":"¡Ay de los tramposos!","malay":"Kecelakaan besar bagi orang-orang yang curang (dalam timbangan dan sukatan),","bosnian":"Teško onima koji pri mjerenju zakidaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/1"}},{"verse_key":"83:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ إِذَا ٱكْتَالُوا۟ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ يَسْتَوْفُونَ","transliteration":"Allatheena itha iktalooAAala annasi yastawfoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full.","pickthall":"Those who when they take the measure from mankind demand it full,","yusuf_ali":"Those who, when they have to receive by measure from men, exact full measure,","urdu":"جن کا حال یہ ہے کہ جب لوگوں سے لیتے ہیں تو پورا پورا لیتے ہیں","turkish":"İnsanlardan, kendileri bir şeyi ölçerek aldıkları zaman tam alan; ama onlara bir şeyi ölçüp tartarak verdiklerinde eksik tutan kimselerin, vay haline!","indonesian":"(yaitu) orang-orang yang apabila menerima takaran dari orang lain mereka minta dicukupkan,","french":"qui, lorsqu’ils font mesurer pour eux-mêmes exigent la pleine mesure,","german":"die, wenn sie sich von den Menschen zumessen lassen, sich volles Maß geben lassen,","bengali":"যারা লোকের নিকট হতে মেপে নেয়ার সময় পূর্ণ মাত্রায় গ্রহণ করে।","spanish":"Que cuando compran exigen el peso exacto,","malay":"Iaitu mereka yang apabila menerima sukatan (gantang cupak) dari orang lain mereka mengambilnya dengan cukup,","bosnian":"koji punu mjeru uzimaju kada od drugih kupuju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/2"}},{"verse_key":"83:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَإِذَا كَالُوهُمْ أَو وَّزَنُوهُمْ يُخْسِرُونَ","transliteration":"Wa-itha kaloohum aw wazanoohumyukhsiroon","translations":{"sahih_international":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss.","pickthall":"But if they measure unto them or weight for them, they cause them loss.","yusuf_ali":"But when they have to give by measure or weight to men, give less than due.","urdu":"اور جب ان کو ناپ کو یا تول کر دیتے ہیں تو انہیں گھاٹا دیتے ہیں۔","turkish":"İnsanlardan, kendileri bir şeyi ölçerek aldıkları zaman tam alan; ama onlara bir şeyi ölçüp tartarak verdiklerinde eksik tutan kimselerin, vay haline!","indonesian":"dan apabila mereka menakar atau menimbang (untuk orang lain), mereka mengurangi.","french":"et qui lorsqu’eux-mêmes mesurent ou pèsent pour les autres, [leur] causent perte.","german":"wenn sie ihnen aber zumessen oder wägen, Verlust zufügen.","bengali":"এবং যখন তাদের জন্য মেপে অথবা ওজন করে দেয় তখন কম দেয়।","spanish":"pero cuando venden hacen trampa [dando menos] en el peso y la medida.","malay":"Dan (sebaliknya) apabila mereka menyukat atau menimbang untuk orang lain, mereka kurangi.","bosnian":"a kada drugima mjere na litar ili na kantar – zakidaju."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/3"}},{"verse_key":"83:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"أَلَا يَظُنُّ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَنَّهُم مَّبْعُوثُونَ","transliteration":"Ala yathunnu ola-ikaannahum mabAAoothoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected","pickthall":"Do such (men) not consider that they will be raised again","yusuf_ali":"Do they not think that they will be called to account?-","urdu":"کیا یہ لوگ نہیں سمجھتے کہ ایک بڑے دن","turkish":"Bunlar, büyük bir günde tekrar dirileceklerini sanmıyorlar mı?","indonesian":"Tidakkah mereka itu mengira, bahwa sesungguhnya mereka akan dibangkitkan,","french":"Ceux-là ne pensent-ils pas qu’ils seront ressuscités,","german":"Glauben jene nicht, daß sie auferweckt werden","bengali":"তারা কি চিন্তা করেনা যে, তারা পুনরুত্থিত হবে,","spanish":"¿Acaso no saben que serán resucitados?","malay":"Tidakkah mereka menyangka bahawa mereka akan dibangkitkan (hidup semula sesudah mati)?","bosnian":"Kako ne pomisle da će oživljeni biti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/4"}},{"verse_key":"83:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"لِيَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ","transliteration":"Liyawmin AAatheem","translations":{"sahih_international":"For a tremendous Day -","pickthall":"Unto an Awful Day,","yusuf_ali":"On a Mighty Day,","urdu":"یہ اٹھا کر لائے جانے والے ہیں؟","turkish":"Bunlar, büyük bir günde tekrar dirileceklerini sanmıyorlar mı?","indonesian":"pada suatu hari yang besar,","french":"en un jour terrible,","german":"zu einem gewaltigen Tag,","bengali":"সেই মহান দিনে;","spanish":"En un día terrible,","malay":"Pada hari (kiamat) yang amat besar (huru-haranya),","bosnian":"na Dan veliki,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/5"}},{"verse_key":"83:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلنَّاسُ لِرَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"Yawma yaqoomu annasu lirabbialAAalameen","translations":{"sahih_international":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds?","pickthall":"The day when (all) mankind stand before the Lord of the Worlds?","yusuf_ali":"A Day when (all) mankind will stand before the Lord of the Worlds?","urdu":"اُس دن جبکہ سب لوگ رب العالمین کے سامنے کھڑے ہوں گے","turkish":"O gün insanlar Alemlerin Rabbinin huzurunda dururlar.","indonesian":"(yaitu) pada hari (ketika) semua orang bangkit menghadap Tuhan seluruh alam.","french":"le jour où les gens se tiendront debout devant le Seigneur de l’Univers ?","german":"am Tag, da die Menschen sich um des Herrn der Weltenbewohner willen aufstellen werden?","bengali":"যে দিন দাঁড়াবে সমস্ত মানুষ জগতসমূহের রবের সম্মুখে!","spanish":"un día en el que comparecerán los seres humanos ante el Señor del universo.","malay":"Hari berdiri manusia untuk mengadap Tuhan sekalian alam?","bosnian":"na Dan kada će se ljudi zbog Gospodara svjetova dići!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/6"}},{"verse_key":"83:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَـٰبَ ٱلْفُجَّارِ لَفِى سِجِّينٍ","transliteration":"Kalla inna kitaba alfujjarilafee sijjeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen.","pickthall":"Nay, but the record of the vile is in Sijjin -","yusuf_ali":"Nay! Surely the record of the wicked is (preserved) in Sijjin.","urdu":"ہر گز نہیں، یقیناً بدکاروں کا نامہٴ اعمال قیدخانے کے دفتر میں ہے۔","turkish":"Sakının; Allah'ın buyruğundan dışarı çıkanlar, muhakkak \"Siccin\" adlı defterde yazılıdır.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali jangan begitu! Sesungguhnya catatan orang yang durhaka benar-benar tersimpan dalam Sijjīn.","french":"Non...! Mais en vérité le livre des libertins sera dans le Sijjîn.","german":"Keineswegs! Das Buch der Sittenlosen ist wahrlich in Siggin.","bengali":"না, না, কখনই না; পাপাচারীদের ‘আমলনামা নিশ্চয়ই সিজ্জীনে থাকে;","spanish":"No quedarán impunes como piensan, porque el registro de los pecadores está en un libro ineludible.","malay":"Tidak sepatutnya (mereka melakukan perbuatan yang salah itu dan melalaikan hari akhirat)! Sesungguhnya \"kitab suratan amal\" orang-orang yang berdosa itu (didaftarkan) dalam \"Sijjiin\".","bosnian":"Uistinu! Knjiga grješnika je u Sidždžinu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/7"}},{"verse_key":"83:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا سِجِّينٌ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma sijjeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen?","pickthall":"Ah! what will convey unto thee what Sijjin is! -","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what Sijjin is?","urdu":"اور تمہیں کیا معلوم کہ وہ قید خانے کا دفتر کیا ہے؟","turkish":"Siccin'in ne olduğunu sen nerden bilirsin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah engkau apakah Sijjīn itu?","french":"et qui te dira ce qu’est le Sijjîn ? -","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was Siggin ist?","bengali":"সিজ্জীন কি তা কি তুমি জান?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará saber lo que es un libro ineludible?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui: apa dia \"Sijjiin\" itu,","bosnian":"a znaš li ti šta je Sidždžin?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/8"}},{"verse_key":"83:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"كِتَـٰبٌ مَّرْقُومٌ","transliteration":"Kitabun marqoom","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed.","pickthall":"A written record.","yusuf_ali":"(There is) a Register (fully) inscribed.","urdu":"ایک کتاب ہے لکھی ہوئی","turkish":"O, yazılmış bir kitaptır.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) Kitab yang berisi catatan (amal).","french":"un livre déjà cacheté (achevé).","german":"(Es ist) ein Buch mit festen Eintragungen.","bengali":"ওটা হচ্ছে লিখিত পুস্তক।","spanish":"Es un libro donde se registran las obras de los pecadores.","malay":"Ialah (tempat simpanan) kitab catitan yang jelas nyata, (yang menghimpunkan amalan orang-orang yang berdosa).","bosnian":"Knjiga ispisana!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/9"}},{"verse_key":"83:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers,","pickthall":"Woe unto the repudiators on that day!","yusuf_ali":"Woe, that Day, to those that deny-","urdu":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے","turkish":"Yalanlayanların o gün vay haline!","indonesian":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi orang-orang yang mendustakan!","french":"Malheur, ce jour-là, aux négateurs,","german":"Wehe an jenem Tag den Leugnern,","bengali":"সেদিন মন্দ পরিণাম হবে মিথ্যাচারীদের –","spanish":"¡Cuán desdichados serán ese día los que negaron la verdad!","malay":"Kecelakaan besar, pada hari itu, bagi orang-orang yang mendustakan -","bosnian":"Teško toga dana onima koji su poricali –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/10"}},{"verse_key":"83:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُكَذِّبُونَ بِيَوْمِ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Allatheena yukaththiboonabiyawmi addeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who deny the Day of Recompense.","pickthall":"Those who deny the Day of Judgment","yusuf_ali":"Those that deny the Day of Judgment.","urdu":"جو روز جزا کو جھٹلاتے ہیں","turkish":"Onlar, kıyamet gününü yalanlamış olanlardır.","indonesian":"(yaitu) orang-orang yang mendustakannya (hari pembalasan).","french":"qui démentent le jour de la Rétribution.","german":"die den Tag des Gerichts für Lüge erklären!","bengali":"যারা কর্মফল দিনকে অস্বীকার করে,","spanish":"Los que desmintieron el Día del Juicio,","malay":"Iaitu mereka yang mendustakan hari pembalasan.","bosnian":"koji su onaj svijet poricali –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/11"}},{"verse_key":"83:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"وَمَا يُكَذِّبُ بِهِۦٓ إِلَّا كُلُّ مُعْتَدٍ أَثِيمٍ","transliteration":"Wama yukaththibu bihi illakullu muAAtadin atheem","translations":{"sahih_international":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor.","pickthall":"Which none denieth save each criminal transgressor,","yusuf_ali":"And none can deny it but the Transgressor beyond bounds the Sinner!","urdu":"اور اُسے نہیں جھٹلاتا مگر ہر وہ شخص جو حد سے گزر جانے والا بد عمل ہے","turkish":"Oysa onu mütecaviz günahkardan başka kimse yalanlamaz.","indonesian":"Dan tidak ada yang mendustakannya (hari pembalasan) kecuali setiap orang yang melampaui batas dan berdosa,","french":"Or, ne le dément que tout transgresseur, pécheur :","german":"Und nur derjenige erklärt ihn für Lüge, der Übertretungen begeht und ein Sünder ist.","bengali":"আর সীমা লংঘনকারী মহাপাপী ব্যতীত কেহই ওকে মিথ্যা বলতে পারেনা।","spanish":"pues solo lo desmienten los transgresores y los pecadores.","malay":"Dan tiada yang mendustakannya melainkan tiap-tiap orang yang melampaui batas (kebenaran), lagi amat derhaka!","bosnian":"a njega može poricati samo prijestupnik, grješnik,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/12"}},{"verse_key":"83:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"إِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَـٰتُنَا قَالَ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"Itha tutla AAalayhi ayatunaqala asateeru al-awwaleen","translations":{"sahih_international":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","pickthall":"Who, when thou readest unto him Our revelations, saith: (Mere) fables of the men of old.","yusuf_ali":"When Our Signs are rehearsed to him, he says, \"Tales of the ancients!\"","urdu":"اُسے جب ہماری آیات سُنائی جاتی ہیں تو کہتا ہے یہ تو اگلے وقتوں کی کہانیاں ہیں","turkish":"Ona ayetlerimiz okunduğu zaman \"Öncekilerin masalları\" der.","indonesian":"yang apabila dibacakan kepadanya ayat-ayat Kami, dia berkata, \"Itu adalah dongeng orang-orang dahulu.\"","french":"qui, lorsque Nos versets lui sont récités, dit : \"[Ce sont] des contes d’anciens !\"","german":"Wenn ihm Unsere Zeichen verlesen werden, sagt er: (Es sind) Fabeln der Früheren.","bengali":"তার নিকট আমার আয়াতসমূহ আবৃত্তি করা হলে সে বলেঃ এটাতো পূরাকালীন কাহিনী।","spanish":"Quienes, cuando les es recitada Mi palabra, dicen: “Son fábulas de los pueblos antiguos”.","malay":"(Sehingga) apabila ia dibacakan kepadanya ayat-ayat Kami, ia berkata:\" Ini ialah dongeng orang-orang dahulu kala!\"","bosnian":"koji je, kada su mu ajeti Naši kazivani, govorio: \"Izmišljotine naroda drevnih!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/13"}},{"verse_key":"83:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"كَلَّا ۖ بَلْ ۜ رَانَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"Kalla bal rana AAalaquloobihim ma kanoo yaksiboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning.","pickthall":"Nay, but that which they have earned is rust upon their hearts.","yusuf_ali":"By no means! but on their hearts is the stain of the (ill) which they do!","urdu":"ہر گز نہیں، بلکہ دراصل اِن لوگوں کے دلوں پر اِن کے بُرے اعمال کا زنگ چڑھ گیا ہے۔","turkish":"Hayır, hayır; onların kazandıkları kalblerini paslandırıp körletmiştir.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Bahkan apa yang mereka kerjakan itu telah menutupi hati mereka.","french":"Pas du tout, mais ce qu’ils ont accompli couvre leurs cœurs.","german":"Keineswegs! Vielmehr hat sich das, was sie zu erwerben pflegten, über ihren Herzen angesetzt.","bengali":"না, এটা সত্য নয়, বরং তাদের কৃতকর্মের ফলেই তাদের মনের উপর মরিচা জমে গেছে।","spanish":"Pero no es así, sino que sus corazones están duros, llenos de herrumbre, debido a los pecados que cometieron.","malay":"Sebenarnya! (Ayat-ayat Kami itu tidak ada cacatnya) bahkan mata hati mereka telah diselaputi kekotoran (dosa), dengan sebab (perbuatan kufur dan maksiat) yang mereka kerjakan.","bosnian":"A nije tako! Ono što su radili prekrilo je srca njihova,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/14"}},{"verse_key":"83:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهُمْ عَن رَّبِّهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّمَحْجُوبُونَ","transliteration":"Kalla innahum AAan rabbihim yawma-ithinlamahjooboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned.","pickthall":"Nay, but surely on that day they will be covered from (the mercy of) their Lord.","yusuf_ali":"Verily, from (the Light of) their Lord, that Day, will they be veiled.","urdu":"ہر گز نہیں، بالیقین اُس روز یہ اپنے ربّ کی دید سے محروم رکھے جائیں گے،","turkish":"Hayır; doğrusu onlar o gün, Rablerinden yoksun kalacaklardır.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Sesungguhnya mereka pada hari itu benar-benar terhalang dari (melihat) Tuhannya.","french":"Qu’ils prennent garde ! En vérité ce jour-là un voile les empêchera de voir leur Seigneur,","german":"Keineswegs! Sie werden von ihrem Herrn an jenem Tag bestimmt abgeschirmt sein.","bengali":"না, অবশ্যই সেদিন তারা তাদের রবের সাক্ষাত হতে অন্তরীণ থাকবে;","spanish":"No es así, sino que ese día no podrán ver a su Señor.","malay":"Jangan lagi mereka berlaku demikian! (kalau tidak), mereka pada hari itu, tetap terdinding dari (rahmat) Tuhannya.","bosnian":"uistinu, oni će toga dana od milosti Gospodara svoga zaklonjeni biti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/15"}},{"verse_key":"83:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّهُمْ لَصَالُوا۟ ٱلْجَحِيمِ","transliteration":"Thumma innahum lasaloo aljaheem","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire.","pickthall":"Then lo! they verily will burn in hell,","yusuf_ali":"Further, they will enter the Fire of Hell.","urdu":"پھر یہ جہنم میں جا پڑیں گے","turkish":"Sonra onlar, şüphesiz, cehenneme gireceklerdir.","indonesian":"Kemudian, sesungguhnya mereka benar-benar masuk neraka.","french":"ensuite, ils brûleront certes, dans la Fournaise;","german":"Hierauf werden sie bestimmt dem Höllenbrand ausgesetzt sein.","bengali":"অনন্তর নিশ্চয়ই তারা জাহান্নামে প্রবেশ করবে;","spanish":"Luego serán llevados al Infierno,","malay":"Kemudian, sesungguhnya mereka akan menderita bakaran neraka.","bosnian":"zatim će, sigurno, u oganj ući,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/16"}},{"verse_key":"83:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"ثُمَّ يُقَالُ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma yuqalu hatha allatheekuntum bihi tukaththiboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny.\"","pickthall":"And it will be said (unto them): This is that which ye used to deny.","yusuf_ali":"Further, it will be said to them: \"This is the (reality) which ye rejected as false!","urdu":"پھر اِن سے کہا جائے گا کہ یہ وہی چیز ہے جسے تم جھٹلایا کرتے تھے","turkish":"Sonra da: \"yalanlayıp durduğunuz işte budur\" denecektir.","indonesian":"Kemudian, dikatakan (kepada mereka), \"Inilah (azab) yang dahulu kamu dustakan.\"","french":"on [leur] dira alors : \"Voilà ce que vous traitiez de mensonge !\"","german":"Hierauf wird gesagt werden: Das ist das, was ihr für Lüge zu erklären pflegtet.","bengali":"অতঃপর বলা হবেঃ এটাই তা যা তোমরা অস্বীকার করতে।","spanish":"donde se les dirá: “Esto es lo que desmentíais y rechazabais”.","malay":"Akhirnya dikatakan (kepada mereka): \"Inilah dia (azab seksa) yang kamu dustakan dahulu.\"","bosnian":"pa će im se reći: \"Eto, to je ono što ste poricali!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/17"}},{"verse_key":"83:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَـٰبَ ٱلْأَبْرَارِ لَفِى عِلِّيِّينَ","transliteration":"Kalla inna kitaba al-abrarilafee AAilliyyeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in ʿilliyyūn.","pickthall":"Nay, but the record of the righteous is in 'Illiyin -","yusuf_ali":"Nay, verily the record of the Righteous is (preserved) in 'Illiyin.","urdu":"ہر گز نہیں، بے شک نیک آدمیوں کا نامہٴ اعمال بلند پایہ لوگوں کے دفتر میں ہے","turkish":"Ama iyilerin defteri yüksek katlardadır.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Sesungguhnya catatan orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar tersimpan dalam 'Illiyyīn.","french":"Qu’ils prennent garde ! Le livre des bons sera dans 'Illiyûn -","german":"Keineswegs! Das Buch der Frommen ist wahrlich in ’Illiyyin.","bengali":"অবশ্যই পুণ্যবানদের ‘আমলনামা ইল্লিয়্যীনে থাকবে,","spanish":"En cambio, el registro de los bienaventurados será un libro noble.","malay":"Ingatlah wahai manusia! Sesungguhnya \"kitab suratan amal\" orang-orang yang berbakti (dengan taat dan amal kebajikan), adalah (didaftarkan) dalam\" Illiyiin\".","bosnian":"Uistinu! Knjiga čestitih je u Illijjunu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/18"}},{"verse_key":"83:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا عِلِّيُّونَ","transliteration":"Wama adraka maAAilliyyoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is ʿilliyyūn?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what 'Illiyin is! -","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what 'Illiyun is?","urdu":"اور تمہیں کیا خبر کہ کیا ہے وہ بلند پایہ لوگوں کا دفتر؟","turkish":"O yüksek katların ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah engkau apakah 'Illiyyīn itu?","french":"et qui te dira ce qu’est 'Illiyûn ?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was ’Illiyyun ist?","bengali":"ইল্লিয়্যীন কি তা কি তুমি জান?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará saber lo que es un libro noble?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui, apa dia \"Illiyiin\" itu?","bosnian":"a znaš li ti šta je Illijjun?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/19"}},{"verse_key":"83:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"كِتَـٰبٌ مَّرْقُومٌ","transliteration":"Kitabun marqoom","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed","pickthall":"A written record,","yusuf_ali":"(There is) a Register (fully) inscribed,","urdu":"ایک لکھی ہوئی کتاب ہے","turkish":"O, gözde meleklerin gördüğü, yazılı bir kitapdır.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) Kitab yang berisi catatan (amal),","french":"un livre cacheté !","german":"(Es ist) ein Buch mit festen Eintragungen,","bengali":"(তা হচ্ছে) লিখিত পুস্তক।","spanish":"Es el libro donde se registran las obras de los que hacen el bien,","malay":"Ialah (tempat simpanan) kitab catitan yang jelas nyata,","bosnian":"Knjiga ispisana! –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/20"}},{"verse_key":"83:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"يَشْهَدُهُ ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ","transliteration":"Yashhaduhu almuqarraboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allāh].","pickthall":"Attested by those who are brought near (unto their Lord).","yusuf_ali":"To which bear witness those Nearest (to Allah).","urdu":"جس کی نگہداشت مقرب فرشتے کرتے ہیں","turkish":"O, gözde meleklerin gördüğü, yazılı bir kitapdır.","indonesian":"yang disaksikan oleh (malaikat-malaikat) yang didekatkan (kepada Allah).","french":"Les rapprochés (d’Allah : les Anges) en témoignent.","german":"in das die (Allah) Nahegestellten Einsicht nehmen.","bengali":"আল্লাহর সান্নিধ্য প্রাপ্তরা ওটা প্রত্যক্ষ করবে।","spanish":"que puede ser visto por los [ángeles] cercanos [a Dios].","malay":"Yang disaksikan oleh sekumpulan malaikat, yang didampingkan Tuhan di sisinya.","bosnian":"nad njom bdiju oni Allahu bliski."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/21"}},{"verse_key":"83:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍ","transliteration":"Inna al-abrara lafee naAAeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure","pickthall":"Lo! the righteous verily are in delight,","yusuf_ali":"Truly the Righteous will be in Bliss:","urdu":"بے شک نیک لوگ بڑے مزے میں ہوں گے","turkish":"İyiler, şüphesiz, nimet içinde ve tahtlar üzerinde etrafı seyrederler.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar berada dalam (surga yang penuh) kenikmatan,","french":"Les bons seront dans [un jardin] de délice,","german":"Die Frommen werden wahrlich in Wonne sein,","bengali":"সৎ আমলকারীতো থাকবে পরম স্বাচ্ছন্দ্যে।","spanish":"Los bienaventurados gozarán las delicias del Paraíso,","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berbakti (dengan taat dan amal kebajikan), tetap berada di dalam Syurga yang penuh nikmat:","bosnian":"Dobri će, zaista, u nasladama boraviti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/22"}},{"verse_key":"83:23","ayah":23,"arabic":"عَلَى ٱلْأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"AAala al-ara-iki yanthuroon","translations":{"sahih_international":"On adorned couches, observing.","pickthall":"On couches, gazing,","yusuf_ali":"On Thrones (of Dignity) will they command a sight (of all things):","urdu":"اونچی مسندوں پر بیٹھے نظارے کر رہے ہوں گے","turkish":"İyiler, şüphesiz, nimet içinde ve tahtlar üzerinde etrafı seyrederler.","indonesian":"mereka (duduk) di atas dipan-dipan melepas pandangan.","french":"sur les divans, ils regardent.","german":"auf überdachten Liegen (gelehnt), und blicken um sich.","bengali":"তারা সুসজ্জিত আসনে বসে অবলোকন করবে।","spanish":"recostados en sofás, contemplando.","malay":"Mereka berehat di atas pelamin-pelamin (yang berhias), sambil melihat (segala keindahan dan kemuliaan yang disediakan untuk mereka di situ).","bosnian":"sa divana gledati,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083023.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/23"}},{"verse_key":"83:24","ayah":24,"arabic":"تَعْرِفُ فِى وُجُوهِهِمْ نَضْرَةَ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"TaAArifu fee wujoohihim nadrata annaAAeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure.","pickthall":"Thou wilt know in their faces the radiance of delight.","yusuf_ali":"Thou wilt recognise in their faces the beaming brightness of Bliss.","urdu":"ان کے چہروں پر تم خوشحالی کی رونق محسوس کرو گے","turkish":"Onları, yüzlerindeki nimet pırıltısından tanırsın.","indonesian":"Kamu dapat mengetahui dari wajah mereka kesenangan hidup yang penuh kenikmatan.","french":"Tu reconnaîtras sur leurs visages, l’éclat de la félicité.","german":"Du erkennst in ihren Gesichtern das Strahlen der Wonne.","bengali":"তুমি তাদের মুখমন্ডলে স্বাচ্ছন্দ্যের দীপ্তি দেখতে পাবে,","spanish":"Reconocerás en sus rostros el resplandor de la dicha.","malay":"Engkau dapat melihat pada muka mereka: cahaya nikmat yang mereka perolehi.","bosnian":"na licima njihovim prepoznaćeš radost sretna života,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083024.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/24"}},{"verse_key":"83:25","ayah":25,"arabic":"يُسْقَوْنَ مِن رَّحِيقٍ مَّخْتُومٍ","transliteration":"Yusqawna min raheeqin makhtoom","translations":{"sahih_international":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed.","pickthall":"They are given to drink of a pure wine, sealed,","yusuf_ali":"Their thirst will be slaked with Pure Wine sealed:","urdu":"ان کو نفیس ترین سر بند شراب پلائی جائے گی جس پر مُشک کی مُہر لگی ہوگی۔","turkish":"Sonunda misk kokusu bırakan, ağzı kapalı saf bir içecekten içerler. İyi şeyler için yarışanlar, bunun için yarışsınlar.","indonesian":"Mereka diberi minum dari khamar murni (tidak memabukkan) yang (tempatnya) masih dilak (disegel),","french":"On leur sert à boire un nectar pur, cacheté,","german":"Ihnen wird von versiegeltem Nektar zu trinken gegeben,","bengali":"তাদেরকে মোহরযুক্ত বিশুদ্ধ মদিরা হতে পান করানো হবে,","spanish":"Se les dará de beber un néctar sellado,","malay":"Mereka diberi minum dari satu minuman yang termeterai bekasnya,","bosnian":"daće im se pa će piće zapečaćeno piti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083025.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/25"}},{"verse_key":"83:26","ayah":26,"arabic":"خِتَـٰمُهُۥ مِسْكٌ ۚ وَفِى ذَٰلِكَ فَلْيَتَنَافَسِ ٱلْمُتَنَـٰفِسُونَ","transliteration":"Khitamuhu miskun wafee thalikafalyatanafasi almutanafisoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete.","pickthall":"Whose seal is musk - for this let (all) those strive who strive for bliss -","yusuf_ali":"The seal thereof will be Musk: And for this let those aspire, who have aspirations:","urdu":"جو لوگ دوسروں پر بازی لے جانا چاہتے ہوں وہ اِس چیز کو حاصل کرنے میں بازی لے جانے کی کوشش کریں","turkish":"Sonunda misk kokusu bırakan, ağzı kapalı saf bir içecekten içerler. İyi şeyler için yarışanlar, bunun için yarışsınlar.","indonesian":"laknya dari kasturi. Dan untuk yang demikian itu hendaknya orang berlomba-lomba.","french":"laissant un arrière-goût de musc. Que ceux qui la convoitent entrent en compétition [pour l’acquérir]","german":"dessen Siegel Moschus ist -, und darum sollen die Wettbewerber wettkämpfen -,","bengali":"ওর মোহর হচ্ছে কস্তুরীর। আর থাকে যদি কারও কোন আকাংখা বা কামনা, তাহলে তারা এরই কামনা করুক।","spanish":"cuyo último sorbo deja un sabor a almizcle. ¡Que se esfuercen por alcanzarla los aspirantes!","malay":"Meterainya kasturi; - dan untuk (memperolehi nikmat kesenangan) itu hendaknya berlumba-lumba mereka yang ingin merebut kelebihan dan kesenangan;","bosnian":"čiji će pečat mošus biti – i neka se za to natječu oni koji se hoće natjecati! –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083026.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/26"}},{"verse_key":"83:27","ayah":27,"arabic":"وَمِزَاجُهُۥ مِن تَسْنِيمٍ","transliteration":"Wamizajuhu min tasneem","translations":{"sahih_international":"And its mixture is of Tasneem,","pickthall":"And mixed with water of Tasnim,","yusuf_ali":"With it will be (given) a mixture of Tasnim:","urdu":"ں۔ اُس شراب میں تسنیم کی آمیزش ہوگی،","turkish":"Onun katkısı gözdelerin içtiği yüce kaynaktandır.","indonesian":"Dan campurannya dari tasnīm,","french":"Il est mélangé à la boisson de Tasnîm,","german":"und dessen Beimischung Tasnim ist,","bengali":"ওর মিশ্রণ হবে তাসনীমের।","spanish":"[El néctar] estará mezclado con agua de Tasnim,","malay":"Dan campuran minuman itu adalah dari \"Tasnim\":","bosnian":"pomiješano sa vodom iz Tesnima će biti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083027.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/27"}},{"verse_key":"83:28","ayah":28,"arabic":"عَيْنًا يَشْرَبُ بِهَا ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ","transliteration":"AAaynan yashrabu biha almuqarraboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"A spring from which those near [to Allāh] drink.","pickthall":"A spring whence those brought near (to Allah) drink.","yusuf_ali":"A spring, from (the waters) whereof drink those Nearest to Allah.","urdu":"یہ ایک چشمہ ہے جس کے پانی کے ساتھ مقرب لوگ شراب پئیں گے","turkish":"Onun katkısı gözdelerin içtiği yüce kaynaktandır.","indonesian":"(yaitu) mata air yang diminum oleh mereka yang dekat (kepada Allah).","french":"source dont les rapprochés boivent.","german":"aus einer Quelle, aus der die (Allah) Nahegestellten trinken.","bengali":"এটি একটি প্রস্রবণ, যা হতে নৈকট্য প্রাপ্ত ব্যক্তিরা পান করে।","spanish":"un manantial del que solo beberán los más cercanos a Dios.","malay":"laitu matair yang diminum daripadanya oleh orang-orang yang di dampingkan (Tuhan di sisiNya).","bosnian":"sa izvora iz kojeg će Allahu bliski piti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083028.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/28"}},{"verse_key":"83:29","ayah":29,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ أَجْرَمُوا۟ كَانُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ يَضْحَكُونَ","transliteration":"Inna allatheena ajramoo kanoomina allatheena amanoo yadhakoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed.","pickthall":"Lo! the guilty used to laugh at those who believed,","yusuf_ali":"Those in sin used to laugh at those who believed,","urdu":"مجرم لوگ دنیا میں ایمان لانے والوں کا مذاق اڑاتے تھے","turkish":"Suçlular, şüphesiz, inanmış olanlara gülerlerdi.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berdosa, adalah mereka yang dahulu menertawakan orang-orang yang beriman.","french":"Les criminels riaient de ceux qui croyaient,","german":"Gewiß, diejenigen, die Übeltaten begingen, pflegten über diejenigen zu lachen, die glauben,","bengali":"অপরাধীরা মু’মিনদেরকে উপহাস করত,","spanish":"Los que se abandonan al pecado se ríen [en esta vida] de los creyentes.","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang derhaka, mereka selalu tertawakan orang-orang yang beriman.","bosnian":"Grješnici se smiju onima koji vjeruju;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083029.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/29"}},{"verse_key":"83:30","ayah":30,"arabic":"وَإِذَا مَرُّوا۟ بِهِمْ يَتَغَامَزُونَ","transliteration":"Wa-itha marroo bihim yataghamazoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances.","pickthall":"And wink one to another when they passed them;","yusuf_ali":"And whenever they passed by them, used to wink at each other (in mockery);","urdu":"جب اُن کے پاس سے گزرتے تو آنکھیں مار مار کر اُن کی طرف اشارے کرتے تھے","turkish":"Yanlarından geçtikleri zaman da birbirlerine göz kırparlardı.","indonesian":"Dan apabila mereka (orang-orang yang beriman) melintas di hadapan mereka, mereka saling mengedip-ngedipkan matanya,","french":"et, passant près d’eux, ils se faisaient des œillades,","german":"und, wenn sie an ihnen vorbeikamen, einander zuzuzwinkern.","bengali":"এবং তারা যখন মু’মিনদের নিকট দিয়ে যেত তখন,","spanish":"Cuando pasan junto a ellos se hacen gestos [despectivos],","malay":"Dan apabila orang-orang yang beriman lalu dekat mereka, mereka mengerling dan memejam celikkan mata sesama sendiri (mencemuhnya).","bosnian":"kada pored njih prolaze, jedni drugima namiguju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083030.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/30"}},{"verse_key":"83:31","ayah":31,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِمُ ٱنقَلَبُوا۟ فَكِهِينَ","transliteration":"Wa-itha inqalaboo ila ahlihimuinqalaboo fakiheen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting.","pickthall":"And when they returned to their own folk, they returned jesting;","yusuf_ali":"And when they returned to their own people, they would return jesting;","urdu":"پنے گھروں کی طرف پلٹتے تو مزے لیتے ہوئے پلٹتے تھے،","turkish":"Taraftarlarına vardıklarında bununla eğlenirlerdi.","indonesian":"dan apabila kembali kepada kaumnya, mereka kembali dengan gembira ria.","french":"et, retournant dans leurs familles, ils retournaient en plaisantant,","german":"Und, wenn sie zu ihren Angehörigen zurückkehrten, kehrten sie zurück, indem sie es sich wohl sein ließen.","bengali":"এবং যখন তাদের আপনজনের নিকট ফিরে আসতো তখন তারা ফিরতো উৎফুল্ল হয়ে।","spanish":"y cuando regresan a sus hogares se jactan [de ello].","malay":"Dan apabila mereka kembali kepada kaum keluarganya, mereka kembali dengan riang gembira;","bosnian":"a kada se porodicama svojim vraćaju, šale zbijajući vraćaju se;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083031.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/31"}},{"verse_key":"83:32","ayah":32,"arabic":"وَإِذَا رَأَوْهُمْ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَضَآلُّونَ","transliteration":"Wa-itha raawhum qaloo inna haola-iladalloon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost.\"","pickthall":"And when they saw them they said: Lo! these have gone astray.","yusuf_ali":"And whenever they saw them, they would say, \"Behold! These are the people truly astray!\"","urdu":"اور جب انہیں دیکھتے تو کہتے تھے کہ یہ بہکے ہوئے لوگ ہیں،","turkish":"İnananları gördükleri zaman: \"Doğrusu bunlar sapık olanlardır\" derlerdi.","indonesian":"Dan apabila mereka melihat (orang-orang mukmin), mereka mengatakan, \"Sesungguhnya mereka benar-benar orang-orang sesat,\"","french":"et les voyant, ils disaient : \"Ce sont vraiment ceux-là les égarés.\"","german":"Und, wenn sie sie sahen, sagten sie: Diese gehen fürwahr in die Irre.","bengali":"এবং যখন তাদেরকে দেখত তখন বলতঃ এরাইতো পথভ্রষ্ট।","spanish":"Cuando ven a los suyos dicen: “Ellos son unos desviados”,","malay":"Dan apabila mereka melihat orang-orang yang beriman, mereka berkata: \"Sesungguhnya orang-orang itu adalah golongan yang sesat!\"","bosnian":"kada ih vide, onda govore: \"Ovi su, doista, zalutali!\" –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083032.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/32"}},{"verse_key":"83:33","ayah":33,"arabic":"وَمَآ أُرْسِلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ حَـٰفِظِينَ","transliteration":"Wama orsiloo AAalayhim hafitheen","translations":{"sahih_international":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them.","pickthall":"Yet they were not sent as guardians over them.","yusuf_ali":"But they had not been sent as keepers over them!","urdu":"حالانکہ وہ اُن پر نگراں بنا کر نہیں بھیجے گئے تھے۔","turkish":"Oysa kendileri, inananlara gözcü olarak gönderilmemişlerdi.","indonesian":"padahal (orang-orang yang berdosa itu), mereka tidak diutus sebagai penjaga (orang-orang mukmin).","french":"Or, ils n’ont pas été envoyés pour être leurs gardiens.","german":"Dabei waren sie doch nicht als Hüter über sie gesandt worden.","bengali":"তাদেরকে তো এদের সংরক্ষকরূপে পাঠানো হয়নি!","spanish":"aunque no les fue encargado velar por ellos.","malay":"Pada hal mereka tidak diutus untuk menjaga sesat atau tidaknya orang-orang yang beriman itu!","bosnian":"a oni nisu poslani da motre na njih."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083033.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/33"}},{"verse_key":"83:34","ayah":34,"arabic":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلْكُفَّارِ يَضْحَكُونَ","transliteration":"Falyawma allatheena amanoomina alkuffari yadhakoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers,","pickthall":"This day it is those who believe who have the laugh of disbelievers,","yusuf_ali":"But on this Day the Believers will laugh at the Unbelievers:","urdu":"آج ایمان لانے والے کفار پر ہنس رہے ہیں","turkish":"Bugün de, inananlar inkarcılara gülerler.","indonesian":"Maka pada hari ini, orang-orang yang beriman yang menertawakan orang-orang kafir,","french":"Aujourd’hui, donc, ce sont ceux qui ont cru qui rient des infidèles.","german":"Heute aber lachen diejenigen, die glauben, über die Ungläubigen,","bengali":"আজ তাই মু’মিনগণ উপহাস করছে কাফিরদেরকে –","spanish":"Pero este día los creyentes serán quienes se rían de los que rechazaron la verdad.","malay":"Maka pada hari ini, orang-orang yang beriman pula tertawakan orang yang kafir itu.","bosnian":"Danas će oni koji su vjerovali – nevjernicima se podsmijavati,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083034.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/34"}},{"verse_key":"83:35","ayah":35,"arabic":"عَلَى ٱلْأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"AAala al-ara-iki yanthuroon","translations":{"sahih_international":"On adorned couches, observing.","pickthall":"On high couches, gazing.","yusuf_ali":"On Thrones (of Dignity) they will command (a sight) (of all things).","urdu":"مسندوں پر بیٹھے ہوئے ان کا حال دیکھ رہے ہیں","turkish":"Tahtlar üzerinde, inkarcıların yaptıkları şeylerin karşılığının nasıl verildiğini seyrederler.","indonesian":"mereka (duduk) di atas dipan-dipan melepas pandangan.","french":"sur les divans, ils regardent.","german":"auf überdachten Liegen (gelehnt), und blicken um sich.","bengali":"সুসজ্জিত আসন হতে তাদেরকে অবলোকন করে।","spanish":"[Los creyentes] estarán reclinados sobre sofás, contemplando [el Rostro de Dios].","malay":"Sambil mereka berehat di atas pelamin-pelamin (yang berhias), serta melihat (hal yang berlaku kepada musuhnya).","bosnian":"sa divana će gledati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083035.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/35"}},{"verse_key":"83:36","ayah":36,"arabic":"هَلْ ثُوِّبَ ٱلْكُفَّارُ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"Hal thuwwiba alkuffaru ma kanooyafAAaloon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do?","pickthall":"Are not the disbelievers paid for what they used to do?","yusuf_ali":"Will not the Unbelievers have been paid back for what they did?","urdu":"مِل گیا نا کافروں کو اُن حرکتوں کا ثواب جو وہ کیا کرتے تھے۔","turkish":"Tahtlar üzerinde, inkarcıların yaptıkları şeylerin karşılığının nasıl verildiğini seyrederler.","indonesian":"Apakah orang-orang kafir itu diberi balasan (hukuman) terhadap apa yang telah mereka perbuat?","french":"Est-ce que les infidèles ont eu la récompense de ce qu’ils faisaient ?","german":"Sind die Ungläubigen nicht doch belohnt worden für das, was sie zu tun pflegten?","bengali":"কাফিরেরা তাদের কৃত কর্মের ফল পেলো তো?","spanish":"¿Acaso los que rechazaron la verdad no han recibido una retribución justa por sus propias obras?","malay":"(Untuk menambahkan kegembiraan mereka, mereka ditanya): \"Bukankah orang-orang yang kafir itu telah dibalas akan apa yang mereka telah kerjakan dahulu?\"","bosnian":"Zar će nevjernici biti drugačije kažnjeni nego prema onome kako su postupali!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/083036.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/83/36"}}]}},{"number":84,"data":{"surah":{"number":84,"name_arabic":"الإنشقاق","name_english":"Al-Inshiqaq","name_translation":"The Sundering","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":83,"verses_count":25,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/084.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/084.mp3"}],"total_verses":25,"verses":[{"verse_key":"84:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ","transliteration":"Itha assamao inshaqqat","translations":{"sahih_international":"When the sky has split [open]","pickthall":"When the heaven is split asunder","yusuf_ali":"When the sky is rent asunder,","urdu":"جب آسمان پھٹ جائے گا","turkish":"Gök yarılıp Rabbine boyun eğdiği zaman, ki gök boyun eğecektir.","indonesian":"Apabila langit terbelah,","french":"Quand le ciel se déchirera.","german":"Wenn der Himmel sich spaltet","bengali":"যখন আকাশ বিদীর্ণ হবে,","spanish":"Cuando el cielo se resquebraje","malay":"Apabila langit terbelah,","bosnian":"Kada se nebo rascijepi"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/1"}},{"verse_key":"84:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","transliteration":"Waathinat lirabbiha wahuqqat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]","pickthall":"And attentive to her Lord in fear,","yusuf_ali":"And hearkens to (the Command of) its Lord, and it must needs (do so);-","urdu":"اور اپنے ربّ کے فرمان کی تعمیل کرے گا اور اُس کے لیے حق یہی ہے (کہ اپنے ربّ کا حکم مانے)","turkish":"Gök yarılıp Rabbine boyun eğdiği zaman, ki gök boyun eğecektir.","indonesian":"dan patuh kepada Tuhannya, dan sudah semestinya patuh,","french":"et obéira à son Seigneur - et fera ce qu’il doit faire -","german":"und auf seinen Herrn hört - und es ist ja rechtens für ihn-,","bengali":"এবং ওটা স্বীয় রবের আদেশ পালন করবে, আর ওকে তদুপযোগী করা হবে,","spanish":"en cumplimiento de la orden de su Señor, como es debido.","malay":"Serta mematuhi perintah Tuhannya, dan sudah semestinya ia patuh;","bosnian":"i posluša Gospodara svoga – a ono će to dužno biti –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/2"}},{"verse_key":"84:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْأَرْضُ مُدَّتْ","transliteration":"Wa-itha al-ardu muddat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the earth has been extended","pickthall":"And when the earth is spread out","yusuf_ali":"And when the earth is flattened out,","urdu":"اور جب زمین پھیلا دی جائے گی","turkish":"Yer düzeltilip, içinde olanları dışarı atarak boşaldığı zaman ve yer Rabbine boyun eğdiği zaman, ki yer boyun eğecektir","indonesian":"dan apabila bumi diratakan,","french":"et que la terre sera nivelée,","german":"und wenn die Erde ausgedehnt wird","bengali":"এবং পৃথিবীকে যখন সম্প্রসারিত করা হবে,","spanish":"Cuando la tierra sea aplanada,","malay":"Dan apabila bumi diratakan,","bosnian":"i kada se Zemlja rastegne,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/3"}},{"verse_key":"84:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَأَلْقَتْ مَا فِيهَا وَتَخَلَّتْ","transliteration":"Waalqat ma feeha watakhallat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it].","pickthall":"And hath cast out all that was in her, and is empty","yusuf_ali":"And casts forth what is within it and becomes (clean) empty,","urdu":"اور جو کچھ اس کے اندر ہے اُسے باہر پھینک کر خالی ہو جائے گی","turkish":"Yer düzeltilip, içinde olanları dışarı atarak boşaldığı zaman ve yer Rabbine boyun eğdiği zaman, ki yer boyun eğecektir","indonesian":"dan memuntahkan apa yang ada di dalamnya dan menjadi kosong,","french":"et qu’elle rejettera ce qui est en son sein (les morts) et se videra,","german":"und herauswirft, was in ihr ist, und sich entleert","bengali":"এবং পৃথিবী তার অভ্যন্তরে যা আছে তা বাইরে নিক্ষেপ করবে ও শূন্য গর্ভ হয়ে যাবে,","spanish":"y expulse lo que hay en su seno y quede vacía,","malay":"Serta mengeluarkan apa yang di dalamnya, dan menjadi kosong,","bosnian":"i izbaci ono što je u njoj, i potpuno se isprazni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/4"}},{"verse_key":"84:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","transliteration":"Waathinat lirabbiha wahuqqat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so] -","pickthall":"And attentive to her Lord in fear!","yusuf_ali":"And hearkens to (the Command of) its Lord,- and it must needs (do so);- (then will come Home the full reality).","urdu":"اور اپنے ربّ کے حکم کی تعمیل کرے گی اور اُس کے لیے حق یہی ہے (کہ اس کی تعمیل کرے)۔","turkish":"Yer düzeltilip, içinde olanları dışarı atarak boşaldığı zaman ve yer Rabbine boyun eğdiği zaman, ki yer boyun eğecektir","indonesian":"dan patuh kepada Tuhannya, dan sudah semestinya patuh.","french":"et qu’elle obéira à son Seigneur - et fera ce qu’elle doit faire -","german":"und auf ihren Herrn hört - und es ist ja rechtens für sie...","bengali":"এবং তার রবের আদেশ পালন করবে, আর ওকে তদুপযোগী করা হবে (তখন তোমরা পুনরুত্থিত হবেই)।","spanish":"en cumplimiento de la orden de su Señor, como es debido.","malay":"Serta mematuhi perintah Tuhannya, dan sudah semestinya ia patuh; - (Maka pada saat itu tiap-tiap seorang akan mengetahui apa yang telah dilakukannya).","bosnian":"i posluša Gospodara svoga – a ona će to dužna biti –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/5"}},{"verse_key":"84:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِنَّكَ كَادِحٌ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَدْحًا فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ","transliteration":"Ya ayyuha al-insanuinnaka kadihun ila rabbika kadhanfamulaqeeh","translations":{"sahih_international":"O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it.","pickthall":"Thou, verily, O man, art working toward thy Lord a work which thou wilt meet (in His presence).","yusuf_ali":"O thou man! Verily thou art ever toiling on towards thy Lord- painfully toiling,- but thou shalt meet Him.","urdu":"اے انسان، تُو کشاں کشاں اپنے ربّ کی طرف چلا جا رہا ہے اور اُس سے ملنے والا ہے","turkish":"Ey insanoğlu! Sen Rabbine kavuşuncaya kadar çalışıp çabalarsın, sonunda O'na kavuşacaksın.","indonesian":"Wahai manusia! Sesungguhnya kamu telah bekerja keras menuju Tuhanmu, maka kamu akan menemui-Nya.","french":"Ô homme ! Toi qui t’efforces vers ton Seigneur sans relâche, tu Le rencontreras alors.","german":"O du Mensch, du mühst dich hart zu deinem Herrn hin, und so wirst du Ihm begegnen.","bengali":"হে মানবসকল! তোমরা কঠোর পরিশ্রম করতে থাক, তোমাদের আমাল অনুযায়ী তোমাদের রবের সাক্ষাত লাভ করবে, আর এটাতো অবশ্যম্ভাবি।","spanish":"¡Oh, ser humano! Haz de comparecer ante tu Señor y ver el resultado de tus obras.","malay":"Wahai manusia! Sesungguhnya engkau sentiasa berpenat-lelah (menjalankan keadaan hidupmu) dengan sedaya upayamu hinggalah (semasa engkau) kembali kepada Tuhanmu, kemudian engkau tetap menemui balasan apa yang engkau telah usahakan itu (tercatit semuanya).","bosnian":"ti ćeš, o čovječe, koji se mnogo trudiš, trud svoj pred Gospodarom svojim naći:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/6"}},{"verse_key":"84:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ","transliteration":"Faama man ootiya kitabahubiyameenih","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then as for he who is given his record in his right hand,","pickthall":"Then whoso is given his account in his right hand","yusuf_ali":"Then he who is given his Record in his right hand,","urdu":"پھر جس کا نامہ اعمال اُس کے سیدھے ہاتھ میں دیا گیا","turkish":"Amel defteri kendisine sağından verilen kimse, kolay geçireceği bir hesaba çekilir ve arkadaşlarının yanına sevinçle döner.","indonesian":"Maka adapun orang yang catatanya diberikan dari sebelah kanannya,","french":"Celui qui recevra son livre en sa main droite,","german":"Was nun jemanden angeht, dem dann sein Buch in seine Rechte gegeben wird,","bengali":"অতঃপর যাকে ডান হাতে তার কর্মলিপি প্রদত্ত হবে –","spanish":"Quien reciba el registro de sus obras en su mano derecha","malay":"Kemudian sesiapa yang diberi menerima surat amalnya dengan tangan kanannya, -","bosnian":"onaj kome bude knjiga njegova u desnu ruku njegovu data"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/7"}},{"verse_key":"84:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"فَسَوْفَ يُحَاسَبُ حِسَابًا يَسِيرًا","transliteration":"Fasawfa yuhasabu hisabanyaseera","translations":{"sahih_international":"He will be judged with an easy account","pickthall":"He truly will receive an easy reckoning","yusuf_ali":"Soon will his account be taken by an easy reckoning,","urdu":"اُس سے ہلکا حساب لیا جائے گا","turkish":"Amel defteri kendisine sağından verilen kimse, kolay geçireceği bir hesaba çekilir ve arkadaşlarının yanına sevinçle döner.","indonesian":"maka dia akan diperiksa dengan pemeriksaan yang mudah,","french":"sera soumis à un jugement facile,","german":"der wird einer leichten Abrechnung unterzogen,","bengali":"তার হিসাব-নিকাশতো সহজভাবে গৃহীত হবে,","spanish":"tendrá un juicio fácil,","malay":"Maka ia akan dihisab dengan cara yang mudah dan ringan,","bosnian":"lahko će račun položiti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/8"}},{"verse_key":"84:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"وَيَنقَلِبُ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا","transliteration":"Wayanqalibu ila ahlihi masroora","translations":{"sahih_international":"And return to his people in happiness.","pickthall":"And will return unto his folk in joy.","yusuf_ali":"And he will turn to his people, rejoicing!","urdu":"اور وہ اپنے لوگوں کی طرف خوش خوش پلٹے گا۔","turkish":"Amel defteri kendisine sağından verilen kimse, kolay geçireceği bir hesaba çekilir ve arkadaşlarının yanına sevinçle döner.","indonesian":"dan dia akan kembali kepada keluarganya (yang sama-sama beriman) dengan gembira.","french":"et retournera réjoui auprès de sa famille.","german":"und er wird erfreut zu seinen Angehörigen zurückkehren.","bengali":"এবং সে তার স্বজনদের নিকট প্রফুল্ল চিত্তে ফিরে যাবে।","spanish":"y [una vez terminado] se reunirá jubiloso con su gente [en el Paraíso].","malay":"Dan ia akan pergi kepada keluarganya (yang beriman) dengan sukacita.","bosnian":"i svojima će se radostan vratiti;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/9"}},{"verse_key":"84:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ وَرَآءَ ظَهْرِهِۦ","transliteration":"Waamma man ootiya kitabahu waraathahrih","translations":{"sahih_international":"But as for he who is given his record behind his back,","pickthall":"But whoso is given his account behind his back,","yusuf_ali":"But he who is given his Record behind his back,-","urdu":"رہا وہ شخص جس کا نامہٴ اعمال اُس کی پیٹھ کے پیچھے دیا جائے گا","turkish":"Ama amel defteri kendisine arkasından verilen kimse: \"Mahvoldum\" diye bağırır ve çılgın alevli cehenneme girer.","indonesian":"Dan adapun orang yang catatannya diberikan dari arah belakang,","french":"Quant à celui qui recevra son livre derrière son dos,","german":"Was aber jemanden angeht, dem sein Buch hinter seinem Rücken gegeben wird,","bengali":"এবং যাকে তার কর্মলিপি তার পৃষ্ঠের পশ্চাদ্ভাগে দেয়া হবে –","spanish":"Mientras que quien reciba el registro de sus obras por detrás de su espalda,","malay":"Dan sesiapa yang diberi menerima surat amalnya (dengan tangan kiri), dari sebelah belakangnya,","bosnian":"a onaj kome bude knjiga njegova iza leđa njegovih data"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/10"}},{"verse_key":"84:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"فَسَوْفَ يَدْعُوا۟ ثُبُورًا","transliteration":"Fasawfa yadAAoo thuboora","translations":{"sahih_international":"He will cry out for destruction","pickthall":"He surely will invoke destruction","yusuf_ali":"Soon will he cry for perdition,","urdu":"تو وہ موت کو پکارے گا","turkish":"Ama amel defteri kendisine arkasından verilen kimse: \"Mahvoldum\" diye bağırır ve çılgın alevli cehenneme girer.","indonesian":"maka dia akan berteriak, \"Celakalah aku!\"","french":"il invoquera la destruction sur lui-même,","german":"der wird nach Vernichtung rufen","bengali":"ফলে অচিরেই সে মৃত্যুকে আহবান করবে,","spanish":"suplicará ser destruido definitivamente.","malay":"Maka ia akan meraung menyebut-nyebut kebinasaannya,","bosnian":"propast će prizivati"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/11"}},{"verse_key":"84:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"وَيَصْلَىٰ سَعِيرًا","transliteration":"Wayasla saAAeera","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [enter to] burn in a Blaze.","pickthall":"And be thrown to scorching fire.","yusuf_ali":"And he will enter a Blazing Fire.","urdu":"اور بھڑکتی ہوئی آگ میں جا پڑے گا","turkish":"Ama amel defteri kendisine arkasından verilen kimse: \"Mahvoldum\" diye bağırır ve çılgın alevli cehenneme girer.","indonesian":"Dan dia akan masuk ke dalam api yang menyala-nyala (neraka).","french":"et il brûlera dans un feu ardent.","german":"und der Feuerglut ausgesetzt sein.","bengali":"এবং জ্বলন্ত আগুনে সে প্রবেশ করবে।","spanish":"Pero será arrastrado al castigo del Infierno.","malay":"Dan ia akan menderita bakaran neraka yang marak menjulang.","bosnian":"i u ognju će gorjeti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/12"}},{"verse_key":"84:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فِىٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا","transliteration":"Innahu kana fee ahlihi masroora","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, he had [once] been among his people in happiness;","pickthall":"He verily lived joyous with his folk,","yusuf_ali":"Truly, did he go about among his people, rejoicing!","urdu":"وہ اپنے گھر والوں میں مگن تھا۔","turkish":"Çünkü o, dünyada, adamlarının yanında iken zevk içindeydi.","indonesian":"Sungguh, dia dahulu (di dunia) bergembira di kalangan keluarganya (yang sama-sama kafir).","french":"Car il était tout joyeux parmi les siens,","german":"Er war ja froh inmitten seiner Angehörigen.","bengali":"সে তার স্বজনদের মধ্যেতো সহর্ষে ছিল,","spanish":"Él vivía alegre con su familia [despreocupado del más allá]","malay":"Sebenarnya ia semasa di dunia dahulu bersukaria dalam kalangan keluarganya (yang juga kufur ingkar)!","bosnian":"jer je sa čeljadi svojom radostan bio"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/13"}},{"verse_key":"84:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ ظَنَّ أَن لَّن يَحُورَ","transliteration":"Innahu thanna an lan yahoor","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, he had thought he would never return [to Allāh].","pickthall":"He verily deemed that he would never return (unto Allah).","yusuf_ali":"Truly, did he think that he would not have to return (to Us)!","urdu":"اُس نے سمجھا تھا کہ اسے کبھی پلٹنا نہیں ہے","turkish":"Zira; o, bir daha dirilip dönmeyeceğini sanmıştı.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya dia mengira bahwa dia tidak akan kembali (kepada Tuhannya).","french":"et il pensait que jamais il ne ressusciterait.","german":"Er meinte ja, daß er nicht zurückkehren würde.","bengali":"যেহেতু সে ভাবতো যে, সে কখনই প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবেনা।","spanish":"pensando que jamás comparecería [ante Dios].","malay":"Sesungguhnya ia menyangka bahawa ia tidak sekali-kali akan kembali (kepada Kami untuk menerima balasan) !","bosnian":"i mislio da se nikada neće vratiti –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/14"}},{"verse_key":"84:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"بَلَىٰٓ إِنَّ رَبَّهُۥ كَانَ بِهِۦ بَصِيرًا","transliteration":"Bala inna rabbahu kana bihi baseera","translations":{"sahih_international":"But yes! Indeed, his Lord was ever, of him, Seeing.","pickthall":"Nay, but lo! his Lord is ever looking on him!","yusuf_ali":"Nay, nay! for his Lord was (ever) watchful of him!","urdu":"پلٹناکیسے نہ تھا، اُس کا ربّ اُس کے کرتُوت دیکھ رہا تھا۔","turkish":"Bilin ki, Rabbi onu şüphesiz görmekteydi.","indonesian":"Tidak demikian, sesungguhnya Tuhannya selalu melihatnya.","french":"Mais si ! Certes, son Seigneur l’observait parfaitement.","german":"Ja doch! Gewiß, sein Herr sieht ihn wohl.","bengali":"হ্যাঁ,(অবশ্যই প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে) নিশ্চয়ই তার রাব্ব তার উপর সবিশেষ দৃষ্টি রাখেন।","spanish":"Pero sí, su Señor estaba bien informado de lo que hacía.","malay":"(Sangkaannya itu tidak betul) bahkan ia tetap kembali! Sesungguhnya Tuhannya sentiasa Melihat dan Mengetahui keadaannya!","bosnian":"a hoće! Gospodar njegov o njemu, zaista, sve zna!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/15"}},{"verse_key":"84:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلشَّفَقِ","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bishshafaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"So I swear by the twilight glow","pickthall":"Oh, I swear by the afterglow of sunset,","yusuf_ali":"So I do call to witness the ruddy glow of Sunset;","urdu":"پس نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں شفق کی","turkish":"Akşamın alaca karanlığına and olsun;","indonesian":"Maka Aku bersumpah demi cahaya merah pada waktu senja,","french":"Non !... Je jure par le crépuscule,","german":"Nein! Ich schwöre beim Abendrot","bengali":"আমি শপথ করি অস্তরাগের –","spanish":"Juro por el crepúsculo,","malay":"Maka Aku bersumpah, demi mega;","bosnian":"I kunem se rumenilom večernjim,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/16"}},{"verse_key":"84:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ وَمَا وَسَقَ","transliteration":"Wallayli wama wasaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the night and what it envelops","pickthall":"And by the night and all that it enshroudeth,","yusuf_ali":"The Night and its Homing;","urdu":"اور رات کی اور جو کچھ وہ سمیٹ لیتی ہے","turkish":"Geceye ve gecenin içinde olan şeylere and olsun;","indonesian":"demi malam dan apa yang diselubunginya,","french":"et par la nuit et ce qu’elle enveloppe,","german":"und der Nacht und dem, was sie zusammentreibt,","bengali":"এবং রাতের, আর ওটা যা কিছুর সমাবেশ ঘটায় তার,","spanish":"por la noche y por las criaturas que habitan en ella,","malay":"Dan malam serta segala yang dihimpunkannya;","bosnian":"i noći, i onim što ona tamom obavije,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/17"}},{"verse_key":"84:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا ٱتَّسَقَ","transliteration":"Walqamari itha ittasaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the moon when it becomes full","pickthall":"And by the moon when she is at the full,","yusuf_ali":"And the Moon in her fullness:","urdu":"اور چاند کی جب کہ وہ ماہ کامل ہو جاتا ہے","turkish":"Dolunay halindeki aya and olsun ki:","indonesian":"demi bulan apabila jadi purnama,","french":"et par la lune quand elle devient pleine-lune !","german":"und dem Mond, wenn er voll geworden ist.","bengali":"এবং শপথ চন্দ্রের যখন ওটা পরিপূর্ণ হয়,","spanish":"y por la Luna cuando alcanza el plenilunio,","malay":"Dan bulan apabila (penuh cahayanya) menjadi purnama:","bosnian":"i Mjesecom punim,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/18"}},{"verse_key":"84:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"لَتَرْكَبُنَّ طَبَقًا عَن طَبَقٍ","transliteration":"Latarkabunna tabaqan AAan tabaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"[That] you will surely embark upon [i.e., experience] state after state.","pickthall":"That ye shall journey on from plane to plane.","yusuf_ali":"Ye shall surely travel from stage to stage.","urdu":"تم کو ضرور درجہ بدرجہ ایک حالت سے دوسری حالت کی طرف گزرتے چلے جانا ہے۔","turkish":"Şüphesiz siz bir durumdan diğerine uğratılacaksınız. (tabakadan tabakaya bineceksiniz)","indonesian":"sungguh, akan kamu jalani tingkat demi tingkat (dalam kehidupan).","french":"Vous passerez, certes, par des états successifs !","german":"Ihr werdet eine Schicht nach der anderen besteigen.","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা এক স্তর হতে অন্য স্তরে আরোহণ করবে,","spanish":"que [los seres humanos] pasan de un estado a otro.","malay":"Sesungguhnya kamu tetap melalui beberapa keadaan yang bertingkat-tingkat baik buruknya, (sebelum kamu menemui Tuhan - menerima kesenangan dan kebahagiaan atau sebaliknya)","bosnian":"vi ćete, sigurno, na sve teže i teže prilike nailaziti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/19"}},{"verse_key":"84:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"فَمَا لَهُمْ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"Fama lahum la yu/minoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"So what is [the matter] with them [that] they do not believe,","pickthall":"What aileth them, then, that they believe not","yusuf_ali":"What then is the matter with them, that they believe not?-","urdu":"پھر اِن لوگوں کو کیا ہو گیا ہے کہ یہ ایمان نہیں لاتے","turkish":"Onlara ne oluyor da inanmıyorlar?","indonesian":"Maka mengapa mereka tidak mau beriman?","french":"Qu’ont-ils à ne pas croire ?","german":"Was ist denn mit ihnen, daß sie nicht glauben","bengali":"সুতরাং তাদের কি হল যে, তারা বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করেনা?","spanish":"¿Qué es lo que les impide creer?","malay":"Maka apakah alasan bagi mereka bersikap tidak mahu beriman?","bosnian":"Pa šta im je, zašto neće da vjeruju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/20"}},{"verse_key":"84:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"وَإِذَا قُرِئَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقُرْءَانُ لَا يَسْجُدُونَ ۩","transliteration":"Wa-itha quri-a AAalayhimu alqur-anula yasjudoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And when the Qur’ān is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allāh]?","pickthall":"And, when the Qur'an is recited unto them, worship not (Allah)?","yusuf_ali":"And when the Qur'an is read to them, they fall not prostrate,","urdu":"اور جب قرآن اِن کے سامنے پڑ ھا جاتا ہے تو سجدہ نہیں کرتے؟","turkish":"Onlara Kuran okunduğu zaman neden secde etmiyorlar?","indonesian":"Dan apabila Alquran dibacakan kepada mereka, mereka tidak (mau) bersujud,","french":"et à ne pas se prosterner quand le Coran leur est lu ?","german":"und, wenn ihnen der Qur’an vorgelesen wird, sich nicht niederwerfen?","bengali":"এবং তাদের নিকট কুরআন পঠিত হলে তারা সাজদাহ করেনা? [সাজদাহ]","spanish":"¿Qué les impide prosternarse cuando se les recita el Corán?","malay":"Dan (apakah pula alasannya) apabila dibacakan Al-Quran kepada mereka, mereka tidak mahu taat dan sujud?","bosnian":"i zašto, kada im se Kur'an čita, na tle licem ne padaju?!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/21"}},{"verse_key":"84:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ يُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"Bali allatheena kafaroo yukaththiboon","translations":{"sahih_international":"But those who have disbelieved deny,","pickthall":"Nay, but those who disbelieve will deny;","yusuf_ali":"But on the contrary the Unbelievers reject (it).","urdu":"بلکہ یہ منکرین تو الٹا جھٹلاتے ہیں","turkish":"Aksine, inkarcılar yalanlıyorlar.","indonesian":"bahkan orang-orang kafir itu mendustakan-(nya).","french":"Mais ceux qui ne croient pas, le traitent plutôt de mensonge.","german":"Aber nein! Diejenigen, die ungläubig sind, erklären (ihn) für Lüge.","bengali":"পরন্তু কাফিরেরাই অসত্যারোপ করে,","spanish":"Los que rechazan la verdad se empeñan en desmentir [el Mensaje].","malay":"(Tidak ada satu alasan pun) bahkan orang-orang yang kafir, semata-mata mendustakannya;","bosnian":"već, nevjernici, poriču,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/22"}},{"verse_key":"84:23","ayah":23,"arabic":"وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يُوعُونَ","transliteration":"Wallahu aAAlamu bimayooAAoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And Allāh is most knowing of what they keep within themselves.","pickthall":"And Allah knoweth best what they are hiding.","yusuf_ali":"But Allah has full knowledge of what they secrete (in their breasts)","urdu":"حالانکہ جو کچھ یہ (اپنے نامہٴ اعمال میں) جمع کر رہے ہیں اللہ اُسے خوب جانتا ہے۔","turkish":"Oysa, Allah, onların sakladıklarını çok iyi bilir.","indonesian":"Dan Allah lebih mengetahui apa yang mereka sembunyikan (dalam hati mereka).","french":"Or, Allah sait bien ce qu’ils dissimulent.","german":"Doch Allah weiß sehr wohl, was sie (in ihren Herzen) für sich behalten.","bengali":"অথচ তারা (মনে মনে) যা পোষণ করে আল্লাহ তা সবিশেষ পরিজ্ঞাত।","spanish":"Pero Dios conoce bien lo que ocultan [sus corazones].","malay":"Sedang Allah mengetahui apa yang mereka rahsiakan dalam hati.","bosnian":"a Allah dobro zna šta oni u sebi kriju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084023.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/23"}},{"verse_key":"84:24","ayah":24,"arabic":"فَبَشِّرْهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","transliteration":"Fabashshirhum biAAathabin aleem","translations":{"sahih_international":"So give them tidings of a painful punishment,","pickthall":"So give them tidings of a painful doom,","yusuf_ali":"So announce to them a Penalty Grievous,","urdu":"لہٰذا اِن کو دردناک عذاب کی بشارت دے دو","turkish":"Onlara can yakıcı azabı müjde et.","indonesian":"Maka sampaikanlah kepada mereka (ancaman) azab yang pedih,","french":"Annonce-leur donc un châtiment douloureux.","german":"So verkünde ihnen schmerzhafte Strafe,","bengali":"সুতরাং তাদেরকে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তির সুসংবাদ প্রদান কর।","spanish":"Anúnciales un castigo doloroso,","malay":"Maka khabarkanlah kepada mereka dengan azab yang tidak terperi sakitnya;","bosnian":"zato im navijesti patnju neizdržljivu!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084024.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/24"}},{"verse_key":"84:25","ayah":25,"arabic":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونٍۭ","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoowaAAamiloo assalihati lahum ajrun ghayrumamnoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds. For them is a reward uninterrupted.","pickthall":"Save those who believe and do good works, for theirs is a reward unfailing.","yusuf_ali":"Except to those who believe and work righteous deeds: For them is a Reward that will never fail.","urdu":"البتہ جو لوگ ایمان لے آئے ہیں اور جنہوں نے نیک عمل کیے ہیں ان کے لیے کبھی ختم نہ ہونے والا اجر ہے","turkish":"Yalnız, inanıp yararlı işler işleyenlere, onlara, kesintisiz ecir vardır.","indonesian":"kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan, mereka akan mendapat pahala yang tidak putus-putusnya.","french":"Sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres: à eux une récompense jamais interrompue.","german":"außer denjenigen, die glauben und rechtschaffene Werke tun; für sie wird es einen Lohn geben, der nicht aufhört.","bengali":"যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে অবিচ্ছিন্ন পুরস্কার।","spanish":"salvo a quienes crean y obren rectamente, porque ellos recibirán una recompensa inagotable.","malay":"Tetapi orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh mereka beroleh pahala balasan yang tidak putus-putus.","bosnian":"Ali one koji budu vjerovali i dobra djela činili nagrada neprekidna će čekati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/084025.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/84/25"}}]}},{"number":85,"data":{"surah":{"number":85,"name_arabic":"البروج","name_english":"Al-Buruj","name_translation":"The Mansions of the Stars","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":27,"verses_count":22,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/085.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/085.mp3"}],"total_verses":22,"verses":[{"verse_key":"85:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلْبُرُوجِ","transliteration":"Wassama-i thatialburooj","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the sky containing great stars","pickthall":"By the heaven, holding mansions of the stars,","yusuf_ali":"By the sky, (displaying) the Zodiacal Signs;","urdu":"قسم ہے مضبُوط قلعوں والے آسمان کی،","turkish":"İçinde burçları bulunan göğe and olsun;","indonesian":"Demi langit yang mempunyai gugusan bintang,","french":"Par le ciel aux constellations !","german":"Beim Himmel mit den Türmen","bengali":"শপথ রাশিচক্র সমন্বিত আকাশের,","spanish":"Juro por el cosmos y sus constelaciones,","malay":"Demi langit yang mempunyai tempat-tempat peredaran bintang-bintang;","bosnian":"Tako mi neba sazviježđima okićenog,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/1"}},{"verse_key":"85:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْمَوْعُودِ","transliteration":"Walyawmi almawAAood","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the promised Day","pickthall":"And by the Promised Day.","yusuf_ali":"By the promised Day (of Judgment);","urdu":"اور اُس دن کی جس کا وعدہ کیا گیا ہے،","turkish":"Söz verilen kıyamet gününe and olsun;","indonesian":"dan demi hari yang dijanjikan.","french":"et par le jour promis !","german":"und dem versprochenen Tag","bengali":"এবং প্রতিশ্রুত দিনের,","spanish":"por el día prometido [el Día del Juicio Final],","malay":"Dan hari (pembalasan) yang dijanjikan;","bosnian":"i Dana već određenog,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/2"}},{"verse_key":"85:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَشَاهِدٍ وَمَشْهُودٍ","transliteration":"Washahidin wamashhood","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the witness and what is witnessed,","pickthall":"And by the witness and that whereunto he beareth testimony,","yusuf_ali":"By one that witnesses, and the subject of the witness;-","urdu":"اور دیکھنے والے کی اور دیکھی جانے والی چیز کی","turkish":"Şahitlik edene ve edilene and olsun ki, insanlar öldükten sonra diriltileceklerdir.","indonesian":"Demi yang menyaksikan dan yang disaksikan.","french":"et par le témoin et ce dont on témoigne !","german":"und dem Zeugen und dem Bezeugten!","bengali":"শপথ দ্রষ্টা ও দৃষ্টের।","spanish":"y por el testigo y lo atestiguado,","malay":"Dan makhluk-makhluk yang hadir menyaksikan hari itu, serta segala keadaan yang disaksikan; -","bosnian":"i prisutnih, i onoga što će biti prisutno –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/3"}},{"verse_key":"85:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"قُتِلَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْأُخْدُودِ","transliteration":"Qutila as-habu alukhdood","translations":{"sahih_international":"Destroyed [i.e., cursed] were the companions of the trench","pickthall":"(Self-)destroyed were the owners of the ditch","yusuf_ali":"Woe to the makers of the pit (of fire),","urdu":"کہ مارے گئے گڑھے والے","turkish":"Hazırladıkları hendekleri, tutuşturulmuş ateşle doldurarak onun çevresinde oturup, inanmış kimselere dinlerinden dönmeleri için yaptıkları işkenceleri seyredenler kahrolmuştur!","indonesian":"Binasalah orang-orang yang membuat parit (yaitu para pembesar Najran di Yaman),","french":"Périssent les gens ceux [qui creusèrent ] des fossés (Al Ukhdûd),","german":"Tod (sei) geweiht den Leuten des Grabens,","bengali":"ধ্বংস হয়েছিল কুন্ডের অধিপতিরা –","spanish":"que los que arrojaron a los creyentes al foso del fuego fueron maldecidos.","malay":"Celakalah kaum yang menggali parit,","bosnian":"prokleti neka su oni koji su rovove iskopali,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/4"}},{"verse_key":"85:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"ٱلنَّارِ ذَاتِ ٱلْوَقُودِ","transliteration":"Annari thati alwaqood","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Containing] the fire full of fuel,","pickthall":"Of the fuel-fed fire,","yusuf_ali":"Fire supplied (abundantly) with fuel:","urdu":"(اُس گڑھے والے) جس میں خوب بھڑکتے ہوئے ایندھن کی آگ تھی","turkish":"Hazırladıkları hendekleri, tutuşturulmuş ateşle doldurarak onun çevresinde oturup, inanmış kimselere dinlerinden dönmeleri için yaptıkları işkenceleri seyredenler kahrolmuştur!","indonesian":"yang berapi (yang mempunyai) kayu bakar,","french":"au feu plein de combustible,","german":"des Feuers mit dem (vielen) Brennstoff,","bengali":"ইন্ধনপূর্ণ যে কুন্ডে ছিল অগ্নি।","spanish":"En el foso encendieron un fuego ardiente,","malay":"(Parit) api yang penuh dengan bahan bakaran,","bosnian":"i vatrom i gorivom ih napunili,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/5"}},{"verse_key":"85:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"إِذْ هُمْ عَلَيْهَا قُعُودٌ","transliteration":"Ith hum AAalayha quAAood","translations":{"sahih_international":"When they were sitting near it.","pickthall":"When they sat by it,","yusuf_ali":"Behold! they sat over against the (fire),","urdu":"جبکہ وہ اُس گڑھے کے کنارے بیٹھے ہوئے تھے","turkish":"Hazırladıkları hendekleri, tutuşturulmuş ateşle doldurarak onun çevresinde oturup, inanmış kimselere dinlerinden dönmeleri için yaptıkları işkenceleri seyredenler kahrolmuştur!","indonesian":"ketika mereka duduk di sekitarnya,","french":"cependant qu’ils étaient assis tout autour,","german":"als sie daran saßen","bengali":"যখন তারা এর পাশে উপবিষ্ট ছিল;","spanish":"y se sentaron en sus bordes","malay":"(Mereka dilaknat) ketika mereka duduk di kelilingnya,","bosnian":"kada su oko nje sjedili"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/6"}},{"verse_key":"85:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"وَهُمْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفْعَلُونَ بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ شُهُودٌ","transliteration":"Wahum AAala ma yafAAaloona bilmu/mineenashuhood","translations":{"sahih_international":"And they, to what they were doing against the believers, were witnesses.","pickthall":"And were themselves the witnesses of what they did to the believers.","yusuf_ali":"And they witnessed (all) that they were doing against the Believers.","urdu":"اور جو کچھ وہ ایمان لانے والوں کے ساتھ کر رہے تھے اُسے دیکھ رہے تھے۔","turkish":"Hazırladıkları hendekleri, tutuşturulmuş ateşle doldurarak onun çevresinde oturup, inanmış kimselere dinlerinden dönmeleri için yaptıkları işkenceleri seyredenler kahrolmuştur!","indonesian":"sedang mereka menyaksikan apa yang mereka perbuat terhadap orang-orang mukmin.","french":"ils étaient ainsi témoins de ce qu’ils faisaient des croyants,","german":"und Zeugen dessen waren, was sie den Gläubigen antaten.","bengali":"এবং তারা মু’মিনদের সাথে যা করেছিল তা প্রত্যক্ষ করছিল।","spanish":"para presenciar lo que cometían contra los creyentes,","malay":"Sambil mereka melihat apa yang mereka lakukan kepada orang-orang yang beriman.","bosnian":"i bili svjedoci onoga što su vjernicima radili!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/7"}},{"verse_key":"85:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَمَا نَقَمُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ إِلَّآ أَن يُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ","transliteration":"Wama naqamoo minhum illa anyu/minoo billahi alAAazeezi alhameed","translations":{"sahih_international":"And they resented them not except because they believed in Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy,","pickthall":"They had naught against them save that they believed in Allah, the Mighty, the Owner of Praise,","yusuf_ali":"And they ill-treated them for no other reason than that they believed in Allah, Exalted in Power, Worthy of all Praise!-","urdu":"اور اُن اہل ایمان سے اُن کی دشمنی اِس کے سوا کسی وجہ سے نہ تھی کہ وہ اُس خدا پر ایمان لے آئے تھے جو زبردست اور اپنی ذات میں آپ محمود ہے","turkish":"Bu inkarcıların, inananlara kızmaları; onların sadece, göklerin ve yerin hükümranlığı kendisinin bulunan ve övülmeğe layık ve güçlü olan Allah'a inanmış olmalarındandı. Allah her şeye şahiddir.","indonesian":"Dan mereka menyiksa orang-orang mukmin itu hanya karena (orang-orang mukmin itu) beriman kepada Allah Yang Mahaperkasa, Maha Terpuji,","french":"à qui ils ne leur reprochaient que d’avoir cru en Allah, le Puissant, le Digne de louange,","german":"Und sie grollten ihnen nur, daß sie an Allah glaubten, den Allmächtigen und Lobenswürdigen,","bengali":"তারা তাদেরকে নির্যাতন করেছিল শুধু এ কারণে যে, তারা সেই মহিমাময় পরাক্রান্ত প্রশংসাভাজন আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান এনেছিল।","spanish":"cuya única culpa para merecer ese castigo era creer en Dios, el Poderoso, el Loable,","malay":"Dan mereka tidak marah dan menyeksakan orang-orang yang beriman itu melainkan kerana orang-orang itu beriman kepada Allah Yang Maha Kuasa, lagi Maha Terpuji!","bosnian":"A svetili su im se samo zato što su u Allaha, Silnoga i Hvale dostojnoga, vjerovali,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/8"}},{"verse_key":"85:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ","transliteration":"Allathee lahu mulku assamawatiwal-ardi wallahu AAala kullishay-in shaheed","translations":{"sahih_international":"To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allāh, over all things, is Witness.","pickthall":"Him unto Whom belongeth the Sovereignty of the heavens and the earth; and Allah is of all things the Witness.","yusuf_ali":"Him to Whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth! And Allah is Witness to all things.","urdu":"جو آسمانوں اور زمین کی سلطنت کا مالک ہے، اور وہ خدا سب کچھ دیکھ رہا ہے۔","turkish":"Bu inkarcıların, inananlara kızmaları; onların sadece, göklerin ve yerin hükümranlığı kendisinin bulunan ve övülmeğe layık ve güçlü olan Allah'a inanmış olmalarındandı. Allah her şeye şahiddir.","indonesian":"yang memiliki kerajaan langit dan bumi. Dan Allah Maha Menyaksikan segala sesuatu.","french":"Auquel appartient la royauté des cieux et de la Terre. Allah est témoin de toute chose.","german":"Dem die Herrschaft der Himmel und der Erde gehört. Und Allah ist über alles Zeuge.","bengali":"আকাশমন্ডলী ও পৃথিবীর সার্বভৌমত্ব যাঁর, আর আল্লাহ সর্ব বিষয়ে দ্রষ্টা।","spanish":"a Quien pertenece el reino de los cielos y de la tierra. Dios es testigo de todo.","malay":"Tuhan yang menguasai segala alam langit dan bumi. Dan (ingatlah), Allah sentiasa menyaksikan tiap-tiap sesuatu.","bosnian":"čija je vlast i na nebesima i na Zemlji – a Allah je svemu Svjedok."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/9"}},{"verse_key":"85:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا۟ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا۟ فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ ٱلْحَرِيقِ","transliteration":"Inna allatheena fatanoo almu/mineenawalmu/minati thumma lam yatooboo falahum AAathabujahannama walahum AAathabu alhareeq","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.","pickthall":"Lo! they who persecute believing men and believing women and repent not, theirs verily will be the doom of hell, and theirs the doom of burning.","yusuf_ali":"Those who persecute (or draw into temptation) the Believers, men and women, and do not turn in repentance, will have the Penalty of Hell: They will have the Penalty of the Burning Fire.","urdu":"جن لوگوں نے مومن مردوں اور عورتوں پر ظلم و ستم توڑا اور پھر اس سے تائب نہ ہوئے، یقیناً اُن کے لیے جہنّم کا عذاب ہے اور ان کے لیے جَلائے جانے کی سزا ہے۔","turkish":"Ama inanmış erkek ve kadınlara işkence ederek onları dinlerinden çevirmeğe uğraşanlar, eğer tevbe etmezlerse, onlara cehennem azabı vardır. Yakıcı azap da onlaradır.","indonesian":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang mendatangkan cobaan (bencana, membunuh, menyiksa) kepada orang-orang mukmin laki-laki dan perempuan lalu mereka tidak bertobat, maka mereka akan mendapat azab Jahanam dan mereka akan mendapat azab (neraka) yang membakar.","french":"Ceux qui font subir des épreuves aux croyants et aux croyantes, puis ne se repentent pas, auront le châtiment de l’Enfer et le supplice du feu.","german":"Gewiß, diejenigen, die die gläubigen Männer und die gläubigen Frauen in Versuchung bringen und hierauf nicht in Reue umkehren, für sie wird es die Strafe der Hölle geben, und für sie wird es die Strafe des Brennens geben.","bengali":"যারা বিশ্বাসী নর নারীকে বিপদাপন্ন করেছে এবং পরে তাওবাহ করেনি, তাদের জন্য আছে জাহান্নামের শাস্তি ও দহন যন্ত্রণা (নির্ধারিত) রয়েছে।","spanish":"Quienes persigan a los creyentes y a las creyentes y no se arrepientan [antes de morir], sufrirán en el Infierno un castigo abrasador.","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang menimpakan bencana untuk memesongkan orang-orang lelaki yang beriman dan orang-orang perempuan yang beriman, kemudian mereka tidak bertaubat, maka mereka akan beroleh azab neraka Jahannam (kerana perbuatan buruk itu), dan mereka akan beroleh lagi azab api yang kuat membakar (kerana mereka tidak bertaubat).","bosnian":"One koji vjernike i vjernice budu na muke stavljali pa se ne budu pokajali – čeka patnja u Džehennemu i isto tako prženje u ognju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/10"}},{"verse_key":"85:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْكَبِيرُ","transliteration":"Inna allatheena amanoowaAAamiloo assalihati lahum jannatuntajree min tahtiha al-anharu thalikaalfawzu alkabeer","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.","pickthall":"Lo! those who believe and do good works, theirs will be Gardens underneath which rivers flow. That is the Great Success.","yusuf_ali":"For those who believe and do righteous deeds, will be Gardens; beneath which rivers flow: That is the great Salvation, (the fulfilment of all desires),","urdu":"جو لوگ ایمان لائے اور جنہوں نے نیک عمل کیے، یقیناً اُن کے لیے جنت کے باغ ہیں جن کے نیچے نہریں بہتی ہوں گی، یہ ہے بڑی کامیابی","turkish":"Şüphesiz inanıp yararlı işler işleyenlere, onlara, içlerinden ırmaklar akan cennetler vardır. Bu, büyük kurtuluştur.","indonesian":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan, mereka akan mendapat surga yang mengalir di bawahnya sungai-sungai, itulah kemenangan yang agung.","french":"Ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres auront des Jardins sous lesquels coulent les ruisseaux. Cela est le grand succès.","german":"Gewiß, diejenigen, die glauben und rechtschaffene Werke tun, für sie wird es Gärten geben, durcheilt von Bächen; das ist der große Erfolg.","bengali":"যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে তাদের জন্যই আছে জান্নাত, যার নিম্নে স্রোতস্বিনী প্রবাহিত; এটাই সুমহান, সফলকাম।","spanish":"En cambio, quienes hayan creído y obrado correctamente serán recompensados con jardines por donde corren los ríos. Ese es el triunfo grandioso.","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh, mereka akan beroleh Syurga yang mengalir di bawahnya beberapa sungai; yang demikian itu ialah kemenangan yang besar.","bosnian":"a one koji budu vjerovali i dobra djela činili čekaju bašče džennetske kroz koje rijeke teku – a to će veliki uspjeh biti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/11"}},{"verse_key":"85:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"إِنَّ بَطْشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيدٌ","transliteration":"Inna batsha rabbika lashadeed","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, the assault [i.e., vengeance] of your Lord is severe.","pickthall":"Lo! the punishment of thy Lord is stern.","yusuf_ali":"Truly strong is the Grip (and Power) of thy Lord.","urdu":"درحقیقت تمہارے رب کی پکڑ بڑی سخت ہے","turkish":"Doğrusu Rabbinin yakalaması amansızdır.","indonesian":"Sungguh, azab Tuhanmu sangat keras.","french":"La riposte de ton Seigneur est redoutable.","german":"Das Zupacken deines Herrn ist wahrlich hart.","bengali":"তোমার রবের শাস্তি বড়ই কঠিন।","spanish":"¡Pero el castigo de tu Señor es severo!","malay":"Sesungguhnya azab Tuhanmu (terhadap orang-orang yang kufur ingkar) amatlah berat.","bosnian":"Odmazda Gospodara tvoga će, zaista, užasna biti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/12"}},{"verse_key":"85:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ يُبْدِئُ وَيُعِيدُ","transliteration":"Innahu huwa yubdi-o wayuAAeed","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, it is He who originates [creation] and repeats.","pickthall":"Lo! He it is Who produceth, then reproduceth,","yusuf_ali":"It is He Who creates from the very beginning, and He can restore (life).","urdu":"وہی پہلی بار پیدا کرتا ہے اور وہی دوبارہ پیدا کرے گا","turkish":"Önce yaratıp sonra bunu tekrar eden O'dur.","indonesian":"Sungguh, Dialah yang memulai penciptaan (makhluk) dan yang menghidupkannya (kembali).","french":"C’est Lui, certes, qui commence (la création) et la refait.","german":"Gewiß, Er macht den Anfang und läßt wiederkehren.","bengali":"তিনিই অস্তিত্ব দান করেন ও পুনরাবর্তন ঘটান,","spanish":"Él da origen y reproduce.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Dia lah yang menciptakan (sekalian makhluk) pada mulanya, dan yang mengembalikannya (hidup semula sesudah mati).","bosnian":"On iz ničega stvara, i ponovo će to učiniti;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/13"}},{"verse_key":"85:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلْوَدُودُ","transliteration":"Wahuwa alghafooru alwadood","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He is the Forgiving, the Affectionate,","pickthall":"And He is the Forgiving, the Loving,","yusuf_ali":"And He is the Oft-Forgiving, Full of Loving-Kindness,","urdu":"اور وہ بخشنے والا ہے، محبت کرنے والا ہے","turkish":"Yüce arşın sahibi, çok seven, bağışlayan O'dur.","indonesian":"Dan Dialah Yang Maha Pengampun, Maha Pengasih,","french":"Et c’est Lui le Pardonneur, le Tout Affectueux,","german":"Und Er ist der Allvergebende und Liebevolle,","bengali":"এবং তিনি ক্ষমাশীল, প্রেমময়,","spanish":"Él es el Absolvedor, el Afectuoso.","malay":"Dan Dia lah yang Maha Pengampun, lagi Maha Pengasih.","bosnian":"i On prašta, i pun je ljubavi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/14"}},{"verse_key":"85:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"ذُو ٱلْعَرْشِ ٱلْمَجِيدُ","transliteration":"Thoo alAAarshi almajeed","translations":{"sahih_international":"Honorable Owner of the Throne,","pickthall":"Lord of the Throne of Glory,","yusuf_ali":"Lord of the Throne of Glory,","urdu":"عرش کا مالک ہے، بزرگ و برتر ہے","turkish":"Yüce arşın sahibi, çok seven, bağışlayan O'dur.","indonesian":"Yang memiliki Arasy, lagi Mahamulia,","french":"Le Maître du Trône, le Tout Glorieux,","german":"der Herr des Thrones, der Ruhmvolle.","bengali":"আরশের অধিপতি মহিমময়,","spanish":"Señor del Trono, el Majestuoso.","malay":"Tuhan yang mempunyai Arasy yang tinggi kemuliaannya,","bosnian":"Gospodar Arša, Uzvišeni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/15"}},{"verse_key":"85:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"فَعَّالٌ لِّمَا يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"FaAAAAalun lima yureed","translations":{"sahih_international":"Effecter of what He intends.","pickthall":"Doer of what He will.","yusuf_ali":"Doer (without let) of all that He intends.","urdu":"اور جو کچھ چاہے کر ڈالنے والا ہے۔","turkish":"Her dilediğini mutlaka yapandır.","indonesian":"Mahakuasa berbuat apa yang Dia kehendaki.","french":"Il réalise parfaitement tout ce qu’Il veut.","german":"(Er) tut alles, was Er will.","bengali":"তিনি যা ইচ্ছা করেন তা’ই করে থাকেন,","spanish":"Hacedor de Su voluntad.","malay":"Yang berkuasa melakukan segala yang dikehendakinya.","bosnian":"On radi šta je Njemu volja."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/16"}},{"verse_key":"85:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْجُنُودِ","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu aljunood","translations":{"sahih_international":"Has there reached you the story of the soldiers -","pickthall":"Hath there come unto thee the story of the hosts","yusuf_ali":"Has the story reached thee, of the forces-","urdu":"کیا تمہیں لشکروں کی خبر پہنچی ہے؟","turkish":"Firavun ve Semud ordularının haberi sana geldi mi?","indonesian":"Sudahkah sampai kepadamu berita tentang bala tentara (penentang),","french":"T’est-il parvenu le récit des armées,","german":"Ist zu dir die Geschichte der Heerscharen gekommen,","bengali":"তোমার নিকট কি পৌঁছেছে সৈন্য বাহিনীর বৃত্তান্ত –","spanish":"¿Has escuchado la historia de los ejércitos [criminales]","malay":"Sudahkah sampai kepadamu (wahai Muhammad) perihal (kebinasaan yang telah menimpa) kaum-kaum yang menentang (Rasul-rasul yang diutuskan kepada mereka)?","bosnian":"Da li je doprla do tebe vijest o vojskama,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/17"}},{"verse_key":"85:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"فِرْعَوْنَ وَثَمُودَ","transliteration":"FirAAawna wathamood","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Those of] Pharaoh and Thamūd?","pickthall":"Of Pharaoh and (the tribe of) Thamud?","yusuf_ali":"Of Pharaoh and the Thamud?","urdu":"فرعون اور ثمود (کے لشکروں)کی؟","turkish":"Firavun ve Semud ordularının haberi sana geldi mi?","indonesian":"(yaitu) Fir'aun dan Samud?","french":"de Pharaon, et de Thamûd ?","german":"Fir’auns und der Tamud?","bengali":"ফির‘আউন ও ছামূদের?","spanish":"del Faraón y del pueblo de Zamud [que desmintieron a los Mensajeros y los destruí]?","malay":"(Mereka itu ialah kaum) Firaun, dan Thamud (kaum Nabi Soleh).","bosnian":"o faraonu i Semudu?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/18"}},{"verse_key":"85:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ فِى تَكْذِيبٍ","transliteration":"Bali allatheena kafaroo fee taktheeb","translations":{"sahih_international":"But they who disbelieve are in [persistent] denial,","pickthall":"Nay, but those who disbelieve live in denial","yusuf_ali":"And yet the Unbelievers (persist) in rejecting (the Truth)!","urdu":"مگر جنہوں نے کفر کیا ہے وہ جھٹلانے میں لگے ہوئے ہیں","turkish":"Doğrusu inkar edenler, hep yalanlayagelmişlerdir.","indonesian":"Memang orang-orang kafir (selalu) mendustakan,","french":"Mais ceux qui ne croient pas persistent à démentir,","german":"Aber nein! Diejenigen, die ungläubig sind, sind dem Leugnen (der Botschaft) verhaftet.","bengali":"তবু কাফিরেরা মিথ্যা আরোপ করায় রত,","spanish":"Sin embargo, los que niegan la verdad continúan desmintiendo.","malay":"(Kaummu wahai Muhammad, bukan sahaja menolak ajaranmu), bahkan orang-orang yang kafir itu terus tenggelam dalam keadaan mendustakan kebenaran;","bosnian":"Ali, ovi koji neće da vjeruju stalno poriču –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/19"}},{"verse_key":"85:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"وَٱللَّهُ مِن وَرَآئِهِم مُّحِيطٌۢ","transliteration":"Wallahu min wara-ihimmuheet","translations":{"sahih_international":"While Allāh encompasses them from behind.","pickthall":"And Allah, all unseen, surroundeth them.","yusuf_ali":"But Allah doth encompass them from behind!","urdu":"حالانکہ اللہ نے ان کو گھیرے میں لے رکھا ہے","turkish":"Oysa Allah onları ardlarından çevirmiştir.","indonesian":"padahal Allah mengepung dari belakang mereka (sehingga tidak dapat lolos).","french":"alors qu’Allah, derrière eux, les cerne de toutes parts.","german":"Doch Allah ist hinter ihnen her, (sie) umfassend.","bengali":"এবং আল্লাহ তাদের পরিবেষ্টন করে রয়েছেন।","spanish":"Pero Dios los domina sin que lo sepan.","malay":"Sedang Allah, dari belakang mereka, melingkungi mereka (dengan kekuasaanNya)!","bosnian":"a Allahu oni neće moći umaći:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/20"}},{"verse_key":"85:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"بَلْ هُوَ قُرْءَانٌ مَّجِيدٌ","transliteration":"Bal huwa qur-anun majeed","translations":{"sahih_international":"But this is an honored Qur’ān","pickthall":"Nay, but it is a glorious Qur'an.","yusuf_ali":"Nay, this is a Glorious Qur'an,","urdu":"(اُن کے جھٹلانے سے اِس قرآن کا کچھ نہیں بگڑتا) بلکہ یہ قرآن بلند پایہ ہے","turkish":"Doğrusu sana vahyedilen bu Kitap, Levhi Mahfuz'da bulunan şanlı bir Kuran'dır.","indonesian":"Bahkan (yang didustakan itu) ialah Alquran yang mulia,","french":"Mais c’est plutôt un Coran glorifié.","german":"Nein! Vielmehr ist es ein ruhmvoller Qur’an","bengali":"এটা কুরআন,","spanish":"Este es un Corán glorioso","malay":"(Sebenarnya apa yang engkau sampaikan kepada mereka bukanlah syair atau sihir), bahkan ialah Al-Quran yang tertinggi kemuliaannya;","bosnian":"a ovo je Kur'an veličanstveni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/21"}},{"verse_key":"85:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"فِى لَوْحٍ مَّحْفُوظٍۭ","transliteration":"Fee lawhin mahfooth","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Inscribed] in a Preserved Slate.","pickthall":"On a guarded tablet.","yusuf_ali":"(Inscribed) in a Tablet Preserved!","urdu":"اُس لوح میں (نقش ہے) جو محفوظ ہے۔","turkish":"Doğrusu sana vahyedilen bu Kitap, Levhi Mahfuz'da bulunan şanlı bir Kuran'dır.","indonesian":"yang (tersimpan) dalam (tempat) yang terjaga (Lauḥ Maḥfūẓ).","french":"préservé sur une Tablette (auprès d’Allah).","german":"auf einer wohlbehüteten Tafel.","bengali":"সংরক্ষিত ফলকে লিপিবদ্ধ।","spanish":"que está registrado en la Tabla Protegida.","malay":"(Lagi yang terpelihara dengan sebaik-baiknya) pada Lauh Mahfuz.","bosnian":"na Ploči pomno čuvanoj."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/85/22"}}]}},{"number":86,"data":{"surah":{"number":86,"name_arabic":"الطارق","name_english":"At-Tariq","name_translation":"The Nightcommer","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":36,"verses_count":17,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/086.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/086.mp3"}],"total_verses":17,"verses":[{"verse_key":"86:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","transliteration":"Wassama-i wattariq","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the sky and the night comer","pickthall":"By the heaven and the Morning Star","yusuf_ali":"By the Sky and the Night-Visitant (therein);-","urdu":"قسم ہے آسمان کی اور رات کو نمودار ہونے والے کی","turkish":"Göğe ve Tarık'a and olsun;","indonesian":"Demi langit dan yang datang pada malam hari.","french":"Par le ciel et par l’astre nocturne.","german":"Beim Himmel und dem Pochenden!","bengali":"শপথ আকাশের এবং রাতে যা আবির্ভূত হয় তার;","spanish":"Juro por el cosmos y el astro nocturno.","malay":"Demi langit dan \"At-Taariq\"; -","bosnian":"Tako mi neba i Danice!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/1"}},{"verse_key":"86:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma attariq","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","pickthall":"- Ah, what will tell thee what the Morning Star is!","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what the Night-Visitant is?-","urdu":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ وہ رات کو نمودار ہونے والا کیا ہے؟","turkish":"Tarık'ın ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah yang datang pada malam hari itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est l’astre nocturne?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was der Pochende ist?","bengali":"তুমি কী জান রাতে যা আবির্ভূত হয় তা কি?","spanish":"¿Y qué puede hacerte comprender lo que es el astro nocturno?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui apa dia \"At-Taariq\" itu? -","bosnian":"A znaš li ti šta je Danica?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/2"}},{"verse_key":"86:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","transliteration":"Annajmu aththaqib","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is the piercing star","pickthall":"- The piercing Star!","yusuf_ali":"(It is) the Star of piercing brightness;-","urdu":"چمکتا ہوا تارا","turkish":"O, (ışığıyla karanlığı) delen yıldızdır.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) bintang yang bersinar tajam,","french":"C’est l’étoile vivement brillante.","german":"(Es ist) der durchbohrend helle Stem.","bengali":"ওটা দীপ্তিমান নক্ষত্র!","spanish":"Es una estrella fulgurante.","malay":"(At-Taariq) ialah bintang yang menembusi (sinaran cahayanya);","bosnian":"Zvijezda blistava!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/3"}},{"verse_key":"86:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ","transliteration":"In kullu nafsin lamma AAalayha hafith","translations":{"sahih_international":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","pickthall":"No human soul but hath a guardian over it.","yusuf_ali":"There is no soul but has a protector over it.","urdu":"کوئی جان ایسی نہیں ہے جس کے اوپر کوئی نگہبان نہ ہو۔","turkish":"Üzerinde gözetici olmayan kimse yoktur.","indonesian":"setiap orang pasti ada penjaganya.","french":"Il n’est pas d’âme qui n’ait sur elle un gardien.","german":"Es gibt keine Seele, über der nicht ein Hüter (eingesetzt) ist.","bengali":"প্রত্যেক জীবের উপরই সংরক্ষক রয়েছে।","spanish":"Toda alma tiene designada un ángel protector que registra sus obras.","malay":"Tiada sesuatu diri juapun melainkan ada malaikat yang menjaga (keadaannya serta menyimpan catitan mengenai segala bawaannya).","bosnian":"Nema čovjeka nad kojim neko ne bdije."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/4"}},{"verse_key":"86:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","transliteration":"Falyanthuri al-insanumimma khuliq","translations":{"sahih_international":"So let man observe from what he was created.","pickthall":"So let man consider from what he is created.","yusuf_ali":"Now let man but think from what he is created!","urdu":"پھر ذرا انسان یہی دیکھ لے کہ وہ کِس چیز سے پیدا کیا گیا ہے۔","turkish":"Öyleyse insan neden yaratıldığına bir baksın.","indonesian":"Maka hendaklah manusia memperhatikan dari apa dia diciptakan.","french":"Que l’homme considère donc de quoi il a été créé.","german":"So soll der Mensch doch hinsehen, woraus er erschaffen ist.","bengali":"সুতরাং মানুষের চিন্তা করা উচিত যে, তাকে কিসের দ্বারা সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে।","spanish":"Que medite el ser humano de qué fue creado:","malay":"(Setelah mengetahui yang demikian), maka hendaklah manusia memikirkan: dari apa ia diciptakan.","bosnian":"Nek čovjek pogleda od čega je stvoren!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/5"}},{"verse_key":"86:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ","transliteration":"Khuliqa min ma-in dafiq","translations":{"sahih_international":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","pickthall":"He is created from a gushing fluid","yusuf_ali":"He is created from a drop emitted-","urdu":"ایک اچھلنے والے پانی سے پیدا کیا گیا ہے","turkish":"O, erkek ve kadının beli ile kaburga kemikleri arasından atılagelen bir sudan yaratılmıştır.","indonesian":"Dia diciptakan dari air (mani) yang terpancar,","french":"Il a été créé d’une giclée d’eau.","german":"Er ist aus sich ergießendem Wasser erschaffen,","bengali":"তাকে সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে সবেগে স্খলিত পানি হতে,","spanish":"Fue creado de un líquido seminal","malay":"Ia diciptakan dari air (mani) yang memancut (ke dalam rahim) -","bosnian":"Stvoren je od tekućine koja se izbaci,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/6"}},{"verse_key":"86:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","transliteration":"Yakhruju min bayni assulbi wattara-ib","translations":{"sahih_international":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","pickthall":"That issued from between the loins and ribs.","yusuf_ali":"Proceeding from between the backbone and the ribs:","urdu":"جو پیٹھ اور سینے کی ہڈیوں کے درمیان سے نکلتا ہے۔","turkish":"O, erkek ve kadının beli ile kaburga kemikleri arasından atılagelen bir sudan yaratılmıştır.","indonesian":"yang keluar dari antara tulang punggung (sulbi) dan tulang dada.","french":"sortie d’entre les lombes et les côtes.","german":"das zwischen der Lende und der (weiblichen) Brust hervorkommt.","bengali":"এটা নির্গত হয় পৃষ্ঠদেশ ও পঞ্জরাস্থির মধ্য হতে।","spanish":"que proviene de entre las entrañas [del hombre] y el arco pélvico [de la mujer].","malay":"Yang keluar dari \"tulang sulbi\" lelaki dan \"tulang dada\" perempuan.","bosnian":"koja između kičme i grudi izlazi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/7"}},{"verse_key":"86:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌ","transliteration":"Innahu AAala rajAAihi laqadir","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.","pickthall":"Lo! He verily is Able to return him (unto life)","yusuf_ali":"Surely (Allah) is able to bring him back (to life)!","urdu":"یقیناً وہ (خالق) اُسے دوبارہ پیدا کرنے پر قادر ہے۔","turkish":"Şüphesiz Allah, gizliliklerin ortaya çıkacağı gün, insanı tekrar yaratmaya Kadir'dir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, Allah benar-benar kuasa untuk mengembalikannya (hidup setelah mati).","french":"Allah est certes capable de le ressusciter.","german":"Er hat die Macht dazu, ihn zurückkehren zu lassen,","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি তার পুনরাবর্তনে ক্ষমতাবান।","spanish":"[Así como lo ha creado la primera vez] Él tiene el poder para resucitarlo.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Allah Maha Kuasa untuk mengembalikannya (hidup semula sesudah mati),","bosnian":"i On je, zaista, kadar da ga ponovo stvori"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/8"}},{"verse_key":"86:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","transliteration":"Yawma tubla assara-ir","translations":{"sahih_international":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","pickthall":"On the day when hidden thoughts shall be searched out.","yusuf_ali":"The Day that (all) things secret will be tested,","urdu":"جس روز پوشیدہ اسرار کی جانچ پڑتال ہوگی","turkish":"Şüphesiz Allah, gizliliklerin ortaya çıkacağı gün, insanı tekrar yaratmaya Kadir'dir.","indonesian":"Pada hari ditampakkan segala rahasia,","french":"Le jour où les cœurs dévoileront leurs secrets,","german":"am Tag, da die geheimsten Gedanken geprüft werden.","bengali":"যেদিন গোপন বিষয়সমূহ পরীক্ষা করা হবে –","spanish":"El día que sean revelados todos los secretos,","malay":"Pada hari didedahkan segala yang terpendam di hati (dari iktiqad, niat, dan lain-lainnya),","bosnian":"onoga Dana kada budu ispitivane savjesti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/9"}},{"verse_key":"86:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ","transliteration":"Fama lahu min quwwatin wala nasir","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.","pickthall":"Then will he have no might nor any helper.","yusuf_ali":"(Man) will have no power, and no helper.","urdu":"اُس وقت انسان کے پاس نہ خود اپنا کوئی زور ہوگا اور نہ کوئی اس کی مدد کرنے والا ہوگا","turkish":"O gün, insanın gücü de, yardımcısı da olmaz.","indonesian":"maka manusia tidak lagi mempunyai suatu kekuatan dan tidak (pula) ada penolong.","french":"Il n’aura alors ni force ni secoureur.","german":"Dann hat er weder Kraft noch einen Helfer.","bengali":"সেদিন তার কোন ক্ষমতা থাকবেনা এবং সাহায্যকারীও না।","spanish":"y [el ser humano] no tenga fuerzas [para defenderse] a sí mismo ni auxiliador alguno.","malay":"Maka (pada saat itu) tidak ada bagi manusia sebarang kekuatan (untuk membela diri), dan tidak ada penolong (yang dapat memberikan pertolongan).","bosnian":"kada čovjek ni snage ni branioca neće imati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/10"}},{"verse_key":"86:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","transliteration":"Wassama-i thati arrajAA","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the sky which sends back","pickthall":"By the heaven which giveth the returning rain,","yusuf_ali":"By the Firmament which returns (in its round),","urdu":"قسم ہے بارش برسانے والے آسمان کی","turkish":"Dönüşlü göğe ve yarılan yeryüzüne and olsun ki,","indonesian":"Demi langit yang mengandung hujan,","french":"Par le ciel qui fait revenir la pluie !","german":"Beim Himmel mit der Wiederkehr","bengali":"শপথ আসমানের যা ধারণ করে বৃষ্টি,","spanish":"Juro por el cielo que devuelve [el agua que sube en forma de lluvias],","malay":"Demi langit yang berulang-ulang mencurahkan hujan,","bosnian":"I tako mi neba puna kiše"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/11"}},{"verse_key":"86:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","transliteration":"Wal-ardi thati assadAA","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the earth which splits,","pickthall":"And the earth which splitteth (with the growth of trees and plants)","yusuf_ali":"And by the Earth which opens out (for the gushing of springs or the sprouting of vegetation),-","urdu":"اور (نباتات اگتے وقت) پھٹ جانے والی زمین کی","turkish":"Dönüşlü göğe ve yarılan yeryüzüne and olsun ki,","indonesian":"dan bumi yang mempunyai tumbuh-tumbuhan,","french":"et par la terre qui se fend !","german":"und der Erde mit ihren Sprüngen!","bengali":"এবং শপথ যমীনের যা বিদীর্ণ হয়,","spanish":"y por la tierra que se abre para que broten los cultivos,","malay":"Dan bumi yang merekah mengeluarkan tumbuh-tumbuhan,","bosnian":"i Zemlje koja se otvara da rastinje nikne,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/12"}},{"verse_key":"86:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlun fasl","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,","pickthall":"Lo! this (Qur'an) is a conclusive word,","yusuf_ali":"Behold this is the Word that distinguishes (Good from Evil):","urdu":"یہ ایک جچی تلی بات ہے","turkish":"Doğrusu bu Kuran kesin bir sözdür.","indonesian":"sungguh, (Alquran) itu benar-benar firman pemisah (antara yang hak dan yang batil),","french":"Ceci [le Coran] est certes, une parole décisive [qui tranche entre le vrai et le faux],","german":"Er ist wahrlich ein entscheidendes Wort;","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই ইহা (আল কুরআন) মীমাংসাকারী বাণী,","spanish":"que el Corán es la Verdad que discrimina [la verdad de la falsedad],","malay":"Sesungguhnya keterangan Al-Quran adalah kata-kata pemutus (yang sebenar),","bosnian":"Kur'an je, doista, govor koji rastavlja istinu od neistine,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/13"}},{"verse_key":"86:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","transliteration":"Wama huwa bilhazl","translations":{"sahih_international":"And it is not amusement.","pickthall":"It is no pleasantry.","yusuf_ali":"It is not a thing for amusement.","urdu":"ہنسی مذاق نہیں ہے۔","turkish":"O, eğlence için değildir.","indonesian":"dan (Alquran) itu bukanlah senda gurauan.","french":"et non point une plaisanterie frivole !","german":"er ist kein Scherz.","bengali":"এবং এটা নিরর্থক নয়।","spanish":"Y no es algo trivial.","malay":"Dan bukanlah ia kata-kata yang olok-olok.","bosnian":"lakrdija nikakva on nije!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/14"}},{"verse_key":"86:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا","transliteration":"Innahum yakeedoona kayda","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","pickthall":"Lo! they plot a plot (against thee, O Muhammad)","yusuf_ali":"As for them, they are but plotting a scheme,","urdu":"یہ لوگ کچھ چالیں چل رہے ہیں","turkish":"Gerçekten onlar düzen kuruyorlar.","indonesian":"Sungguh, mereka (orang kafir) merencanakan tipu daya yang jahat,","french":"Ils se servent d’une ruse,","german":"Sie wenden eine List an,","bengali":"তারা ভীষণ ষড়যন্ত্র করে,","spanish":"[Los que niegan la verdad] traman [cizañas],","malay":"Sesungguhnya mereka (yang menentangmu, wahai Muhammad) bermati-mati menjalankan rancangan jahat,","bosnian":"Oni se služe spletkama,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/15"}},{"verse_key":"86:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا","transliteration":"Waakeedu kayda","translations":{"sahih_international":"But I am planning a plan.","pickthall":"And I plot a plot (against them).","yusuf_ali":"And I am planning a scheme.","urdu":"اور میں بھی ایک چال چل رہا ہوں۔","turkish":"Ben de bir düzen kurmaktayım.","indonesian":"dan Aku pun membuat rencana (tipu daya) yang jitu.","french":"et Moi aussi Je me sers de Mon plan.","german":"Und Ich wende eine List an.","bengali":"আর আমিও ভীষণ কৌশল করি।","spanish":"pero Yo desbarato sus planes.","malay":"Dan Aku pula tetap bertindak membalas rancangan jahat (mereka, dan menggagalkannya).","bosnian":"a Ja ih uništavam –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/16"}},{"verse_key":"86:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","transliteration":"Famahhili alkafireena amhilhum ruwayda","translations":{"sahih_international":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","pickthall":"So give a respite to the disbelievers. Deal thou gently with them for a while.","yusuf_ali":"Therefore grant a delay to the Unbelievers: Give respite to them gently (for awhile).","urdu":"پس چھوڑ دو اے نبیؐ ، اِن کافروں کو اِک ذرا کی ذرا اِن کے حال پر چھوڑ دو۔","turkish":"Sen inkarcılara mehil ver; onlara mukabeleyi biraz geri bırak.","indonesian":"Karena itu berilah penangguhan kepada orang-orang kafir. Berilah mereka kesempatan untuk sementara waktu.","french":"Accorde (ô Prophète) donc un délai aux infidèles: accorde-leur un court délai.","german":"So lasse den Ungläubigen noch Zeit; lasse ihnen nur eine Weile Zeit.","bengali":"অতএব কাফিরদেরকে অবকাশ দাও, তাদেরকে অবকাশ দাও কিছু কালের জন্য।","spanish":"Sé tolerante con los que niegan la verdad, y dales un tiempo.","malay":"Oleh itu janganlah engkau hendakkan segera kebinasaan orang-orang kafir itu, berilah tempoh kepada mereka sedikit masa.","bosnian":"zato nevjernicima još vremena dadni, još koji trenutak ih ostavi."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/086017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/86/17"}}]}},{"number":87,"data":{"surah":{"number":87,"name_arabic":"الأعلى","name_english":"Al-A'la","name_translation":"The Most High","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":8,"verses_count":19,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/087.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/087.mp3"}],"total_verses":19,"verses":[{"verse_key":"87:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" سَبِّحِ ٱسْمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلْأَعْلَى","transliteration":"Sabbihi isma rabbika al-aAAla","translations":{"sahih_international":"Exalt the name of your Lord, the Most High,","pickthall":"Praise the name of thy Lord the Most High,","yusuf_ali":"Glorify the name of thy Guardian-Lord Most High,","urdu":"(اے نبیؐ)اپنے ربِّ برتر کے نام کی تسبیح کرو","turkish":"Yüce Rabbinin adını tesbih et.","indonesian":"Sucikanlah nama Tuhanmu Yang Mahatinggi,","french":"Glorifie le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Haut,","german":"Preise den Namen deines höchsten Herrn,","bengali":"তুমি তোমার সুমহান রবের নামের পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর।","spanish":"Glorifica el nombre de tu Señor, el Altísimo,","malay":"Bertasbihlah mensucikan nama Tuhanmu Yang Maha Tinggi (dari segala sifat-sifat kekurangan), -","bosnian":"Hvali ime Gospodara svoga Svevišnjeg,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/1"}},{"verse_key":"87:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqa fasawwa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who created and proportioned","pickthall":"Who createth, then disposeth;","yusuf_ali":"Who hath created, and further, given order and proportion;","urdu":"جس نے پیدا کیا اور تناسُب قائم کیا،","turkish":"O, yaratıp şekil vermiştir.","indonesian":"yang menciptakan, lalu menyempurnakan (penciptaan-Nya),","french":"Celui Qui a créé et agencé harmonieusement,","german":"Der erschafft und dann zurechtformt","bengali":"যিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর যথাযথভাবে সমন্বিত করেছেন,","spanish":"Quien ha creado todas las cosas a la perfección","malay":"Yang telah menciptakan (sekalian makhlukNya) serta menyempurnakan kejadiannya dengan kelengkapan yang sesuai dengan keadaannya;","bosnian":"koji sve stvara i čini skladnim,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/2"}},{"verse_key":"87:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَٱلَّذِى قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Wallathee qaddara fahada","translations":{"sahih_international":"And who destined and [then] guided","pickthall":"Who measureth, then guideth;","yusuf_ali":"Who hath ordained laws. And granted guidance;","urdu":"جس نے تقدیر بنائی پھر راہ دکھائی،","turkish":"O, her şeyi ölçüyle yapıp doğru yolu göstermiştir.","indonesian":"yang menentukan kadar (masing-masing) dan memberi petunjuk,","french":"qui a décrété et guidé,","german":"und Der das Maß festsetzt und dann rechtleitet","bengali":"এবং যিনি নিয়ন্ত্রণ করেছেন, তারপর পথ দেখিয়েছেন,","spanish":"y ha decretado para cada ser su función;","malay":"Dan Yang telah mengatur (keadaan makhluk-makhlukNya) serta memberikan hidayah petunjuk (ke jalan keselamatannya dan kesempurnaannya);","bosnian":"i koji sve s mjerom određuje i nadahnjuje,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/3"}},{"verse_key":"87:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَخْرَجَ ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ","transliteration":"Wallathee akhraja almarAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And who brings out the pasture","pickthall":"Who bringeth forth the pasturage,","yusuf_ali":"And Who bringeth out the (green and luscious) pasture,","urdu":"جس نے نباتات اُگائیں","turkish":"O, yeşillikler bitirmiştir.","indonesian":"dan Yang menumbuhkan rerumputan,","french":"et qui a fait pousser le pâturage,","german":"und Der die Weide hervorbringt","bengali":"এবং যিনি তৃণাদী উৎপন্ন করেছেন,","spanish":"Quien hace brotar la hierba,","malay":"Dan Yang telah mengeluarkan tumbuh-tumbuhan untuk binatang-binatang ternak,","bosnian":"i koji čini da rastu pašnjaci,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/4"}},{"verse_key":"87:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحْوَىٰ","transliteration":"FajaAAalahu ghuthaan ahwa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [then] makes it black stubble.","pickthall":"Then turneth it to russet stubble.","yusuf_ali":"And then doth make it (but) swarthy stubble.","urdu":"پھر اُن کو سیاہ کُوڑا کرکٹ بنا دیا۔","turkish":"Sonra da onları siyah çerçöpe çevirmiştir.","indonesian":"lalu dijadikan-Nya (rumput-rumput) itu kering kehitam-hitaman.","french":"et en a fait ensuite un foin sombre.","german":"und sie dann zu dunkelbrauner Spreu macht.","bengali":"পরে ওকে বিশুস্ক বিমলিন করেছেন,","spanish":"y luego la convierte en heno seco.","malay":"Kemudian Ia menjadikan (tumbuh-tumbuhan yang menghijau) itu kering - (berubah warnanya) kehitam-hitaman.","bosnian":"i potom čini da postanu suhi, potamnjeli."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/5"}},{"verse_key":"87:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"سَنُقْرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Sanuqri-oka fala tansa","translations":{"sahih_international":"We will make you recite, [O Muḥammad], and you will not forget,","pickthall":"We shall make thee read (O Muhammad) so that thou shalt not forget","yusuf_ali":"By degrees shall We teach thee to declare (the Message), so thou shalt not forget,","urdu":"ہم تمہیں پڑھوا دیں گے، پھر تم نہیں بھولو گے","turkish":"Sana Kuran'ı Biz okutacağız ve asla unutmayacaksın;","indonesian":"Kami akan membacakan (Alquran) kepadamu (Muhammad) sehingga engkau tidak akan lupa,","french":"Nous te ferons réciter (le Coran), de sorte que tu n’oublieras.","german":"Wir werden dich lesen lassen, und dann wirst du nichts vergessen,","bengali":"অচিরেই আমি তোমাকে পাঠ করাব, ফলে তুমি বিস্মৃত হবেনা –","spanish":"[¡Oh, Muhámmad!] Haré que recites [el Corán] y no lo olvides.","malay":"Kami sentiasa menjadikan engkau (wahai Muhammad) dapat membaca (Al-Quran yang diturunkan kepadamu - dengan perantaraan jibril), sehingga engkau (menghafaznya dan) tidak lupa,","bosnian":"Mi ćemo te naučiti da izgovaraš pa ništa nećeš zaboraviti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/6"}},{"verse_key":"87:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعْلَمُ ٱلْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ","transliteration":"Illa ma shaa Allahuinnahu yaAAlamu aljahra wama yakhfa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Except what Allāh should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden.","pickthall":"Save that which Allah willeth. Lo! He knoweth the disclosed and that which still is hidden;","yusuf_ali":"Except as Allah wills: For He knoweth what is manifest and what is hidden.","urdu":"سوائے اُس کے جو اللہ چاہے، وہ ظاہر کو بھی جانتا ہے اور جوکچھ پوشیدہ ہے اُس کو بھی۔","turkish":"Allah'ın dilediği bundan müstesnadır. Doğrusu açığı da, gizliyi de bilen O'dur.","indonesian":"kecuali jika Allah menghendaki. Sungguh, Dia mengetahui yang terang dan yang tersembunyi.","french":"que ce qu’Allah veut. Car, Il connaît ce qui paraît au grand jour ainsi que ce qui est caché.","german":"außer dem, was Allah will. Er weiß ja, was laut vernehmbar geäußert wird und was verborgen bleibt.","bengali":"আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছা করবেন তদ্ব্যতীত, নিশ্চয়ই তিনি প্রকাশ্য ও গুপ্ত বিষয় জ্ঞাত আছেন,","spanish":"Salvo que Dios quiera, pues Él conoce lo manifiesto y lo oculto.","malay":"Kecuali apa yang dikehendaki Allah engkau lupakan; sesungguhnya Ia mengetahui (segala keadaan yang patut berlaku), dan yang tersembunyi.","bosnian":"osim onoga što će Allah htjeti – jer, On zna i ono što na javu iznosite i ono što tajite –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/7"}},{"verse_key":"87:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Wanuyassiruka lilyusra","translations":{"sahih_international":"And We will ease you toward ease.","pickthall":"And We shall ease thy way unto the state of ease.","yusuf_ali":"And We will make it easy for thee (to follow) the simple (Path).","urdu":"اور ہم تمہیں آسان طریقے کی سہولت دیتے ہیں","turkish":"Kolay olanı yapmayı sana kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"Dan Kami akan memudahkan bagimu ke jalan kemudahan (mencapai kebahagian dunia dan akhirat),","french":"Nous te mettrons sur la voie la plus facile.","german":"Und Wir werden dir den Weg zum Leichteren leicht machen.","bengali":"আমি তোমার জন্য কল্যাণের পথকে সহজ করে দিব।","spanish":"Te dirigiré por el camino de la facilidad.","malay":"Dan Kami tetap memberi kemudahan kepadamu untuk (melaksanakan segala perkara) Ugama yang mudah diterima oleh akal yang sihat.","bosnian":"i sve što je dobro Mi ćemo tebi dostupnim učiniti;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/8"}},{"verse_key":"87:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fathakkir in nafaAAati aththikra","translations":{"sahih_international":"So remind, if the reminder should benefit;","pickthall":"Therefor remind (men), for of use is the reminder.","yusuf_ali":"Therefore give admonition in case the admonition profits (the hearer).","urdu":"لہٰذا تم نصیحت کرو اگر نصیحت نافع ہو۔","turkish":"Faydalı olacaksa insanlara öğüt ver.","indonesian":"oleh sebab itu berikanlah peringatan, karena peringatan itu bermanfaat,","french":"Rappelle, donc, où le Rappel doit être utile.","german":"So ermahne -, wenn die Ermahnung nützt.","bengali":"অতএব উপদেশ যদি ফলপ্রসু হয় তাহলে উপদেশ প্রদান কর।","spanish":"Exhorta [con el Corán], porque el recuerdo es beneficioso.","malay":"Oleh itu berilah peringatan (kepada umat manusia dengan ajaran Al-Quran), kalau-kalau peringatan itu berguna (dan sudah tentu berguna);","bosnian":"zato poučavaj – pouka će već od koristi biti:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/9"}},{"verse_key":"87:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ","transliteration":"Sayaththakkaru man yakhsha","translations":{"sahih_international":"He who fears [Allāh] will be reminded.","pickthall":"He will heed who feareth,","yusuf_ali":"The admonition will be received by those who fear (Allah):","urdu":"جو شخص ڈرتا ہے وہ نصیحت قبول کر لے گا،","turkish":"Allah'tan korkan öğüt alacaktır.","indonesian":"orang yang takut (kepada Allah) akan mendapat pelajaran,","french":"Quiconque craint (Allah) s’[en] rappellera,","german":"Bedenken wird jemand, der gottesfürchtig ist.","bengali":"যারা ভয় করে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করবে।","spanish":"Quien tenga temor de Dios recapacitará [con tu exhortación],","malay":"Kerana orang yang takut (melanggar perintah Allah) akan menerima peringatan itu;","bosnian":"dozvaće se onaj koji se Allaha boji,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/10"}},{"verse_key":"87:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَشْقَى","transliteration":"Wayatajannabuha al-ashqa","translations":{"sahih_international":"But the wretched one will avoid it","pickthall":"But the most hapless will flout it,","yusuf_ali":"But it will be avoided by those most unfortunate ones,","urdu":"اور اس سے گریز کریگا وہ انتہائی بد بخت","turkish":"Bedbaht olan ondan kaçınacaktır.","indonesian":"dan orang yang celaka (kafir) akan menjauhinya,","french":"et s’en écartera le grand malheureux,","german":"Meiden aber wird es der Unseligste,","bengali":"আর ওটা উপেক্ষা করবে সে, যে নিতান্ত হতভাগা।","spanish":"pero el negador de la verdad la rechazará","malay":"Dan (sebaliknya) orang yang sangat celaka akan menjauhinya,","bosnian":"a izbjegavaće je onaj najgori,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/11"}},{"verse_key":"87:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى يَصْلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee yasla annaraalkubra","translations":{"sahih_international":"[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire,","pickthall":"He who will be flung to the great Fire","yusuf_ali":"Who will enter the Great Fire,","urdu":"جو بڑی آگ میں جائے گا","turkish":"O, en büyük ateşe yaslanacaktır.","indonesian":"(yaitu) orang yang akan memasuki api yang besar (neraka),","french":"qui brûlera dans le plus grand Feu,","german":"der dem größten (Höllen)feuer ausgesetzt sein wird;","bengali":"সে ভয়াবহ অগ্নিকুন্ডে প্রবেশ করবে।","spanish":"y por eso será abrazado por un gran fuego,","malay":"Dia lah orang yang akan menderita bakaran neraka yang amat besar (azab seksanya),","bosnian":"koji će u vatri velikoj gorjeti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/12"}},{"verse_key":"87:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ","transliteration":"Thumma la yamootu feeha walayahya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Neither dying therein nor living.","pickthall":"Wherein he will neither die nor live.","yusuf_ali":"In which they will then neither die nor live.","urdu":"پھر نہ اس میں مرے گا اور نہ جیے گا۔","turkish":"O, orada ne ölecektir ne de dirilecektir.","indonesian":"selanjutnya dia di sana tidak mati dan tidak (pula) hidup.","french":"où il ne mourra ni ne vivra.","german":"darin wird er hierauf weder sterben noch leben.","bengali":"অতঃপর সে সেখানে মরবেও না, বাঁচবেও না।","spanish":"donde no podrá morir [para descansar del sufrimiento] ni vivir [sin dolor].","malay":"Selain dari itu, ia tidak mati di dalamnya dan tidak pula hidup senang.","bosnian":"pa u njoj neće ni umrijeti ni živjeti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/13"}},{"verse_key":"87:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man tazakka","translations":{"sahih_international":"He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself","pickthall":"He is successful who groweth,","yusuf_ali":"But those will prosper who purify themselves,","urdu":"فلاح پا گیا وہ جس نے پاکیزگی اختیار کی","turkish":"Arınmış olan, Rabbinin adını anıp namaz kılan, saadete erişecektir.","indonesian":"Sungguh beruntung orang yang menyucikan diri (dengan beriman),","french":"Réussit, certes, celui qui se purifie,","german":"Wohl ergehen wird es ja jemandem, der sich läutert,","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই সে সাফল্য লাভ করবে যে পবিত্রতা অর্জন করে।","spanish":"¡Será de los bienaventurados quien se purifique [de la idolatría y los pecados],","malay":"Sesungguhnya berjayalah orang yang - setelah menerima peringatan itu - berusaha membersihkan dirinya (dengan taat dan amal yang soleh),","bosnian":"Postići će šta želi onaj koji se očisti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/14"}},{"verse_key":"87:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"وَذَكَرَ ٱسْمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wathakara isma rabbihi fasalla","translations":{"sahih_international":"And mentions the name of his Lord and prays.","pickthall":"And remembereth the name of his Lord, so prayeth,","yusuf_ali":"And glorify the name of their Guardian-Lord, and (lift their hearts) in prayer.","urdu":"اور اپنے ربّ کا نام یاد کیا پھر نماز پڑھی۔","turkish":"Arınmış olan, Rabbinin adını anıp namaz kılan, saadete erişecektir.","indonesian":"dan mengingat nama Tuhannya, lalu dia salat.","french":"et se rappelle le nom de son Seigneur, puis célèbre la prière (As-Salât).","german":"und des Namens seines Herrn gedenkt; so betet er.","bengali":"এবং স্বীয় রবের নাম স্মরণ করে ও সালাত আদায় করে।","spanish":"recuerde el nombre de su Señor y cumpla con sus oraciones!","malay":"Dan menyebut-nyebut dengan lidah dan hatinya akan nama Tuhannya serta mangerjakan sembahyang (dengan khusyuk).","bosnian":"i spomene ime Gospodara svoga pa molitvu obavi!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/15"}},{"verse_key":"87:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"Bal tu/thiroona alhayata addunya","translations":{"sahih_international":"But you prefer the worldly life,","pickthall":"But ye prefer the life of the world","yusuf_ali":"Nay (behold), ye prefer the life of this world;","urdu":"مگر تم لوگ دنیا کی زندگی کو ترجیح دیتے ہو،","turkish":"Ama sizler dünya hayatını tercih ediyorsunuz.","indonesian":"Sedangkan kamu (orang-orang kafir) memilih kehidupan dunia,","french":"Mais, vous préférez plutôt la vie présente,","german":"Nein! Vielmehr zieht ihr das diesseitige Leben vor,","bengali":"কিন্তু তোমরা পার্থিব জীবনকে পছন্দ করে থাক,","spanish":"Pero [muchos] preferís la vida mundanal,","malay":"(Tetapi kebanyakkan kamu tidak melakukan yang demikian), bahkan kamu utamakan kehidupan dunia;","bosnian":"Ali, vi više život na ovom svijetu volite,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/16"}},{"verse_key":"87:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wal-akhiratu khayrun waabqa","translations":{"sahih_international":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring.","pickthall":"Although the Hereafter is better and more lasting.","yusuf_ali":"But the Hereafter is better and more enduring.","urdu":"حالانکہ آخرت بہتر ہے اور باقی رہنے والی ہے۔","turkish":"Oysa ahiret daha iyi ve daha bakidir.","indonesian":"padahal kehidupan akhirat itu lebih baik dan lebih kekal.","french":"alors que l’au-delà est meilleur et plus durable.","german":"während das Jenseits besser und beständiger ist.","bengali":"অথচ আখিরাতের জীবনই উত্তম ও অবিনশ্বর।","spanish":"aunque debéis saber que la vida del más allá es superior y eterna.","malay":"Padahal kehidupan akhirat lebih baik dan lebih kekal.","bosnian":"a onaj svijet je bolji i vječan je."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/17"}},{"verse_key":"87:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Inna hatha lafee assuhufial-oola","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures,","pickthall":"Lo! This is in the former scrolls.","yusuf_ali":"And this is in the Books of the earliest (Revelation),-","urdu":"یہی بات پہلے آئے ہوئے صحیفوں میں بھی کہی گئی تھی","turkish":"Doğrusu bu hükümler ilk sahifelerde, İbrahim ve Musa'nın sahifelerinde de vardır.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya ini terdapat dalam kitab-kitab yang dahulu,","french":"Ceci se trouve, certes, dans les Feuilles anciennes,","german":"Dies ist wahrlich in den früheren Blättern (enthalten),","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই এটা পূর্ববর্তী গ্রন্থসমূহে (বিদ্যমান) আছে।","spanish":"Este Mensaje se encuentra mencionado en las primeras revelaciones,","malay":"Sesungguhnya (keterangan-keterangan yang dinyatakan) ini ada (disebutkan) di dalam Kitab-kitab yang terdahulu, -","bosnian":"Ovo, doista, ima u listovima davnašnjim,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/18"}},{"verse_key":"87:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"Suhufi ibraheema wamoosa","translations":{"sahih_international":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses.","pickthall":"The Books of Abraham and Moses.","yusuf_ali":"The Books of Abraham and Moses.","urdu":"ابراہیمؑ اور موسیٰؑ کے صحیفوں میں۔","turkish":"Doğrusu bu hükümler ilk sahifelerde, İbrahim ve Musa'nın sahifelerinde de vardır.","indonesian":"(yaitu) kitab-kitab Ibrahim dan Musa.","french":"les Feuilles d’Abraham et de Moïse.","german":"den Blättern Ibrahims und Musas.","bengali":"(বিশেষতঃ) ইবরাহীম ও মূসার গ্রন্থসমূহে।","spanish":"en las revelaciones recibidas por Abraham y Moisés.","malay":"Iaitu Kitab-kitab Nabi Ibrahim dan Nabi Musa.","bosnian":"listovima Ibrahimovim i Musaovim."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/087019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/87/19"}}]}},{"number":88,"data":{"surah":{"number":88,"name_arabic":"الغاشية","name_english":"Al-Ghashiyah","name_translation":"The Overwhelming","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":68,"verses_count":26,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/088.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/088.mp3"}],"total_verses":26,"verses":[{"verse_key":"88:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْغَـٰشِيَةِ","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu alghashiyat","translations":{"sahih_international":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]?","pickthall":"Hath there come unto thee tidings of the Overwhelming?","yusuf_ali":"Has the story reached thee of the overwhelming (Event)?","urdu":"کیا تمہیں اُس چھا جانے والی آفت کی خبر پہنچی ہے؟","turkish":"Her şeyi kaplayacak kıyametin haberi sana gelmedi mi?","indonesian":"Sudahkah sampai kepadamu berita tentang (hari Kiamat)?","french":"T’est-il parvenu le récit de l’enveloppante ?","german":"Ist zu dir die Geschichte der Überdeckenden gekommen?","bengali":"তোমার কাছে কি সমাচ্ছন্নকারী সংবাদ পৌঁছেছে?","spanish":"¿Te ha llegado la historia sobre el día que todo lo alcanza?","malay":"Sudahkah sampai kepadamu (wahai Muhammad) perihal hari kiamat yang huru-haranya meliputi?","bosnian":"Da li je doprla do tebe vijest o teškoj nevolji? –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/1"}},{"verse_key":"88:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ خَـٰشِعَةٌ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawma-ithin khashiAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled,","pickthall":"On that day (many) faces will be downcast,","yusuf_ali":"Some faces, that Day, will be humiliated,","urdu":"کچھ چہرے اُس روز خوف زدہ ہوں گے","turkish":"O gün bir takım yüzler zillete bürünmüştür.","indonesian":"Pada hari itu banyak wajah yang tertunduk hina,","french":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des visages humiliés,","german":"(Die einen) Gesichter werden an jenem Tag demütig sein,","bengali":"সেদিন বহু মুখমন্ডল অবনত হবে;","spanish":"Ese día los rostros [de los condenados al Fuego] se verán humillados,","malay":"Muka (orang-orang yang kafir) pada hari itu tunduk kerana merasa hina,","bosnian":"kada će se neka lica potištena,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/2"}},{"verse_key":"88:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"عَامِلَةٌ نَّاصِبَةٌ","transliteration":"AAamilatun nasiba","translations":{"sahih_international":"Working [hard] and exhausted.","pickthall":"Toiling, weary,","yusuf_ali":"Labouring (hard), weary,-","urdu":"سخت مشقت کر رہے ہونگے","turkish":"Zor işler altında bitkin düşmüştür.","indonesian":"(karena) bekerja keras lagi kepayahan,","french":"préoccupés, harassés.","german":"sich abarbeitend und von Mühsal erfüllt,","bengali":"কর্মক্লান্ত পরিশ্রান্তভাবে;","spanish":"abatidos y asfixiados.","malay":"Mereka menjalankan kerja yang berat lagi berpenat lelah,","bosnian":"premorena, napaćena"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/3"}},{"verse_key":"88:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"تَصْلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةً","transliteration":"Tasla naran hamiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire.","pickthall":"Scorched by burning fire,","yusuf_ali":"The while they enter the Blazing Fire,-","urdu":"تھکے جاتے ہونگے، شدید آگ میں جھلس رہے ہونگے","turkish":"Yakıcı ateşe yaslanırlar.","indonesian":"mereka memasuki api yang sangat panas (neraka),","french":"Ils brûleront dans un Feu ardent,","german":"einem sehr heißen Feuer ausgesetzt,","bengali":"তারা প্রবেশ করবে জ্বলন্ত আগুনে;","spanish":"Serán llevados a un fuego intenso","malay":"Mereka tetap menderita bakaran neraka yang amat panas (membakar), -","bosnian":"u vatri užarenoj pržiti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/4"}},{"verse_key":"88:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"تُسْقَىٰ مِنْ عَيْنٍ ءَانِيَةٍ","transliteration":"Tusqa min AAaynin aniya","translations":{"sahih_international":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring.","pickthall":"Drinking from a boiling spring,","yusuf_ali":"The while they are given, to drink, of a boiling hot spring,","urdu":"کھولتے ہوئے چشمے کا پانی انہیں پینے کو دیا جائے گا","turkish":"Kızgın bir kaynaktan içirilirler.","indonesian":"diberi minum dari sumber mata air yang sangat panas.","french":"et seront abreuvés d’une source bouillante.","german":"und aus einer siedenden Quelle zu trinken bekommen.","bengali":"তাদেরকে উত্তপ্ত প্রস্রবণ হতে পান করানো হবে,","spanish":"donde les será dado a beber de una fuente de agua hirviente.","malay":"Mereka diberi minum dari matair yang menggelegak panasnya.","bosnian":"sa vrela uzavrelog piti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/5"}},{"verse_key":"88:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"لَّيْسَ لَهُمْ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِن ضَرِيعٍ","transliteration":"Laysa lahum taAAamun illamin dareeAA","translations":{"sahih_international":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant","pickthall":"No food for them save bitter thorn-fruit","yusuf_ali":"No food will there be for them but a bitter Dhari'","urdu":"خاردار سُوکھی گھاس کے سوا کوئی کھانا اُن کے لیے نہ ہوگا،","turkish":"Semirtmeyen, açlığı gidermeyen kötü kokulu (kuru) bir dikenden başka yiyecekleri yoktur.","indonesian":"Tidak ada makanan bagi mereka selain dari pohon yang berduri,","french":"Il n’y aura pour eux d’autre nourriture que des plantes épineuses [Dharî'],","german":"Es wird für sie keine Speise geben außer aus trockenen Dornen,","bengali":"তাদের জন্য বিষাক্ত কন্টক ব্যতীত খাদ্য নেই –","spanish":"No tendrán otra comida más que espinas","malay":"Tiada makanan bagi mereka (di situ) selain dari pokok-pokok yang berduri,","bosnian":"kada drugog jela osim trnja neće imati,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/6"}},{"verse_key":"88:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"لَّا يُسْمِنُ وَلَا يُغْنِى مِن جُوعٍ","transliteration":"La yusminu wala yughnee minjooAA","translations":{"sahih_international":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger.","pickthall":"Which doth not nourish nor release from hunger.","yusuf_ali":"Which will neither nourish nor satisfy hunger.","urdu":"جو نہ موٹا کرے نہ بھوک مٹائے","turkish":"Semirtmeyen, açlığı gidermeyen kötü kokulu (kuru) bir dikenden başka yiyecekleri yoktur.","indonesian":"yang tidak menggemukkan dan tidak menghilangkan lapar.","french":"qui n’engraisse, ni n’apaise la faim.","german":"die weder fett machen noch gegen den Hunger nützen.","bengali":"যা তাদেরকে পুষ্ট করবেনা এবং তাদের ক্ষুধাও নিবৃত্ত করবেনা।","spanish":"que no alimentan ni sacian.","malay":"Yang tidak menggemokkan, dan tidak pula dapat menghilangkan sedikit kelaparan pun.","bosnian":"koje neće ni ugojiti ni glad utoliti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/7"}},{"verse_key":"88:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ نَّاعِمَةٌ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawma-ithin naAAima","translations":{"sahih_international":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure.","pickthall":"In that day other faces will be calm,","yusuf_ali":"(Other) faces that Day will be joyful,","urdu":"کچھ چہرے اُس روز با رونق ہوں گے","turkish":"İnanmış olanların yüzleri, o gün, pırıl pırıldır.","indonesian":"Pada hari itu banyak (pula) wajah yang berseri-seri,","french":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des visages épanouis,","german":"(Die anderen) Gesichter werden an jenem Tag wonnig sein,","bengali":"বহু মুখমন্ডল হবে সেদিন আনন্দোজ্জ্বল –","spanish":"Pero ese día los rostros [de los bienaventurados] estarán radiantes de felicidad.","malay":"(Sebaliknya) muka (orang-orang yang beriman) pada hari itu berseri-seri,","bosnian":"Neka lica toga dana biće radosna,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/8"}},{"verse_key":"88:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"لِّسَعْيِهَا رَاضِيَةٌ","transliteration":"LisaAAyiha radiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"With their effort [they are] satisfied","pickthall":"Glad for their effort past,","yusuf_ali":"Pleased with their striving,-","urdu":"اپنی کار گزاری پر خوش ہوں گے،","turkish":"Yaptıklarından hoşnuddurlar.","indonesian":"merasa senang karena usahanya (sendiri),","french":"contents de leurs efforts,","german":"mit ihrem Bemühen zufrieden","bengali":"নিজেদের কর্মসাফল্যে পরিতৃপ্ত,","spanish":"Estarán complacidos de sus obras.","malay":"Berpuas hati dengan balasan amal usahanya (yang baik yang telah dikerjakannya di dunia), -","bosnian":"trudom svojim zadovoljna –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/9"}},{"verse_key":"88:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"فِى جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٍ","transliteration":"Fee jannatin AAaliya","translations":{"sahih_international":"In an elevated garden,","pickthall":"In a high Garden","yusuf_ali":"In a Garden on high,","urdu":"عالی مقام جنت میں ہوں گے","turkish":"Yüksek bir cennettedirler.","indonesian":"(mereka) dalam surga yang tinggi,","french":"dans un haut Jardin,","german":"und in einem hohen Garten,","bengali":"সমুন্নত কাননে অবস্থিতি হবে –","spanish":"Morarán en un jardín sublime,","malay":"(Mereka tinggal menetap) di dalam Syurga tinggi (tempat kedudukannya darjatnya),","bosnian":"u Džennetu izvanrednome,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/10"}},{"verse_key":"88:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"لَّا تَسْمَعُ فِيهَا لَـٰغِيَةً","transliteration":"La tasmaAAu feeha laghiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Wherein they will hear no unsuitable speech.","pickthall":"Where they hear no idle speech,","yusuf_ali":"Where they shall hear no (word) of vanity:","urdu":"کوئی بےہودہ بات وہاں نہ سُنیں گے،","turkish":"Orada boş söz işitmezler.","indonesian":"di sana (kamu) tidak mendengar perkataan yang tidak berguna.","french":"où ils n’entendent aucune futilité.","german":"worin sie keine unbedachte Rede hören.","bengali":"সেখানে তারা অবান্তর বাক্য শুনবেনা।","spanish":"en el que no oirán palabras vanas.","malay":"Mereka tidak mendengar di situ sebarang perkataan yang sia-sia,","bosnian":"u kome prazne besjede neće slušati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/11"}},{"verse_key":"88:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"فِيهَا عَيْنٌ جَارِيَةٌ","transliteration":"Feeha AAaynun jariya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Within it is a flowing spring.","pickthall":"Wherein is a gushing spring,","yusuf_ali":"Therein will be a bubbling spring:","urdu":"اُس میں چشمے رواں ہونگے","turkish":"Orada akan kaynak vardır.","indonesian":"Di sana ada mata air yang mengalir.","french":"Là, il y aura une source coulante.","german":"Darin gibt es eine fließende Quelle,","bengali":"সেখানে আছে প্রবহমান ঝর্ণাধারা –","spanish":"En él habrá manantiales,","malay":"Di dalam Syurga itu ada matair yang mengalir,","bosnian":"U njemu su izvor-vode koje teku,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/12"}},{"verse_key":"88:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"فِيهَا سُرُرٌ مَّرْفُوعَةٌ","transliteration":"Feeha sururun marfooAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Within it are couches raised high","pickthall":"Wherein are couches raised","yusuf_ali":"Therein will be Thrones (of dignity), raised on high,","urdu":"اُس کے اندر اونچی مسندیں ہوں گی","turkish":"Orada, yükseltilmiş tahtlar vardır.","indonesian":"Di sana ada dipan-dipan yang ditinggikan,","french":"Là, des divans élevés.","german":"darin gibt es erhöhte Liegen","bengali":"তন্মধ্যে রয়েছে সমুচ্চ আসনসমূহ;","spanish":"lechos elevados,","malay":"Di situ juga ada pelamin-pelamin (berhias) yang tinggi (tempatnya),","bosnian":"u njemu su i divani skupocjeni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/13"}},{"verse_key":"88:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"وَأَكْوَابٌ مَّوْضُوعَةٌ","transliteration":"Waakwabun mawdooAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And cups put in place","pickthall":"And goblets set at hand","yusuf_ali":"Goblets placed (ready),","urdu":"ساغر رکھے ہوئے ہوں گے،","turkish":"Yerleştirilmiş kaseler,","indonesian":"dan gelas-gelas yang tersedia (di dekatnya),","french":"et des coupes posées.","german":"und hingestellte Trinkschalen","bengali":"এবং সুরক্ষিত পান পাত্রসমূহ,","spanish":"copas al alcance de su mano,","malay":"Dan piala-piala minuman yang disediakan (untuk mereka),","bosnian":"i pehari postavljeni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/14"}},{"verse_key":"88:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"وَنَمَارِقُ مَصْفُوفَةٌ","transliteration":"Wanamariqu masfoofa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And cushions lined up","pickthall":"And cushions ranged","yusuf_ali":"And cushions set in rows,","urdu":"گاؤ تکیوں کی قطاریں لگی ہوں گی","turkish":"Sıra sıra yastıklar,","indonesian":"dan bantal-bantal sandaran yang tersusun,","french":"et des coussins rangés.","german":"und aufgereihte Kissen","bengali":"ও সারি সারি তাকিয়াসমূহ,","spanish":"cojines alineados","malay":"Dan bantal-bantal yang teratur (untuk mereka berbaring atau bersandar),","bosnian":"i jastuci poredani,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/15"}},{"verse_key":"88:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"وَزَرَابِىُّ مَبْثُوثَةٌ","transliteration":"Wazarabiyyu mabthootha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And carpets spread around.","pickthall":"And silken carpets spread.","yusuf_ali":"And rich carpets (all) spread out.","urdu":"اور نفیس فرش بچھے ہوئے ہوں گے","turkish":"Serilmiş, yumuşak tüylü halılar vardır.","indonesian":"dan permadani-permadani yang terhampar.","french":"et des tapis étalés.","german":"und ausgebreitete Teppiche.","bengali":"এবং সম্প্রসারিত গালিচাসমূহ।","spanish":"y alfombras extendidas.","malay":"Serta hamparan-hamparan yang terbentang.","bosnian":"i ćilimi rašireni."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/16"}},{"verse_key":"88:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ","transliteration":"Afala yanthuroona ilaal-ibili kayfa khuliqat","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created?","pickthall":"Will they not regard the camels, how they are created?","yusuf_ali":"Do they not look at the Camels, how they are made?-","urdu":"(یہ لوگ نہیں مانتے) تو کیا یہ اونٹوں کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے بنائے گئے؟","turkish":"Bu insanlar, devenin nasıl yaratıldığına, göğün nasıl yükseltildiğine, dağların nasıl dikildiğine, yerin nasıl yayıldığına bir bakmazlar mı?","indonesian":"Maka tidakkah mereka memperhatikan unta, bagaimana diciptakan?","french":"Ne considèrent-ils donc pas les chameaux, comment ils ont été créés,","german":"Schauen sie denn nicht zu den Kamelen, wie sie erschaffen worden sind,","bengali":"তাহলে কি তারা উষ্ট্র পালের দিকে লক্ষ্য করেনা যে, কিভাবে ওকে সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে?","spanish":"¿Acaso no reflexionan [los que niegan la verdad] en la maravillosa creación del camello?","malay":"(Mengapa mereka yang kafir masih mengingkari akhirat) tidakkah mereka memperhatikan keadaan unta bagaimana ia diciptakan?","bosnian":"Pa zašto oni ne pogledaju kamile – kako su stvorene,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/17"}},{"verse_key":"88:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-ila assama-i kayfarufiAAat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And at the sky - how it is raised?","pickthall":"And the heaven, how it is raised?","yusuf_ali":"And at the Sky, how it is raised high?-","urdu":"آسمان کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے اٹھایا گیا؟","turkish":"Bu insanlar, devenin nasıl yaratıldığına, göğün nasıl yükseltildiğine, dağların nasıl dikildiğine, yerin nasıl yayıldığına bir bakmazlar mı?","indonesian":"Dan langit, bagaimana ditinggikan?","french":"et le ciel comment il est élevé,","german":"und zum Himmel, wie er emporgehoben worden ist,","bengali":"এবং আকাশের দিকে যে, কিভাবে ওটাকে সমুচ্চ করা হয়েছে?","spanish":"En el cielo, cómo ha sido elevado.","malay":"Dan keadaan langit bagaimana ia ditinggikan binaannya.?","bosnian":"i nebo – kako je uzdignuto,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/18"}},{"verse_key":"88:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"وَإِلَى ٱلْجِبَالِ كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-ila aljibali kayfa nusibat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And at the mountains - how they are erected?","pickthall":"And the hills, how they are set up?","yusuf_ali":"And at the Mountains, how they are fixed firm?-","urdu":"پہاڑوں کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے جمائے گئے؟","turkish":"Bu insanlar, devenin nasıl yaratıldığına, göğün nasıl yükseltildiğine, dağların nasıl dikildiğine, yerin nasıl yayıldığına bir bakmazlar mı?","indonesian":"Dan gunung-gunung bagaimana ditegakkan?","french":"et les montagnes comment elles sont dressées.","german":"und zu den Bergen, wie sie aufgerichtet worden sind,","bengali":"এবং পর্বতমালার দিকে যে, কিভাবে ওটা দৃঢ়ভাবে স্থাপন করা হয়েছে?","spanish":"En las montañas, cómo han sido afirmadas.","malay":"Dan keadaan gunung-ganang bagaimana ia ditegakkan?","bosnian":"i planine – kako su postavljene,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/19"}},{"verse_key":"88:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"وَإِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ","transliteration":"Wa-ila al-ardi kayfa sutihat","translations":{"sahih_international":"And at the earth - how it is spread out?","pickthall":"And the earth, how it is spread?","yusuf_ali":"And at the Earth, how it is spread out?","urdu":"اور زمین کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے بچھائی گئی؟","turkish":"Bu insanlar, devenin nasıl yaratıldığına, göğün nasıl yükseltildiğine, dağların nasıl dikildiğine, yerin nasıl yayıldığına bir bakmazlar mı?","indonesian":"Dan bumi bagaimana dihamparkan?","french":"et la terre comment elle est nivelée ?","german":"und zur Erde, wie sie flach gemacht worden ist?","bengali":"এবং ভূতলের দিকে যে, কিভাবে ওটাকে সমতল করা হয়েছে?","spanish":"Y en la Tierra, cómo ha sido extendida.","malay":"Dan keadaan bumi bagaimana ia dihamparkan?","bosnian":"i Zemlju – kako je prostrta?!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/20"}},{"verse_key":"88:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"فَذَكِّرْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٌ","transliteration":"Fathakkir innama anta muthakkir","translations":{"sahih_international":"So remind, [O Muḥammad]; you are only a reminder.","pickthall":"Remind them, for thou art but a remembrancer,","yusuf_ali":"Therefore do thou give admonition, for thou art one to admonish.","urdu":"اچھا تو (اے نبیؐ) نصیحت کیے جاؤ، تم بس نصیحت ہی کرنے والے ہو","turkish":"Sen öğüt ver! Esasen sen sadece bir öğütçüsün.","indonesian":"Maka berilah peringatan, karena sesungguhnya engkau (Muhammad) hanyalah pemberi peringatan.","french":"Eh bien, rappelle ! Tu n’es qu’un rappeleur,","german":"So ermahne; du bist nur ein Ermahner.","bengali":"অতএব তুমি উপদেশ দিতে থাক, তুমিতো একজন উপদেশ দাতা মাত্র।","spanish":"Exhorta a la gente porque esa es tu misión.","malay":"Oleh itu berikanlah sahaja peringatan (wahai Muhammad, kepada manusia, dan janganlah berdukacita kiranya ada yang menolaknya), kerana sesungguhnya engkau hanyalah seorang Rasul pemberi ingatan;","bosnian":"Ti poučavaj – tvoje je da poučavaš,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/21"}},{"verse_key":"88:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ","transliteration":"Lasta AAalayhim bimusaytir","translations":{"sahih_international":"You are not over them a controller.","pickthall":"Thou art not at all a warder over them.","yusuf_ali":"Thou art not one to manage (men's) affairs.","urdu":"کچھ ان پر جبر کرنے والے نہیں ہو۔","turkish":"Sen, onlara zor kullanacak değilsin.","indonesian":"Engkau bukanlah orang yang berkuasa atas mereka,","french":"et tu n’es pas un dominateur sur eux.","german":"Du übst nicht die Oberherrschaft über sie aus.","bengali":"তুমি তাদের কর্মনিয়ন্ত্রক নও।","spanish":"No puedes obligarlos a creer.","malay":"Bukanlah engkau seorang yang berkuasa memaksa mereka (menerima ajaran Islam yang engkau sampaikan itu).","bosnian":"ti vlast nad njima nemaš!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/22"}},{"verse_key":"88:23","ayah":23,"arabic":"إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ","transliteration":"Illa man tawalla wakafar","translations":{"sahih_international":"However, he who turns away and disbelieves","pickthall":"But whoso is averse and disbelieveth,","yusuf_ali":"But if any turn away and reject Allah,-","urdu":"البتہ جو شخص منہ موڑے گا اور انکار کرے گا","turkish":"Ama kim yüz çevirir, inkar ederse, Allah onu en büyük azaba uğratır.","indonesian":"kecuali (jika ada) orang yang berpaling dan kafir,","french":"Sauf celui qui tourne le dos et ne croit pas,","german":"Wer sich aber abkehrt und ungläubig ist,","bengali":"তবে কেহ মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিলে ও কুফরী করলে –","spanish":"A quien dé la espalda y rechace la verdad","malay":"Akan tetapi sesiapa yang berpaling (dari kebenaran) serta ia kufur ingkar, -","bosnian":"A onoga koji glavu okreće i neće da vjeruje,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088023.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/23"}},{"verse_key":"88:24","ayah":24,"arabic":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَكْبَرَ","transliteration":"FayuAAaththibuhu Allahu alAAathabaal-akbar","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then Allāh will punish him with the greatest punishment.","pickthall":"Allah will punish him with direst punishment.","yusuf_ali":"Allah will punish him with a mighty Punishment,","urdu":"تو اللہ اس کو بھاری سزا دے گا","turkish":"Ama kim yüz çevirir, inkar ederse, Allah onu en büyük azaba uğratır.","indonesian":"maka Allah akan mengazabnya dengan azab yang besar.","french":"alors Allah le châtiera du plus grand châtiment.","german":"den straft dann Allah mit der größten Strafe.","bengali":"আল্লাহ তাকে কঠোর দন্ডে দন্ডিত করবেন।","spanish":"Dios lo someterá al peor de los castigos.","malay":"Maka Allah akan menyeksanya dengan azab seksa yang sebesar-besarnya.","bosnian":"njega će Allah najvećom mukom mučiti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088024.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/24"}},{"verse_key":"88:25","ayah":25,"arabic":"إِنَّ إِلَيْنَآ إِيَابَهُمْ","transliteration":"Inna ilayna iyabahum","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, to Us is their return.","pickthall":"Lo! unto Us is their return","yusuf_ali":"For to Us will be their return;","urdu":"اِن لوگوں کو پلٹنا ہماری طرف ہی ہے","turkish":"Doğrusu onların dönüşü Bize'dir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, kepada Kami lah mereka kembali,","french":"Vers Nous est leur retour.","german":"Gewiß, zu Uns ist ihre Rückkehr","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন আমারই নিকট।","spanish":"Porque todos comparecerán ante Mí,","malay":"Sesungguhnya kepada Kamilah kembalinya mereka,","bosnian":"Nama će se oni, zaista, vratiti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088025.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/25"}},{"verse_key":"88:26","ayah":26,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا حِسَابَهُم","transliteration":"Thumma inna AAalayna hisabahum","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then indeed, upon Us is their account.","pickthall":"And Ours their reckoning.","yusuf_ali":"Then it will be for Us to call them to account.","urdu":"پھر اِن کا حساب لینا ہمارے ہی ذمہ ہے","turkish":"Şüphesiz sonra hesaplarını görmek de Bize düşmektedir.","indonesian":"kemudian sesungguhnya (kewajiban) Kami lah membuat perhitungan atas mereka.","french":"Ensuite, c’est à Nous de leur demander compte.","german":"und gewiß, hierauf obliegt Uns ihre Abrechnung.","bengali":"অতঃপর আমারই নিকট তাদের হিসাব-নিকাশ (গ্রহণের ভার)।","spanish":"y seré Yo Quien los juzgue.","malay":"Selain dari itu, sesungguhnya tanggungan Kamilah soal menghitung amal mereka.","bosnian":"i pred Nama će, doista, račun polagati!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/088026.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/88/26"}}]}},{"number":89,"data":{"surah":{"number":89,"name_arabic":"الفجر","name_english":"Al-Fajr","name_translation":"The Dawn","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":10,"verses_count":30,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/089.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/089.mp3"}],"total_verses":30,"verses":[{"verse_key":"89:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلْفَجْرِ","transliteration":"Walfajr","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the dawn","pickthall":"By the Dawn","yusuf_ali":"By the break of Day","urdu":"قسم ہے فجر کی","turkish":"Tanyerinin ağarmasına and olsun;","indonesian":"Demi fajar,","french":"Par l’Aube !","german":"Bei der Morgendämmerung","bengali":"শপথ ঊষার,","spanish":"Juro por la Aurora,","malay":"Demi waktu fajar;","bosnian":"Tako mi zore,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/1"}},{"verse_key":"89:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَلَيَالٍ عَشْرٍ","transliteration":"Walayalin AAashr","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] ten nights","pickthall":"And ten nights,","yusuf_ali":"By the Nights twice five;","urdu":"اور دس راتوں کی","turkish":"Zilhicce ayının ilk on gecesine and olsun;","indonesian":"demi malam yang sepuluh,","french":"et par les dix nuits !","german":"und den zehn Nächten","bengali":"শপথ দশ রাতের,","spanish":"por las diez noches,","malay":"Dan malam yang sepuluh (yang mempunyai kelebihan di sisi Allah);","bosnian":"i deset noći,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/2"}},{"verse_key":"89:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَٱلشَّفْعِ وَٱلْوَتْرِ","transliteration":"WashshafAAi walwatr","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the even [number] and the odd","pickthall":"And the Even and the Odd,","yusuf_ali":"By the even and odd (contrasted);","urdu":"اور جفت اور طاق کی","turkish":"Herşeyin çiftine de, tekine de and olsun;","indonesian":"demi yang genap dan yang ganjil,","french":"Par le pair et l’impair !","german":"und dem geraden und dem ungeraden (Tag)","bengali":"শপথ জোড় ও বেজোড়ের,","spanish":"por [las oraciones] pares e impares,","malay":"Dan bilangan yang genap serta yang ganjil;","bosnian":"i parnih i neparnih,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/3"}},{"verse_key":"89:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَسْرِ","transliteration":"Wallayli itha yasr","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the night when it passes,","pickthall":"And the night when it departeth,","yusuf_ali":"And by the Night when it passeth away;-","urdu":"اور رات کی جبکہ وہ رخصت ہو رہی ہو","turkish":"Gelip geçen geceye and olsun ki, bunların her biri akıl sahibi için birer yemine değmez mi?","indonesian":"demi malam apabila berlalu.","french":"Et par la nuit quand elle s’écoule !","german":"und der Nacht, wenn sie fortzieht!","bengali":"এবং শপথ রাতের, যখন ওটা গত হতে থাকে।","spanish":"y por la noche cuando transcurre.","malay":"Dan malam, apabila ia berlalu; -","bosnian":"i noći kada nestaje –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/4"}},{"verse_key":"89:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"هَلْ فِى ذَٰلِكَ قَسَمٌ لِّذِى حِجْرٍ","transliteration":"Hal fee thalika qasamun lithee hijr","translations":{"sahih_international":"Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception?","pickthall":"There surely is an oath for thinking man.","yusuf_ali":"Is there (not) in these an adjuration (or evidence) for those who understand?","urdu":"کیا اِس میں کسی صاحب ِ عقل کے لیے کوئی قسم ہے؟","turkish":"Gelip geçen geceye and olsun ki, bunların her biri akıl sahibi için birer yemine değmez mi?","indonesian":"Adakah pada yang demikian itu terdapat sumpah (yang dapat diterima) bagi orang-orang yang berakal?","french":"N’est-ce pas là un serment, pour un doué d’intelligence ?","german":"Ist darin ein (ausreichender) Schwur für jemanden, der Klugheit besitzt?","bengali":"জ্ঞানবান ব্যক্তি জন্য কি এর মধ্যে কসম করার উপাদান নেই?","spanish":"¿Acaso no son estos juramentos [argumentos suficientes sobre el poder de Dios] para los dotados de intelecto?","malay":"Bukankah yang demikian itu mengandungi sumpah (yang diakui kebenarannya) oleh orang yang berakal sempurna?","bosnian":"zar to pametnom zakletva nije…?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/5"}},{"verse_key":"89:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِعَادٍ","transliteration":"Alam tara kayfa faAAala rabbuka biAAad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with ʿAad -","pickthall":"Dost thou not consider how thy Lord dealt with (the tribe of) A'ad,","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou not how thy Lord dealt with the 'Ad (people),-","urdu":"تم نے دیکھا نہیں کہ تمہارے ربّ نے کیا برتاوٴ کیا","turkish":"Rabbinin, hiçbir memlekette benzeri ortaya konmayan sütunlara sahip İrem şehrinde oturan Ad milletine ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"Tidakkah engkau (Muhammad) memperhatikan bagaimana Tuhanmu berbuat terhadap (kaum) 'Ād?","french":"N’as-tu pas vu comment ton Seigneur a agi avec les 'Âd.","german":"Siehst du nicht, wie dein Herr mit den ’Ad verfuhr,","bengali":"তুমি কি দেখনি তোমার রাব্ব কি করেছিলেন ‘আদ বংশের –","spanish":"¿No has visto cómo tu Señor castigó al pueblo de ‘Ád","malay":"(Kami tetap akan membinasakan orang-orang yang menentangmu wahai Muhammad), tidakkah engkau perhatikan, bagaimana Tuhanmu telah melakukan terhadap kaum Aad (yang kufur derhaka)","bosnian":"Zar ne znaš šta je Gospodar tvoj sa Adom uradio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/6"}},{"verse_key":"89:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"إِرَمَ ذَاتِ ٱلْعِمَادِ","transliteration":"Irama thati alAAimad","translations":{"sahih_international":"[With] Iram - who had lofty pillars,","pickthall":"With many-columned Iram,","yusuf_ali":"Of the (city of) Iram, with lofty pillars,","urdu":"اُونچے ستونوں والے عادِ اِرَم کے ساتھ،","turkish":"Rabbinin, hiçbir memlekette benzeri ortaya konmayan sütunlara sahip İrem şehrinde oturan Ad milletine ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"(yaitu) penduduk Iram (ibukota kaum 'Ād) yang mempunyai bangunan-bangunan yang tinggi,","french":"[avec] Iram, [la cité] à la colonne remarquable,","german":"(mit) Iram mit den Stützen,","bengali":"ইরাম গোত্রের প্রতি, যারা অধিকারী ছিল সুউচ্চ প্রাসাদের?","spanish":"en Iram?, el de las [construcciones con grandes] columnas,","malay":"Iaitu penduduk \"Iram\" yang mempunyai bangunan-bangunan yang tinggi tiangnya, (sesuai dengan penduduknya)","bosnian":"sa stanovnicima Irema, punog palata na stupovima,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/7"}},{"verse_key":"89:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"ٱلَّتِى لَمْ يُخْلَقْ مِثْلُهَا فِى ٱلْبِلَـٰدِ","transliteration":"Allatee lam yukhlaq mithluha fee albilad","translations":{"sahih_international":"The likes of whom had never been created in the land?","pickthall":"The like of which was not created in the lands;","yusuf_ali":"The like of which were not produced in (all) the land?","urdu":"جن کے مانند کوئی قوم دنیا کے ملکوں میں پیدا نہیں کی گئی تھی؟","turkish":"Rabbinin, hiçbir memlekette benzeri ortaya konmayan sütunlara sahip İrem şehrinde oturan Ad milletine ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"yang belum pernah dibangun (suatu kota) seperti itu, di negeri-negeri lain,","french":"dont jamais pareille ne fut construite parmi les villes ?","german":"dergleichen nicht erschaffen wurden in den Landstrichen?","bengali":"যার সমতুল্য অন্য কোন নগর নির্মিত হয়নি?","spanish":"que no tenía similar entre los otros pueblos [en su opulencia].","malay":"Yang belum pernah diciptakan sepertinya (tentang besar dan kukuhnya) di segala negeri (pada zamannya)?","bosnian":"kojima ravna ni u jednoj zemlji nije bilo;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/8"}},{"verse_key":"89:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"وَثَمُودَ ٱلَّذِينَ جَابُوا۟ ٱلصَّخْرَ بِٱلْوَادِ","transliteration":"Wathamooda allatheena jaboo assakhrabilwad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [with] Thamūd, who carved out the rocks in the valley?","pickthall":"And with (the tribe of) Thamud, who clove the rocks in the valley;","yusuf_ali":"And with the Thamud (people), who cut out (huge) rocks in the valley?-","urdu":"اور ثمود کے ساتھ جنہوں نے وادی میں چٹانیں تراشی تھیں؟","turkish":"Vadide kayaları kesip yontan Semud milletine, memleketlerde aşırı giden, oralarda bozgunculuğu artıran, sarsılmaz bir saltanat sahibi Firavun'a Rabbinin ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"dan (terhadap) kaum Samud yang memotong batu-batu besar di lembah,","french":"et avec les Thamûd qui taillaient le rocher dans la vallée ?","german":"Und (mit) den Tamud, die im Tal die Felsen aushöhlten?","bengali":"এবং ছামূদের প্রতি, যারা উপত্যকার পাথর কেটে গৃহ নির্মাণ করেছিল?","spanish":"Y al pueblo de Zamud, que esculpieron sus casas en las montañas rocosas del valle.","malay":"Dan (terhadap) kaum Thamud yang memahat batu-batu besar di lembah (Wadil-Qura iaitu tempat tinggalnya)?","bosnian":"i Semudom, koji je stijene u dolini klesao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/9"}},{"verse_key":"89:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَفِرْعَوْنَ ذِى ٱلْأَوْتَادِ","transliteration":"WafirAAawna thee al-awtad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [with] Pharaoh, owner of the stakes?","pickthall":"And with Pharaoh, firm of might,","yusuf_ali":"And with Pharaoh, lord of stakes?","urdu":"اور میخوں والے فرعون کے ساتھ؟","turkish":"Vadide kayaları kesip yontan Semud milletine, memleketlerde aşırı giden, oralarda bozgunculuğu artıran, sarsılmaz bir saltanat sahibi Firavun'a Rabbinin ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"dan (terhadap) Fir'aun yang mempunyai pasak-pasak (bangunan yang besar),","french":"ainsi qu’avec Pharaon, l’homme aux épieux ?","german":"Und (mit) Fir’aun, dem Besitzer der Pfähle,","bengali":"এবং বহু সৈন্য শিবিরের অধিপতি ফির‘আউনের প্রতি –","spanish":"Y al Faraón, el de las estacas.","malay":"Dan (terhadap) Firaun yang menguasai bangunan-bangunan yang handal kukuh?","bosnian":"i faraonom, koji je šatore imao –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/10"}},{"verse_key":"89:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ طَغَوْا۟ فِى ٱلْبِلَـٰدِ","transliteration":"Allatheena taghaw fee albilad","translations":{"sahih_international":"[All of] whom oppressed within the lands","pickthall":"Who (all) were rebellious (to Allah) in these lands,","yusuf_ali":"(All) these transgressed beyond bounds in the lands,","urdu":"یہ وہ لوگ تھے جنہوں نے دنیا کے ملکوں میں بڑی سرکشی کی تھی","turkish":"Vadide kayaları kesip yontan Semud milletine, memleketlerde aşırı giden, oralarda bozgunculuğu artıran, sarsılmaz bir saltanat sahibi Firavun'a Rabbinin ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"yang berbuat sewenang-wenang dalam negeri,","french":"Tous, étaient des gens qui transgressaient dans [leurs] pays,","german":"die (sie alle) das Maß (an Frevel) in den Landstrichen überschritten","bengali":"যারা নগরসমূহে উদ্ধতাচরণ করেছিল।","spanish":"Todos ellos fueron tiranos con los pueblos,","malay":"(Semuanya itu ialah) orang-orang yang telah bermaharajalela di negeri (masing-masing).","bosnian":"koji su na Zemlji zulum provodili"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/11"}},{"verse_key":"89:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"فَأَكْثَرُوا۟ فِيهَا ٱلْفَسَادَ","transliteration":"Faaktharoo feeha alfasad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And increased therein the corruption.","pickthall":"And multiplied iniquity therein?","yusuf_ali":"And heaped therein mischief (on mischief).","urdu":"اور ان میں بہت فساد پھیلایا تھا","turkish":"Vadide kayaları kesip yontan Semud milletine, memleketlerde aşırı giden, oralarda bozgunculuğu artıran, sarsılmaz bir saltanat sahibi Firavun'a Rabbinin ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"lalu mereka banyak berbuat kerusakan dalam negeri itu,","french":"et y avaient commis beaucoup de désordre.","german":"und darin viel Unheil stifteten?","bengali":"অতঃপর সেখানে তারা বহু বিপ্লব (সংঘটিত) করেছিল।","spanish":"sembrando la corrupción.","malay":"Lalu mereka melakukan dengan banyaknya kerosakan dan bencana di negeri-negeri itu.","bosnian":"i poroke na njoj umnožili,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/12"}},{"verse_key":"89:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"فَصَبَّ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّكَ سَوْطَ عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"Fasabba AAalayhim rabbuka sawtaAAathab","translations":{"sahih_international":"So your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment.","pickthall":"Therefore thy Lord poured on them the disaster of His punishment.","yusuf_ali":"Therefore did thy Lord pour on them a scourge of diverse chastisements:","urdu":"آخرکار تمہارے رب نے ان پر عذاب کا کوڑا برسا دیا","turkish":"Rabbin onları azap kırbacından geçirmiştir.","indonesian":"karena itu Tuhanmu menimpakan cemeti azab kepada mereka,","french":"Donc, ton Seigneur déversa sur eux un fouet du châtiment.","german":"Da schüttete dein Herr auf sie eine Geißel von Strafe aus.","bengali":"সুতরাং তোমার রাব্ব তাদের উপর শাস্তির কশাঘাত হানলেন।","spanish":"Pero como consecuencia de eso tu Señor les azotó con un castigo,","malay":"Dengan yang demikian, Tuhanmu mencurahkan ke atas mereka berbagai paluan azab;","bosnian":"pa je Gospodar tvoj – bič patnje na njih spustio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/13"}},{"verse_key":"89:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَبِٱلْمِرْصَادِ","transliteration":"Inna rabbaka labilmirsad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, your Lord is in observation.","pickthall":"Lo! thy Lord is ever watchful.","yusuf_ali":"For thy Lord is (as a Guardian) on a watch-tower.","urdu":"حقیقت یہ ہے کہ تمہارا ربّ گھات لگائے ہوئے ہے۔","turkish":"Doğrusu Rabbin hep gözetlemektedir.","indonesian":"sungguh, Tuhanmu benar-benar mengawasi.","french":"Car ton Seigneur demeure aux aguets.","german":"Gewiß, dein Herr wartet ja (auf sie).","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমার রাব্ব সবই দেখেন ও সময়ের প্রতীক্ষায় থাকেন।","spanish":"tu Señor está atento [a las acciones de la gente].","malay":"Sesungguhnya Tuhanmu tetap mengawas dan membalas, (terutama balasan akhirat)","bosnian":"jer, Gospodar tvoj je, zaista, u zasjedi."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/14"}},{"verse_key":"89:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَأَكْرَمَهُۥ وَنَعَّمَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَكْرَمَنِ","transliteration":"Faamma al-insanu itha maibtalahu rabbuhu faakramahu wanaAAAAamahu fayaqoolu rabbeeakraman","translations":{"sahih_international":"And as for man, when his Lord tries him and [thus] is generous to him and favors him, he says, \"My Lord has honored me.\"","pickthall":"As for man, whenever his Lord trieth him by honouring him, and is gracious unto him, he saith: My Lord honoureth me.","yusuf_ali":"Now, as for man, when his Lord trieth him, giving him honour and gifts, then saith he, (puffed up), \"My Lord hath honoured me.\"","urdu":"مگر انسان کا حال یہ ہے کہ اس کا ربّ جب اس کو آزمائش میں ڈالتا ہے اور اُسے عزت اور نعمت دیتا ہے تو وہ کہتا ہے کہ میرے ربّ نے مجھے عزت دار بنا دیا","turkish":"Rabbin denemek için bir insana iyilik edip, nimet verdiği zaman, o: \"Rabbim beni şerefli kıldı\" der.","indonesian":"Adapun manusia, apabila Tuhan mengujinya lalu memuliakannya dan memberinya kesenangan, maka dia berkata, \"Tuhanku telah memuliakanku.\"","french":"Quant à l’homme, lorsque son Seigneur l’éprouve en l’honorant et en le comblant de bienfaits, il dit : \"Mon Seigneur m’a honoré.\"","german":"Was nun den Menschen angeht, wenn sein Herr ihn prüft und ihn da(bei) freigebig behandelt und ihm ein wonnevolles Leben verschafft, so sagt er: Mein Herr behandelt mich freigebig.","bengali":"মানুষতো এমনই যে, তার রাব্ব যখন তাকে পরীক্ষা করেন, পরে তাকে সম্মানিত করেন এবং সুখ-সম্পদ দান করেন, তখন সে বলেঃ আমার রাব্ব আমাকে সম্মানিত করেছেন।","spanish":"El ser humano, cuando su Señor lo agracia, dice: “Mi Señor me ha honrado [porque lo merezco]”.","malay":"(Dalam pada itu manusia tidak menghiraukan balasan akhirat), oleh yang demikian, maka kebanyakan manusia apabila diuji oleh Tuhannya dengan dimuliakan dan dimewahkan hidupnya, (ia tidak mahu bersyukur tetapi terus bersikap takbur) serta berkata dengan sombongnya: \"Tuhanku telah memuliakan daku!\"","bosnian":"Čovjek, kada Gospodar njegov hoće da ga iskuša pa mu počast ukaže i blagodatima ga obaspe, rekne: \"Gospodar moj je prema meni plemenito postupio!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/15"}},{"verse_key":"89:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"وَأَمَّآ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ فَقَدَرَ عَلَيْهِ رِزْقَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَهَـٰنَنِ","transliteration":"Waamma itha ma ibtalahufaqadara AAalayhi rizqahu fayaqoolu rabbee ahanan","translations":{"sahih_international":"But when He tries him and restricts his provision, he says, \"My Lord has humiliated me.\"","pickthall":"But whenever He trieth him by straitening his means of life, he saith: My Lord despiseth me.","yusuf_ali":"But when He trieth him, restricting his subsistence for him, then saith he (in despair), \"My Lord hath humiliated me!\"","urdu":"اور جب وہ اُس کو آزمائش میں ڈالتا ہے اور اُس کا رزق اُس پر تنگ کر دیتا ہے تو وہ کہتا ہے میرے ربّ نے مجھے ذلیل کر دیا۔","turkish":"Ama onu sınamak için rızkını daraltıp bir ölçüye göre verdiği zaman: \"Rabbim bana hor baktı\" der.","indonesian":"Namun apabila Tuhan mengujinya lalu membatasi rezekinya, maka dia berkata, \"Tuhanku telah menghinaku.\"","french":"Mais par contre, quand Il l’éprouve en lui restreignant sa subsistance, il dit : \"Mon Seigneur m’a avili.\"","german":"Was (ihn) aber angeht, wenn Er ihn prüft und ihm da(bei) seine Versorgung bemißt, so sagt er: Mein Herr setzt mich der Schmach aus.","bengali":"এবং আবার যখন তাকে পরীক্ষা করেন, অতঃপর তার রিয্ক সংকুচিত করেন, তখন সে বলেঃ আমার রাব্ব আমাকে হীন করেছেন।","spanish":"En cambio cuando lo pone a prueba restringiendo su sustento, dice: “Mi Señor me ha despreciado [y no ha tenido en cuenta mis méritos]”.","malay":"Dan sebaliknya apabila ia diuji oleh Tuhannya, dengan disempitkan rezekinya, (ia tidak bersabar bahkan ia resah gelisah) serta merepek dengan katanya: \"Tuhanku telah menghinakan daku!\"","bosnian":"A kad mu, da bi ga iskušao, opskrbu njegovu oskudnom učini, onda rekne: \"Gospodar moj me je napustio!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/16"}},{"verse_key":"89:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"كَلَّا ۖ بَل لَّا تُكْرِمُونَ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","transliteration":"Kalla bal la tukrimoonaalyateem","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! But you do not honor the orphan","pickthall":"Nay, but ye (for your part) honour not the orphan","yusuf_ali":"Nay, nay! but ye honour not the orphans!","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، بلکہ تم یتیم سے عزّت کا سلوک نہیں کرتے","turkish":"Hayır; yetime karşı cömert davranmıyorsunuz.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Bahkan kamu tidak memuliakan anak yatim,","french":"Mais non ! C’est vous plutôt, qui n’êtes pas généreux envers les orphelins ;","german":"Keineswegs! Vielmehr behandelt ihr die Waise nicht freigebig","bengali":"না, কখনই নয়। বস্তুতঃ তোমরা ইয়াতীমদেরকে সম্মান করনা।","spanish":"¡Pero no! No habéis comprendido el verdadero significado de las pruebas [de la riqueza y la pobreza] y por eso no sois generosos con el huérfano","malay":"Jangan demikian, (sebenarnya kata-kata kamu itu salah). Bahkan (perbuatan kamu wahai orang-orang yang hidup mewah, lebih salah lagi kerana) kamu tidak memuliakan anak yatim, (malah kamu menahan apa yang Ia berhak menerimanya);","bosnian":"A nije tako! Vi pažnju siročetu ne ukazujete,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/17"}},{"verse_key":"89:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"وَلَا تَحَـٰٓضُّونَ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","transliteration":"Wala tahaddoona AAala taAAamialmiskeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you do not encourage one another to feed the poor.","pickthall":"And urge not on the feeding of the poor.","yusuf_ali":"Nor do ye encourage one another to feed the poor!-","urdu":"اور مسکین کو کھانا کھلانے پر ایک دُوسرے کو نہیں اُکساتے،","turkish":"Yoksulu yedirmek konusunda birbirinize özenmiyorsunuz.","indonesian":"dan kamu tidak saling mengajak memberi makan orang miskin,","french":"qui ne vous incitez pas mutuellement à nourrir le pauvre,","german":"und haltet euch nicht gegenseitig zur Speisung des Armen an.","bengali":"এবং তোমরা অভাবগ্রস্তকে খাদ্য দানে পরস্পরকে উৎসাহিত করনা,","spanish":"ni exhortáis unos a otros a alimentar al pobre.","malay":"Dan kamu tidak menggalakkan untuk memberi makanan (yang berhak diterima oleh) orang miskin;","bosnian":"i da se puki siromah nahrani – jedan drugog ne nagovarate,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/18"}},{"verse_key":"89:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"وَتَأْكُلُونَ ٱلتُّرَاثَ أَكْلًا لَّمًّا","transliteration":"Wata/kuloona atturatha aklanlamma","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you consume inheritance, devouring [it] altogether,","pickthall":"And ye devour heritages with devouring greed.","yusuf_ali":"And ye devour inheritance - all with greed,","urdu":"اور میراث کا سارا مال سمیٹ کر کھا جاتے ہو،","turkish":"Size kalan mirası hak gözetmeden yiyorsunuz.","indonesian":"sedangkan kamu memakan harta warisan dengan cara mencampurbaurkan (yang halal dan yang haram),","french":"qui dévorez l’héritage avec une avidité vorace,","german":"Und ihr verzehrt das Erbe, ja ihr verzehrt es ganz und gar.","bengali":"এবং তোমরা উত্তরাধিকারীদের প্রাপ্য সম্পদ সম্পূর্ণ রূপে আহার করে থাকো,","spanish":"[En lugar de eso] os apropiáis codiciosamente de los bienes del prójimo,","malay":"Dan kamu sentiasa makan harta pusaka secara rakus (dengan tidak membezakan halal haramnya),","bosnian":"a nasljedstvo pohlepno jedete"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/19"}},{"verse_key":"89:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"وَتُحِبُّونَ ٱلْمَالَ حُبًّا جَمًّا","transliteration":"Watuhibboona almala hubbanjamma","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you love wealth with immense love.","pickthall":"And love wealth with abounding love.","yusuf_ali":"And ye love wealth with inordinate love!","urdu":"اور مال کی محبت میں بُری طرح گرفتار ہو۔","turkish":"Malı pek çok seviyorsunuz.","indonesian":"dan kamu mencintai harta dengan kecintaan yang berlebihan.","french":"et aimez les richesses d’un amour sans bornes.","german":"Und ihr liebt den Besitz, ja ihr liebt ihn voll und ganz.","bengali":"এবং তোমরা ধন-সম্পদকে অত্যধিক ভালবেসে থাক,","spanish":"y sois insaciables en vuestro amor [y codicia] por el dinero.","malay":"Serta kamu pula sayangkan harta secara tamak haloba!","bosnian":"i bogatstvo pretjerano volite."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/20"}},{"verse_key":"89:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِذَا دُكَّتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ دَكًّا دَكًّا","transliteration":"Kalla itha dukkati al-ardudakkan dakka","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! When the earth has been leveled - pounded and crushed","pickthall":"Nay, but when the earth is ground to atoms, grinding, grinding,","yusuf_ali":"Nay! When the earth is pounded to powder,","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، جب زمین پے در پے کوُٹ کوُٹ کر ریگ زار بنا دی جائے گی","turkish":"Ama yer, çarpılıp paralandığı zaman;","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Apabila bumi diguncangkan berturut-turut (berbenturan),","french":"Prenez garde ! Quand la terre sera complètement pulvérisée,","german":"Keineswegs! Wenn die Erde eingeebnet, ja platt eingeebnet wird","bengali":"এটা সংগত নয়। পৃথিবীকে যখন চূর্ণ বিচূর্ণ করা হবে,","spanish":"¡Basta! [Pensad en cuál será su destino] cuando la Tierra sea golpeada una y otra vez,","malay":"Jangan sekali-kali bersikap demikian! (Sebenarnya) apabila bumi (dihancurkan segala yang ada di atasnya dan) diratakan serata-ratanya,","bosnian":"A ne valja to! Kada se Zemlja u komadiće zdrobi"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/21"}},{"verse_key":"89:22","ayah":22,"arabic":"وَجَآءَ رَبُّكَ وَٱلْمَلَكُ صَفًّا صَفًّا","transliteration":"Wajaa rabbuka walmalaku saffansaffa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And your Lord has come and the angels, rank upon rank,","pickthall":"And thy Lord shall come with angels, rank on rank,","yusuf_ali":"And thy Lord cometh, and His angels, rank upon rank,","urdu":"اور تمہارا ربّ جلوہ فرما ہوگا اِس حال میں کہ فرشتے صف در صف کھڑے ہوں گے","turkish":"Melekler sıra sıra dizilip, Rabbinin buyruğu gelince,","indonesian":"dan datanglah Tuhanmu; dan malaikat berbaris-baris,","french":"et que ton Seigneur viendra ainsi que les Anges, rang par rang,","german":"und dein Herr kommt und die Engel, Reihe um Reihe,","bengali":"এবং যখন তোমার রাব্ব আগমন করবেন, আর সারিবদ্ধভাবে মালাইকা/ফেরেশতাগণও সমুপস্থিত হবে –","spanish":"y llegue vuestro Señor y se presenten los ángeles en fila tras fila,","malay":"Dan (perintah) Tuhanmu pun datang, sedang malaikat berbaris-baris (siap sedia menjalankan perintah),","bosnian":"i kada dođe Gospodar tvoj, a meleki budu sve red do reda,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089022.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/22"}},{"verse_key":"89:23","ayah":23,"arabic":"وَجِا۟ىٓءَ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بِجَهَنَّمَ ۚ يَوْمَئِذٍ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ وَأَنَّىٰ لَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Wajee-a yawma-ithin bijahannamayawma-ithin yatathakkaru al-insanu waannalahu aththikra","translations":{"sahih_international":"And brought [within view], that Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but how [i.e., what good] to him will be the remembrance?","pickthall":"And hell is brought near that day; on that day man will remember, but how will the remembrance (then avail him)?","yusuf_ali":"And Hell, that Day, is brought (face to face),- on that Day will man remember, but how will that remembrance profit him?","urdu":"اور جہنّم اُس روز سامنے لے آئی جائے گی، اُس دن انسان کو سمجھ آئے گی اور اس وقت اُس کے سمجھنے کا کیا حاصل ؟","turkish":"O gün, cehennem ortaya konur. O gün insan öğüt almaya çalışır ama artık öğütten ona ne?","indonesian":"dan pada hari itu diperlihatkan neraka Jahanam; pada hari itu sadarlah manusia, tetapi tidak berguna lagi baginya kesadaran itu.","french":"et que ce jour-là, on amènera l’Enfer ; ce jour-là, l’homme se rappellera. Mais à quoi lui servira de se souvenir ?","german":"und herbeigebracht wird an jenem Tag die Hölle, an jenem Tag wird der Mensch bedenken. Wie soll ihm dann die Selbstbesinnung (nützen)?","bengali":"সেদিন জাহান্নামকে আনয়ন করা হবে এবং সেদিন মানুষ উপলদ্ধি করবে, কিন্তু এই উপলদ্ধি তার কি করে কাজে আসবে?","spanish":"y sea traído el Infierno. Ese día el ser humano recordará sus obras, pero de nada le servirá.","malay":"Serta diperlihatkan neraka Jahannam pada hari itu, (maka) pada saat itu manusia akan ingat (hendak berlaku baik), dan bagaimana ingatan itu akan berguna lagi kepadanya?","bosnian":"i kad se tog Dana primakne Džehennem; tada će se čovjek sjetiti – a na što mu je sjećanje?! –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089023.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/23"}},{"verse_key":"89:24","ayah":24,"arabic":"يَقُولُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى قَدَّمْتُ لِحَيَاتِى","transliteration":"Yaqoolu ya laytanee qaddamtu lihayatee","translations":{"sahih_international":"He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life.\"","pickthall":"He will say: Ah, would that I had sent before me (some provision) for my life!","yusuf_ali":"He will say: \"Ah! Would that I had sent forth (good deeds) for (this) my (Future) Life!\"","urdu":"وہ کہے گا کہ کاش میں نے اپنی اِس زندگی کے لیے کچھ پیشگی سامان کیا ہوتا!","turkish":"\"Keşke bu hayatım için önceden bir şey yapsaymışım\" der.","indonesian":"Dia berkata, \"Alangkah baiknya sekiranya dahulu aku mengerjakan (kebajikan) untuk hidupku ini.\"","french":"Il dira : \"Hélas ! Que n’ai-je fais du bien pour ma vie future !","german":"Er wird sagen: O hätte ich doch für mein (jenseitiges) Leben (etwas) vorausgeschickt!","bengali":"সে বলবেঃ হায়! আমার এ জীবনের জন্য আমি যদি কিছু অগ্রিম পাঠাতাম!","spanish":"Y dirá lamentándose: “¡Ojalá hubiera realizado buenas obras para mi vida [del más allá]!”","malay":"Ia akan berkata: \"Alangkah baiknya kalau aku dahulu sediakan amal-amal baik untuk hidupku (di sini)!\"","bosnian":"i reći: \"Kamo sreće da sam se za ovaj život pripremio!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089024.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/24"}},{"verse_key":"89:25","ayah":25,"arabic":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍ لَّا يُعَذِّبُ عَذَابَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Fayawma-ithin la yuAAaththibuAAathabahu ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment,","pickthall":"None punisheth as He will punish on that day!","yusuf_ali":"For, that Day, His Chastisement will be such as none (else) can inflict,","urdu":"پھر اُس دن اللہ جو عذاب دے گا ویسا عذاب دینے والا کوئی نہیں","turkish":"O gün, hiç kimse, Allah'ın azabettiği gibi azabedemez.","indonesian":"Maka pada hari itu tidak ada seorang pun yang mengazab seperti azab-Nya (yang adil),","french":"Ce jour-là donc, nul ne saura châtier comme Lui châtie,","german":"An jenem Tag wird niemand strafen, so wie Er straft,","bengali":"সেই দিন তাঁর শাস্তির মত শাস্তি কেহ দিতে পারবেনা,","spanish":"Sabed que nadie ha castigado como Él castigará ese día,","malay":"Maka pada hari itu tiada sesiapapun yang dapat menyeksa seperti azab (yang ditimpakan oleh) Allah.","bosnian":"Tog Dana niko neće kao On mučiti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089025.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/25"}},{"verse_key":"89:26","ayah":26,"arabic":"وَلَا يُوثِقُ وَثَاقَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Wala yoothiqu wathaqahu ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers].","pickthall":"None bindeth as He then will bind.","yusuf_ali":"And His bonds will be such as none (other) can bind.","urdu":"اور اللہ جیسا باندھے گا ویسا باندھنے والا کوئی نہیں","turkish":"Hiç kimse O'nun vurduğu bağ gibisini bağlayamaz.","indonesian":"dan tidak ada seorang pun yang mengikat seperti ikatan-Nya.","french":"et nul ne saura garrotter comme Lui garrotte.","german":"und niemand wird fesseln, so wie Er fesselt.","bengali":"এবং তাঁর বন্ধনের মত বন্ধন কেহ করতে পারবেনা।","spanish":"y nadie ha encadenado como Él encadenará [ese día].","malay":"Dan tiada sesiapapun yang dapat mengikat serta membelenggu seperti ikatan dan belengguNya.","bosnian":"i niko neće kao On u okove okivati!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089026.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/26"}},{"verse_key":"89:27","ayah":27,"arabic":"يَـٰٓأَيَّتُهَا ٱلنَّفْسُ ٱلْمُطْمَئِنَّةُ","transliteration":"Ya ayyatuha annafsualmutma-inna","translations":{"sahih_international":"[To the righteous it will be said], \"O reassured soul,","pickthall":"But ah! thou soul at peace!","yusuf_ali":"(To the righteous soul will be said:) \"O (thou) soul, in (complete) rest and satisfaction!","urdu":"(دُوسری طرف ارشاد ہوگا)اے نفسِ مطمئن،","turkish":"Ey huzur içinde olan can!","indonesian":"Wahai jiwa yang tenang!","french":"\"ô toi, âme apaisée,","german":"O du Seele, die du Ruhe gefunden hast,","bengali":"বলা হবেঃ হে প্রশান্ত চিত্ত!","spanish":"[Le será dicho al creyente:] “¡Oh, alma que estás en paz con tu Señor!","malay":"(Setelah menerangkan akibat orang-orang yang tidak menghiraukan akhirat, Tuhan menyatakan bahawa orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh akan disambut dengan kata-kata): \"Wahai orang yang mempunyai jiwa yang sentiasa tenang tetap dengan kepercayaan dan bawaan baiknya! -","bosnian":"A ti, o dušo smirena,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089027.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/27"}},{"verse_key":"89:28","ayah":28,"arabic":"ٱرْجِعِىٓ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكِ رَاضِيَةً مَّرْضِيَّةً","transliteration":"IrjiAAee ila rabbiki radiyatanmardiyya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Return to your Lord, well-pleased and pleasing [to Him],","pickthall":"Return unto thy Lord, content in His good pleasure!","yusuf_ali":"\"Come back thou to thy Lord,- well pleased (thyself), and well-pleasing unto Him!","urdu":"چل اپنے ربّ کی طرف اِس حال میں کہ تُو (اپنے انجامِ نیک سے) خوش (اور اپنے ربّ کے نزدیک) پسندیدہ ہے","turkish":"O, senden, sen de O'ndan hoşnut olarak Rabbine dön!","indonesian":"Kembalilah kepada Tuhanmu dengan hati yang rida dan diridai-Nya.","french":"retourne vers ton Seigneur, satisfaite et agréée ;","german":"kehre zu deinem Herrn zufrieden und mit Wohlgefallen zurück.","bengali":"তুমি তোমার রবের নিকট ফিরে এসো সন্তুষ্ট ও সন্তোষ ভাজন হয়ে,","spanish":"Vuelve a la vera de tu Señor complacida, porque Dios está complacido contigo,","malay":"\"Kembalilah kepada Tuhanmu dengan keadaan engkau berpuas hati (dengan segala nikmat yang diberikan) lagi diredhai (di sisi Tuhanmu) ! -","bosnian":"vrati se Gospodaru svome zadovoljna, a i On tobom zadovoljan,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089028.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/28"}},{"verse_key":"89:29","ayah":29,"arabic":"فَٱدْخُلِى فِى عِبَـٰدِى","transliteration":"Fadkhulee fee AAibadee","translations":{"sahih_international":"And enter among My [righteous] servants","pickthall":"Enter thou among My bondmen!","yusuf_ali":"\"Enter thou, then, among My devotees!","urdu":"شامل ہو جا میرے (نیک) بندوں میں","turkish":"Ey can! İyi kullarımın arasına gir.","indonesian":"Maka masuklah ke dalam golongan hamba-hamba-Ku,","french":"entre donc parmi Mes serviteurs,","german":"Tritt ein unter Meine Diener,","bengali":"অতঃপর তুমি আমার বান্দাদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হও,","spanish":"y únete a Mis siervos piadosos","malay":"\"Serta masuklah engkau dalam kumpulan hamba-hambaku yang berbahagia -","bosnian":"pa uđi među robove Moje,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089029.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/29"}},{"verse_key":"89:30","ayah":30,"arabic":"وَٱدْخُلِى جَنَّتِى","transliteration":"Wadkhulee jannatee","translations":{"sahih_international":"And enter My Paradise.\"","pickthall":"Enter thou My Garden!","yusuf_ali":"\"Yea, enter thou My Heaven!","urdu":"اور داخل ہو جا میری جنت میں","turkish":"Cennetime gir.","indonesian":"dan masuklah ke dalam surga-Ku.","french":"et entre dans Mon Paradis.\"","german":"und tritt ein in Meinen (Paradies)garten.","bengali":"এবং আমার জান্নাতে প্রবেশ কর।","spanish":"entrando a Mi Paraíso”.","malay":"\"Dan masuklah ke dalam SyurgaKu! \"","bosnian":"i uđi u Džennet Moj!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/089030.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/89/30"}}]}},{"number":90,"data":{"surah":{"number":90,"name_arabic":"البلد","name_english":"Al-Balad","name_translation":"The City","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":35,"verses_count":20,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/090.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/090.mp3"}],"total_verses":20,"verses":[{"verse_key":"90:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","transliteration":"La oqsimu bihatha albalad","translations":{"sahih_international":"I swear by this city [i.e., Makkah]","pickthall":"Nay, I swear by this city -","yusuf_ali":"I do call to witness this City;-","urdu":"نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں اِس شہر کی","turkish":"Bu şehre (Mekke'ye) yemin ederim; ki sen bu şehirde oturmuşsun.","indonesian":"Aku bersumpah dengan negeri ini (Mekkah),","french":"Non !... Je jure par cette Cité !","german":"Nein, Ich schwöre bei dieser Ortschaft","bengali":"শপথ করছি এই নগরের,","spanish":"Juro por esta ciudad [La Meca],","malay":"Aku bersumpah dengan negeri (Makkah) ini;","bosnian":"Kunem se gradom ovim –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/1"}},{"verse_key":"90:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَأَنتَ حِلٌّۢ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","transliteration":"Waanta hillun bihatha albalad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you, [O Muḥammad], are free of restriction in this city","pickthall":"And thou art an indweller of this city -","yusuf_ali":"And thou art a freeman of this City;-","urdu":"اور حال یہ ہے کہ (اے نبیؐ) اِس شہر میں تم کو حلال کر لیا گیا ہے،","turkish":"Bu şehre (Mekke'ye) yemin ederim; ki sen bu şehirde oturmuşsun.","indonesian":"dan engkau (Muhammad), bertempat di negeri (Mekkah) ini,","french":"et toi, tu es un résident dans cette cité -","german":"-, wo du in dieser Ortschaft deinen Aufenthalt hast,","bengali":"আর তুমি এই নগরের বৈধ অধিকারী হবে।","spanish":"en la que tú resides [¡Oh, Muhámmad!],","malay":"Sedang engkau (wahai Muhammad) tinggal di negeri ini (sentiasa ditindas),","bosnian":"a tebi će biti dopušteno sve u gradu ovome –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/2"}},{"verse_key":"90:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَوَالِدٍ وَمَا وَلَدَ","transliteration":"Wawalidin wama walad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the father and that which was born [of him],","pickthall":"And the begetter and that which he begat,","yusuf_ali":"And (the mystic ties of) parent and child;-","urdu":"اور قسم کھاتا ہوں باپ کی اور اس اولاد کی جو اس سے پیدا ہوئی،","turkish":"Doğurana ve doğurduğuna and olsun ki;","indonesian":"dan demi (pertalian) bapak dan anaknya.","french":"Et par le père et ce qu’il engendre !","german":"und bei einem (jeden) Erzeuger und dem, was er zeugt.","bengali":"শপথ জন্মদাতার এবং যা সে জন্ম দিয়েছে তার।","spanish":"y juro por el progenitor y su descendencia,","malay":"Demi manusia yang melahirkan zuriat, dan zuriat yang dilahirkannya;","bosnian":"i roditeljem i onim koga je rodio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/3"}},{"verse_key":"90:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ فِى كَبَدٍ","transliteration":"Laqad khalaqna al-insana feekabad","translations":{"sahih_international":"We have certainly created man into hardship.","pickthall":"We verily have created man in an atmosphere:","yusuf_ali":"Verily We have created man into toil and struggle.","urdu":"درحقیقت ہم نے انسان کو مشقّت میں پیدا کیا ہے۔","turkish":"İnsanoğlunu, zorluklara katlanacak şekilde yarattık.","indonesian":"Sungguh, Kami telah menciptakan manusia berada dalam susah payah.","french":"Nous avons, certes, créé l’homme pour une vie de lutte.","german":"Wir haben den Menschen ja (zu einem Leben) in Mühsal erschaffen.","bengali":"অবশ্যই আমি মানুষকে সৃষ্টি করেছি ক্লেশের মধ্যে।","spanish":"que creé al ser humano para una vida de continuas dificultades.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah jadikan manusia sentiasa dalam keadaan menghadapi kesulitan dan kesukaran (jasmani dan rohaninya);","bosnian":"Mi čovjeka stvaramo da se trudi."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/4"}},{"verse_key":"90:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Ayahsabu an lan yaqdira AAalayhi ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?","pickthall":"Thinketh he that none hath power over him?","yusuf_ali":"Thinketh he, that none hath power over him?","urdu":"کیا اُس نے یہ سمجھ رکھا ہے کہ اُس پر کوئی قابو نہ پا سکے گا؟","turkish":"İnsanoğlu, kendisine kimsenin güç yetiremeyeceğini mi sanıyor?","indonesian":"Apakah dia (manusia) itu mengira bahwa tidak ada sesuatu pun yang berkuasa atasnya?","french":"Pense-t-il que personne ne pourra rien contre lui ?","german":"Meint er etwa, daß überhaupt niemand Macht über ihn hat?","bengali":"সে কি মনে করে যে, কখনও তার উপর কেহ ক্ষমতাবান হবেনা?","spanish":"¿Acaso piensa que nadie tiene poder sobre él?","malay":"Patutkah manusia yang demikian keadaannya (terpedaya dengan kekuasaan yang ada padanya dan) menyangka bahawa tidak ada sesiapapun yang dapat mengatasi kekuasaannya (dan menyeksakannya)?","bosnian":"Misli li on da mu niko ništa ne može?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/5"}},{"verse_key":"90:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَالًا لُّبَدًا","transliteration":"Yaqoolu ahlaktu malan lubada","translations":{"sahih_international":"He says, \"I have spent wealth in abundance.\"","pickthall":"And he saith: I have destroyed vast wealth:","yusuf_ali":"He may say (boastfully); Wealth have I squandered in abundance!","urdu":"کہتا ہے کہ میں نے ڈھیروں مال اُڑا دیا۔","turkish":"\"Yığın yığın mal tüketmişimdir\" diyor.","indonesian":"Dia mengatakan, \"Aku telah menghabiskan harta yang banyak.\"","french":"Il dit : \"J’ai gaspillé beaucoup de biens.\"","german":"Er sagt: Ich habe Besitz in Mengen verbraucht.","bengali":"সে বলেঃ আমি রাশি রাশি অর্থ উড়িয়ে দিয়েছি।","spanish":"Presume diciendo: “He derrochado una gran fortuna”.","malay":"Manusia yang demikian keadaannya (tidaklah patut ia bermegah-megah dengan kekayaannya dan) berkata: \"Aku telah habiskan harta benda yang banyak (dalam usaha menegakkan nama dan bangsa).","bosnian":"\"Utrošio sam blago nebrojeno!\" – reći će."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/6"}},{"verse_key":"90:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّمْ يَرَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Ayahsabu an lam yarahu ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Does he think that no one has seen him?","pickthall":"Thinketh he that none beholdeth him?","yusuf_ali":"Thinketh he that none beholdeth him?","urdu":"کیا وہ سمجھتا ہے کہ کسی نے اُس کو نہیں دیکھا؟","turkish":"O, kimsenin kendisini görmediğini mi zannediyor?","indonesian":"Apakah dia mengira bahwa tidak ada sesuatu pun yang melihatnya?","french":"Pense-t-il que nul ne l’a vu?","german":"Meint er etwa, daß niemand ihn gesehen hat?","bengali":"সে কি ধারণা করে যে, তাকে কেহই দেখছেনা?","spanish":"¿Acaso cree que nadie le ve?","malay":"Adakah ia menyangka bahawa tidak ada sesiapapun yang melihatnya (dan mengetahui tujuannya menghabiskan harta bendanya itu?","bosnian":"Zar misli da ga niko vidio nije?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/7"}},{"verse_key":"90:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"أَلَمْ نَجْعَل لَّهُۥ عَيْنَيْنِ","transliteration":"Alam najAAal lahu AAaynayn","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have We not made for him two eyes?","pickthall":"Did We not assign unto him two eyes","yusuf_ali":"Have We not made for him a pair of eyes?-","urdu":"کیا ہم نے اُسے دو آنکھیں","turkish":"Biz onun için iki göz, bir dil ve iki dudak var etmedik mi?","indonesian":"Bukankah Kami telah menjadikan untuknya sepasang mata,","french":"Ne lui avons-Nous pas assigné deux yeux,","german":"Haben Wir ihm nicht zwei Augen gemacht,","bengali":"আমি কি তার জন্য সৃষ্টি করিনি চক্ষু যুগল?","spanish":"¿Acaso no le he dado dos ojos,","malay":"(Mengapa manusia terpedaya dan bermegah-megah?) Tidakkah Kami telah menjadikan baginya: dua mata (untuk ia memerhatikan kekuasaan dan kekayaan Kami?) -","bosnian":"Zar mu nismo dali oka dva"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/8"}},{"verse_key":"90:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"وَلِسَانًا وَشَفَتَيْنِ","transliteration":"Walisanan washafatayn","translations":{"sahih_international":"And a tongue and two lips?","pickthall":"And a tongue and two lips,","yusuf_ali":"And a tongue, and a pair of lips?-","urdu":"اور ایک زبان اور دو ہونٹ نہیں دیے؟","turkish":"Biz onun için iki göz, bir dil ve iki dudak var etmedik mi?","indonesian":"dan lidah dan sepasang bibir?","french":"et une langue et deux lèvres ?","german":"eine Zunge und zwei Lippen","bengali":"তার জিহবা ও ওষ্ঠদ্বয়?","spanish":"una lengua y dos labios,","malay":"Dan lidah serta dua bibir (untuk ia menyempurnakan sebahagian besar dari hajat-hajatnya)?","bosnian":"i jezik i usne dvije,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/9"}},{"verse_key":"90:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَهَدَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلنَّجْدَيْنِ","transliteration":"Wahadaynahu annajdayn","translations":{"sahih_international":"And have shown him the two ways?","pickthall":"And guide him to the parting of the mountain ways?","yusuf_ali":"And shown him the two highways?","urdu":"اور دونوں نمایاں راستے اُسے (نہیں) دکھا دیے؟","turkish":"Biz ona eğri ve doğru iki yolu da göstermedik mi?","indonesian":"Dan Kami telah menunjukkan kepadanya dua jalan (kebajikkan dan kejahatan).","french":"Ne l’avons-Nous pas guidé aux deux voies.","german":"und ihn beide Hochebenen geleitet?","bengali":"এবং আমি তাদেরকে দু’টি পথ দেখিয়েছি ।","spanish":"y le he mostrado los dos senderos [el del bien y el del mal]?","malay":"Dan Kami telah menunjukkan kepadanya dua jalan, (jalan kebaikan untuk dijalaninya, dan jalan kejahatan untuk dijauhi)?","bosnian":"i dobro i zlo mu objasnili?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/10"}},{"verse_key":"90:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"فَلَا ٱقْتَحَمَ ٱلْعَقَبَةَ","transliteration":"Fala iqtahama alAAaqaba","translations":{"sahih_international":"But he has not broken through the difficult pass.","pickthall":"But he hath not attempted the Ascent -","yusuf_ali":"But he hath made no haste on the path that is steep.","urdu":"مگر اس نے دشوار گزار گھاٹی سے گزرنے کی ہمّت نہ کی۔","turkish":"Ama o, zor geçidi aşmaya girişemedi.","indonesian":"Tetapi dia tidak menempuh jalan yang mendaki dan sukar?","french":"Or, il ne s’engage pas dans la voie difficile !","german":"Aber er ist nicht den steilen Paßweg hinaufgestürmt.","bengali":"কিন্তু সে গিরিসংকটে প্রবেশ করলনা।","spanish":"Pero no está dispuesto a tomar el camino del esfuerzo.","malay":"Dalam pada itu manusia tidak (memilih jalan kebaikan) merempuh masuk mengerjakan amal-amal yang tinggi darjatnya di sisi Tuhan;","bosnian":"Pa, zašto on na blagodatima zahvalan bio nije? –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/11"}},{"verse_key":"90:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْعَقَبَةُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka maalAAaqaba","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is [breaking through] the difficult pass?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Ascent is! -","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee the path that is steep?-","urdu":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ کیا ہے وہ دشوار گزار گھاٹی؟","turkish":"O zor geçidin ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah jalan yang mendaki dan sukar itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est la voie difficile ?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was der steile Paßweg ist?","bengali":"তুমি কি জান, গিরিসংকট কি?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará comprender lo que es el camino del esfuerzo?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui: apa dia amal-amal yang tinggi darjatnya di sisi Tuhan itu?","bosnian":"A šta ti misliš: kako se može na blagodatima zahvalan biti? –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/12"}},{"verse_key":"90:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"فَكُّ رَقَبَةٍ","transliteration":"Fakku raqaba","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is the freeing of a slave","pickthall":"(It is) to free a slave,","yusuf_ali":"(It is:) freeing the bondman;","urdu":"کسی گردن کو غلامی سے چھڑانا","turkish":"O geçit, bir köle ve esir azadetmek,","indonesian":"(Yaitu) membebaskan budak (hamba sahaya),","french":"C’est délier un joug [affranchir un esclave],","german":"(Es ist) die Freilassung eines Sklaven","bengali":"এটা হচ্ছে দাসকে মুক্তি প্রদান।","spanish":"Es liberar [al esclavo] de la esclavitud","malay":"(Di antara amal-amal itu - bagi orang yang mampu) ialah: memerdekakan hamba abdi;","bosnian":"roba ropstva osloboditi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/13"}},{"verse_key":"90:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"أَوْ إِطْعَـٰمٌ فِى يَوْمٍ ذِى مَسْغَبَةٍ","transliteration":"Aw itAAamun fee yawmin theemasghaba","translations":{"sahih_international":"Or feeding on a day of severe hunger","pickthall":"And to feed in the day of hunger.","yusuf_ali":"Or the giving of food in a day of privation","urdu":"یا فاقے کے دن","turkish":"Yahut, açlık gününde, yakını olan bir öksüzü, yahut toprağa serilmiş bir yoksulu doyurmaktır.","indonesian":"atau memberi makan pada hari terjadi kelaparan,","french":"ou nourrir, en un jour de famine,","german":"oder zu speisen am Tag der Hungersnot","bengali":"অথবা দুর্ভিক্ষের সময় আহার্য দান –","spanish":"y dar alimentos en días de hambre","malay":"Atau memberi makan pada hari kelaparan -","bosnian":"ili, kad glad hara, nahraniti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/14"}},{"verse_key":"90:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"يَتِيمًا ذَا مَقْرَبَةٍ","transliteration":"Yateeman tha maqraba","translations":{"sahih_international":"An orphan of near relationship","pickthall":"An orphan near of kin,","yusuf_ali":"To the orphan with claims of relationship,","urdu":"کسی قریبی یتیم","turkish":"Yahut, açlık gününde, yakını olan bir öksüzü, yahut toprağa serilmiş bir yoksulu doyurmaktır.","indonesian":"(kepada) anak yatim yang ada hubungan kerabat,","french":"un orphelin proche parent.","german":"eine Waise, die einem nahe ist,","bengali":"পিতৃহীন আত্মীয়কে,","spanish":"al pariente huérfano,","malay":"Kepada anak yatim dari kaum kerabat,","bosnian":"siroče bliska roda,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/15"}},{"verse_key":"90:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"أَوْ مِسْكِينًا ذَا مَتْرَبَةٍ","transliteration":"Aw miskeenan tha matraba","translations":{"sahih_international":"Or a needy person in misery","pickthall":"Or some poor wretch in misery,","yusuf_ali":"Or to the indigent (down) in the dust.","urdu":"یا خاک نشین مسکین کو کھانا کھلانا۔","turkish":"Yahut, açlık gününde, yakını olan bir öksüzü, yahut toprağa serilmiş bir yoksulu doyurmaktır.","indonesian":"atau orang miskin yang sangat fakir.","french":"ou un pauvre dans le dénouement.","german":"oder einen Armen, der dem Boden nahe ist.","bengali":"অথবা ধূলায় লুন্ঠিত দরিদ্রকে।","spanish":"o al pobre hundido en la miseria.","malay":"Atau kepada orang miskin yang terlantar di atas tanah.","bosnian":"ili ubogoga nevoljnika,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/16"}},{"verse_key":"90:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلْمَرْحَمَةِ","transliteration":"Thumma kana mina allatheena amanoowatawasaw bissabri watawasaw bilmarhama","translations":{"sahih_international":"And then being among those who believed and advised one another to patience and advised one another to compassion.","pickthall":"And to be of those who believe and exhort one another to perseverance and exhort one another to pity.","yusuf_ali":"Then will he be of those who believe, and enjoin patience, (constancy, and self-restraint), and enjoin deeds of kindness and compassion.","urdu":"پھر (اِس کے ساتھ یہ کہ) آدمی اُن لوگوں میں شامل ہو جو ایمان لائے اور جنہوں نے ایک دُوسرے کو صبر اور (خلقِ خدا پر) رحم کی تلقین کی۔","turkish":"Sonra, inanıp birbirlerine sabır tavsiye edenlerden, merhametlilerden olmayı tavsiye edenlerden olmaktır.","indonesian":"Kemudian dia termasuk orang-orang yang beriman, dan saling berpesan untuk bersabar dan saling berpesan untuk berkasih sayang.","french":"Et c’est être, en outre, de ceux qui croient et s’enjoignent mutuellement l’endurance, et s’enjoignent mutuellement la miséricorde.","german":"Und daß man hierauf zu denjenigen gehört, die glauben, einander die Standhaftigkeit eindringlich empfehlen und einander die Barmherzigkeit eindringlich empfehlen.","bengali":"অতঃপর অন্তর্ভুক্ত হওয়া মু’মিনদের এবং তাদের যারা পরস্পরকে উপদেশ দেয় ধৈর্য ধারনের ও দয়া দাক্ষিণ্যের।","spanish":"Y ser, además, de los creyentes que se aconsejan mutuamente ser perseverantes [en el camino del esfuerzo y de la fe] y ser misericordiosos [con el prójimo].","malay":"Selain dari (tidak mengerjakan amal-amal) itu, ia (tidak pula) menjadi dari orang-orang yang beriman dan berpesan-pesan dengan sabar serta berpesan-pesan dengan kasih sayang.","bosnian":"a uz to da je od onih koji vjeruju, koji jedni drugima izdržljivost preporučuju i koji jedni drugima milosrđe preporučuju;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/17"}},{"verse_key":"90:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ","transliteration":"Ola-ika as-habualmaymana","translations":{"sahih_international":"Those are the companions of the right.","pickthall":"Their place will be on the right hand.","yusuf_ali":"Such are the Companions of the Right Hand.","urdu":"یہ لوگ ہیں دائیں بازو والے","turkish":"İşte bunlar amel defterleri sağdan verilenlerdir.","indonesian":"Mereka (orang-orang yang beriman dan saling berpesan itu) adalah golongan kanan.","french":"Ceux-là sont les gens de la droite ;","german":"Das sind die Gefährten der rechten Seite.","bengali":"তারাই সৌভাগ্যশালী।","spanish":"Estos son los bienaventurados de la derecha.","malay":"(Ketahuilah! Bahawa orang-orang yang beriman serta berusaha mengerjakan amal-amal yang tinggi darjatnya di sisi Tuhan), merekalah golongan pihak kanan (yang akan beroleh Syurga).","bosnian":"oni će biti – sretnici!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/18"}},{"verse_key":"90:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا هُمْ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ","transliteration":"Wallatheena kafaroo bi-ayatinahum as-habu almash-ama","translations":{"sahih_international":"But they who disbelieved in Our signs - those are the companions of the left.","pickthall":"But those who disbelieve Our revelations, their place will be on the left hand.","yusuf_ali":"But those who reject Our Signs, they are the (unhappy) Companions of the Left Hand.","urdu":"اور جنہوں نے ہماری آیات کو ماننے سے انکار کیا وہ بائیں بازو والے ہیں،","turkish":"Ayetlerimizi inkar edenler, işte onlar amel defterleri sollarından verilenlerdir.","indonesian":"Dan orang-orang yang kafir kepada ayat-ayat Kami, mereka itu adalah golongan kiri.","french":"alors que ceux qui ne croient pas en Nos versets sont les gens de la gauche.","german":"Diejenigen aber, die Unsere Zeichen verleugnen, sie sind die Gefährten der unglückseligen Seite.","bengali":"যারা আমার নিদর্শন প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছে তারাই হতভাগ্য।","spanish":"Mientras que quienes rechacen Mi revelación serán los desventurados de la izquierda","malay":"Dan (sebaliknya) orang-orang yang kufur ingkar akan ayat-ayat keterangan Kami, merekalah golongan pihak kiri. -","bosnian":"A oni koji ne vjeruju u dokaze Naše, oni će biti – nesretnici,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/19"}},{"verse_key":"90:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِمْ نَارٌ مُّؤْصَدَةٌۢ","transliteration":"AAalayhim narun mu/sada","translations":{"sahih_international":"Over them will be fire closed in.","pickthall":"Fire will be an awning over them.","yusuf_ali":"On them will be Fire vaulted over (all round).","urdu":"ان پر آگ چھائی ہوئی ہوگی۔","turkish":"Onlar her yönden ateşle kapatılacaklardır.","indonesian":"Mereka berada dalam neraka yang ditutup rapat.","french":"Le Feu se refermera sur eux.","german":"Über ihnen liegt ein (sie) einschließendes Feuer.","bengali":"তাদের উপরই অবরুদ্ধ রয়েছে প্রচন্ড আগুন।","spanish":"y el fuego se cercará sobre ellos.","malay":"Mereka ditimpakan (azab seksa) neraka yang ditutup rapat (supaya kuat bakarannya).","bosnian":"iznad njih će vatra zatvorena biti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/090020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/90/20"}}]}},{"number":91,"data":{"surah":{"number":91,"name_arabic":"الشمس","name_english":"Ash-Shams","name_translation":"The Sun","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":26,"verses_count":15,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/091.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/091.mp3"}],"total_verses":15,"verses":[{"verse_key":"91:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Washshamsi waduhaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the sun and its brightness","pickthall":"By the sun and his brightness,","yusuf_ali":"By the Sun and his (glorious) splendour;","urdu":"سُورج اور اُس کی دُھوپ کی قسم","turkish":"Güneşe ve onun ışığına,","indonesian":"Demi matahari dan sinarnya pada pagi hari,","french":"Par le soleil et par sa clarté !","german":"Bei der Sonne und ihrer Morgenhelle","bengali":"শপথ সূর্যের যখন সে আচ্ছন্ন করে,","spanish":"Juro por el Sol cuando resplandece,","malay":"Demi matahari dan cahayanya yang terang-benderang;","bosnian":"Tako Mi Sunca i svjetla njegova,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/1"}},{"verse_key":"91:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Walqamari itha talaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","pickthall":"And the moon when she followeth him,","yusuf_ali":"By the Moon as she follows him;","urdu":"اور چاند کی قسم جبکہ وہ اُس کے پیچھے آتا ہے","turkish":"Ardından gelmekte olan aya,","indonesian":"demi bulan apabila mengiringinya,","french":"Et par la lune quand elle le suit !","german":"und dem Mond, wenn er ihr folgt,","bengali":"শপথ চন্দ্রের যখন ওটা সূর্যের পর আবির্ভুত হয়।","spanish":"por la Luna cuando lo refleja,","malay":"Dan bulan apabila ia mengiringinya;","bosnian":"i Mjeseca kada ga prati,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/2"}},{"verse_key":"91:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"Wannahari itha jallaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the day when it displays it","pickthall":"And the day when it revealeth him,","yusuf_ali":"By the Day as it shows up (the Sun's) glory;","urdu":"اور دن کی قسم جبکہ وہ (سورج کو) نمایاں کر دیتا ہے","turkish":"Onu ortaya koyan gündüze,","indonesian":"demi siang apabila menampakkannya,","french":"Et par le jour quand il l’éclaire !","german":"und dem Tag, wenn er sie erscheinen läßt,","bengali":"শপথ দিনের, যখন ওটা ওকে প্রকাশ করে।","spanish":"por el día cuando fulgura,","malay":"Dan siang apabila ia memperlihatkannya dengan jelas nyata;","bosnian":"i dana kada ga vidljivim učini,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/3"}},{"verse_key":"91:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Wallayli itha yaghshaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the night when it covers [i.e., conceals] it","pickthall":"And the night when it enshroudeth him,","yusuf_ali":"By the Night as it conceals it;","urdu":"اور رات کی قسم جبکہ وہ (سُورج کو) ڈھانک لیتی ہے،","turkish":"Onu bürüyen geceye,","indonesian":"demi malam apabila menutupinya (gelap gulita),","french":"Et par la nuit quand elle l’enveloppe !","german":"und der Nacht, wenn sie sie überdeckt,","bengali":"শপথ রাতের, যখন ওটা ওকে আচ্ছাদিত করে।","spanish":"por la noche cuando cubre con su oscuridad,","malay":"Dan malam apabila ia menyelubunginya (dengan gelap- gelita),","bosnian":"i noći kada ga zakloni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/4"}},{"verse_key":"91:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Wassama-i wama banaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","pickthall":"And the heaven and Him Who built it,","yusuf_ali":"By the Firmament and its (wonderful) structure;","urdu":"اور آسمان کی اور اُس ذات کی قسم جس نے اُسے قائم کیا،","turkish":"Göğe ve onu yapana,","indonesian":"demi langit serta perancangannya (yang menakjubkan),","french":"Et par le ciel et Celui qui l’a construit !","german":"und dem Himmel und Dem, Der ihn aufgebaut hat,","bengali":"শপথ আকাশের এবং যিনি ওটা নির্মাণ করেছেন তাঁর।","spanish":"por el cosmos y la creación maravillosa que hay en él,","malay":"Demi langit dan Yang membinanya (dalam bentuk yang kuat kukuh - yang melambangkan kekuasaanNya);","bosnian":"i neba i Onoga koji ga sazda,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/5"}},{"verse_key":"91:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Wal-ardi wama tahaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","pickthall":"And the earth and Him Who spread it,","yusuf_ali":"By the Earth and its (wide) expanse:","urdu":"اور زمین کی اور اُس ذات کی قسم جس نے اُسے بچھایا","turkish":"Yere ve onu yayana,","indonesian":"demi bumi serta penghamparannya,","french":"Et par la terre et Celui qui l’a étendue !","german":"und der Erde und Dem, Der sie ausgebreitet hat,","bengali":"শপথ পৃথিবীর এবং যিনি ওকে বিস্তৃত করেছেন তাঁর।","spanish":"por la Tierra y su vasta extensión,","malay":"Serta bumi dan Yang menghamparkannya (untuk kemudahan makhluk-makhlukNya);","bosnian":"i Zemlje i Onoga koji je ravnom učini,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/6"}},{"verse_key":"91:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"وَنَفْسٍ وَمَا سَوَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"Wanafsin wama sawwaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","pickthall":"And a soul and Him Who perfected it","yusuf_ali":"By the Soul, and the proportion and order given to it;","urdu":"اور نفسِ انسانی کی اور اُس ذات کی قسم جس نے اُسے ہموار کیا","turkish":"Kişiye ve onu şekillendirene,","indonesian":"demi jiwa serta penyempurnaan (ciptaan)nya,","french":"Et par l’âme et Celui qui l’a harmonieusement façonnée ;","german":"und einer (jeden) Seele und Dem, Der sie zurechtgeformt hat","bengali":"শপথ মানুষের এবং তাঁর, যিনি তাকে সুঠাম করেছেন।","spanish":"por el alma y su armonía,","malay":"Demi diri manusia dan Yang menyempurnakan kejadiannya (dengan kelengkapan yang sesuai dengan keadaannya);","bosnian":"i duše i Onoga koji je stvori"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/7"}},{"verse_key":"91:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Faalhamaha fujooraha wataqwaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,","pickthall":"And inspired it (with conscience of) what is wrong for it and (what is) right for it.","yusuf_ali":"And its enlightenment as to its wrong and its right;-","urdu":"پھر اُس کی بدی اوراُس کی پرہیزگاری اس پر الہام کر دی،","turkish":"Sonra da ona iyilik ve kötülük kabiliyeti verene and olsun ki:","indonesian":"maka Dia mengilhamkan kepadanya (jalan) kejahatan dan ketakwaannya,","french":"et lui a alors inspiré son immoralité, de même que sa piété !","german":"und ihr dann ihre Sittenlosigkeit und ihre Gottesfurcht eingegeben hat!","bengali":"অতঃপর তাকে তার অসৎ কাজ ও তার সৎ কার্জের জ্ঞান দান করেছেন,","spanish":"[Dios] le enseñó [al ser humano] a distinguir entre el pecado y la conciencia de Dios.","malay":"Serta mengilhamkannya (untuk mengenal) jalan yang membawanya kepada kejahatan, dan yang membawanya kepada bertaqwa; -","bosnian":"pa joj put dobra i put zla shvatljivim učini,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/8"}},{"verse_key":"91:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن زَكَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man zakkaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"He has succeeded who purifies it,","pickthall":"He is indeed successful who causeth it to grow,","yusuf_ali":"Truly he succeeds that purifies it,","urdu":"یقیناً فلاح پا گیا وہ جس نے نفس کا تزکیہ کیا","turkish":"Kendini arıtan saadete ermiştir.","indonesian":"sungguh beruntung orang yang menyucikannya (jiwa itu),","french":"A réussi, certes celui qui la purifie.","german":"Wohl ergehen wird es ja jemandem, der sie läutert,","bengali":"সে’ই সফলকাম হবে যে নিজেকে পবিত্র করবে।","spanish":"¡Será bienaventurado quien purifique su alma [apartándola de los pecados],","malay":"Sesungguhnya berjayalah orang yang menjadikan dirinya - yang sedia bersih - bertambah-tambah bersih (dengan iman dan amal kebajikan),","bosnian":"uspjeće samo onaj ko je očisti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/9"}},{"verse_key":"91:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"Waqad khaba man dassaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption].","pickthall":"And he is indeed a failure who stunteth it.","yusuf_ali":"And he fails that corrupts it!","urdu":"اور نامراد ہوا وہ جس نے اُس کو دبا دیا۔","turkish":"Kendini fenalıklara gömen kimse de ziyana uğramıştır.","indonesian":"dan sungguh rugi orang yang mengotorinya.","french":"Et est perdu, certes, celui qui la corrompt.","german":"und enttäuscht sein wird ja, wer sie verkümmern läßt.","bengali":"এবং সে’ই ব্যর্থ মনোরথ হবে যে নিজেকে কলুষাচ্ছন্ন করবে।","spanish":"pero será un desventurado quien la abandone a sus pasiones!","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya hampalah orang yang menjadikan dirinya - yang sedia bersih - itu susut dan terbenam kebersihannya (dengan sebab kekotoran maksiat).","bosnian":"a biće izgubljen onaj ko je na stranputicu odvodi!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/10"}},{"verse_key":"91:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","transliteration":"Kaththabat thamoodu bitaghwaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"Thamūd denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,","pickthall":"(The tribe of) Thamud denied (the truth) in their rebellious pride,","yusuf_ali":"The Thamud (people) rejected (their prophet) through their inordinate wrong-doing,","urdu":"ثمُود نے اپنی سرکشی کی بنا پر جھُٹلایا۔","turkish":"Semud milleti, içlerinden en azgını ileri atılınca, azgınlığı yüzünden peygamberleri yalanladı.","indonesian":"(Kaum) Samud telah mendustakan (rasulnya) karena mereka melampaui batas (zalim),","french":"Les Thamûd, par leur transgression, ont crié au mensonge,","german":"Die Tamud erklärten in ihrer Auflehnung (die Botschaft) für Lüge,","bengali":"ছামূদ সম্প্রদায় অবাধ্যতা বশতঃ সত্যকে মিথ্যা বলে প্রত্যাখ্যান করল,","spanish":"El pueblo de Zamud rechazó el Mensaje por soberbia.","malay":"(Ingatlah), kaum Thamud telah mendustakan (Rasulnya) dengan sebab perbuatan derhaka mereka yang melampaui batas;","bosnian":"Semud je zbog obijesti svoje poricao:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/11"}},{"verse_key":"91:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشْقَىٰهَا","transliteration":"Ithi inbaAAatha ashqaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth.","pickthall":"When the basest of them broke forth","yusuf_ali":"Behold, the most wicked man among them was deputed (for impiety).","urdu":"جب اُس قوم کا سب سے زیادہ شقی آدمی بپھر کر اٹھا","turkish":"Semud milleti, içlerinden en azgını ileri atılınca, azgınlığı yüzünden peygamberleri yalanladı.","indonesian":"ketika bangkit orang yang paling celaka di antara mereka,","french":"lorsque le plus misérable d’entre eux se leva (pour tuer la chamelle)","german":"als der Unseligste von ihnen sich erhob.","bengali":"সুতরাং তাদের মধ্যে যে সর্বাধিক হতভাগ্য সে যখন তৎপর হয়ে উঠল –","spanish":"Cuando el más opresor de ellos se prestó para matar a la camella.","malay":"Ketika orang yang paling jahat di antara mereka menerima perintah dari mereka (supaya membunuh unta yang menjadi mukjizat),","bosnian":"kad se jedan nesretnik između njih podigao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/12"}},{"verse_key":"91:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","transliteration":"Faqala lahum rasoolu Allahi naqataAllahi wasuqyaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the messenger of Allāh [i.e., Ṣāliḥ] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allāh or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","pickthall":"And the messenger of Allah said: It is the she-camel of Allah, so let her drink!","yusuf_ali":"But the Messenger of Allah said to them: \"It is a She-camel of Allah! And (bar her not from) having her drink!\"","urdu":"تو اللہ کے رسُول نے اُن لوگوں سے کہا کہ خبردار، اللہ کی اُونٹنی کو (ہاتھ نہ لگانا) اور اُس کے پانی پینے (میں مانع نہ ہونا)۔","turkish":"Allah'ın peygamberi onlara, Allah'ın devesini göstermiş ve: \"Allah'ın bu devesine ve onun su hakkına dokunmayın\" demişti.","indonesian":"lalu Rasul Allah (Saleh) berkata kepada mereka, \"(Biarkanlah) unta betina dari Allah ini dengan minumannya.\"","french":"Le Messager d’Allah leur avait dit : \"La chamelle d’Allah ! Laissez-la boire.\"","german":"Allahs Gesandter sagte zu ihnen: (Achtet auf) Allahs Kamelstute und ihre Trinkzeit.","bengali":"তখন আল্লাহর রাসূল তাদেরকে বললঃ আল্লাহর উষ্ট্রী ও, ওকে পানি পান করানোর বিষয়ে সাবধান হও,","spanish":"El Mensajero de Dios [Sálih] los previno: “No maten a la camella de Dios [enviada como milagro] y déjenla abrevar libremente”.","malay":"Maka berkatalah Rasul Allah (Nabi Soleh) kepada mereka: \" (Janganlah kamu ganggu) unta betina dari Allah itu, dan (janganlah kamu menyekatnya daripada mendapat) air minumnya (supaya kamu tidak ditimpa azab)!\"","bosnian":"Allahov poslanik im je doviknuo: \"Brinite se o Allahovoj kamili i vremenu kad treba da pije!\","},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/13"}},{"verse_key":"91:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمْ فَسَوَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"Fakaththaboohu faAAaqaroohafadamdama AAalayhim rabbuhum bithanbihim fasawwaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","pickthall":"But they denied him, and they hamstrung her, so Allah doomed them for their sin and rased (their dwellings).","yusuf_ali":"Then they rejected him (as a false prophet), and they hamstrung her. So their Lord, on account of their crime, obliterated their traces and made them equal (in destruction, high and low)!","urdu":"مگر انہوں نے اُس کی بات کو جھُوٹا قرار دیا ااور اُونٹنی کو مار ڈالا۔ آخر کار اُن کے گناہ کی پاداش میں ان کے ربّ نے ان پر ایسی آفت توڑی کہ ایک ساتھ سب کو پیوندِ خاک کر دیا","turkish":"Onu yalanladılar ve deveyi boğazladılar. Bunun üzerine Rableri, suçlarından dolayı onların üzerine katmerli azap indirdi; yerle bir etti onları.","indonesian":"Namun mereka mendustakannya dan menyembelihnya, karena itu Tuhan membinasakan mereka karena dosanya, lalu diratakan-Nya (dengan tanah).","french":"Mais, ils le traitèrent de menteur, et la tuèrent. Leur Seigneur les détruisit donc, pour leur péché et étendit Son châtiment sur tous.","german":"Sie aber bezichtigten ihn der Lüge, und so schnitten sie ihr die Sehnen durch. Da schmetterte ihr Herr sie für ihre Sünde nieder, und so ebnete Er über ihnen die Erde ein.","bengali":"কিন্তু তারা তাকে মিথ্যাবাদী বলল, অতঃপর ঐ উষ্ট্রিকে কেটে ফেলল। সুতরাং তাদের পাপের জন্য তাদের রাব্ব তাদেরকে সমূলে ধ্বংস করলেন, অতঃপর তাদেরকে ভূমিসাৎ করে ফেললেন,","spanish":"Pero desmintieron al Mensajero y mataron a la camella. Entonces, su Señor los destruyó a todos, por lo que cometieron, con un castigo arrasador,","malay":"(Setelah Nabi Soleh memberi amaran) lalu mereka mendustakannya serta menyembelih unta itu. Dengan sebab dosa mereka, maka Tuhan menimpakan mereka dengan azab yang membinasakan serta Ia meratakan azab itu meliputi mereka (sehingga punah-ranah semuanya).","bosnian":"ali mu oni nisu povjerovali, već su je zaklali – i Gospodar njihov ih je zbog grijeha njihovih uništio i do posljednjeg istrijebio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/14"}},{"verse_key":"91:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَـٰهَا","transliteration":"Wala yakhafu AAuqbaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof.","pickthall":"He dreadeth not the sequel (of events).","yusuf_ali":"And for Him is no fear of its consequences.","urdu":"اور اسے (اپنے اس فعل کے) کسی بُرے نتیجے کا کوئی خوف نہیں ہے۔","turkish":"Bu işin sonundan O'nun korkusu yoktur.","indonesian":"Dan Dia tidak takut terhadap akibatnya.","french":"Et Allah n’a aucune crainte des conséquences.","german":"Und Er (Allah) fürchtet nicht die Folge davon.","bengali":"আর তিনি ওর পরিণামকে ভয় করলেন না।","spanish":"sin temor por la magnitud de Su castigo.","malay":"Dan Allah tidak hiraukan kesudahan (mereka) yang demikian, (kerana itu adalah balasan yang adil).","bosnian":"i ne strahujući zbog toga od odgovornosti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/091015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/91/15"}}]}},{"number":92,"data":{"surah":{"number":92,"name_arabic":"الليل","name_english":"Al-Layl","name_translation":"The Night","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":9,"verses_count":21,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/092.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/092.mp3"}],"total_verses":21,"verses":[{"verse_key":"92:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰ","transliteration":"Wallayli itha yaghsha","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the night when it covers","pickthall":"By the night enshrouding","yusuf_ali":"By the Night as it conceals (the light);","urdu":"قسم ہے رات کی جبکہ وہ چھا جائے","turkish":"Kararıp ortalığı bürüdüğü zaman geceye and olsun.","indonesian":"Demi malam apabila menutupi (cahaya siang),","french":"Par la nuit quand elle enveloppe tous !","german":"Bei der Nacht, wenn sie (alles) überdeckt,","bengali":"শপথ রাতের যখন ওটা আচ্ছন্ন করে,","spanish":"Juro por la noche cuando cubre con la oscuridad,","malay":"Demi malam apabila ia menyelubungi segala-galanya (dengan gelap-gelitanya),","bosnian":"Tako mi noći kada tmine razastre,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/1"}},{"verse_key":"92:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wannahari itha tajalla","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the day when it appears","pickthall":"And the day resplendent","yusuf_ali":"By the Day as it appears in glory;","urdu":"اور دن کی جبکہ وہ روشن ہو","turkish":"Açılıp aydınlattığı zaman gündüze and olsun.","indonesian":"demi siang bila terang benderang,","french":"Par le jour quand il éclaire !","german":"und dem Tag, wenn er (in seiner Helligkeit) erscheint,","bengali":"শপথ দিনের যখন ওটা উদ্ভাসিত করে,","spanish":"por el día cuando resplandece,","malay":"Dan siang apabila ia lahir terang-benderang;","bosnian":"i dana kad svane,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/2"}},{"verse_key":"92:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلْأُنثَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama khalaqa aththakarawal-ontha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] He who created the male and female,","pickthall":"And Him Who hath created male and female,","yusuf_ali":"By (the mystery of) the creation of male and female;-","urdu":"اور اُس ذات کی جس نے نر اور مادہ کو پیدا کیا","turkish":"Erkeği ve dişiyi yaratana and olsun ki:","indonesian":"demi penciptaan laki-laki dan perempuan,","french":"Et par ce qu’Il a créé, mâle et femelle !","german":"und Dem, Der das Männliche und das Weibliche erschaffen hat!","bengali":"এবং শপথ নর ও নারীর যা তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন।","spanish":"por Quien creó al hombre y a la mujer,","malay":"Demi Yang menciptakan (makhluk-makhlukNya) lelaki dan perempuan, (jantan dan betina); -","bosnian":"i Onoga koji muško i žensko stvara –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/3"}},{"verse_key":"92:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"إِنَّ سَعْيَكُمْ لَشَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"Inna saAAyakum lashatta","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, your efforts are diverse.","pickthall":"Lo! your effort is dispersed (toward divers ends).","yusuf_ali":"Verily, (the ends) ye strive for are diverse.","urdu":"درحقیقت تم لوگوں کی کوششیں مختلف قسم کی ہیں۔","turkish":"Doğrusu sizin çalışmalarınız çeşitlidir.","indonesian":"sungguh, usahamu memang beraneka macam.","french":"Vos efforts sont divergents.","german":"Euer Bemühen ist wahrlich verschieden.","bengali":"অবশ্যই তোমাদের কর্মপ্রচেষ্টা বিভিন্ন মুখী,","spanish":"que las obras [de las personas] son diversas.","malay":"Sesungguhnya amal usaha kamu adalah berbagai-bagai keadaannya.","bosnian":"vaš trud je, zaista, različit:"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/4"}},{"verse_key":"92:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَنْ أَعْطَىٰ وَٱتَّقَىٰ","transliteration":"Faamma man aAAta wattaqa","translations":{"sahih_international":"As for he who gives and fears Allāh","pickthall":"As for him who giveth and is dutiful (toward Allah)","yusuf_ali":"So he who gives (in charity) and fears (Allah),","urdu":"تو جس نے (راہ خدا میں) مال دیا اور (خدا کی نافرمانی سے) پرہیز کیا","turkish":"Elinde bulunandan verenin, Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınanın, en güzel söz olan Allah'ın birliğini doğrulayanın işlerini kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"Maka barangsiapa memberikan (hartanya di jalan Allah) dan bertakwa,","french":"Celui qui donne et craint (Allah).","german":"Was nun jemanden angeht, der gibt und gottesfürchtig ist","bengali":"সুতরাং কেহ দান করলে, সংযত হলে –","spanish":"A quien dé caridades, tenga temor [de Dios]","malay":"Jelasnya: adapun orang yang memberikan apa yang ada padanya ke jalan kebaikan dan bertaqwa (mengerjakan suruhan Allah dan meninggalkan segala laranganNya), -","bosnian":"onome koji udjeljuje i ne griješi"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/5"}},{"verse_key":"92:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"وَصَدَّقَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wasaddaqa bilhusna","translations":{"sahih_international":"And believes in the best [reward],","pickthall":"And believeth in goodness;","yusuf_ali":"And (in all sincerity) testifies to the best,-","urdu":"اور بھلائی کو سچ مانا،","turkish":"Elinde bulunandan verenin, Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınanın, en güzel söz olan Allah'ın birliğini doğrulayanın işlerini kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"dan membenarkan (adanya pahala) yang terbaik (surga),","french":"et déclare véridique la plus belle récompense.","german":"und das Beste für wahr hält,","bengali":"এবং সদ্বিষয়কে সত্যজ্ঞান করলে –","spanish":"y crea en los valores más sublimes,","malay":"Serta ia mengakui dengan yakin akan perkara yang baik,","bosnian":"i ono najljepše smatra istinitim –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/6"}},{"verse_key":"92:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilyusra","translations":{"sahih_international":"We will ease him toward ease.","pickthall":"Surely We will ease his way unto the state of ease.","yusuf_ali":"We will indeed make smooth for him the path to Bliss.","urdu":"اس کو ہم آسان راستے کے لیے سہُولت دیں گے۔","turkish":"Elinde bulunandan verenin, Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınanın, en güzel söz olan Allah'ın birliğini doğrulayanın işlerini kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"maka akan Kami mudahkan baginya jalan menuju kemudahan (kebahagiaan).","french":"Nous lui faciliterons la voie au plus grand bonheur.","german":"so werden Wir ihm den Weg zum Leichteren leicht machen.","bengali":"অচিরেই আমি তার জন্য সুগম করে দিব সহজ পথ।","spanish":"le facilitaré el camino del bien.","malay":"Maka sesungguhnya Kami akan memberikannya kemudahan untuk mendapat kesenangan (Syurga).","bosnian":"njega ćemo za Džennet pripremiti;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/7"}},{"verse_key":"92:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنۢ بَخِلَ وَٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Waamma man bakhila wastaghna","translations":{"sahih_international":"But as for he who withholds and considers himself free of need","pickthall":"But as for him who hoardeth and deemeth himself independent,","yusuf_ali":"But he who is a greedy miser and thinks himself self-sufficient,","urdu":"اور جس نے بخل کیا اور (اپنے خدا سے) بے نیازی برتی","turkish":"Ama, cimrilik eden, kendini Allah'tan müstağni sayan, en güzel sözü yalanlayan kimsenin güçlüğe uğramasını kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"Dan adapun orang yang kikir dan merasa dirinya cukup (tidak perlu pertolongan Allah),","french":"Et quand à celui qui est avare, se dispense (de l’adoration d’Allah),","german":"Was aber jemanden angeht, der geizt und sich für unbedürftig hält","bengali":"পক্ষান্তরে কেহ কার্পণ্য করলে ও নিজেকে স্বয়ংসম্পূর্ণ মনে করলে –","spanish":"Pero a quien sea avaro, crea que puede prescindir [de Dios]","malay":"Sebaliknya: orang yang bakhil (daripada berbuat kebajikan) dan merasa cukup dengan kekayaan dan kemewahannya, -","bosnian":"a onome koji tvrdiči i osjeća se neovisnim"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/8"}},{"verse_key":"92:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wakaththaba bilhusna","translations":{"sahih_international":"And denies the best [reward],","pickthall":"And disbelieveth in goodness;","yusuf_ali":"And gives the lie to the best,-","urdu":"اور بَھلائی کو جھُٹلایا،","turkish":"Ama, cimrilik eden, kendini Allah'tan müstağni sayan, en güzel sözü yalanlayan kimsenin güçlüğe uğramasını kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"serta mendustakan (pahala) yang terbaik,","french":"et traite de mensonge la plus belle récompense,","german":"und das Beste für Lüge erklärt,","bengali":"আর যা উত্তম তা অস্বীকার করলে –","spanish":"y desmienta los valores más sublimes,","malay":"Serta ia mendustakan perkara yang baik,","bosnian":"i ono najljepše smatra lažnim –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/9"}},{"verse_key":"92:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْعُسْرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilAAusra","translations":{"sahih_international":"We will ease him toward difficulty.","pickthall":"Surely We will ease his way unto adversity.","yusuf_ali":"We will indeed make smooth for him the path to Misery;","urdu":"اس کو ہم سخت راستے کے لیے سہُولت دیں گے۔","turkish":"Ama, cimrilik eden, kendini Allah'tan müstağni sayan, en güzel sözü yalanlayan kimsenin güçlüğe uğramasını kolaylaştırırız.","indonesian":"maka akan Kami mudahkan baginya jalan menuju kesukaran (kesengsaraan).","french":"Nous lui faciliterons la voie à la plus grande difficulté,","german":"so werden Wir ihm den Weg zum Schwereren leicht machen;","bengali":"অচিরেই তার জন্য আমি সুগম করে দিব কঠোর পরিণামের পথ –","spanish":"no le impediré transitar por el camino de la adversidad.","malay":"Maka sesungguhnya Kami akan memberikannya kemudahan untuk mendapat kesusahan dan kesengsaraan;","bosnian":"njega ćemo za Džehennem pripremiti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/10"}},{"verse_key":"92:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"وَمَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥٓ إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama yughnee AAanhu maluhu ithataradda","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what will his wealth avail him when he falls?","pickthall":"His riches will not save him when he perisheth.","yusuf_ali":"Nor will his wealth profit him when he falls headlong (into the Pit).","urdu":"اور اُس کا مال آخر اُس کے کس کام آئے گا جبکہ وہ ہلاک ہو جائے؟","turkish":"O kimse ölüp ateşe yuvarlandığı zaman, malı ona fayda vermez.","indonesian":"Dan hartanya tidak bermanfaat baginya apabila dia telah binasa.","french":"et à rien ne lui serviront ses richesses quand il sera jeté (au Feu).","german":"und was soll sein Besitz ihm nützen, wenn er sich ins Verderben stürzt?","bengali":"এবং তার সম্পদ তার কোন কাজে আসবেনা যখন সে ধ্বংস হবে।","spanish":"¿De qué le servirán sus bienes materiales cuando muera?","malay":"Dan apakah pertolongan yang dapat diberi kepadanya oleh hartanya apabila ia telah terjerumus (ke dalam azab seksa hari akhirat)?","bosnian":"i bogatstvo njegovo mu, kad se strovali, neće koristiti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/11"}},{"verse_key":"92:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا لَلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"Inna AAalayna lalhuda","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, [incumbent] upon Us is guidance.","pickthall":"Lo! Ours it is (to give) the guidance","yusuf_ali":"Verily We take upon Ourselves to guide,","urdu":"بے شک راستہ بتانا ہمارے ذمّہ ہے،","turkish":"Bize düşen sadece doğru yolu göstermektir.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya Kami lah yang memberi petunjuk,","french":"C’est à Nous, certes, de guider ;","german":"Uns obliegt wahrlich die Rechtleitung.","bengali":"আমার কাজতো শুধু পথ নির্দেশ করা,","spanish":"Evidencio la guía,","malay":"Sesungguhnya tanggungan Kamilah memberi hidayah petunjuk (tentang yang benar dan yang salah).","bosnian":"Mi smo dužni ukazati na Pravi put,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/12"}},{"verse_key":"92:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ لَنَا لَلْـَٔاخِرَةَ وَٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa-inna lana lal-akhirata wal-oola","translations":{"sahih_international":"And indeed, to us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life].","pickthall":"And lo! unto Us belong the latter portion and the former.","yusuf_ali":"And verily unto Us (belong) the End and the Beginning.","urdu":"اور درحقیقت آخرت اور دنیا، دونوں کے ہم ہی مالک ہیں۔","turkish":"Şüphesiz ahiret de, dünya da Bizimdir.","indonesian":"dan sesungguhnya milik Kami lah akhirat dan dunia.","french":"à Nous appartient, certes, la vie dernière et la vie présente.","german":"Und Uns gehört wahrlich das Jenseits und das Diesseits.","bengali":"আমিই মালিক পরলোকের ও ইহলোকের।","spanish":"y a Mí me pertenecen esta vida y la otra.","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya Kamilah yang menguasai hari akhirat dan alam dunia.","bosnian":"i jedino Nama pripada i onaj i ovaj svijet!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/13"}},{"verse_key":"92:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"فَأَنذَرْتُكُمْ نَارًا تَلَظَّىٰ","transliteration":"Faanthartukum naran talaththa","translations":{"sahih_international":"So I have warned you of a Fire which is blazing.","pickthall":"Therefor have I warned you of the flaming Fire","yusuf_ali":"Therefore do I warn you of a Fire blazing fiercely;","urdu":"پس میں نے تم کو خبردار کر دیا ہے بھڑکتی ہوئی آگ سے","turkish":"Sizi alevler saçan ateşle uyardım;","indonesian":"Maka aku memperingatkan kamu dengan neraka yang menyala-nyala,","french":"Je vous ai donc avertis d’un Feu qui flambe.","german":"So habe Ich euch gewarnt vor einem Feuer, das lodert,","bengali":"আমি তোমাদেরকে জাহান্নামের লেলিহান আগুন হতে সতর্ক করে দিয়েছি।","spanish":"Les he advertido sobre un fuego abrasador,","malay":"Maka (serentak dengan memberi hidayah petunjuk) Aku juga telah memberi amaran mengingatkan kamu akan api neraka yang marak menjulang,","bosnian":"Zato vas opominjem razbuktalom vatrom,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/14"}},{"verse_key":"92:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"لَا يَصْلَىٰهَآ إِلَّا ٱلْأَشْقَى","transliteration":"La yaslaha illaal-ashqa","translations":{"sahih_international":"None will [enter to] burn therein except the most wretched one","pickthall":"Which only the most wretched must endure,","yusuf_ali":"None shall reach it but those most unfortunate ones","urdu":"اُس میں نہیں جھلسے گا مگر وہ انتہائی بد بخت","turkish":"Oraya, yalanlayıp yüz çevirmiş olan o en azgından başkası yaslanmaz.","indonesian":"yang hanya dimasuki oleh orang yang paling celaka,","french":"où ne brûlera que le damné,","german":"dem nur der Unseligste ausgesetzt sein wird,","bengali":"তাতে প্রবেশ করবে সে’ই যে নিতান্ত হতভাগা –","spanish":"en el que solo ingresarán los desventurados","malay":"Yang tidak akan menderita bakarannya melainkan orang yang sungguh celaka, -","bosnian":"u koju će ući samo nesretnik,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/15"}},{"verse_key":"92:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee kaththaba watawalla","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who had denied and turned away.","pickthall":"He who denieth and turneth away.","yusuf_ali":"Who give the lie to Truth and turn their backs.","urdu":"جس نے جھٹلایا اور منہ پھیرا","turkish":"Oraya, yalanlayıp yüz çevirmiş olan o en azgından başkası yaslanmaz.","indonesian":"yang mendustakan (kebenaran) dan berpaling (dari iman).","french":"qui dément et tourne le dos ;","german":"der (die Botschaft) für Lüge erklärt und sich abkehrt.","bengali":"যে অসত্যারোপ করে ও মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।","spanish":"que desmientan y se aparten [del Mensaje].","malay":"Yang telah mendustakan (kebenaran) dan berpaling ingkar.","bosnian":"onaj koji bude poricao i glavu okretao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/16"}},{"verse_key":"92:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَتْقَى","transliteration":"Wasayujannabuha al-atqa","translations":{"sahih_international":"But the righteous one will avoid it","pickthall":"Far removed from it will be the righteous","yusuf_ali":"But those most devoted to Allah shall be removed far from it,-","urdu":"اور اُس سے دور رکھا جائیگا وہ نہایت پرہیزگار","turkish":"Arınmak için malını veren, en çok sakınan kimse ise ondan uzak tutulur.","indonesian":"Dan akan dijauhkan darinya (neraka) orang yang paling bertakwa,","french":"alors qu’en sera écarté le pieux,","german":"Doch davon ferngehalten wird der Gottesfürchtigste werden,","bengali":"আর ওটা হতে রক্ষা পাবে সেই পরম মুত্তাকী –","spanish":"Pero el piadoso estará a salvo [de ese fuego],","malay":"Dan (sebaliknya) akan dijauhkan (azab neraka) itu daripada orang yang sungguh bertaqwa, -","bosnian":"a od nje će daleko biti onaj koji se bude Allaha bojao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/17"}},{"verse_key":"92:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى يُؤْتِى مَالَهُۥ يَتَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee yu/tee malahuyatazakka","translations":{"sahih_international":"[He] who gives [from] his wealth to purify himself","pickthall":"Who giveth his wealth that he may grow (in goodness).","yusuf_ali":"Those who spend their wealth for increase in self-purification,","urdu":"جو پاکیزہ ہونے کی خاطر اپنا مال دیتا ہے۔","turkish":"Arınmak için malını veren, en çok sakınan kimse ise ondan uzak tutulur.","indonesian":"yang menginfakkan hartanya (di jalan Allah) untuk membersihkan (dirinya),","french":"qui donne ses biens pour se purifier.","german":"der seinen Besitz hingibt, um sich zu läutern,","bengali":"যে স্বীয় সম্পদ দান করে আত্মশুদ্ধির উদ্দেশে,","spanish":"aquel que da parte de su riqueza para purificarse [de la avaricia],","malay":"Yang mendermakan hartanya dengan tujuan membersihkan dirinya dan hartabendanya,","bosnian":"onaj koji bude dio imetka svoga udjeljivao, da bi se očistio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/18"}},{"verse_key":"92:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِندَهُۥ مِن نِّعْمَةٍ تُجْزَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama li-ahadin AAindahu minniAAmatin tujza","translations":{"sahih_international":"And not [giving] for anyone who has [done him] a favor to be rewarded","pickthall":"And none hath with him any favour for reward,","yusuf_ali":"And have in their minds no favour from anyone for which a reward is expected in return,","urdu":"اُس پر کسی کا کوئی احسان نہیں ہے جس کا بدلہ اُسے دینا ہو","turkish":"O yaptığı iyiliği birinden karşılık görmek için değil, ancak yüce Rabbinin hoşnudluğunu (rızasını) gözeterek yapmıştır.","indonesian":"dan tidak ada seorang pun memberikan suatu nikmat padanya yang harus dibalasnya,","french":"et auprès de qui personne ne profite d’un bienfait intéressé,","german":"und niemand hat bei ihm eine Gunst (anzurechnen), die vergolten werden müßte,","bengali":"এবং তার প্রতি কারও অনুগ্রহের প্রতিদান হিসাবে নয়,","spanish":"no anhelando una retribución ni favor [de otra persona],","malay":"Sedang ia tidak menanggung budi sesiapapun, yang patut di balas,","bosnian":"ne očekujući da mu se zahvalnošću uzvrati,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/19"}},{"verse_key":"92:20","ayah":20,"arabic":"إِلَّا ٱبْتِغَآءَ وَجْهِ رَبِّهِ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","transliteration":"Illa ibtighaa wajhi rabbihial-aAAla","translations":{"sahih_international":"But only seeking the face [i.e., acceptance] of his Lord, Most High.","pickthall":"Except as seeking (to fulfil) the purpose of his Lord Most High.","yusuf_ali":"But only the desire to seek for the Countenance of their Lord Most High;","urdu":"وہ تو صرف اپنے ربِّ برتر کی رضا جوئی کے لیے یہ کام کرتا ہے۔","turkish":"O yaptığı iyiliği birinden karşılık görmek için değil, ancak yüce Rabbinin hoşnudluğunu (rızasını) gözeterek yapmıştır.","indonesian":"tetapi (dia memberikan itu semata-mata) karena mencari keridaan Tuhannya Yang Mahatinggi.","french":"mais seulement pour la recherche de La Face de son seigneur le Très- Haut.","german":"sondern (er handelt) im Trachten nach dem Angesicht seines höchsten Herrn.","bengali":"বরং শুধু তার মহান রবের সন্তোষ লাভের প্রত্যাশায়,","spanish":"sino anhelando el Rostro de su Señor, el Altísimo,","malay":"Hanyalah mengharapkan keredaan Tuhannya Yang Maha Tinggi;","bosnian":"već jedino da bi naklonost Gospodara svoga Svevišnjeg stekao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092020.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/20"}},{"verse_key":"92:21","ayah":21,"arabic":"وَلَسَوْفَ يَرْضَىٰ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yarda","translations":{"sahih_international":"And he is going to be satisfied.","pickthall":"He verily will be content.","yusuf_ali":"And soon will they attain (complete) satisfaction.","urdu":"اور ضرور وہ (اُس سے) خوش ہوگا۔","turkish":"Elbette kendisi de hoşnut (razı) olacaktır.","indonesian":"Dan niscaya kelak dia akan mendapat kesenangan (yang sempurna).","french":"Et certes, il sera bientôt satisfait !","german":"Und er wird wahrlich zufrieden sein.","bengali":"সেতো অচিরেই সন্তোষ লাভ করবে।","spanish":"y por eso quedará complacido.","malay":"Dan demi sesungguhnya, ia tetap akan berpuas hati (pada hari akhirat, dengan mendapat segala yang diharapkannya).","bosnian":"i on će, zbilja, zadovoljan biti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/092021.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/92/21"}}]}},{"number":93,"data":{"surah":{"number":93,"name_arabic":"الضحى","name_english":"Ad-Duhaa","name_translation":"The Morning Hours","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":11,"verses_count":11,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/093.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/093.mp3"}],"total_verses":11,"verses":[{"verse_key":"93:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","transliteration":"Wadduha","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the morning brightness","pickthall":"By the morning hours","yusuf_ali":"By the Glorious Morning Light,","urdu":"قسم ہے روزِ روشن کی","turkish":"Kuşluk vaktine and olsun;","indonesian":"Demi waktu duha (ketika matahari naik sepenggalan),","french":"Par le Jour Montant !","german":"Bei der Morgenhelle","bengali":"শপথ পূর্বাহ্নের।","spanish":"Juro por el resplandor matinal,","malay":"Demi waktu dhuha,","bosnian":"Tako mi jutra"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/1"}},{"verse_key":"93:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","transliteration":"Wallayli itha saja","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,","pickthall":"And by the night when it is stillest,","yusuf_ali":"And by the Night when it is still,-","urdu":"اور رات کی جبکہ وہ سکون کے ساتھ طاری ہو جائے","turkish":"Sükun erdiği zaman geceye and olsun ki,","indonesian":"dan demi malam apabila telah sunyi,","french":"Et par la nuit quand elle couvre tout !","german":"und der Nacht, wenn sie (alles) umhüllt!","bengali":"শপথ রাতের যখন ওটা সমাচ্ছন্ন করে ফেলে;","spanish":"por la noche cuando se serena,","malay":"Dan malam apabila ia sunyi-sepi -","bosnian":"i noći kada se utiša –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/2"}},{"verse_key":"93:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","transliteration":"Ma waddaAAaka rabbuka wama qala","translations":{"sahih_international":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muḥammad], nor has He detested [you].","pickthall":"Thy Lord hath not forsaken thee nor doth He hate thee,","yusuf_ali":"Thy Guardian-Lord hath not forsaken thee, nor is He displeased.","urdu":"(اے نبیؐ) تمہارے ربّ نے تم کو ہر گز نہیں چھوڑا اور نہ وہ ناراض ہوا۔","turkish":"Rabbin seni ne bıraktı ve ne de sana darıldı.","indonesian":"Tuhanmu tidak meninggalkan engkau (Muhammad) dan tidak (pula) membencimu,","french":"Ton Seigneur ne t’a ni abandonné, ni détesté.","german":"Dein Herr hat sich weder von dir verabschiedet noch haßt Er (dich).","bengali":"তোমার রাব্ব তোমাকে পরিত্যাগ করেননি এবং তোমার প্রতি বিরূপও হননি।","spanish":"que tu Señor no te ha abandonado ni aborrecido [¡Oh, Muhámmad!].","malay":"(Bahawa) Tuhanmu (wahai Muhammad) tidak meninggalkanmu, dan Ia tidak benci (kepadamu, sebagaimana yang dituduh oleh kaum musyrik).","bosnian":"Gospodar tvoj nije te ni napustio ni omrznuo!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/3"}},{"verse_key":"93:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Walal-akhiratu khayrun laka minaal-oola","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","pickthall":"And verily the latter portion will be better for thee than the former,","yusuf_ali":"And verily the Hereafter will be better for thee than the present.","urdu":"اور یقیناً تمہارے لیے بعد کا دور پہلے دور سے بہتر ہے،","turkish":"Doğrusu ahiret senin için dünyadan daha hayırlıdır.","indonesian":"dan sungguh, yang kemudian itu lebih baik bagimu daripada yang permulaan.","french":"La vie dernière t’est, certes, meilleure que la vie présente.","german":"Und das Jenseits ist wahrlich besser für dich als das Diesseits.","bengali":"তোমার জন্য পরবর্তী সময়তো পূর্ববর্তী সময় অপেক্ষা শ্রেয় বা কল্যাণকর।","spanish":"La vida del más allá será mejor para ti que esta.","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya kesudahan keaadaanmu adalah lebih baik bagimu daripada permulaannya.","bosnian":"Onaj svijet je, zaista, bolji za tebe od ovoga svijeta,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/4"}},{"verse_key":"93:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yuAAteeka rabbuka fatarda","translations":{"sahih_international":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied.","pickthall":"And verily thy Lord will give unto thee so that thou wilt be content.","yusuf_ali":"And soon will thy Guardian-Lord give thee (that wherewith) thou shalt be well-pleased.","urdu":"اور عنقریب تمہارا ربّ تم کو اتنا دے گا کہ تم خوش ہو جاوٴ گے۔","turkish":"Rabbin şüphesiz sana verecek ve sen de hoşnut olacaksın.","indonesian":"Dan sungguh, kelak Tuhanmu pasti memberikan karunia-Nya kepadamu, sehingga engkau menjadi puas.","french":"Ton Seigneur t’accordera certes [Ses faveurs], et alors tu seras satisfait.","german":"Und dein Herr wird dir wahrlich geben, und dann wirst du zufrieden sein.","bengali":"অচিরেই তোমার রাব্ব তোমাকে এরূপ দান করবেন যাতে তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হবে।","spanish":"Tu Señor te agraciará y te complacerás.","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya Tuhanmu akan memberikanmu (kejayaan dan kebahagiaan di dunia dan di akhirat) sehingga engkau reda - berpuas hati.","bosnian":"a Gospodar tvoj će tebi, sigurno, dati, pa ćeš zadovoljan biti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/5"}},{"verse_key":"93:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yajidka yateeman faawa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?","pickthall":"Did He not find thee an orphan and protect (thee)?","yusuf_ali":"Did He not find thee an orphan and give thee shelter (and care)?","urdu":"کیا اُس نے تم کو یتیم نہیں پایا اور پھر ٹھِکانا فراہم کیا؟","turkish":"Seni öksüz bulup da barındırmadı mı?","indonesian":"Bukankah Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yatim, lalu Dia melindungi(mu).","french":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé orphelin ? Alors Il t’a accueilli !","german":"Hat Er dich nicht als Waise gefunden und (dir) dann Zuflucht verschafft","bengali":"তিনি কি তোমাকে পিতৃহীন অবস্থায় পাননি, অতঃপর তোমাকে আশ্রয় দান করেননি?","spanish":"¿Acaso no te encontró huérfano y te dio amparo,","malay":"Bukankah dia mendapati engkau yatim piatu, lalu la memberikan perlindungan?","bosnian":"Zar nisi siroče bio, pa ti je On utočište pružio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/6"}},{"verse_key":"93:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّا فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka dallan fahada","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He found you lost and guided [you],","pickthall":"Did He not find thee wandering and direct (thee)?","yusuf_ali":"And He found thee wandering, and He gave thee guidance.","urdu":"اور تمہیں ناواقفِ راہ پایا اور پھر ہدایت بخشی۔","turkish":"Seni şaşırmış bulup, doğru yola eriştirmedi mi?","indonesian":"Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang bingung, lalu Dia memberikan petunjuk.","french":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé égaré ? Alors Il t’a guidé.","german":"und dich irregehend gefunden und dann rechtgeleitet","bengali":"তিনি তোমাকে পেলেন পথ সম্পর্কে অনবহিত, অতঃপর তিনি পথের নির্দেশ দিলেন।","spanish":"y te encontró perdido y te guió,","malay":"Dan didapatiNya engkau mencari-cari (jalan yang benar), lalu Ia memberikan hidayah petunjuk (dengan wahyu - Al-Quran)?","bosnian":"i za pravu vjeru nisi znao, pa te je na Pravi put uputio,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/7"}},{"verse_key":"93:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka AAa-ilan faaghna","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient.","pickthall":"Did He not find thee destitute and enrich (thee)?","yusuf_ali":"And He found thee in need, and made thee independent.","urdu":"اور تمہیں نادار پایا اور پھر مالدار کر دیا۔","turkish":"Seni fakir bulup zenginleştirmedi mi?","indonesian":"Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang kekurangan, lalu Dia memberikan kecukupan.","french":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé pauvre ? Alors Il t’a enrichi.","german":"und dich arm gefunden und dann reich gemacht?","bengali":"তিনি তোমাকে পেলেন নিঃস্ব অবস্থায়, অতঃপর অভাবমুক্ত করলেন।","spanish":"y te encontró pobre y te enriqueció?","malay":"Dan didapatiNya engkau miskin, lalu Ia memberikan kekayaan?","bosnian":"i siromah si bio, pa te je imućnim učinio?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/8"}},{"verse_key":"93:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","transliteration":"Faamma alyateema fala taqhar","translations":{"sahih_international":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","pickthall":"Therefor the orphan oppress not,","yusuf_ali":"Therefore, treat not the orphan with harshness,","urdu":"لہٰذا یتیم پر سختی نہ کرو،","turkish":"Öyleyse sakın öksüze kötü muamele etme;","indonesian":"Maka terhadap anak yatim janganlah engkau berlaku sewenang-wenang.","french":"Quant à l’orphelin, donc, ne le maltraite pas.","german":"Was nun die Waise angeht, so unterjoche (sie) nicht,","bengali":"অতএব তুমি পিতৃহীনের প্রতি কঠোর হয়োনা,","spanish":"No maltrates al huérfano","malay":"Oleh itu, adapun anak yatim maka janganlah engkau berlaku kasar terhadapnya,","bosnian":"Zato siroče ne ucvili,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/9"}},{"verse_key":"93:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","transliteration":"Waamma assa-ila falatanhar","translations":{"sahih_international":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","pickthall":"Therefor the beggar drive not away,","yusuf_ali":"Nor repulse the petitioner (unheard);","urdu":"اور سائل کو نہ جھِڑکو،","turkish":"Ve sakın bir şey isteyeni azarlama;","indonesian":"Dan terhadap orang yang meminta-minta, janganlah engkau menghardik(nya).","french":"Quant au demandeur, ne le repousse pas.","german":"und was den Bettler angeht, so fahre (ihn) nicht an,","bengali":"আর সওয়ালকারীকে ভৎর্সনা করনা।","spanish":"ni rechaces al mendigo.","malay":"Adapun orang yang meminta (bantuan pimpinan) maka janganlah engkau tengking herdik;","bosnian":"a na prosjaka ne podvikni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/10"}},{"verse_key":"93:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","transliteration":"Waamma biniAAmati rabbika fahaddith","translations":{"sahih_international":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","pickthall":"Therefor of the bounty of thy Lord be thy discourse.","yusuf_ali":"But the bounty of the Lord - rehearse and proclaim!","urdu":"اور اپنے ربّ کی نعمت کا اظہار کرو۔","turkish":"Yalnızca Rabbinin nimetini anlat.","indonesian":"Dan terhadap nikmat Tuhanmu, hendaklah engkau nyatakan (dengan bersyukur).","french":"Et quant au bienfait de ton Seigneur, proclame-le.","german":"und was die Gunst deines Herrn angeht, so erzähle (davon).","bengali":"তুমি তোমার রবের অনুগ্রহের কথা ব্যক্ত করতে থাকো।","spanish":"Y divulga las bendiciones de tu Señor.","malay":"Adapun nikmat Tuhanmu, maka hendaklah engkau sebut-sebutkan (dan zahirkan) sebagai bersyukur kepadaNya.","bosnian":"i o blagodati Gospodara svoga kazuj!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/093011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/93/11"}}]}},{"number":94,"data":{"surah":{"number":94,"name_arabic":"الشرح","name_english":"Ash-Sharh","name_translation":"The Relief","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":12,"verses_count":8,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/094.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/094.mp3"}],"total_verses":8,"verses":[{"verse_key":"94:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alam nashrah laka sadrak","translations":{"sahih_international":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muḥammad], your breast?","pickthall":"Have We not caused thy bosom to dilate,","yusuf_ali":"Have We not expanded thee thy breast?-","urdu":"(اے نبیؐ) کیا ہم نے تمہارا سینہ تمہارے لیے کھول نہیں دیا؟","turkish":"Senin gönlünü açmadık mı?","indonesian":"Bukankah kami telah melapangkan dadamu (Muhammad)?","french":"N’avons-Nous pas ouvert pour toi ta poitrine ?","german":"Haben Wir dir nicht deine Brust aufgetan","bengali":"আমি কি তোমার বক্ষ তোমার কল্যাণে উন্মুক্ত করে দিইনি?","spanish":"¿Acaso no he dado sosiego a tu corazón [¡Oh, Muhámmad!],","malay":"Bukankah Kami telah melapangkan bagimu: dadamu (wahai Muhammad serta mengisinya dengan iman dan hidayah petunjuk) ?","bosnian":"Zar grudi tvoje nismo prostranim učinili,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/1"}},{"verse_key":"94:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","transliteration":"WawadaAAna AAanka wizrak","translations":{"sahih_international":"And We removed from you your burden","pickthall":"And eased thee of the burden","yusuf_ali":"And removed from thee thy burden","urdu":"اور تم پر سے وہ بھاری بوجھ اتار دیا","turkish":"Belini büken yükünü üzerinden almadık mı?","indonesian":"dan kami pun telah menurunkan beban darimu,","french":"Et ne t’avons-Nous pas déchargé du fardeau.","german":"und dir deine Last abgenommen,","bengali":"আমি তোমা হতে অপসারণ করেছি তোমার সেই ভার –","spanish":"te he liberado de la carga","malay":"Dan Kami telah meringankan daripadamu: bebanmu (menyiarkan Islam) -","bosnian":"i breme tvoje s tebe skinuli,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/2"}},{"verse_key":"94:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","transliteration":"Allathee anqada thahrak","translations":{"sahih_international":"Which had weighed upon your back","pickthall":"Which weighed down thy back;","yusuf_ali":"The which did gall thy back?-","urdu":"جو تمہاری کمر توڑ ڈال رہا تھا۔","turkish":"Belini büken yükünü üzerinden almadık mı?","indonesian":"yang memberatkan punggungmu,","french":"qui accablait ton dos ?","german":"die deinen Rücken niederdrückte,","bengali":"যা তোমার পৃষ্ঠকে অবনমিত করেছিল;","spanish":"que agobiaba tu espalda,","malay":"Yang memberati tanggunganmu, (dengan memberikan berbagai kemudahan dalam melaksanakannya)?","bosnian":"koje je pleća tvoja tištilo,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/3"}},{"verse_key":"94:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","transliteration":"WarafaAAna laka thikrak","translations":{"sahih_international":"And raised high for you your repute.","pickthall":"And exalted thy fame?","yusuf_ali":"And raised high the esteem (in which) thou (art held)?","urdu":"اور تمہاری خاطر تمہارے ذِکر کا آوازہ بلند کردیا۔","turkish":"Senin şanını yükseltmedik mi?","indonesian":"dan kami tinggikan sebutan (nama)mu bagimu.","french":"Et exalté pour toi ta renommée ?","german":"und dir dein Ansehen erhöht?","bengali":"এবং আমি তোমার খ্যাতিকে উচ্চ মর্যাদা দান করেছি।","spanish":"y he elevado tu renombre?","malay":"Dan Kami telah meninggikan bagimu: sebutan namamu (dengan mengurniakan pangkat Nabi dan berbagai kemuliaan)?","bosnian":"i spomen na tebe visoko uzdigli!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/4"}},{"verse_key":"94:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Fa-inna maAAa alAAusri yusra","translations":{"sahih_international":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease [i.e., relief].","pickthall":"But lo! with hardship goeth ease,","yusuf_ali":"So, verily, with every difficulty, there is relief:","urdu":"پس حقیقت یہ ہے کہ تنگی کے ساتھ فراخی بھی ہے","turkish":"Elbette güçlükle beraber şüphesiz bir kolaylık vardır.","indonesian":"Maka sesungguhnya bersama kesulitan ada kemudahan,","french":"A côté de la difficulté est, certes, une facilité !","german":"Also gewiß, mit der Erschwernis ist Erleichterung,","bengali":"কষ্টের সাথেই তো স্বস্তি আছে।","spanish":"Con toda dificultad viene una facilidad.","malay":"Oleh itu, maka (tetapkanlah kepercayaanmu) bahawa sesungguhnya tiap-tiap kesukaran disertai kemudahan,","bosnian":"Ta, zaista, s mukom je i last,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/5"}},{"verse_key":"94:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Inna maAAa alAAusri yusra","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","pickthall":"Lo! with hardship goeth ease;","yusuf_ali":"Verily, with every difficulty there is relief.","urdu":"بے شک تنگی کے ساتھ فراخی بھی ہے۔","turkish":"Gerçekten, güçlükle beraber bir kolaylık vardır.","indonesian":"sesungguhnya bersama kesulitan ada kemudahan.","french":"A côté de la difficulté, est certes, une facilité !","german":"gewiß, mit der Erschwernis ist Erleichterung.","bengali":"অবশ্যই কষ্টের সাথে স্বস্তি আছে।","spanish":"Realmente, con toda dificultad viene una facilidad.","malay":"(Sekali lagi ditegaskan): bahawa sesungguhnya tiap-tiap kesukaran disertai kemudahan.","bosnian":"zaista, s mukom je i last!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/6"}},{"verse_key":"94:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","transliteration":"Fa-itha faraghta fansab","translations":{"sahih_international":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship].","pickthall":"So when thou art relieved, still toil","yusuf_ali":"Therefore, when thou art free (from thine immediate task), still labour hard,","urdu":"لہٰذا جب تم فارغ ہو تو عبادت کی مشقت میں لگ جاؤ","turkish":"Öyleyse, bir işi bitirince diğerine giriş;","indonesian":"Maka apabila engkau telah selesai (dari suatu urusan), tetaplah bekerja keras (untuk urusan yang lain),","french":"Quand tu te libères, donc, lève-toi,","german":"Wenn du nun fertig bist, dann strenge dich an","bengali":"অতএব যখনই অবসর পাও সাধনা কর,","spanish":"Cuando cumplas con tus obligaciones dedícate a la adoración,","malay":"Kemudian apabila engkau telah selesai (daripada sesuatu amal soleh), maka bersungguh-sungguhlah engkau berusaha (mengerjakan amal soleh yang lain),","bosnian":"A kad završiš, molitvi se predaj"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/7"}},{"verse_key":"94:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب","transliteration":"Wa-ila rabbika farghab","translations":{"sahih_international":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing.","pickthall":"And strive to please thy Lord.","yusuf_ali":"And to thy Lord turn (all) thy attention.","urdu":"اور اپنے ربّ ہی کی طرف راغب ہو۔","turkish":"Ve ümit edeceğini yalnız Rabbinden iste.","indonesian":"dan hanya kepada Tuhanmulah engkau berharap.","french":"et à ton Seigneur aspire.","german":"und nach deinem Herrn richte dein Begehren aus.","bengali":"এবং তোমার রবের প্রতিই মনোনিবেশ কর।","spanish":"y a tu Señor anhela con devoción.","malay":"Dan kepada Tuhanmu sahaja hendaklah engkau memohon (apa yang engkau gemar dan ingini).","bosnian":"i samo se Gospodaru svome obraćaj!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/094008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/94/8"}}]}},{"number":95,"data":{"surah":{"number":95,"name_arabic":"التين","name_english":"At-Tin","name_translation":"The Fig","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":28,"verses_count":8,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/095.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/095.mp3"}],"total_verses":8,"verses":[{"verse_key":"95:1","ayah":1,"arabic":"وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيْتُونِ","transliteration":"Watteeni wazzaytoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the fig and the olive","pickthall":"By the fig and the olive,","yusuf_ali":"By the Fig and the Olive,","urdu":"قسم ہے انجیر اور زیتون کی","turkish":"İncir ve zeytine and olsun,","indonesian":"Demi (buah) Tin dan (buah) Zaitun,","french":"Par le figuier et l’olivier !","german":"Bei der Feige und der Olive","bengali":"শপথ ‘তীন’ ও যাইতূন’ এর –","spanish":"Juro por la higuera y el olivo,","malay":"Demi buah Tiin dan Zaitun,","bosnian":"Tako mi smokve i masline,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/1"}},{"verse_key":"95:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَطُورِ سِينِينَ","transliteration":"Watoori seeneen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] Mount Sinai","pickthall":"By Mount Sinai,","yusuf_ali":"And the Mount of Sinai,","urdu":"اور طورِ سینا","turkish":"And olsun Sina dağına,","indonesian":"demi gunung Sinai,","french":"Et par le Mont Sînîn[ 1077] !","german":"und dem Berg Sinin","bengali":"শপথ ‘সিনাই’ পর্বতের –","spanish":"por el monte Sinaí,","malay":"Dan Gunung Tursina,","bosnian":"i Sinajske gore,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/2"}},{"verse_key":"95:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ ٱلْأَمِينِ","transliteration":"Wahatha albaladi al-ameen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And [by] this secure city [i.e., Makkah],","pickthall":"And by this land made safe;","yusuf_ali":"And this City of security,-","urdu":"اور اِس پرامن شہر (مکہ) کی","turkish":"And olsun bu güvenli Mekke şehrine ki:","indonesian":"dan demi negeri (Mekkah) yang aman ini.","french":"Et par cette Cité sûre !","german":"und dieser sicheren Ortschaft!","bengali":"এবং শপথ এই নিরাপদ বা শান্তিময় নগরীর –","spanish":"y por esta ciudad segura [La Meca].","malay":"Serta negeri (Makkah) yang aman ini, -","bosnian":"i grada ovog, sigurnog –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/3"}},{"verse_key":"95:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ فِىٓ أَحْسَنِ تَقْوِيمٍ","transliteration":"Laqad khalaqna al-insana fee ahsanitaqweem","translations":{"sahih_international":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature;","pickthall":"Surely We created man of the best stature","yusuf_ali":"We have indeed created man in the best of moulds,","urdu":"ہم نے انسان کو بہترین ساخت پر پیدا کیا،","turkish":"Biz insanı en güzel şekilde yarattık,","indonesian":"Sungguh, Kami telah menciptakan manusia dalam bentuk yang sebaik-baiknya,","french":"Nous avons certes créé l’homme dans la forme la plus parfaite.","german":"Wir haben den Menschen ja in schönster Gestaltung erschaffen,","bengali":"আমিতো সৃষ্টি করেছি মানুষকে সুন্দরতম গঠনে,","spanish":"Que he creado al ser humano con la mejor conformación.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah menciptakan manusia dalam bentuk yang sebaik-baiknya (dan berkelengkapan sesuai dengan keadaannya).","bosnian":"Mi čovjeka stvaramo u skladu najljepšem,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/4"}},{"verse_key":"95:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"ثُمَّ رَدَدْنَـٰهُ أَسْفَلَ سَـٰفِلِينَ","transliteration":"Thumma radadnahu asfala safileen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then We return him to the lowest of the low,","pickthall":"Then we reduced him to the lowest of the low,","yusuf_ali":"Then do We abase him (to be) the lowest of the low,-","urdu":"پھر اُسے اُلٹا پھیر کر ہم نے سب نِیچوں سے نیچ کر دیا،","turkish":"Sonra onu aşağıların en aşağısı kıldık.","indonesian":"kemudian Kami kembalikan dia ke tempat yang serendah-rendahnya,","french":"Ensuite, Nous l’avons ramené au niveau le plus bas,","german":"hierauf haben Wir ihn zu den Niedrigsten der Niedrigen werden lassen,","bengali":"অতঃপর আমি তাকে হীনতাগ্রস্তদের হীনতমে পরিণত করি –","spanish":"Sin embargo, [a quien rechace el Mensaje] lo degradaré al rango más bajo.","malay":"Kemudian (jika ia panjang umur sehingga tua atau menyalahgunakan kelengkapan itu), Kami kembalikan dia ke serendah-rendah peringkat orang-orang yang rendah,","bosnian":"zatim ćemo ga u najnakazniji lik vratiti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/5"}},{"verse_key":"95:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ فَلَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونٍ","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoowaAAamiloo assalihati falahum ajrun ghayrumamnoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted.","pickthall":"Save those who believe and do good works, and theirs is a reward unfailing.","yusuf_ali":"Except such as believe and do righteous deeds: For they shall have a reward unfailing.","urdu":"سوائے اُن لوگوں کے جو ایمان لائے اور نیک عمل کرتے رہے کہ ان کے لیے کبھی ختم نہ ہونے والا اجر ہے۔","turkish":"Yalnız, inanıp yararlı iş işleyenler bunun dışındadır. Onlara kesintisiz ecir vardır.","indonesian":"kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan; maka mereka akan mendapat pahala yang tidak ada putus-putusnya.","french":"sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres: ceux-là auront une récompense jamais interrompue.","german":"außer denjenigen, die glauben und rechtschaffene Werke tun; für sie wird es einen Lohn geben, der nicht aufhört.","bengali":"কিন্তু তাদের নয় যারা মু’মিন ও সৎ কর্মপরায়ণ; তাদের জন্যতো আছে নিরবিচ্ছিন্ন পুরস্কার।","spanish":"En cambio, a los creyentes que obran rectamente les tengo reservada una recompensa inagotable.","malay":"Kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh, maka mereka beroleh pahala yang tidak putus-putus.","bosnian":"samo ne one koji budu vjerovali i dobra djela činili, njih čeka nagrada neprekidna."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/6"}},{"verse_key":"95:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعْدُ بِٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Fama yukaththibuka baAAdu biddeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"So what yet causes you to deny the Recompense?","pickthall":"So who henceforth will give the lie to thee about the judgment?","yusuf_ali":"Then what can, after this, contradict thee, as to the judgment (to come)?","urdu":"پس (اے نبیؐ)اِس کے بعد کون جزا و سزا کے معاملہ میں تم کو جھُٹلا سکتا ہے؟","turkish":"Öyleyken, sana dini yalan saydırtan nedir?","indonesian":"Maka apa yang menyebabkan (mereka) mendustakanmu (tentang) hari pembalasan setelah (adanya keterangan-keterangan) itu?","french":"Après cela, qu’est-ce qui te fait traiter la rétribution de mensonge ?","german":"Was läßt dich da weiterhin das Gericht für Lüge erklären?","bengali":"সুতরাং এরপর কিসে তোমাকে কর্মফল সম্বন্ধে অবিশ্বাসী করে?","spanish":"¿Cómo puedes desmentir el Día del Juicio?","malay":"(Jika demikian kekuasaanKu), maka apa pula yang menjadikan engkau seorang pendusta, (berkata tidak benar) mengenai hari pembalasan, sesudah (ternyata dalil-dalil yang membuktikan kekuasaanKu mengadakan hari pembalasan) itu?","bosnian":"Pa šta te onda navodi da poričeš onaj svijet –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/7"}},{"verse_key":"95:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"أَلَيْسَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَحْكَمِ ٱلْحَـٰكِمِينَ","transliteration":"Alaysa Allahu bi-ahkami alhakimeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Is not Allāh the most just of judges?","pickthall":"Is not Allah the most conclusive of all judges?","yusuf_ali":"Is not Allah the wisest of judges?","urdu":"کیا اللہ سب حاکموں سے بڑا حاکم نہیں ہے؟","turkish":"Allah, hükmedenlerin en iyi hükmedeni değil midir?","indonesian":"Bukankah Allah Hakim yang paling adil?","french":"Allah n’est-Il pas le plus sage des Juges ?","german":"Ist nicht Allah der Weiseste derjenigen, die richten?","bengali":"আল্লাহ কি বিচারকদের মধ্যে শ্রেষ্ঠ নন?","spanish":"¿Acaso no es Dios el más Justo de los jueces?","malay":"Bukankah Allah (yang demikian kekuasaanNya) seadil-adil Hakim?","bosnian":"zar Allah nije sudija najpravedniji?!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/095008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/95/8"}}]}},{"number":96,"data":{"surah":{"number":96,"name_arabic":"العلق","name_english":"Al-'Alaq","name_translation":"The Clot","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":1,"verses_count":19,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/096.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/096.mp3"}],"total_verses":19,"verses":[{"verse_key":"96:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Iqra/ bi-ismi rabbika allathee khalaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created","pickthall":"Read: In the name of thy Lord Who createth,","yusuf_ali":"Proclaim! (or read!) in the name of thy Lord and Cherisher, Who created-","urdu":"پڑھو (اے نبیؐ) اپنے ربّ کے نام کے ساتھ جس نے پیدا کیا،","turkish":"Yaratan Rabbinin adıyla oku!","indonesian":"Bacalah dengan (menyebut) nama Tuhanmu yang menciptakan,","french":"Lis, au nom de ton Seigneur qui a créé,","german":"Lies im Namen deines Herrn, Der erschaffen hat,","bengali":"তুমি পাঠ কর তোমার রবের নামে, যিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন।","spanish":"¡Lee! [¡Oh, Muhámmad!] En el nombre de tu Señor, Quien creó todas las cosas.","malay":"Bacalah (wahai Muhammad) dengan nama Tuhanmu yang menciptakan (sekalian makhluk),","bosnian":"Čitaj, u ime Gospodara tvoga, koji stvara,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/1"}},{"verse_key":"96:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","transliteration":"Khalaqa al-insana min AAalaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"Created man from a clinging substance.","pickthall":"Createth man from a clot.","yusuf_ali":"Created man, out of a (mere) clot of congealed blood:","urdu":"جمے ہوئے خون کے ایک لوتھڑے سے انسان کی تخلیق کی۔","turkish":"O, insanı pıhtılaşmış kandan (alak'tan) yarattı.","indonesian":"Dia telah menciptakan manusia dari segumpal darah.","french":"qui a créé l’homme d’une adhérence.","german":"den Menschen erschaffen hat aus einem Anhängsel.","bengali":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন মানুষকে রক্তপিন্ড হতে।","spanish":"Creó al ser humano de una célula embrionaria.","malay":"Ia menciptakan manusia dari sebuku darah beku;","bosnian":"stvara čovjeka od ugruška!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/2"}},{"verse_key":"96:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","transliteration":"Iqra/ warabbuka al-akram","translations":{"sahih_international":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -","pickthall":"Read: And thy Lord is the Most Bounteous,","yusuf_ali":"Proclaim! And thy Lord is Most Bountiful,-","urdu":"پڑھو، اور تمہارا رب بڑا کریم ہے","turkish":"Oku! Kalemle öğreten, insana bilmediğini bildiren Rabbin, en büyük kerem sahibidir.","indonesian":"Bacalah, dan Tuhanmulah Yang Mahamulia.","french":"Lis! Ton Seigneur est le Très Noble,","german":"Lies, und dein Herr ist der Edelste,","bengali":"পাঠ করঃ আর তোমার রাব্ব মহা মহিমান্বিত,","spanish":"¡Lee! Que tu Señor es el más Generoso.","malay":"Bacalah, dan Tuhanmu Yang Maha Pemurah, -","bosnian":"Čitaj, plemenit je Gospodar tvoj,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/3"}},{"verse_key":"96:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","transliteration":"Allathee AAallama bilqalam","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who taught by the pen","pickthall":"Who teacheth by the pen,","yusuf_ali":"He Who taught (the use of) the pen,-","urdu":"جس نے قلم کے ذریعہ سے علم سکھایا،","turkish":"Oku! Kalemle öğreten, insana bilmediğini bildiren Rabbin, en büyük kerem sahibidir.","indonesian":"Yang mengajar (manusia) dengan pena.","french":"qui a enseigné par la plume [le calame],","german":"Der (das Schreiben) mit dem Schreibrohr gelehrt hat,","bengali":"যিনি কলমের সাহায্যে শিক্ষা দিয়েছেন।","spanish":"Enseñó la escritura con la pluma","malay":"Yang mengajar manusia melalui pena dan tulisan, -","bosnian":"koji poučava peru,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/4"}},{"verse_key":"96:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","transliteration":"AAallama al-insana ma lamyaAAlam","translations":{"sahih_international":"Taught man that which he knew not.","pickthall":"Teacheth man that which he knew not.","yusuf_ali":"Taught man that which he knew not.","urdu":"انسان کو وہ علم دیا جسے وہ نہ جانتا تھا۔","turkish":"Oku! Kalemle öğreten, insana bilmediğini bildiren Rabbin, en büyük kerem sahibidir.","indonesian":"Dia mengajarkan manusia apa yang tidak diketahuinya.","french":"a enseigné à l’homme ce qu’il ne savait pas.","german":"den Menschen gelehrt hat, was er nicht wußte.","bengali":"তিনি শিক্ষা দিয়েছেন মানুষকে যা সে জানতনা।","spanish":"y le enseñó al ser humano lo que este no sabía.","malay":"Ia mengajarkan manusia apa yang tidak diketahuinya.","bosnian":"koji čovjeka poučava onome što ne zna."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/5"}},{"verse_key":"96:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Kalla inna al-insana layatgha","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","pickthall":"Nay, but verily man is rebellious","yusuf_ali":"Nay, but man doth transgress all bounds,","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، انسان سرکشی کرتا ہے","turkish":"Ama, insanoğlu kendini müstağni sayarak azgınlık eder.","indonesian":"Sekali-sekali tidak! Sungguh, manusia itu benar-benar melampaui batas,","french":"Prenez-garde ! Vraiment l’homme devient rebelle,","german":"Keineswegs! Der Mensch lehnt sich wahrlich auf,","bengali":"বস্তুতঃ মানুষতো সীমালংঘন করেই থাকে,","spanish":"No obstante, el ser humano se excede","malay":"Ingatlah! Sesungguhnya jenis manusia tetap melampaui batas (yang sepatutnya atau yang sewajibnya),","bosnian":"Uistinu, čovjek se uzobijesti"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/6"}},{"verse_key":"96:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"An raahu istaghna","translations":{"sahih_international":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient.","pickthall":"That he thinketh himself independent!","yusuf_ali":"In that he looketh upon himself as self-sufficient.","urdu":"اِس بنا پر کہ وہ اپنے آپ کو بے نیاز دیکھتا ہے","turkish":"Ama, insanoğlu kendini müstağni sayarak azgınlık eder.","indonesian":"apabila melihat dirinya serba cukup.","french":"dès qu’il estime qu’il peut se suffire à lui-même (à cause de sa richesse).","german":"daß er von sich meint, unbedürftig zu sein.","bengali":"কারণ সে নিজেকে অভাবমুক্ত বা অমুখাপেক্ষী মনে করে।","spanish":"cuando se cree autosuficiente.","malay":"Dengan sebab ia melihat dirinya sudah cukup apa yang dihajatinya.","bosnian":"čim se neovisnim osjeti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/7"}},{"verse_key":"96:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Inna ila rabbika arrujAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","pickthall":"Lo! unto thy Lord is the return.","yusuf_ali":"Verily, to thy Lord is the return (of all).","urdu":"(حالانکہ) پلٹنا یقیناً تیرے ربّ ہی کی طرف ہے۔","turkish":"Dönüş şüphesiz Rabbinedir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, hanya kepada Tuhanmulah tempat kembali(mu).","french":"Mais, c’est vers ton Seigneur qu’est le retour.","german":"Gewiß, zu deinem Herrn wird die Rückkehr sein.","bengali":"তোমার রবের নিকট প্রত্যাবর্তন সুনিশ্চিত।","spanish":"Pero todos habrán de comparecer ante tu Señor.","malay":"(Ingatlah) sesungguhnya kepada Tuhanmu lah tempat kembali (untuk menerima balasan).","bosnian":"a Gospodaru tvome će se, doista, svi vratiti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/8"}},{"verse_key":"96:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yanha","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you seen the one who forbids","pickthall":"Hast thou seen him who dissuadeth","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou one who forbids-","urdu":"تم نے دیکھا اُس شخص کو","turkish":"Sen, namaz kılan kulu bundan menedeni gördün mü?","indonesian":"Bagaimana pendapatmu tentang orang yang melarang?","french":"As-tu vu celui qui interdit.","german":"Siehst du denjenigen, der abhält","bengali":"তুমি কি তাকে দেখেছো যে বাধা দেয় –","spanish":"¿Qué piensas de quien impide","malay":"Adakah engkau nampak (baiknya) orang yang melarang (dan menghalang) -","bosnian":"Vidje li ti onoga koji brani"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/9"}},{"verse_key":"96:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"AAabdan itha salla","translations":{"sahih_international":"A servant when he prays?","pickthall":"A slave when he prayeth?","yusuf_ali":"A votary when he (turns) to pray?","urdu":"جو ایک بندے کو منع کرتا ہے جبکہ وہ نماز پڑھتا ہو؟","turkish":"Sen, namaz kılan kulu bundan menedeni gördün mü?","indonesian":"seorang hamba ketika dia melaksanakan salat,","french":"à un serviteur d’Allah (Mohammed) de célébrer la prière (As-Salât) ?","german":"einen Diener, wenn er betet?","bengali":"এক বান্দাকে যখন সে সালাত আদায় করে?","spanish":"a un siervo de Dios realizar sus oraciones?","malay":"Seorang hamba Allah apabila ia mengerjakan sembahyang?","bosnian":"robu da molitvu obavi?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/10"}},{"verse_key":"96:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Araayta in kana AAala alhuda","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance","pickthall":"Hast thou seen if he relieth on the guidance (of Allah)","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou if he is on (the road of) Guidance?-","urdu":"تمہارا کیا خیال ہے اگر (وہ بندہ) راہ راست پر ہو","turkish":"Söyle bakalım, o kul doğru yolda giden veya Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınmayı buyuran bir kimse olsun; veya söyle, yalanlayıp yüz çeviren birisi olsun","indonesian":"bagaimana pendapatmu jika dia (yang dilarang salat itu) berada di atas kebenaran (petunjuk),","french":"Vois-tu s’il est sur la bonne voie,","german":"Siehst du! Obwohl er nach der Rechtleitung verfährt,","bengali":"তুমি লক্ষ্য করেছ কি যদি সে সৎ পথে থাকে?","spanish":"¿Acaso ha recapacitado que trae la guía","malay":"Adakah engkau nampak (buruknya) jika ia berada di atas jalan yang betul? -","bosnian":"Reci mi ako on misli da je na Pravome putu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/11"}},{"verse_key":"96:12","ayah":12,"arabic":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw amara bittaqwa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Or enjoins righteousness?","pickthall":"Or enjoineth piety?","yusuf_ali":"Or enjoins Righteousness?","urdu":"یا پرہیزگاری کی تلقین کرتا ہو؟","turkish":"Söyle bakalım, o kul doğru yolda giden veya Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınmayı buyuran bir kimse olsun; veya söyle, yalanlayıp yüz çeviren birisi olsun","indonesian":"atau dia menyuruh bertakwa (kepada Allah)?","french":"ou s’il ordonne la piété?","german":"oder die Gottesfurcht gebietet?","bengali":"অথবা তাকওয়ার নির্দেশ দেয়?","spanish":"y exhorta a la piedad?","malay":"Atau ia menyuruh orang bertaqwa (jangan melakukan syirik)?","bosnian":"ili ako bogobojaznost naređuje?!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096012.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/12"}},{"verse_key":"96:13","ayah":13,"arabic":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Araayta in kaththaba watawalla","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away -","pickthall":"Hast thou seen if he denieth (Allah's guidance) and is froward?","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou if he denies (Truth) and turns away?","urdu":"تمہارا کیا خیال ہے اگر (یہ منع کرنے والا شخص حق کو) جھٹلاتا اور منہ موڑتا ہو؟","turkish":"Söyle bakalım, o kul doğru yolda giden veya Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınmayı buyuran bir kimse olsun; veya söyle, yalanlayıp yüz çeviren birisi olsun","indonesian":"Bagaimana pendapatmu jika dia (yang melarang) itu mendustakan dan berpaling?","french":"Vois-tu s’il dément et tourne le dos ?","german":"Siehst du! Wie (wäre es) wenn er (die Botschaft) für Lüge erklärt und sich abkehrt?","bengali":"তুমি লক্ষ্য করেছ কি যদি সে মিথ্যা আরোপ করে ও মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়?","spanish":"¿Acaso no ves cómo desmiente y rechaza?","malay":"Adakah engkau nampak (terlepasnya dari azab) jika ia mendustakan (apa yang disampaikan oleh Nabi Muhammad kepadanya) serta ia berpaling ingkar?","bosnian":"reci mi, ako on poriče i glavu okreće –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096013.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/13"}},{"verse_key":"96:14","ayah":14,"arabic":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yaAAlam bi-anna Allaha yara","translations":{"sahih_international":"Does he not know that Allāh sees?","pickthall":"Is he then unaware that Allah seeth?","yusuf_ali":"Knoweth he not that Allah doth see?","urdu":"کیا وہ نہیں جانتا کہ اللہ دیکھ رہا ہے؟","turkish":"Allah'ın her şeyi görmekte olduğunu bilmez mi?","indonesian":"Tidakkah dia mengetahui bahwa sesungguhnya Allah melihat (segala perbuatannya)?","french":"Ne sait-il pas que vraiment Allah voit ?","german":"Weiß er denn nicht, daß Allah sieht?","bengali":"তাহলে সে কি অবগত নয় যে, আল্লাহ দেখছেন?","spanish":"¿Acaso no sabe que Dios lo ve?","malay":"Tidakkah ia mengetahui bahawa sesungguhnya Allah melihat (segala amal perbuatannya dan membalasnya)?","bosnian":"zar on ne zna da Allah sve vidi?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096014.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/14"}},{"verse_key":"96:15","ayah":15,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","transliteration":"Kalla la-in lam yantahi lanasfaAAanbinnasiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock","pickthall":"Nay, but if he cease not We will seize him by the forelock -","yusuf_ali":"Let him beware! If he desist not, We will drag him by the forelock,-","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، اگر وہ باز نہ آیا تو ہم اس کی پیشانی کے بال پکڑ کر اُسے کھینچیں گے","turkish":"Ama bundan vazgeçmezse, and olsun ki, onu perçeminden,","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Sungguh, jika dia tidak berhenti (berbuat demikian) niscaya Kami tarik ubun-ubunnya (ke dalam neraka),","french":"Mais non ! S’il ne cesse pas, Nous le saisirons certes, par le toupet,","german":"Keineswegs! Wenn er nicht aufhört, werden Wir ihn ganz gewiß an der Stirnlocke packen und ziehen,","bengali":"সাবধান! সে যদি নিবৃত্ত না হয় তাহলে আমি তাকে অবশ্যই হেচড়িয়ে নিয়ে যাব মাথার সম্মুখ ভাগের কেশগুচ্ছ ধরে –","spanish":"Si no pone fin [a sus agresiones contra los creyentes] le arrastraré por su frente,","malay":"Jangan sekali-kali berlaku derhaka! Demi sesungguhnya jika ia tidak berhenti (dari perbuatannya yang buruk itu), nescaya Kami akan menyentap ubun-ubunnya (dan menyeretnya ke dalam neraka), -","bosnian":"Ne valja to! Ako se ne okani, dohvatićemo ga za kiku,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096015.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/15"}},{"verse_key":"96:16","ayah":16,"arabic":"نَاصِيَةٍ كَـٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍ","transliteration":"Nasiyatin kathibatin khati-a","translations":{"sahih_international":"A lying, sinning forelock.","pickthall":"The lying, sinful forelock -","yusuf_ali":"A lying, sinful forelock!","urdu":"اُس پیشانی کو جو جھُوٹی اور سخت خطاکار ہے۔","turkish":"Yalancı ve günahkar perçeminden cehenneme sürükleriz.","indonesian":"(yaitu) ubun-ubun orang yang mendustakan dan durhaka.","french":"le toupet d’un menteur, d’un pécheur.","german":"einer Stirnlocke, einer lügnerischen, einer verfehlt handelnden.","bengali":"মিথ্যাবাদী, পাপিষ্ঠের কেশগুচ্ছ।","spanish":"esa frente mentirosa y perversa.","malay":"Ubun-ubun (orang) yang berdusta, yang bersalah.","bosnian":"kiku lažnu i grješnu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096016.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/16"}},{"verse_key":"96:17","ayah":17,"arabic":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"FalyadAAu nadiyah","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then let him call his associates;","pickthall":"Then let him call upon his henchmen!","yusuf_ali":"Then, let him call (for help) to his council (of comrades):","urdu":"وہ بُلالے اپنے حامیوں کی ٹولی کو،","turkish":"O zaman, kafadarlarını çağırsın,","indonesian":"Maka biarlah dia memanggil golongannya (untuk menolongnya),","french":"Qu’il appelle donc son assemblée.","german":"So soll er doch seine Genossen rufen.","bengali":"অতএব সে তার পার্শ্বচরদের আহবান করুক।","spanish":"Que pida auxilio a sus secuaces,","malay":"Kemudian biarlah ia memanggil kumpulannya (untuk menyelamatkannya),","bosnian":"pa neka on pozove društvo svoje –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096017.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/17"}},{"verse_key":"96:18","ayah":18,"arabic":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","transliteration":"SanadAAu azzabaniya","translations":{"sahih_international":"We will call the angels of Hell.","pickthall":"We will call the guards of hell.","yusuf_ali":"We will call on the angels of punishment (to deal with him)!","urdu":"ہم بھی عذاب کے فرشتوں کو بُلا لیں گے۔","turkish":"Biz de zebanileri çağıracağız.","indonesian":"kelak Kami akan memanggil Malaikat Zabaniyah (penyiksa orang-orang yang berdosa)","french":"Nous appellerons les gardiens (de l’Enfer).","german":"Wir werden die (Höllen)wache rufen.","bengali":"আমিও আহবান করব জাহান্নামের প্রহরীদেরকে।","spanish":"que llamaré a los ángeles guardianes del Infierno.","malay":"Kami pula akan memanggil malaikat Zabaniyah (untuk menyeksanya)!","bosnian":"Mi ćemo pozvati zebanije."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096018.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/18"}},{"verse_key":"96:19","ayah":19,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","transliteration":"Kalla la tutiAAhu wasjudwaqtarib","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allāh].","pickthall":"Nay, Obey not thou him. But prostrate thyself, and draw near (unto Allah).","yusuf_ali":"Nay, heed him not: But bow down in adoration, and bring thyself the closer (to Allah)!","urdu":"ہرگزنہیں، اُس کی بات نہ مانو اور سجدہ کرو اور (اپنے ربّ کا) قرب حاصل کرو۔","turkish":"Sakın ona uyma; sen secde et, Rabbine yaklaş.","indonesian":"sekali-kali tidak! Janganlah kamu patuh kepadanya; dan sujudlah serta dekatkanlah (dirimu kepada Allah).","french":"Non ! Ne lui obéis pas; mais prosterne-toi et rapproche-toi.","german":"Keineswegs! Gehorche ihm nicht, sondern wirf dich nieder und sei (Allah) nah!","bengali":"সাবধান! তুমি তার অনুসরণ করনা। সাজদাহ কর ও আমার নিকটবর্তী হও। [সাজদাহ]","spanish":"¡No! No le obedezcas, sino que prostérnate [ante Dios] y busca Su proximidad.","malay":"Ingatlah! Janganlah engkau (wahai Muhammad) menurut kehendaknya, dan (sebaliknya) sujudlah dan dampingkanlah dirimu kepada Allah (dengan taat dan beramal soleh)!","bosnian":"Ne valja to! Ti njega ne slušaj, već molitvu obavljaj i nastoj da se Gospodaru svome približiš!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/096019.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/96/19"}}]}},{"number":97,"data":{"surah":{"number":97,"name_arabic":"القدر","name_english":"Al-Qadr","name_translation":"The Power","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":25,"verses_count":5,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/097.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/097.mp3"}],"total_verses":5,"verses":[{"verse_key":"97:1","ayah":1,"arabic":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ","transliteration":"Inna anzalnahu fee laylatialqadr","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, We sent it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down during the Night of Decree.","pickthall":"Lo! We revealed it on the Night of Predestination.","yusuf_ali":"We have indeed revealed this (Message) in the Night of Power:","urdu":"ہم نے اِس (قرآن)کو شبِ قدر میں نازل کیا ہے۔","turkish":"Doğrusu, Biz, Kuran'ı kadir gecesinde indirmişizdir.","indonesian":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah menurunkannya (Alquran) pada malam qadar.","french":"Nous l’avons certes, fait descendre (le Coran) pendant la nuit d’Al-Qadr (du Destin).","german":"Wir haben ihn ja in der Nacht der Bestimmung hinabgesandt.","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি ইহা অবতীর্ণ করেছি মহিমান্বিত রাতে;","spanish":"Comencé la revelación [del Corán] en la noche de la predestinación.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah menurunkan (Al-Quran) ini pada Malam Lailatul-Qadar,","bosnian":"Mi smo ga počeli objavljivati u Noći Kadr –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/097001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/97/1"}},{"verse_key":"97:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma laylatualqadr","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Night of Power is!","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what the night of power is?","urdu":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ شب قدر کیا ہے؟","turkish":"Kadir gecesinin ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah malam kemuliaan itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est la nuit d’Al-Qadr ?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was die Nacht der Bestimmung ist?","bengali":"আর মহিমান্বিত রাত সম্বন্ধে তুমি জান কী?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará comprender la importancia de la noche de la predestinación?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui apa dia kebesaran Malam Lailatul-Qadar itu?","bosnian":"a šta ti misliš šta je Noć Kadr?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/097002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/97/2"}},{"verse_key":"97:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ","transliteration":"Laylatu alqadri khayrun min alfi shahr","translations":{"sahih_international":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","pickthall":"The Night of Power is better than a thousand months.","yusuf_ali":"The Night of Power is better than a thousand months.","urdu":"شبِ قدر ہزار مہینوں سے زیادہ بہتر ہے۔","turkish":"Kadir gecesi bin aydan hayırlıdır.","indonesian":"Malam kemuliaan itu lebih baik daripada seribu bulan.","french":"La nuit d’Al-Qadr est meilleure que mille mois.","german":"Die Nacht der Bestimmung ist besser als tausend Monate.","bengali":"মহিমান্বিত রাত হাজার মাস অপেক্ষা উত্তম।","spanish":"[Adorar a Dios] la noche de la predestinación es superior en recompensa a hacerlo durante mil meses.","malay":"Malam Lailatul-Qadar lebih baik daripada seribu bulan.","bosnian":"Noć Kadr je bolja od hiljadu mjeseci –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/097003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/97/3"}},{"verse_key":"97:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"تَنَزَّلُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِم مِّن كُلِّ أَمْرٍ","transliteration":"Tanazzalu almala-ikatu warroohufeeha bi-ithni rabbihim min kulli amr","translations":{"sahih_international":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","pickthall":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein, by the permission of their Lord, with all decrees.","yusuf_ali":"Therein come down the angels and the Spirit by Allah's permission, on every errand:","urdu":"فرشتے اور رُوح اُس میں اپنے ربّ کے اِذن سے ہر حکم لے کر اُترتے ہیں۔","turkish":"Melekler ve Cebrail o gecede Rablerinin izniyle her türlü iş için inerler.","indonesian":"Pada malam itu turun para malaikat dan Ruh (Jibril) dengan izin Tuhannya untuk mengatur semua urusan.","french":"Durant celle-ci descendent les Anges ainsi que l’Esprit, par permission de leur Seigneur pour tout ordre.","german":"Es kommen die Engel und der Geist in ihr mit der Erlaubnis ihres Herrn mit jeder Angelegenheit herab.","bengali":"ঐ রাতে (মালাইকা) ফিরিশতাগণ ও রুহ অবতীর্ণ হয় প্রত্যেক কাজে তাদের রবের অনুমতিক্রমে।","spanish":"Esta noche descienden los ángeles y el espíritu [el ángel Gabriel] con órdenes de su Señor para todos los asuntos.","malay":"Pada Malam itu, turun malaikat dan Jibril dengan izin Tuhan mereka, kerana membawa segala perkara (yang ditakdirkan berlakunya pada tahun yang berikut);","bosnian":"meleki i Džibril, s dozvolom Gospodara svoga, spuštaju se u njoj zbog odluke svake,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/097004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/97/4"}},{"verse_key":"97:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"سَلَـٰمٌ هِىَ حَتَّىٰ مَطْلَعِ ٱلْفَجْرِ","transliteration":"Salamun hiya hatta matlaAAialfajr","translations":{"sahih_international":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","pickthall":"(The night is) Peace until the rising of the dawn.","yusuf_ali":"Peace!... This until the rise of morn!","urdu":"وہ رات سراسر سلامتی ہے طلوعِ فجر تک۔","turkish":"O gece, tan yerinin ağarmasına kadar bir esenliktir.","indonesian":"Sejahteralah (malam itu) sampai terbit fajar.","french":"Elle est paix et salut jusqu’à l’apparition de l’aube.","german":"Frieden ist sie bis zum Anbruch der Morgendämmerung.","bengali":"শান্তিই শান্তি! সেই রাত-ফাজরের আবির্ভাব পর্যন্ত।","spanish":"Es una noche de paz y seguridad hasta el comienzo del alba.","malay":"Sejahteralah Malam (yang berkat) itu hingga terbit fajar!","bosnian":"sigurnost je u njoj sve dok zora ne svane."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/097005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/97/5"}}]}},{"number":98,"data":{"surah":{"number":98,"name_arabic":"البينة","name_english":"Al-Bayyinah","name_translation":"The Clear Proof","revelation_place":"madinah","revelation_order":100,"verses_count":8,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/098.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/098.mp3"}],"total_verses":8,"verses":[{"verse_key":"98:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" لَمْ يَكُنِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ مُنفَكِّينَ حَتَّىٰ تَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","transliteration":"Lam yakuni allatheena kafaroo min ahlialkitabi walmushrikeena munfakkeena hattata/tiyahumu albayyina","translations":{"sahih_international":"Those who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists were not to be parted [from misbelief] until there came to them clear evidence","pickthall":"Those who disbelieve among the People of the Scripture and the idolaters could not have left off (erring) till the clear proof came unto them,","yusuf_ali":"Those who reject (Truth), among the People of the Book and among the Polytheists, were not going to depart (from their ways) until there should come to them Clear Evidence,-","urdu":"اہلِ کتاب اور مشرکین میں سے جو لوگ کافر تھے (وہ اپنے کُفر سے) باز آنے والے نہ تھے جب تک کہ ان کے پاس دلیلِ روشن نہ آجائے","turkish":"Kitap ehlinden ve ortak koşanlardan inkarcılar, kendilerine apaçık bir belge, içinde kesin ve en doğru hükümlerin bulunduğu arınmış sahifeleri okuyan, Allah katından bir Peygamber gelene kadar dinlerinden vazgeçecek değillerdi.","indonesian":"Orang-orang yang kafir dari golongan Ahli Kitab dan orang-orang musyrik tidak akan meninggalkan (agama mereka) sampai datang kepada mereka bukti yang nyata,","french":"Les infidèles parmi les gens du Livre, ainsi que les Associateurs, ne cesseront pas de mécroire jusqu’à ce que leur vienne la Preuve évidente :","german":"Diejenigen von den Leuten der Schrift und den Götzendienern, die ungläubig sind, werden sich nicht (eher von ihrem Unglauben) lösen, bis (daß) der klare Beweis zu ihnen kommt,","bengali":"কিতাবীদের মধ্যে যারা কুফরী করেছিল এবং মুশরিকরা আপন মতে অবিচল ছিল তাদের নিকট সুস্পষ্ট প্রমান না আসা পর্যন্ত।","spanish":"No es concebible que los incrédulos, de la Gente del Libro o los idólatras, sean condenados hasta que les haya llegado una evidencia clara,","malay":"Orang-orang yang kafir dari Ahli Kitab (Yahudi dan Nasrani) serta orang-orang musyrik, tidak akan terlepas (dari kepercayaan dan amalan masing-masing) sehingga datang kepada mereka bukti yang jelas nyata, -","bosnian":"Nisu se nevjernici između sljedbenika Knjige i mnogobošci odvojili, sve dok im nije došao dokaz jasni;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/1"}},{"verse_key":"98:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"رَسُولٌ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ يَتْلُوا۟ صُحُفًا مُّطَهَّرَةً","transliteration":"Rasoolun mina Allahi yatloo suhufanmutahhara","translations":{"sahih_international":"A Messenger from Allāh, reciting purified scriptures","pickthall":"A messenger from Allah, reading purified pages","yusuf_ali":"An messenger from Allah, rehearsing scriptures kept pure and holy:","urdu":"(یعنی) اللہ کی طرف سے ایک رسُول جو پاک صحیفے پڑھ کر سُنائے","turkish":"Kitap ehlinden ve ortak koşanlardan inkarcılar, kendilerine apaçık bir belge, içinde kesin ve en doğru hükümlerin bulunduğu arınmış sahifeleri okuyan, Allah katından bir Peygamber gelene kadar dinlerinden vazgeçecek değillerdi.","indonesian":"(yaitu) seorang Rasul dari Allah (Muhammad) yang membacakan lembaran-lembaran yang suci (Alquran),","french":"un Messager, de la part d’Allah, qui leur récite des feuilles purifiées,","german":"ein Gesandter von Allah, der gereinigte Blätter verliest,","bengali":"আল্লাহর নিকট হতে এক রাসূল, যে আবৃত্তি করে পবিত্র গ্রন্থ,","spanish":"que sea un Mensajero de Dios, que les recite una revelación purificada [de toda falsedad y contradicción],","malay":"Iaitu seorang Rasul dari Allah yang membacakan (kepada mereka) Lembaran-lembaran Suci,","bosnian":"od Allaha Poslanik, koji čita listove čiste,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/2"}},{"verse_key":"98:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"فِيهَا كُتُبٌ قَيِّمَةٌ","transliteration":"Feeha kutubun qayyima","translations":{"sahih_international":"Within which are correct writings [i.e., rulings and laws].","pickthall":"Containing correct scriptures.","yusuf_ali":"Wherein are laws (or decrees) right and straight.","urdu":"جن میں بالکل راست اور درست تحریریں لکھی ہوئی ہوں","turkish":"Kitap ehlinden ve ortak koşanlardan inkarcılar, kendilerine apaçık bir belge, içinde kesin ve en doğru hükümlerin bulunduğu arınmış sahifeleri okuyan, Allah katından bir Peygamber gelene kadar dinlerinden vazgeçecek değillerdi.","indonesian":"di dalamnya terdapat (isi) kitab-kitab yang lurus (benar).","french":"dans lesquelles se trouvent des prescriptions d’une rectitude parfaite.","german":"in denen rechte Schriften sind.","bengali":"যাতে সু-প্রতিষ্ঠিত ব্যবস্থাসমূহ রয়েছে।","spanish":"que contiene preceptos de rectitud y justicia.","malay":"Terkandung di dalamnya pelajaran-pelajaran dan hukum-hukum yang benar.","bosnian":"u kojima su propisi ispravni."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/3"}},{"verse_key":"98:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَمَا تَفَرَّقَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","transliteration":"Wama tafarraqa allatheena ootooalkitaba illa min baAAdi ma jaat-humualbayyina","translations":{"sahih_international":"Nor did those who were given the Scripture become divided until after there had come to them clear evidence.","pickthall":"Nor were the People of the Scripture divided until after the clear proof came unto them.","yusuf_ali":"Nor did the People of the Book make schisms, until after there came to them Clear Evidence.","urdu":"پہلے جن لوگوں کو کتاب دی گئی تھی اُن میں تفرقہ برپا نہیں ہوا مگر اِس کے بعد کہ اُن کے پاس (راہِ راست کا) بیانِ واضح آچکا تھا۔","turkish":"Ama, kendilerine kitap verilenler, onlara apaçık belge geldikten sonra ayrılığa düştüler.","indonesian":"Dan tidaklah terpecah belah orang-orang Ahli Kitab melainkan setelah datang kepada mereka bukti yang nyata.","french":"Et ceux à qui le Livre a été donné ne se sont divisés qu’après que la preuve leur fut venue.","german":"Und diejenigen, denen die Schrift gegeben wurde, haben sich nicht eher gespalten, als bis der klare Beweis zu ihnen gekommen ist.","bengali":"যাদেরকে কিতাব দেয়া হয়েছিল তারাতো বিভক্ত হল তাদের নিকট সু-স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ আসার পর।","spanish":"Pero quienes recibieron el Libro con anterioridad [judíos, cristianos y otros] rompieron su unidad [en la fe] cuando les llegó la evidencia clara [a pesar de provenir de la misma fuente divina],","malay":"Dan orang-orang (Yahudi dan Nasrani) yang diberi Kitab (Taurat dan Injil) itu, tidak berpecah-belah melainkan setelah datang kepada mereka bukti yang jelas nyata.","bosnian":"A podvojili su se oni kojima je data Knjiga baš onda kada im je došao dokaz jasni,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/4"}},{"verse_key":"98:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَمَآ أُمِرُوٓا۟ إِلَّا لِيَعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ مُخْلِصِينَ لَهُ ٱلدِّينَ حُنَفَآءَ وَيُقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَيُؤْتُوا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ دِينُ ٱلْقَيِّمَةِ","transliteration":"Wama omiroo illa liyaAAbudooAllaha mukhliseena lahu addeena hunafaawayuqeemoo assalata wayu/too azzakatawathalika deenu alqayyima","translations":{"sahih_international":"And they were not commanded except to worship Allāh, [being] sincere to Him in religion, inclining to truth, and to establish prayer and to give zakāh. And that is the correct religion.","pickthall":"And they are ordered naught else than to serve Allah, keeping religion pure for Him, as men by nature upright, and to establish worship and to pay the poor-due. That is true religion.","yusuf_ali":"And they have been commanded no more than this: To worship Allah, offering Him sincere devotion, being true (in faith); to establish regular prayer; and to practise regular charity; and that is the Religion Right and Straight.","urdu":"اور اُن کو اِس کے سوا کوئی حکم نہیں دیا گیا تھا کہ اللہ کی بندگی کریں اپنے دین کو اُس کے لیے خالص کر کے، بالکل یَکسُو ہو کر، اور نماز قائم کریں اور زکوٰة دیں۔ یہی نہایت صحیح و درست دین ہے۔","turkish":"Oysa onlar, doğruya yönelerek, dini yalnız Allah'a has kılarak O'na kulluk etmek, namazı kılmak ve zekatı vermekle emrolunmuşlardı. Dosdoğru olan din de budur.","indonesian":"Padahal mereka hanya diperintah menyembah Allah dengan ikhlas menaati-Nya semata-mata karena (menjalankan) agama, dan juga agar melaksanakan salat dan menunaikan zakat; dan yang demikian itulah agama yang lurus (benar).","french":"Il ne leur a été commandé, cependant, que d’adorer Allah, Lui vouant un culte exclusif, d’accomplir la prière (As-Salât) et d’acquitter l'aumône (Az-Zakât). Et voilà la religion de droiture.","german":"Und nichts anderes wurde ihnen befohlen, als nur Allah zu dienen und (dabei) Ihm gegenüber aufrichtig in der Religion (zu sein), als Anhänger des rechten Glaubens, und das Gebet zu verrichten und die Abgabe zu entrichten; das ist die Religion des rechten Verhaltens.","bengali":"তারাতো আদিষ্ট হয়েছিল আল্লাহর আনুগত্যে বিশুদ্ধ চিত্ত হয়ে একনিষ্ঠভাবে তাঁর ইবাদাত করতে এবং সালাত কায়েম করতে ও যাকাত প্রদান করতে; এটাই সু-প্রতিষ্ঠিত ধর্ম।","spanish":"En la que únicamente se les ordenaba que fueran monoteístas adorando solo a Dios con sinceridad, que realizaran la oración y pagaran el zakat, pues esa es la verdadera religión.","malay":"Pada hal mereka tidak diperintahkan melainkan supaya menyembah Allah dengan mengikhlaskan ibadat kepadaNya, lagi tetap teguh di atas tauhid; dan supaya mereka mendirikan sembahyang serta memberi zakat. Dan yang demikian itulah Ugama yang benar.","bosnian":"a naređeno im je da se samo Allahu klanjaju, da Mu iskreno, kao pravovjerni, vjeru ispovijedaju, i da molitvu obavljaju, i da milostinju udjeljuju; a to je – ispravna vjera."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/5"}},{"verse_key":"98:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ فِى نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمْ شَرُّ ٱلْبَرِيَّةِ","transliteration":"Inna allatheena kafaroo min ahli alkitabiwalmushrikeena fee nari jahannama khalideenafeeha ola-ika hum sharru albariyya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, they who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists will be in the fire of Hell, abiding eternally therein. Those are the worst of creatures.","pickthall":"Lo! those who disbelieve, among the People of the Scripture and the idolaters, will abide in fire of hell. They are the worst of created beings.","yusuf_ali":"Those who reject (Truth), among the People of the Book and among the Polytheists, will be in Hell-Fire, to dwell therein (for aye). They are the worst of creatures.","urdu":"اہلِ کتاب اور مشرکین میں سے جن لوگوں نے کُفر کیا ہے وہ یقیناً جہنّم کی آگ میں جائیں گے اور ہمیشہ اس میں رہیں گے ، یہ لوگ بدترینِ خلائق ہیں۔","turkish":"Kitap ehlinden ve ortak koşanlardan inkar edenler, şüphesiz içinde temelli kalacakları cehennem ateşindedirler. İşte bunlar, yaratıkların en kötüsüdürler.","indonesian":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang kafir dari golongan Ahli Kitab dan orang-orang musyrik (akan masuk) ke neraka Jahanam; mereka kekal di dalamnya selama-lamanya. Mereka itu adalah sejahat-jahat makhluk.","french":"Les infidèles parmi les gens du Livre, ainsi que les Associateurs iront au feu de l’Enfer, pour y demeurer éternellement. De toute la création, ce sont eux les pires.","german":"Gewiß, diejenigen unter den Leuten der Schrift und den Götzendienern, die ungläubig sind, werden im Feuer der Hölle sein, ewig darin zu bleiben. Das sind die schlechtesten Geschöpfe.","bengali":"কিতাবীদের মধ্যে যারা কুফরী করে তারা এবং মুশরিকরা জাহান্নামের আগুনে স্থায়ীভাবে অবস্থান করবে; তারাই সৃষ্টির অধম।","spanish":"Quienes se hayan negado a seguir la verdad, sean Gente del Libro o idólatras, serán castigados eternamente en el fuego del Infierno. Ellos son lo peor entre todos los seres creados.","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang kafir dari Ahli Kitab dan orang-orang musyrik itu akan ditempatkan di dalam neraka Jahannam, kekalah mereka di dalamnya. Mereka itulah sejahat-jahat makhluk.","bosnian":"Oni koji ne vjeruju između sljedbenika Knjige i mnogobošci biće, sigurno, u vatri džehennemskoj, u njoj će vječno ostati; oni su najgora stvorenja."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/6"}},{"verse_key":"98:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمْ خَيْرُ ٱلْبَرِيَّةِ","transliteration":"Inna allatheena amanoowaAAamiloo assalihati ola-ika humkhayru albariyya","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, they who have believed and done righteous deeds - those are the best of creatures.","pickthall":"(And) lo! those who believe and do good works are the best of created beings.","yusuf_ali":"Those who have faith and do righteous deeds,- they are the best of creatures.","urdu":"جو لوگ ایمان لے آئے اور جنہوں نے نیک عمل کیے ، وہ یقیناً بہترین خلائق ہیں۔","turkish":"Fakat, inanıp yararlı iş işleyenler, işte onlar da, yaratıkların en iyileridirler.","indonesian":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan, mereka itulah sebaik-baik makhluk.","french":"Quant à ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres, ce sont les meilleurs de toute la création.","german":"Gewiß, diejenigen aber, die glauben und rechtschaffene Werke tun, das sind die besten Geschöpfe.","bengali":"যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে তারাই সৃষ্টির শ্রেষ্ঠ।","spanish":"En cambio, los que creen y obran rectamente son lo mejor entre todos los seres creados.","malay":"Seungguhnya orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh, mereka itulah sebaik-baik makhluk.","bosnian":"A oni koji vjeruju i čine dobra djela – oni su, zbilja, najbolja stvorenja,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/7"}},{"verse_key":"98:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"جَزَآؤُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ جَنَّـٰتُ عَدْنٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا ۖ رَّضِىَ ٱللَّهُ عَنْهُمْ وَرَضُوا۟ عَنْهُ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ لِمَنْ خَشِىَ رَبَّهُۥ","transliteration":"Jazaohum AAinda rabbihim jannatuAAadnin tajree min tahtiha al-anharu khalideenafeeha abadan radiya Allahu AAanhum waradooAAanhu thalika liman khashiya rabbah","translations":{"sahih_international":"Their reward with their Lord will be gardens of perpetual residence beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever, Allāh being pleased with them and they with Him. That is for whoever has feared his Lord.","pickthall":"Their reward is with their Lord: Gardens of Eden underneath which rivers flow, wherein they dwell for ever. Allah hath pleasure in them and they have pleasure in Him. This is (in store) for him who feareth his Lord.","yusuf_ali":"Their reward is with Allah: Gardens of Eternity, beneath which rivers flow; they will dwell therein for ever; Allah well pleased with them, and they with Him: all this for such as fear their Lord and Cherisher.","urdu":"ن کی جزا اُن کے ربّ کے ہاں دائمی قیام کی جنّتیں ہیں جن کے نیچے نہریں بہ رہی ہوں گی، وہ ان میں ہمیشہ ہمیشہ رہیں گے۔ اللہ ان سے راضی ہوا اور وہ اللہ سے راضی ہوئے۔ یہ کچھ ہے اُس شخص کے لیے جس نے اپنے ربّ کا خوف کیا ہو۔","turkish":"Onların Rableri katındaki mükafatı, içinde temelli ve sonsuz kalacakları, içlerinden ırmaklar akan Adn cennetleridir. Allah onlardan razıdır. Onlar da Allah'tan razıdır. Bu, Rabbinden korkan kimseyedir.","indonesian":"Balasan mereka di sisi Tuhan mereka ialah surga 'Ādn yang mengalir di bawahnya sungai-sungai; mereka kekal di dalamnya selama-lamanya. Allah rida terhadap mereka dan mereka pun rida kepada-Nya. Yang demikian itu adalah (balasan) bagi orang yang takut kepada Tuhannya.","french":"Leur récompense auprès d’Allah sera les Jardins de séjour, sous lesquels coulent les ruisseaux, pour y demeurer éternellement. Allah les agrée et ils L’agréent. Telle sera [la récompense] de celui qui craint son Seigneur.","german":"Ihr Lohn bei ihrem Herrn sind die Gärten Edens, durcheilt von Bächen, ewig und auf immer darin zu bleiben. Allah hat Wohlgefallen an ihnen, und sie haben Wohlgefallen an Ihm; das ist für jemanden, der seinen Herrn fürchtet.","bengali":"তাদের রবের নিকট আছে তাদের পুরস্কার স্থায়ী জান্নাত, যার নিম্নদেশে নদী প্রবাহিত, সেখানে তারা চিরস্থায়ী হবে; আল্লাহ তাদের উপর প্রসন্ন এবং তারাও তাঁর উপর সন্তুষ্ট; ইহা এ জন্য যে, তারা তাদের রাব্বকে ভয় করে।","spanish":"Ellos recibirán como recompensa de su Señor Jardines del Edén por donde corren ríos, en los que estarán eternamente. Dios estará complacido con ellos y ellos lo estarán con Él. Esto es lo que aguarda a quienes hayan tenido temor de Dios.","malay":"Balasan mereka di sisi Tuhannya ialah syurga Adn (tempat tinggal yang tetap), yang mengalir di bawahnya beberapa sungai; kekalah mereka di dalamnya selama-lamanya; Allah reda akan mereka dan merekapun reda (serta bersyukur) akan nikmat pemberianNya. Balasan yang demikian itu untuk orang-orang yang takut (melanggar perintah) Tuhannya.","bosnian":"njih nagrada u Gospodara njihova čeka; edenski vrtovi kroz koje rijeke teku, u kojima će vječno i zauvijek boraviti; Allah će biti njima zadovoljan, a i oni će biti Njime zadovoljni. To će biti za onoga koji se bude bojao Gospodara svoga."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/098008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/98/8"}}]}},{"number":99,"data":{"surah":{"number":99,"name_arabic":"الزلزلة","name_english":"Az-Zalzalah","name_translation":"The Earthquake","revelation_place":"madinah","revelation_order":93,"verses_count":8,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/099.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/099.mp3"}],"total_verses":8,"verses":[{"verse_key":"99:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" إِذَا زُلْزِلَتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ زِلْزَالَهَا","transliteration":"Itha zulzilati al-ardu zilzalaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake","pickthall":"When Earth is shaken with her (final) earthquake","yusuf_ali":"When the earth is shaken to her (utmost) convulsion,","urdu":"جب زمین اپنی پُوری شدّت کے ساتھ ہلا ڈالی جائے گی،","turkish":"Yer dehşetle sarsıldıkça sarsıldığı, yeryüzü ağırlıklarını dışarıya çıkardığı ve insanın: \"Buna ne oluyor?\" dediği zaman;","indonesian":"Apabila bumi diguncangkan dengan guncangan yang dahsyat,","french":"Quand la terre tremblera d’un violent tremblement,","german":"Wenn die Erde erschüttert wird durch ihr heftiges Beben","bengali":"পৃথিবী যখন কম্পনে প্রবলভাবে প্রকম্পিত হবে,","spanish":"Cuando la Tierra sea sacudida por el gran terremoto,","malay":"Apabila bumi digegarkan dengan gegaran yang sedahsyat-dahsyatnya,","bosnian":"Kada se Zemlja najžešćim potresom svojim potrese"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/1"}},{"verse_key":"99:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَأَخْرَجَتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ أَثْقَالَهَا","transliteration":"Waakhrajati al-ardu athqalaha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the earth discharges its burdens","pickthall":"And Earth yieldeth up her burdens,","yusuf_ali":"And the earth throws up her burdens (from within),","urdu":"اور زمین اپنے اندر کے سارے بوجھ نکال کر باہر ڈال دے گی،","turkish":"Yer dehşetle sarsıldıkça sarsıldığı, yeryüzü ağırlıklarını dışarıya çıkardığı ve insanın: \"Buna ne oluyor?\" dediği zaman;","indonesian":"dan bumi telah mengeluarkan beban-beban berat (yang dikandung)nya,","french":"et que la terre fera sortir ses fardeaux,","german":"und die Erde hervorbringt ihre Lasten","bengali":"এবং পৃথিবী যখন তার ভারসমূহ বের করে দিবে,","spanish":"y expulse su carga [haciendo surgir a los muertos de sus tumbas],","malay":"Serta bumi itu mengeluarkan segala isinya,","bosnian":"i kada Zemlja izbaci terete svoje,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/2"}},{"verse_key":"99:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَقَالَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا لَهَا","transliteration":"Waqala al-insanu ma laha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it?\" -","pickthall":"And man saith: What aileth her?","yusuf_ali":"And man cries (distressed): 'What is the matter with her?'-","urdu":"اور انسان کہے گا کہ یہ اِس کو کیا ہو رہا ہے،","turkish":"Yer dehşetle sarsıldıkça sarsıldığı, yeryüzü ağırlıklarını dışarıya çıkardığı ve insanın: \"Buna ne oluyor?\" dediği zaman;","indonesian":"dan manusia bertanya, \"Apa yang terjadi pada bumi ini?\"","french":"et que l’homme dira : \"Qu’a-t-elle ?\"","german":"und der Mensch sagt: Was ist mit ihr?,","bengali":"এবং মানুষ বলবেঃ এর কি হল?","spanish":"y el ser humano diga: “¿Qué le sucede a la Tierra?”","malay":"Dan berkatalah manusia (dengan perasaan gerun); \"Apa yang sudah terjadi kepada bumi?\"","bosnian":"i čovjek uzvikne: \"Šta joj je?!\" –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/3"}},{"verse_key":"99:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"يَوْمَئِذٍ تُحَدِّثُ أَخْبَارَهَا","transliteration":"Yawma-ithin tuhaddithu akhbaraha","translations":{"sahih_international":"That Day, it will report its news","pickthall":"That day she will relate her chronicles,","yusuf_ali":"On that Day will she declare her tidings:","urdu":"اُس روز وہ اپنے (اُوپر گزرے ہوئے) حالات بیان کرے گی،","turkish":"İşte o gün, yer, Rabbinin ona vahyetmesiyle kendi haberlerini anlatır.","indonesian":"Pada hari itu bumi menyampaikan beritanya,","french":"Ce jour-là, elle contera son histoire,","german":"an jenem Tag wird sie die Nachrichten über sich erzählen,","bengali":"সেদিন পৃথিবী তার বৃত্তান্ত বর্ণনা করবে।","spanish":"Ese día, la Tierra dará testimonio de todo cuanto sucedió sobre ella,","malay":"Pada hari itu bumipun menceritakan khabar beritanya:","bosnian":"toga Dana će ona vijesti svoje kazivati"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/4"}},{"verse_key":"99:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"بِأَنَّ رَبَّكَ أَوْحَىٰ لَهَا","transliteration":"Bi-anna rabbaka awha laha","translations":{"sahih_international":"Because your Lord has inspired [i.e., commanded] it.","pickthall":"Because thy Lord inspireth her.","yusuf_ali":"For that thy Lord will have given her inspiration.","urdu":"کیونکہ تیرے رب نے اُسے (ایساکرنے کا) حکم دیا ہوگا","turkish":"İşte o gün, yer, Rabbinin ona vahyetmesiyle kendi haberlerini anlatır.","indonesian":"karena sesungguhnya Tuhanmu telah memerintahkan (yang sedemikian itu) padanya.","french":"selon ce que ton Seigneur lui aura révélé [ordonné].","german":"weil dein Herr (es) ihr eingegeben hat.","bengali":"তোমার রাব্ব তাকে আদেশ করবেন।","spanish":"por orden de su Señor.","malay":"Bahawa Tuhanmu telah memerintahnya (berlaku demikian).","bosnian":"jer će joj Gospodar tvoj narediti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/5"}},{"verse_key":"99:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"يَوْمَئِذٍ يَصْدُرُ ٱلنَّاسُ أَشْتَاتًا لِّيُرَوْا۟ أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"Yawma-ithin yasduru annasuashtatan liyuraw aAAmalahum","translations":{"sahih_international":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds.","pickthall":"That day mankind will issue forth in scattered groups to be shown their deeds.","yusuf_ali":"On that Day will men proceed in companies sorted out, to be shown the deeds that they (had done).","urdu":"اُس روز لوگ متفرق حالت میں پلٹیں گے تاکہ اُن کے اعمال اُن کو دکھائے جائیں۔","turkish":"O gün insanlar işlerinin kendilerine gösterilmesi için bölük bölük dönerler.","indonesian":"Pada hari itu manusia keluar dari kuburnya dalam keadaan berkelompok-kelompok, untuk diperlihatkan kepada mereka (balasan) semua amal perbuatannya.","french":"Ce jour-là, les gens sortiront séparément pour que leur soient montrées leurs œuvres.","german":"An jenem Tag werden die Menschen (in Gruppen) getrennt herauskommen, damit ihnen ihre Werke gezeigt werden.","bengali":"সেদিন মানুষ দলে দলে বের হবে, কারণ তাদেরকে তাদের কৃতকর্ম দেখানো হবে।","spanish":"Entonces, los seres humanos acudirán al Día del Juicio en grupos para conocer el resultado de sus obras.","malay":"Pada hari itu manusia akan keluar berselerak (dari kubur masing-masing) - untuk diperlihatkan kepada mereka (balasan) amal-amal mereka.","bosnian":"Tog Dana će se ljudi odvojeno pojaviti da im se pokažu djela njihova;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/6"}},{"verse_key":"99:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَمَن يَعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ خَيْرًا يَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faman yaAAmal mithqala tharratinkhayran yarah","translations":{"sahih_international":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it,","pickthall":"And whoso doeth good an atom's weight will see it then,","yusuf_ali":"Then shall anyone who has done an atom's weight of good, see it!","urdu":"پھر جس نے ذرہ برابر نیکی کی ہوگی وہ اس کو دیکھ لے گا","turkish":"Kim zerre kadar iyilik yapmışsa onu görür.","indonesian":"Maka barangsiapa mengerjakan kebaikan seberat zarah, niscaya dia akan melihat (balasan)nya.","french":"Quiconque fait un bien fût-ce du poids d’un atome, le verra,","german":"Wer nun im Gewicht eines Stäubchens Gutes tut, wird es sehen.","bengali":"কেহ অণু পরিমাণ সৎ কাজ করলে তাও দেখতে পাবে।","spanish":"Quien haya realizado una obra de bien, tan pequeña como un átomo, la encontrará registrada.","malay":"Maka sesiapa berbuat kebajikan seberat zarah, nescaya akan dilihatnya (dalam surat amalnya)!","bosnian":"onaj ko bude uradio koliko trun dobra – vidjeće ga,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/7"}},{"verse_key":"99:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَمَن يَعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ شَرًّا يَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Waman yaAAmal mithqala tharratinsharran yarah","translations":{"sahih_international":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it.","pickthall":"And whoso doeth ill an atom's weight will see it then.","yusuf_ali":"And anyone who has done an atom's weight of evil, shall see it.","urdu":"اور جس نے ذرّہ برابر بدی کی ہوگی وہ اس کو دیکھ لے گا۔","turkish":"Kim de zerre kadar kötülük yapmışsa onu görür.","indonesian":"Dan barangsiapa mengerjakan kejahatan seberat zarah, niscaya dia akan melihat (balasan)nya.","french":"et quiconque fait un mal fût-ce du poids d’un atome, le verra","german":"Und wer im Gewicht eines Stäubchens Böses tut, wird es sehen.","bengali":"এবং কেহ অণু পরিমান অসৎ কাজ করলে তাও দেখতে পাবে।","spanish":"Y quien haya realizado una mala obra, tan pequeña como un átomo, la encontrará registrada.","malay":"Dan sesiapa berbuat kejahatan seberat zarah, nescaya akan dilihatnya (dalam surat amalnya)!","bosnian":"a onaj ko bude uradio koliko trun zla – vidjeće ga."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/099008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/99/8"}}]}},{"number":100,"data":{"surah":{"number":100,"name_arabic":"العاديات","name_english":"Al-'Adiyat","name_translation":"The Courser","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":14,"verses_count":11,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/100.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/100.mp3"}],"total_verses":11,"verses":[{"verse_key":"100:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلْعَـٰدِيَـٰتِ ضَبْحًا","transliteration":"WalAAadiyati dabha","translations":{"sahih_international":"By the racers, panting,","pickthall":"By the snorting courses,","yusuf_ali":"By the (Steeds) that run, with panting (breath),","urdu":"قسم ہے اُن (گھوڑوں) کی جو پھُنکارے مارتے ہوئے دَوڑتے ہیں،","turkish":"And olsun Allah yolunda koştukça koşanlara;","indonesian":"Demi kuda perang yang berlari kencang terengah-engah,","french":"Par les coursiers qui halètent,","german":"Bei den schnaubend Rennenden,","bengali":"শপথ উর্ধ্বশ্বাসে ধাবমান অশ্বরাজীর,","spanish":"Juro por los corceles que se lanzan relinchando","malay":"Demi Kuda Perang yang tangkas berlari dengan kedengaran kencang nafasnya,","bosnian":"Tako mi onih koji dahćući jure,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/1"}},{"verse_key":"100:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"فَٱلْمُورِيَـٰتِ قَدْحًا","transliteration":"Falmooriyati qadha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","pickthall":"Striking sparks of fire","yusuf_ali":"And strike sparks of fire,","urdu":"پھر (اپنی ٹاپوں سے) چِنگاریاں جھاڑتے ہیں،","turkish":"And olsun kıvılcımlar saçanlara;","indonesian":"dan kuda yang memercikkan bunga api (dengan pukulan kuku kakinya),","french":"qui font jaillir des étincelles,","german":"den (mit ihren Hufen) Funken Schlagenden,","bengali":"যারা ক্ষুরাঘাতে অগ্নি স্ফুলিংগ বিচ্ছুরিত করে।","spanish":"y arrancan chispas con sus cascos","malay":"Serta mencetuskan api dari telapak kakinya,","bosnian":"pa varnice vrcaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/2"}},{"verse_key":"100:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبْحًا","transliteration":"Falmugheerati subha","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the chargers at dawn,","pickthall":"And scouring to the raid at dawn,","yusuf_ali":"And push home the charge in the morning,","urdu":"پھر صبح سویرے چھاپہ مارتے ہیں،","turkish":"Sabah sabah akına çıkanlara;","indonesian":"dan kuda yang menyerang (dengan tiba-tiba) pada waktu pagi,","french":"qui attaquent au matin.","german":"den am Morgen Angreifenden,","bengali":"যারা অভিযান করে প্রভাতকালে,","spanish":"y sorprenden al amanecer","malay":"Dan meluru menyerbu musuh pada waktu subuh,","bosnian":"i zorom napadaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/3"}},{"verse_key":"100:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"فَأَثَرْنَ بِهِۦ نَقْعًا","transliteration":"Faatharna bihi naqAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,","pickthall":"Then, therewith, with their trail of dust,","yusuf_ali":"And raise the dust in clouds the while,","urdu":"پھر اس موقع پر گرد و غبار اڑاتے ہیں","turkish":"Ve tozu dumana katanlara;","indonesian":"sehingga menerbangkan debu,","french":"et font ainsi voler la poussière,","german":"die darin Staub aufwirbeln,","bengali":"এবং যারা ঐ সময়ে ধূলি উৎক্ষিপ্ত করে।","spanish":"levantando una nube de polvo,","malay":"Sehingga menghamburkan debu pada waktu itu,","bosnian":"i dižu tada prašinu"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/4"}},{"verse_key":"100:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَوَسَطْنَ بِهِۦ جَمْعًا","transliteration":"Fawasatna bihi jamAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,","pickthall":"Cleaving, as one, the centre (of the foe),","yusuf_ali":"And penetrate forthwith into the midst (of the foe) en masse;-","urdu":"پھر اِسی حالت میں کسی مجمع کے اندر جا گھستے ہیں","turkish":"Düşman topluluğunun içine dalanlara ki:","indonesian":"lalu menyerbu ke tengah-tengah kumpulan musuh,","french":"et pénètrent au centre de la troupe ennemie.","german":"die dann mitten in die Ansammlung eindringen!","bengali":"অতঃপর শত্রুদলের অভ্যন্তরে ঢুকে পড়ে।","spanish":"e irrumpiendo en las filas del enemigo,","malay":"Lalu menggempur ketika itu di tengah-tengah kumpulan musuh;","bosnian":"pa u njoj u gomilu upadaju –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/5"}},{"verse_key":"100:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌ","transliteration":"Inna al-insana lirabbihi lakanood","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","pickthall":"Lo! man is an ingrate unto his Lord","yusuf_ali":"Truly man is, to his Lord, ungrateful;","urdu":"حقیقت یہ ہے کہ انسان اپنے ربّ کا بڑا ناشکرا ہے،","turkish":"İnsan gerçekten Rabbine karşı pek nankördür.","indonesian":"sungguh, manusia itu sangat ingkar, (tidak bersyukur) kepada Tuhannya,","french":"L’homme est, certes, ingrat envers son Seigneur ;","german":"Der Mensch ist seinem Herrn gegenüber wahrlich undankbar,","bengali":"মানুষ অবশ্যই তার রবের প্রতি অকৃতজ্ঞ,","spanish":"que el ser humano es ingrato con su Señor.","malay":"Sesungguhnya manusia sangat tidak bersyukur akan nikmat Tuhannya.","bosnian":"čovjek je, zaista, Gospodaru svome nezahvalan"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/6"}},{"verse_key":"100:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌ","transliteration":"Wa-innahu AAala thalikalashaheed","translations":{"sahih_international":"And indeed, he is to that a witness.","pickthall":"And lo! he is a witness unto that;","yusuf_ali":"And to that (fact) he bears witness (by his deeds);","urdu":"اور وہ خود اِس پر گواہ ہے،","turkish":"Doğrusu kendisi de bunların hepsine şahittir.","indonesian":"dan sesungguhnya dia (manusia) menyaksikan (mengakui) keingkarannya,","french":"et pourtant, il est certes, témoin de cela ;","german":"und er (selbst) ist darüber wahrlich Zeuge.","bengali":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই সে নিজেই এ বিষয়ের সাক্ষী।","spanish":"Y él mismo es testigo de ello,","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya ia (dengan bawaannya) menerangkan dengan jelas keadaan yang demikian;","bosnian":"i sam je on toga, doista, svjestan,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/7"}},{"verse_key":"100:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","transliteration":"Wa-innahu lihubbi alkhayri lashadeed","translations":{"sahih_international":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.","pickthall":"And lo! in the love of wealth he is violent.","yusuf_ali":"And violent is he in his love of wealth.","urdu":"اور وہ مال و دولت کی محبت میں بُری طرح مُبتلا ہے۔","turkish":"Gerçekten mala da pek düşkündür.","indonesian":"dan sesungguhnya cintanya kepada harta benar-benar berlebihan.","french":"et pour l’amour des richesses il est certes ardent.","german":"Und er ist in seiner Liebe zum (eigenen) Besten wahrlich heftig.","bengali":"এবং অবশ্যই সে ধন সম্পদের আসক্তিতে অত্যন্ত কঠিন।","spanish":"porque tiene una codicia apasionada por los bienes materiales.","malay":"Dan sesungguhnya ia melampau sangat sayangkan harta (secara tamak haloba).","bosnian":"i on je, zato što voli bogatstvo – radiša."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/8"}},{"verse_key":"100:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","transliteration":"Afala yaAAlamu itha buAAthira mafee alquboor","translations":{"sahih_international":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","pickthall":"Knoweth he not that, when the contents of the graves are poured forth","yusuf_ali":"Does he not know,- when that which is in the graves is scattered abroad","urdu":"تو کیا وہ اُس وقت کو نہیں جانتا جب قبروں میں جو کچھ (مدفون) ہے اُسے نکال لیا جائے گا،","turkish":"İnsan, kabirlerde bulunanların çıkarılacağı ve kalblerde olanların ortaya konulacağı bir zamanın geleceğini bilmez mi?","indonesian":"Maka tidakkah dia mengetahui apabila apa yang di dalam kubur dikeluarkan,","french":"Ne sait-il donc pas que lorsque ce qui est dans les tombes sera bouleversé,","german":"Weiß er denn nicht? Wenn durchwühlt wird, was in den Gräbern ist,","bengali":"তবে কি সে সেই সম্পর্কে অবহিত নয় যে, কবরে যা আছে তা কখন উত্থিত হবে?","spanish":"¿Acaso no sabe que cuando se haga surgir a quienes están en las sepulturas","malay":"(Patutkah ia bersikap demikian?) Tidakkah ia mengetahui (bagaimana keadaan) ketika dibongkarkan segala yang ada dalam kubur?","bosnian":"A zar on ne zna da će, kada budu oživljeni oni koji su u grobovima"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/9"}},{"verse_key":"100:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"Wahussila ma fee assudoor","translations":{"sahih_international":"And that within the breasts is obtained,","pickthall":"And the secrets of the breasts are made known,","yusuf_ali":"And that which is (locked up) in (human) breasts is made manifest-","urdu":"اور سینوں میں جو کچھ (مخفی) ہے اُسے بر آمد کر کے اس کی جانچ پڑتال کی جائے گی؟","turkish":"İnsan, kabirlerde bulunanların çıkarılacağı ve kalblerde olanların ortaya konulacağı bir zamanın geleceğini bilmez mi?","indonesian":"dan apa yang tersimpan di dalam dada dikeluarkan?","french":"et que sera dévoilé ce qui est dans les poitrines,","german":"und herausgeholt wird, was in den Brüsten ist,...","bengali":"এবং অন্তরে যা আছে তা প্রকাশ করা হবে?","spanish":"y se evidencie lo que hay en los corazones,","malay":"Dan dikumpul serta didedahkan segala yang terpendam dalam dada?","bosnian":"i kada iziđe na vidjelo ono što je u srcima,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/10"}},{"verse_key":"100:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"Inna rabbahum bihim yawma-ithinlakhabeer","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Aware.","pickthall":"On that day will their Lord be perfectly informed concerning them.","yusuf_ali":"That their Lord had been Well-acquainted with them, (even to) that Day?","urdu":"یقیناً اُن کا ربّ اُس روز اُن سے خوب باخبر ہوگا۔","turkish":"Doğrusu Rableri o gün onların her şeyinden haberdardır.","indonesian":"sungguh, Tuhan mereka pada hari itu Mahateliti terhadap keadaan mereka.","french":"ce jour-là, certes, leur Seigneur sera Parfaitement Connaisseur d’eux ?","german":"ihr Herr wird an jenem Tag ihrer wahrlich Kundig sein.","bengali":"সেদিন তাদের কি ঘটবে, তাদের রাব্ব অবশ্যই তা সবিশেষ অবহিত।","spanish":"ese día su Señor estará bien informado de lo que hicieron?","malay":"Sesungguhnya Tuhan mereka Maha Mengetahui dengan mendalam tentang (balasan yang diberikanNya kepada) mereka - pada hari itu.","bosnian":"Gospodar njihov toga Dana, sigurno, sve znati o njima?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/100011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/100/11"}}]}},{"number":101,"data":{"surah":{"number":101,"name_arabic":"القارعة","name_english":"Al-Qari'ah","name_translation":"The Calamity","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":30,"verses_count":11,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/101.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/101.mp3"}],"total_verses":11,"verses":[{"verse_key":"101:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"AlqariAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"The Striking Calamity -","pickthall":"The Calamity!","yusuf_ali":"The (Day) of Noise and Clamour:","urdu":"عظیم حادثہ!","turkish":"Gürültü koparacak olan","indonesian":"Hari Kiamat,","french":"Le fracas!","german":"Das Verhängnis!","bengali":"মহা প্রলয়।","spanish":"El evento repentino.","malay":"Hari yang menggemparkan,","bosnian":"Smak svijeta!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/1"}},{"verse_key":"101:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Ma alqariAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"What is the Striking Calamity?","pickthall":"What is the Calamity?","yusuf_ali":"What is the (Day) of Noise and Clamour?","urdu":"کیا ہے وہ عظیم حادثہ؟","turkish":"Nedir o gürültü koparacak olan?","indonesian":"Apakah hari Kiamat itu?","french":"Qu’est-ce que le fracas?","german":"Was ist das Verhängnis?","bengali":"মহা প্রলয় কী?","spanish":"¿Qué es el evento repentino?","malay":"Apa dia hari yang menggemparkan itu?","bosnian":"Šta je Smak svijeta?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/2"}},{"verse_key":"101:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alqariAAa","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Calamity is!","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what the (Day) of Noise and Clamour is?","urdu":"تم کیا جانو کہ وہ عظیم حادثہ کیا ہے؟","turkish":"O gürültü koparacak olanın ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah hari Kiamat itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est le fracas?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was das Verhängnis ist?","bengali":"মহা প্রলয় সম্বন্ধে তুমি কী জান?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará comprender la magnitud del evento repentino?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui kedahsyatan hari yang menggemparkan itu? -","bosnian":"i šta ti znaš o Smaku svijeta?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/3"}},{"verse_key":"101:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","transliteration":"Yawma yakoonu annasu kalfarashialmabthooth","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","pickthall":"A day wherein mankind will be as thickly-scattered moths","yusuf_ali":"(It is) a Day whereon men will be like moths scattered about,","urdu":"وہ دن جب لوگ بکھرے ہوئے پروانوں کی طرح","turkish":"O gün insanlar, ateş etrafında çırpınıp dökülen pervaneye dönecekler.","indonesian":"Pada hari itu manusia seperti laron yang beterbangan,","french":"C’est le jour où les gens seront comme des papillons éparpillés,","german":"Am Tag, da die Menschen wie flatternde Motten sein werden","bengali":"সেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত।","spanish":"Ese día la gente parecerá mariposas dispersas,","malay":"(Hari itu ialah: hari kiamat), hari manusia menjadi seperti kelkatu yang terbang berkeliaran,","bosnian":"Toga dana će ljudi biti kao leptiri raštrkani,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/4"}},{"verse_key":"101:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","transliteration":"Watakoonu aljibalu kalAAihnialmanfoosh","translations":{"sahih_international":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","pickthall":"And the mountains will become as carded wool.","yusuf_ali":"And the mountains will be like carded wool.","urdu":"اور پہاڑ رنگ برنگ کے دُھنکے ہوئے اُون کی طرح ہوں گے۔","turkish":"Dağlar, atılmış renkli yüne benzeyecekler.","indonesian":"dan gunung-gunung seperti bulu yang dihambur-hamburkan.","french":"et les montagnes comme de la laine cardée ;","german":"und die Berge wie zerflockte gefärbte Wolle sein werden.","bengali":"এবং পর্বতসমূহ হবে ধূনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।","spanish":"y las montañas copos de lana cardada.","malay":"Dan gunung-ganang menjadi seperti bulu yang dibusar berterbangan.","bosnian":"a planine kao šarena vuna iščupanā."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/5"}},{"verse_key":"101:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Faamma man thaqulat mawazeenuh","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","pickthall":"Then, as for him whose scales are heavy (with good works),","yusuf_ali":"Then, he whose balance (of good deeds) will be (found) heavy,","urdu":"پھر جس کے پلڑے بھاری ہوں گے","turkish":"Ama tartıları ağır gelen kimse hoş bir hayat içinde olacaktır.","indonesian":"Maka adapun orang yang berat timbangan (kebaikan)nya,","french":"quant à celui dont la balance sera lourde.","german":"Was nun jemanden angeht, dessen Waagschalen schwer sind,","bengali":"তখন যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে –","spanish":"Aquel cuyas obras buenas sean más pesadas en la balanza","malay":"Setelah berlaku demikian, maka (manusia akan diberikan tempatnya menurut amal masing-masing); adapun orang yang berat timbangan amal baiknya, -","bosnian":"Onaj u koga njegova djela budu teška –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/6"}},{"verse_key":"101:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ","transliteration":"Fahuwa fee AAeeshatin radiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"He will be in a pleasant life.","pickthall":"He will live a pleasant life.","yusuf_ali":"Will be in a life of good pleasure and satisfaction.","urdu":"وہ دل پسند عیش میں ہوگا","turkish":"Ama tartıları ağır gelen kimse hoş bir hayat içinde olacaktır.","indonesian":"maka dia berada dalam kehidupan yang memuaskan (senang).","french":"il sera dans une vie agréable ;","german":"so wird er in einem zufriedenen Leben sein.","bengali":"সেতো লাভ করবে প্রীতিপদ জীবন।","spanish":"gozará de una vida placentera.","malay":"Maka ia berada dalam kehidupan yang senang lenang.","bosnian":"u ugodnu životu će živjeti,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/7"}},{"verse_key":"101:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Waamma man khaffat mawazeenuh","translations":{"sahih_international":"But as for one whose scales are light,","pickthall":"But as for him whose scales are light,","yusuf_ali":"But he whose balance (of good deeds) will be (found) light,-","urdu":"اور جس کے پلڑے ہلکے ہوں گے","turkish":"Tartıları hafif gelenler ise,","indonesian":"Dan adapun orang yang ringan timbangan (kebaikan)nya,","french":"et quant à celui dont la balance sera légère,","german":"Was aber jemanden angeht, dessen Waagschalen leicht sind,","bengali":"এবং যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে –","spanish":"En cambio, aquel cuyas obras buenas sean más livianas en la balanza,","malay":"Sebaliknya orang yang ringan timbangan amal baiknya, -","bosnian":"a onaj u koga njegova djela budu lahka –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/8"}},{"verse_key":"101:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌ","transliteration":"Faommuhu hawiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"His refuge will be an abyss.","pickthall":"A bereft and Hungry One will be his mother,","yusuf_ali":"Will have his home in a (bottomless) Pit.","urdu":"اس کی جائے قرار گہری کھائی ہوگی۔","turkish":"Onların yeri bir çukurdur.","indonesian":"maka tempat kembalinya adalah neraka Hāwiyah.","french":"sa mère [destination] est un abîme très profond.","german":"dessen Mutter wird ein Abgrund sein.","bengali":"তার স্থান হবে হা’বিয়াহ।","spanish":"su morada estará en el abismo.","malay":"Maka tempat kembalinya ialah \"Haawiyah\"","bosnian":"boravište će mu bezdan biti."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/9"}},{"verse_key":"101:10","ayah":10,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma hiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what that is?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what she is! -","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee what this is?","urdu":"اور تمہیں کیا خبر کہ وہ کیا چیز ہے؟","turkish":"O çukurun ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah neraka Hāwiyah itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce que c’est ?","german":"Und was läßt dich wissen, was das ist?","bengali":"ওটা কি, তা কি তুমি জান?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará comprender qué es el abismo?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui, apa dia \"Haawiyah\" itu?","bosnian":"A znaš li ti šta će to biti? –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101010.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/10"}},{"verse_key":"101:11","ayah":11,"arabic":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","transliteration":"Narun hamiya","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","pickthall":"Raging Fire.","yusuf_ali":"(It is) a Fire Blazing fiercely!","urdu":"بھڑکتی ہوئی آگ۔","turkish":"O, kızgın bir ateştir.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) api yang sangat panas.","french":"C’est un Feu ardent.","german":"Ein sehr heißes Feuer.","bengali":"ওটা অতি উত্তপ্ত অগ্নি।","spanish":"Es un fuego abrasador.","malay":"(Haawiyah itu ialah): api yang panas membakar.","bosnian":"Vatra užarena!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/101011.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/101/11"}}]}},{"number":102,"data":{"surah":{"number":102,"name_arabic":"التكاثر","name_english":"At-Takathur","name_translation":"The Rivalry in world increase","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":16,"verses_count":8,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/102.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/102.mp3"}],"total_verses":8,"verses":[{"verse_key":"102:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","transliteration":"Alhakumu attakathur","translations":{"sahih_international":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","pickthall":"Rivalry in worldly increase distracteth you","yusuf_ali":"The mutual rivalry for piling up (the good things of this world) diverts you (from the more serious things),","urdu":"تم لوگوں کو زیادہ سے زیادہ اور ایک دُوسرے سے بڑھ کر دنیا حاصل کرنے کی دُھن نے غفلت میں ڈال رکھا ہے","turkish":"Çoğunluk olmak iddianız sizi o kadar meşgul etti ki, mezarları ziyaretle oradakileri de sayacak kadar oldunuz.","indonesian":"Bermegah-megahan telah melalaikan kamu,","french":"La course aux richesses vous distrait,","german":"Die Vermehrung lenkt euch ab,","bengali":"প্রাচুর্যের প্রতিযোগিতা তোমাদেরকে মোহাচ্ছন্ন করে রাখে,","spanish":"El afán de tener más y más os domina","malay":"Kamu telah dilalaikan (daripada mengerjakan amal bakti) oleh perbuatan berlumba-lumba untuk mendapat dengan sebanyak-banyaknya (harta benda, anak-pinak pangkat dan pengaruh), -","bosnian":"Zaokuplja vas nastojanje da što imućniji budete"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/1"}},{"verse_key":"102:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","transliteration":"Hatta zurtumu almaqabir","translations":{"sahih_international":"Until you visit the graveyards.","pickthall":"Until ye come to the graves.","yusuf_ali":"Until ye visit the graves.","urdu":"یہاں تک کہ (اِسی فکر میں) تم لبِ گور تک پہنچ جاتے ہو۔","turkish":"Çoğunluk olmak iddianız sizi o kadar meşgul etti ki, mezarları ziyaretle oradakileri de sayacak kadar oldunuz.","indonesian":"sampai kamu masuk ke dalam kubur.","french":"jusqu’à ce que vous visitiez les tombes.","german":"bis ihr die Friedhöfe besucht.","bengali":"যতক্ষণ না তোমরা কাবরসমূহে উপস্থিত হচ্ছ।","spanish":"hasta que la muerte os sorprenda y entréis en la tumba.","malay":"Sehingga kamu masuk kubur.","bosnian":"sve dok grobove ne naselite."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/2"}},{"verse_key":"102:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Kalla sawfa taAAlamoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! You are going to know.","pickthall":"Nay, but ye will come to know!","yusuf_ali":"But nay, ye soon shall know (the reality).","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، عنقریب تم کو معلوم ہو جائے گا۔","turkish":"Hayır; öyle olmayın; yakında bileceksiniz.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Kelak kamu akan mengetahui (akibat perbuatanmu itu),","french":"Mais non ! Vous saurez bientôt !","german":"Keineswegs! Ihr werdet (es noch) erfahren.","bengali":"এটা সংগত নয়, তোমরা শীঘ্রই এটা জানতে পারবে।","spanish":"¡No deberíais comportaros así! Ya os vais a enterar [que obrar para la otra vida es superior].","malay":"Jangan sekali-kali (bersikap demikian)! Kamu akan mengetahui kelak (akibatnya yang buruk semasa hendak mati)!","bosnian":"A ne valja tako, saznaćete svakako!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/3"}},{"verse_key":"102:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then, no! You are going to know.","pickthall":"Nay, but ye will come to know!","yusuf_ali":"Again, ye soon shall know!","urdu":"پھر (سن لو کہ) ہرگز نہیں، عنقریب تم کو معلوم ہو جائے گا","turkish":"Hayır; gözünüzü açın; yakında bileceksiniz.","indonesian":"kemudian sekali-kali tidak! Kelak kamu akan mengetahui.","french":"(Encore une fois) ! Vous saurez bientôt !","german":"Abermals: Keineswegs! Ihr werdet (es noch) erfahren.","bengali":"আবার বলি, এটা সংগত নয়, তোমরা শীঘ্রই এটা জানতে পারবে।","spanish":"Una vez más: ¡No deberíais comportaros así! Ya os vais a enterar [que obrar para la otra vida es superior].","malay":"Sekali lagi (diingatkan): jangan sekali-kali (kamu bersikap demikian)! Kamu akan mengetahui kelak akibatnya yang buruk pada hari kiamat)!","bosnian":"I još jednom, ne valja tako! Saznaćete sigurno!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/4"}},{"verse_key":"102:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","pickthall":"Nay, would that ye knew (now) with a sure knowledge!","yusuf_ali":"Nay, were ye to know with certainty of mind, (ye would beware!)","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، اگر تم یقینی علم کی حیثیت سے (اِس روش کے انجام کو) جانتے ہوتے (تو تمہارا یہ طرز عمل نہ ہوتا)","turkish":"Dikkat edin, şayet yaptığınızın sonucunu kesin olarak bir bilseniz!","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Sekiranya kamu mengetahui dengan pasti,","french":"Sûrement ! Si vous saviez de science certaine.","german":"Keineswegs! Wenn ihr es nur mit dem Wissen der Gewißheit wüßtet!","bengali":"সাবধান! তোমাদের নিশ্চিত জ্ঞান থাকলে অবশ্যই তোমরা মোহাচ্ছন্ন হতেনা।","spanish":"Si hubierais sabido con certeza [el castigo de quienes consumen su vida en el afán de tener más y más, habríais cambiado el rumbo de vuestras vidas].","malay":"Demi sesungguhnya! Kalaulah kamu mengetahui - (apa yang kamu akan hadapi) - dengan pengetahuan yang yakin, (tentulah kamu akan mengerjakan perkara-perkara yang menjadi bekalan kamu untuk hari akhirat).","bosnian":"Ne valja tako, neka znate pouzdano,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/5"}},{"verse_key":"102:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","transliteration":"Latarawunna aljaheem","translations":{"sahih_international":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","pickthall":"For ye will behold hell-fire.","yusuf_ali":"Ye shall certainly see Hell-Fire!","urdu":"تم دوزخ دیکھ کر رہو گے","turkish":"And olsun ki, cehennemi göreceksiniz.","indonesian":"niscaya kamu benar-benar akan melihat neraka Jahim,","french":"Vous verrez, certes, la Fournaise.","german":"Ihr werdet ganz gewiß den Höllenbrand sehen.","bengali":"তোমরাতো জাহান্নাম দেখবেই।","spanish":"Habréis de ver el fuego del Infierno,","malay":"(Ingatlah) demi sesungguhnya! - Kamu akan melihat neraka yang marak menjulang.","bosnian":"Džehennem ćete vidjeti jasno!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/6"}},{"verse_key":"102:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","pickthall":"Aye, ye will behold it with sure vision.","yusuf_ali":"Again, ye shall see it with certainty of sight!","urdu":"پھر (سن لو کہ) تم بالکل یقین کے ساتھ اُسے دیکھ لو گے","turkish":"And olsun ki, onu gözünüzle kesin olarak göreceksiniz.","indonesian":"kemudian kamu benar-benar akan melihatnya dengan mata kepala sendiri,","french":"Puis, vous la verrez certes, avec l’œil de certitude.","german":"Abermals: Ihr werdet ihn mit dem Auge der Gewißheit sehen.","bengali":"আবার বলি, তোমরাতো ওটা দেখবেই চাক্ষুষ প্রত্যয়ে।","spanish":"y lo veréis con los ojos de la certeza.","malay":"Selepas itu - demi sesungguhnya! - kamu (wahai orang-orang yang derhaka) akan melihatnya dengan penglihatan yang yakin (semasa kamu dilemparkan ke dalamnya)!","bosnian":"I još jednom, doista ćete ga vidjeti očigledno!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/7"}},{"verse_key":"102:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"Thumma latus-alunna yawma-ithin AAaniannaAAeem","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","pickthall":"Then, on that day, ye will be asked concerning pleasure.","yusuf_ali":"Then, shall ye be questioned that Day about the joy (ye indulged in!).","urdu":"پھر ضرور اُس روز تم سے اِن نعمتوں کے بارے میں جواب طلبی کی جائے گی۔","turkish":"Sonra o gün, size verilmiş olan her nimetten sorguya çekileceksiniz.","indonesian":"kemudian kamu benar-benar akan ditanya pada hari itu tentang kenikmatan (yang megah di dunia itu).","french":"Puis, assurément, vous serez interrogés, ce jour-là, sur les délices.","german":"Hierauf werdet ihr an jenem Tag ganz gewiß nach der Wonne gefragt werden.","bengali":"এরপর অবশ্যই সেদিন তোমরা সুখ সম্পদ সম্বন্ধে জিজ্ঞাসিত হবে।","spanish":"Luego, ese día [del Juicio] se os preguntará por cada bendición que habéis recibido [durante la vida mundanal].","malay":"Selain dari itu, sesungguhnya kamu akan ditanya pada hari itu, tentang segala nikmat (yang kamu telah menikmatinya)!","bosnian":"Zatim ćete toga dana za sladak život biti pitani sigurno!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/102008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/102/8"}}]}},{"number":103,"data":{"surah":{"number":103,"name_arabic":"العصر","name_english":"Al-'Asr","name_translation":"The Declining Day","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":13,"verses_count":3,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/103.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/103.mp3"}],"total_verses":3,"verses":[{"verse_key":"103:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَٱلْعَصْرِ","transliteration":"WalAAasr","translations":{"sahih_international":"By time,","pickthall":"By the declining day,","yusuf_ali":"By (the Token of) Time (through the ages),","urdu":"زمانے کی قسم","turkish":"İkindi vaktine (Asra; çağa) and olsun ki,","indonesian":"Demi masa.","french":"Par le Temps !","german":"Beim Zeitalter!","bengali":"মহাকালের শপথ!","spanish":"Juro por el tiempo","malay":"Demi Masa!","bosnian":"Tako mi vremena –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/103001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/103/1"}},{"verse_key":"103:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَفِى خُسْرٍ","transliteration":"Inna al-insana lafee khusr","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, mankind is in loss,","pickthall":"Lo! man is a state of loss,","yusuf_ali":"Verily Man is in loss,","urdu":"انسان درحقیقت بڑے خسارے میں ہے","turkish":"İnsan hiç şüphesiz hüsran içindedir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, manusia berada dalam kerugian,","french":"L’homme est certes, en perdition,","german":"Der Mensch befindet sich wahrlich in Verlust,","bengali":"মানুষ অবশ্যই ক্ষতির মধ্যে রয়েছে।","spanish":"que los seres humanos están en la perdición,","malay":"Sesungguhnya manusia itu dalam kerugian -","bosnian":"čovjek, doista, gubi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/103002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/103/2"}},{"verse_key":"103:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoowaAAamiloo assalihati watawasaw bilhaqqiwatawasaw bissabr","translations":{"sahih_international":"Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience.","pickthall":"Save those who believe and do good works, and exhort one another to truth and exhort one another to endurance.","yusuf_ali":"Except such as have Faith, and do righteous deeds, and (join together) in the mutual teaching of Truth, and of Patience and Constancy.","urdu":"سوائے اُن لوگوں کے جو ایمان لائے، اور نیک اعمال کرتے رہے، اور ایک دوسرے کو حق کی نصیحت اور صبر کی تلقین کرتے رہے۔","turkish":"Ancak inanıp yararlı iş işleyenler, birbirlerine gerçeği tavsiye edenler ve sabırlı olmayı tavsiye edenler bunun dışındadır.","indonesian":"kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan serta saling menasihati untuk kebenaran dan saling menasihati untuk kesabaran.","french":"sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres, s’enjoignent mutuellement la vérité et s’enjoignent mutuellement l’endurance.","german":"außer denjenigen, die glauben und rechtschaffene Werke tun und einander die Wahrheit eindringlich empfehlen und einander die Standhaftigkeit eindringlich empfehlen.","bengali":"কিন্তু তারা নয়, যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে এবং পরস্পরকে সত্যের উপদেশ দেয় ও ধৈর্য ধারণে পরস্পরকে উদ্ধুদ্ধ করে।","spanish":"excepto aquellos que crean, obren rectamente, y se aconsejen mutuamente con la verdad y con la paciencia [ante las adversidades].","malay":"Kecuali orang-orang yang beriman dan beramal soleh, dan mereka pula berpesan-pesan dengan kebenaran serta berpesan-pesan dengan sabar.","bosnian":"samo ne oni koji vjeruju i dobra djela čine, i koji jedni drugima istinu preporučuju i koji jedni drugima preporučuju strpljenje."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/103003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/103/3"}}]}},{"number":104,"data":{"surah":{"number":104,"name_arabic":"الهمزة","name_english":"Al-Humazah","name_translation":"The Traducer","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":32,"verses_count":9,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/104.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/104.mp3"}],"total_verses":9,"verses":[{"verse_key":"104:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ","transliteration":"Waylun likulli humazatin lumaza","translations":{"sahih_international":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","pickthall":"Woe unto every slandering traducer,","yusuf_ali":"Woe to every (kind of) scandal-monger and-backbiter,","urdu":"تباہی ہے ہر اُس شخص کے لیے جو (مُنہ در مُنہ) لوگوں پر طعن اور (پیٹھ پیچھے) بُرائیاں کرنے کا خوگر ہے۔","turkish":"Mal toplayarak onu tekrar tekrar sayan, diliyle çekiştirip alay eden kimsenin vay haline!","indonesian":"Celakalah bagi setiap pengumpat dan pencela,","french":"Malheur à tout calomniateur diffamateur,","german":"Wehe jedem Stichler und Nörgler,","bengali":"দুর্ভোগ প্রত্যেকের, যে পশ্চাতে ও সম্মুখে লোকের নিন্দা করে,","spanish":"¡Ay del castigo que les aguarda al difamador y al calumniador,","malay":"Kecelakaan besar bagi tiap-tiap pencaci, pengeji,","bosnian":"Teško svakom klevetniku-podrugljivcu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/1"}},{"verse_key":"104:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Allathee jamaAAa malanwaAAaddadah","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","pickthall":"Who hath gathered wealth (of this world) and arranged it.","yusuf_ali":"Who pileth up wealth and layeth it by,","urdu":"جس نے مال جمع کیا اور اُسے گِن گِن کر رکھا۔","turkish":"Mal toplayarak onu tekrar tekrar sayan, diliyle çekiştirip alay eden kimsenin vay haline!","indonesian":"yang mengumpulkan harta dan menghitung-hitungnya,","french":"qui amasse une fortune et la compte,","german":"der Besitz zusammenträgt und ihn zählt und immer wieder zählt,","bengali":"যে অর্থ জমায় ও তা গুণে গুণে রাখে।","spanish":"al que acumula bienes materiales y los cuenta una y otra vez,","malay":"Yang mengumpulkan harta dan berulang-ulang menghitung kekayaannya;","bosnian":"koji blago gomila i prebrojava ga,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/2"}},{"verse_key":"104:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Yahsabu anna malahu akhladah","translations":{"sahih_international":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","pickthall":"He thinketh that his wealth will render him immortal.","yusuf_ali":"Thinking that his wealth would make him last for ever!","urdu":"وہ سمجھتا ہے کہ اُس کا مال ہمیشہ اُس کے پاس رہے گا۔","turkish":"Malının kendisini ölümsüz kılacağını sanır.","indonesian":"dia (manusia) mengira bahwa hartanya itu dapat mengekalkannya.","french":"pensant que sa fortune l’immortalisera.","german":"wobei er meint, daß sein Besitz ihn ewig leben ließe!","bengali":"সে ধারণা করে যে, তার অর্থ তাকে অমর করে রাখবে।","spanish":"creyendo que su riqueza lo hará vivir eternamente!","malay":"Ia menyangka bahawa hartanya itu dapat mengekalkannya (dalam dunia ini)!","bosnian":"i misli da će ga blago njegovo besmrtnim učiniti!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/3"}},{"verse_key":"104:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","transliteration":"Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutama","translations":{"sahih_international":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","pickthall":"Nay, but verily he will be flung to the Consuming One.","yusuf_ali":"By no means! He will be sure to be thrown into That which Breaks to Pieces,","urdu":"ہرگز نہیں، وہ شخص تو چَکنا چُور کر دینے والی جگہ میں پھینک دیا جائے گا۔","turkish":"Hayır; o, and olsun ki, Hutame'ye atılacaktır.","indonesian":"Sekali-kali tidak! Pasti dia akan dilemparkan ke dalam (neraka) Ḥuṭamah.","french":"Mais non ! Il sera certes, jeté dans la Hutamah.","german":"Keineswegs! Er wird ganz gewiß in al-Hutama geworfen werden.","bengali":"কখনও না, সে অবশ্যই নিক্ষিপ্ত হবে হুতামায়।","spanish":"Por el contrario, serán arrojados en un fuego demoledor.","malay":"Tidak! Sesungguhnya dia akan dicampakkan ke dalam \"Al-Hutamah\".","bosnian":"A ne valja tako! On će, sigurno, biti bačen u Džehennem!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/4"}},{"verse_key":"104:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alhutama","translations":{"sahih_international":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","pickthall":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Consuming One is!","yusuf_ali":"And what will explain to thee That which Breaks to Pieces?","urdu":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ کیا ہے وہ چکنا چور کر دینے والی جگہ؟","turkish":"Hutame'nin ne olduğunu sen bilir misin?","indonesian":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah (neraka) Ḥuṭamah itu?","french":"Et qui te dira ce qu’est la Hutamah ?","german":"Was läßt dich wissen, was al-Hutama ist?","bengali":"হুতামা কী, তা কি তুমি জান?","spanish":"¿Y qué te hará comprender lo que es un fuego demoledor?","malay":"Dan apa jalannya engkau dapat mengetahui, apa dia \"Al-Hutamah\" itu?","bosnian":"A znaš li ti šta je Džehennem?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/5"}},{"verse_key":"104:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","transliteration":"Naru Allahi almooqada","translations":{"sahih_international":"It is the fire of Allāh, [eternally] fueled,","pickthall":"(It is) the fire of Allah, kindled,","yusuf_ali":"(It is) the Fire of (the Wrath of) Allah kindled (to a blaze),","urdu":"اللہ کی آگ، خُوب بھڑکائی ہوئی","turkish":"O, yüreklere çökecek olan, Allah'ın tutuşturulmuş ateşidir.","indonesian":"(Yaitu) api (azab) Allah yang dinyalakan,","french":"Le Feu attisé d’Allah.","german":"(Sie ist) Allahs entfachtes Feuer,","bengali":"ওটা আল্লাহর প্রজ্জ্বলিত হুতাশন –","spanish":"Es un fuego encendido por Dios","malay":"(Al-Hutamah) ialah api Allah yang dinyalakan (dengan perintahNya), -","bosnian":"Vatra Allahova razbuktana,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/6"}},{"verse_key":"104:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","transliteration":"Allatee tattaliAAu AAalaal-af-ida","translations":{"sahih_international":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","pickthall":"Which leapeth up over the hearts (of men).","yusuf_ali":"The which doth mount (Right) to the Hearts:","urdu":"جو دلوں تک پہنچے گی۔","turkish":"O, yüreklere çökecek olan, Allah'ın tutuşturulmuş ateşidir.","indonesian":"yang (membakar) sampai ke hati.","french":"qui monte jusqu’aux cœurs.","german":"das Einblick in die Herzen gewinnt.","bengali":"যা হৃদয়কে গ্রাস করবে।","spanish":"cuyo dolor alcanza los corazones.","malay":"Yang naik menjulang ke hati;","bosnian":"koja će do srcā dopirati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/7"}},{"verse_key":"104:8","ayah":8,"arabic":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ","transliteration":"lnnaha AAalayhim mu/sada","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, it [i.e., Hellfire] will be closed down upon them","pickthall":"Lo! it is closed in on them","yusuf_ali":"It shall be made into a vault over them,","urdu":"وہ اُن پر ڈھانک کر بند کر دی جائے گی","turkish":"Onlar, uzun sütunlar arasında, her yönden o ateşle kapatılmışlardır.","indonesian":"Sungguh, api itu ditutup rapat atas (diri) mereka,","french":"Il se refermera sur eux,","german":"Gewiß, es wird sie einschließen","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই ওটা তাদেরকে পরিবেষ্টন করে রাখবে,","spanish":"El Infierno se cerrará en torno a ellos","malay":"Sesungguhnnya api neraka itu ditutup rapat atas mereka.","bosnian":"Ona će iznad njih biti zatvorena,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104008.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/8"}},{"verse_key":"104:9","ayah":9,"arabic":"فِى عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Fee AAamadin mumaddada","translations":{"sahih_international":"In extended columns.","pickthall":"In outstretched columns.","yusuf_ali":"In columns outstretched.","urdu":"(اِس حالت میں کہ وہ) اُونچے اُونچے ستونوں میں (گھِرے ہوئے ہوں گے)۔","turkish":"Onlar, uzun sütunlar arasında, her yönden o ateşle kapatılmışlardır.","indonesian":"(sedang mereka itu) diikat pada tiang-tiang yang panjang.","french":"en colonnes (de flammes) étendues.","german":"in langgestreckten Säulen.","bengali":"দীর্ঘায়িত স্তম্ভসমূহে।","spanish":"con columnas inmensas.","malay":"(Mereka terikat di situ) pada batang-batang palang yang melintang panjang.","bosnian":"plamenim stupovima zasvođena."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/104009.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/104/9"}}]}},{"number":105,"data":{"surah":{"number":105,"name_arabic":"الفيل","name_english":"Al-Fil","name_translation":"The Elephant","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":19,"verses_count":5,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/105.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/105.mp3"}],"total_verses":5,"verses":[{"verse_key":"105:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصْحَـٰبِ ٱلْفِيلِ","transliteration":"Alam tara kayfa faAAala rabbuka bi-as-habialfeel","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you not considered, [O Muḥammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant?","pickthall":"Hast thou not seen how thy Lord dealt with the owners of the Elephant?","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou not how thy Lord dealt with the Companions of the Elephant?","urdu":"تم نے دیکھا نہیں کہ تمہارے ربّ نے ہاتھی والوں کے ساتھ کیا کیا؟","turkish":"Fil sahiplerine Rabbinin ne ettiğini görmedin mi?","indonesian":"Tidakkah engkau (Muhammad) perhatikan bagaimana Tuhanmu telah bertindak terhadap pasukan bergajah?","french":"N’as-tu pas vu comment ton Seigneur a agi envers les gens de l’Eléphant.","german":"Siehst du nicht, wie dein Herr mit den Leuten des Elefanten verfuhr?","bengali":"তুমি কি দেখনি যে, তোমার রাব্ব হস্তি অধিপতিদের কিরূপ (পরিণতি) করেছিলেন?","spanish":"¿No has observado lo que hizo tu Señor con el ejército del elefante?","malay":"Tidakkah engkau mengetahui bagaimana Tuhanmu telah melakukan kepada angkatan tentera (yang dipimpin oleh pembawa) Gajah, (yang hendak meruntuhkan Kaabah)?","bosnian":"Zar nisi čuo šta je sa vlasnicima slona Gospodar tvoj uradio!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/105001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/105/1"}},{"verse_key":"105:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"أَلَمْ يَجْعَلْ كَيْدَهُمْ فِى تَضْلِيلٍ","transliteration":"Alam yajAAal kaydahum fee tadleel","translations":{"sahih_international":"Did He not make their plan into misguidance?","pickthall":"Did He not bring their stratagem to naught,","yusuf_ali":"Did He not make their treacherous plan go astray?","urdu":"کیا اُس نے اُن کی تدبیر کو اَکارَت نہیں کر دیا؟","turkish":"Onların düzenlerini boşa çıkarmadı mı?","indonesian":"Bukankah Dia telah menjadikan tipu daya mereka itu sia-sia?","french":"N’a-t-Il pas rendu leur ruse complètement vaine ?","german":"Ließ Er nicht ihre List verlorengehen","bengali":"তিনি কি তাদের চক্রান্ত ব্যর্থ করে দেননি?","spanish":"¿No has visto cómo desbarató sus planes [de destruir la Ka‘bah]?","malay":"Bukankah Tuhanmu telah menjadikan rancangan jahat mereka dalam keadaan yang rugi dan memusnahkan mereka?","bosnian":"Zar lukavstvo njihovo nije omeo"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/105002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/105/2"}},{"verse_key":"105:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَأَرْسَلَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَيْرًا أَبَابِيلَ","transliteration":"Waarsala AAalayhim tayran ababeel","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He sent against them birds in flocks,","pickthall":"And send against them swarms of flying creatures,","yusuf_ali":"And He sent against them Flights of Birds,","urdu":"اور اُن پر پرندوں کے جھُنڈ کے جھُنڈ بھیج دیے","turkish":"Onların üzerine, sert taşlar atan sürülerle kuşlar gönderdi.","indonesian":"dan Dia mengirimkan kepada mereka burung yang berbondong-bondong,","french":"et envoyé sur eux des oiseaux par volées.","german":"und sandte gegen sie Vögel in aufeinanderfolgenden Schwärmen,","bengali":"তাদের বিরুদ্ধে তিনি ঝাঁকে ঝাঁকে পক্ষীকূল প্রেরণ করেছিলেন –","spanish":"Y envió sobre ellos bandadas de aves","malay":"Dan Ia telah menghantarkan kepada mereka (rombongan) burung berpasuk-pasukan, -","bosnian":"i protiv njih jata ptica poslao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/105003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/105/3"}},{"verse_key":"105:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"تَرْمِيهِم بِحِجَارَةٍ مِّن سِجِّيلٍ","transliteration":"Tarmeehim bihijaratin minsijjeel","translations":{"sahih_international":"Striking them with stones of hard clay,","pickthall":"Which pelted them with stones of baked clay,","yusuf_ali":"Striking them with stones of baked clay.","urdu":"جو اُن پر پکّی ہوئی مَٹّی کے پتھر پھینک رہے تھے،","turkish":"Onların üzerine, sert taşlar atan sürülerle kuşlar gönderdi.","indonesian":"yang melempari mereka dengan batu dari tanah liat yang dibakar,","french":"qui leur lançaient des pierres d’argile ?","german":"die sie mit Steinen aus gebranntem Lehm bewarfen,","bengali":"যারা তাদের উপর প্রস্তর কংকর নিক্ষেপ করেছিল।","spanish":"que les arrojaron piedras de arcilla dura,","malay":"Yang melontar mereka dengan batu-batu dari sejenis tanah yang dibakar keras, -","bosnian":"Koje su na njih grumenje od gline pečene bacale,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/105004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/105/4"}},{"verse_key":"105:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فَجَعَلَهُمْ كَعَصْفٍ مَّأْكُولٍۭ","transliteration":"FajaAAalahum kaAAasfin ma/kool","translations":{"sahih_international":"And He made them like eaten straw.","pickthall":"And made them like green crops devoured (by cattle)?","yusuf_ali":"Then did He make them like an empty field of stalks and straw, (of which the corn) has been eaten up.","urdu":"پھر اُن کا یہ حال کر دیا جیسے جانوروں کا کھایا ہوا بھوسا۔","turkish":"Sonunda onları, yenilmiş ekin gibi yaptı.","indonesian":"sehingga mereka dijadikan-Nya seperti daun-daun yang dimakan (ulat).","french":"Et Il les a rendus semblables à une paille mâchée.","german":"und sie so wie abgefressene Halme machte?","bengali":"অতঃপর তিনি তাদেরকে ভক্ষিত তৃণ সদৃশ করে দেন।","spanish":"y los dejó como heno carcomido.","malay":"Lalu Ia menjadikan mereka hancur berkecai seperti daun-daun kayu yang dimakan ulat.","bosnian":"pa ih On kao lišće koje su crvi istočili učinio?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/105005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/105/5"}}]}},{"number":106,"data":{"surah":{"number":106,"name_arabic":"قريش","name_english":"Quraysh","name_translation":"Quraysh","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":29,"verses_count":4,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/106.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/106.mp3"}],"total_verses":4,"verses":[{"verse_key":"106:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" لِإِيلَـٰفِ قُرَيْشٍ","transliteration":"Li-eelafi quraysh","translations":{"sahih_international":"For the accustomed security of the Quraysh -","pickthall":"For the taming of Qureysh.","yusuf_ali":"For the covenants (of security and safeguard enjoyed) by the Quraish,","urdu":"چونکہ قریش مانوس ہوئے","turkish":"Kureyş kabilesinin yaz ve kış yolculuklarında uzlaşması ve anlaşması sağlanmıştır.","indonesian":"Karena kebiasaan orang-orang Quraisy,","french":"A cause de l'habitude des Quraysh,","german":"Für die Vereinigung der Qurais","bengali":"যেহেতু কুরাইশের আসক্তি আছে,","spanish":"Le proporcioné seguridad a [la tribu de] Quraish,","malay":"Kerana kebiasaan aman tenteram kaum Quraisy (penduduk Makkah)","bosnian":"Zbog navike Kurejšija,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/106001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/106/1"}},{"verse_key":"106:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"إِۦلَـٰفِهِمْ رِحْلَةَ ٱلشِّتَآءِ وَٱلصَّيْفِ","transliteration":"Eelafihim rihlata ashshita-iwassayf","translations":{"sahih_international":"Their accustomed security [in] the caravan of winter and summer -","pickthall":"For their taming (We cause) the caravans to set forth in winter and summer.","yusuf_ali":"Their covenants (covering) journeys by winter and summer,-","urdu":"(یعنی) جاڑے اور گرمی کے سفروں سے مانوس،","turkish":"Kureyş kabilesinin yaz ve kış yolculuklarında uzlaşması ve anlaşması sağlanmıştır.","indonesian":"(yaitu) kebiasaan mereka bepergian pada musim dingin dan musim panas.","french":"De leur habitude [concernant] les voyages d’hiver et d’été.","german":"ihre Vereinigung während der Reise des Winters und des Sommers.","bengali":"আসক্তি আছে তাদের শীত ও গ্রীষ্ম সফরের,","spanish":"e hice que sus caravanas en invierno [al Yemen] y en verano [a Siria] fueran respetadas.","malay":"(laitu) kebiasaan aman tenteram perjalanan mereka (menjalankan perniagaan) pada musim sejuk (ke negeri Yaman), dan pada musim panas (ke negeri Syam),","bosnian":"navike njihove da zimi i ljeti putuju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/106002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/106/2"}},{"verse_key":"106:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"فَلْيَعْبُدُوا۟ رَبَّ هَـٰذَا ٱلْبَيْتِ","transliteration":"FalyaAAbudoo rabba hatha albayt","translations":{"sahih_international":"Let them worship the Lord of this House,","pickthall":"So let them worship the Lord of this House,","yusuf_ali":"Let them adore the Lord of this House,","urdu":"لہٰذا اُن کو چاہیے کہ اِس گھر کے ربّ کی عبادت کریں","turkish":"Öyleyse kendilerini açken doyuran ve korku içindeyken güven veren bu Ev'in (Kabe'nin) Rabbine kulluk etsinler.","indonesian":"Maka hendaklah mereka menyembah Tuhan (pemilik) rumah ini (Ka'bah),","french":"Qu’ils adorent donc le Seigneur de cette Maison (la Kaaba).","german":"So sollen sie dem Herrn dieses Hauses dienen,","bengali":"অতএব তারা ইবাদাত করুক এই গৃহের রবের,","spanish":"Que adoren y agradezcan, en consecuencia, al Señor de esta Casa [la Ka‘bah],","malay":"Maka hendaklah mereka menyembah Tuhan yang menguasai rumah (Kaabah) ini,","bosnian":"neka se oni Gospodaru hrama ovoga klanjaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/106003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/106/3"}},{"verse_key":"106:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَطْعَمَهُم مِّن جُوعٍ وَءَامَنَهُم مِّنْ خَوْفٍۭ","transliteration":"Allathee atAAamahum min jooAAinwaamanahum min khawf","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who has fed them, [saving them] from hunger and made them safe, [saving them] from fear.","pickthall":"Who hath fed them against hunger and hath made them safe from fear.","yusuf_ali":"Who provides them with food against hunger, and with security against fear (of danger).","urdu":"جس نے اُنہیں بھُوک سے بچا کر کھانے کو دیا اور خوف سے بچا کر امن عطا کیا۔","turkish":"Öyleyse kendilerini açken doyuran ve korku içindeyken güven veren bu Ev'in (Kabe'nin) Rabbine kulluk etsinler.","indonesian":"yang telah memberi makanan kepada mereka untuk menghilangkan lapar dan mengamankan mereka dari rasa ketakutan.","french":"qui les a nourris contre la faim et rassurés de la crainte!","german":"Der ihnen Speise nach ihrem Hunger gegeben und ihnen Sicherheit nach ihrer Furcht gewährt hat.","bengali":"যিনি তাদেরকে ক্ষুধায় আহার্য দান করেছেন এবং ভয় হতে তাদেরকে নিরাপদ করেছেন।","spanish":"Quien les concedió el sustento para que no sufrieran hambre y les dio seguridad para protegerlos del peligro.","malay":"Tuhan yang memberi mereka penghidupan: menyelamatkan mereka dari kelaparan, dan mengamankan mereka dari ketakutan.","bosnian":"koji ih gladne hrani i od straha brani."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/106004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/106/4"}}]}},{"number":107,"data":{"surah":{"number":107,"name_arabic":"الماعون","name_english":"Al-Ma'un","name_translation":"The Small kindnesses","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":17,"verses_count":7,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/107.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/107.mp3"}],"total_verses":7,"verses":[{"verse_key":"107:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yukaththibu biddeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?","pickthall":"Hast thou observed him who belieth religion?","yusuf_ali":"Seest thou one who denies the Judgment (to come)?","urdu":"تم نے دیکھا اُس شخص کو جو آخرت کی جزا و سزا کو جھُٹلاتا ہے؟","turkish":"Dini yalan sayanı gördün mü?","indonesian":"Tahukah kamu (orang) yang mendustakan agama?","french":"Vois-tu celui qui traite de mensonge la Rétribution ?","german":"Siehst du (nicht) denjenigen, der das Gericht für Lüge erklärt?","bengali":"তুমি কি দেখেছ তাকে, যে কর্মফলকে মিথ্যা বলে থাকে?","spanish":"¿Acaso has observado a quien desmiente el Día del Juicio?","malay":"Tahukah engkau akan orang yang mendustakan ugama (meliputi hari pembalasan)?","bosnian":"Znaš li ti onoga koji onaj svijet poriče?"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/1"}},{"verse_key":"107:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","transliteration":"Fathalika allathee yaduAAAAualyateem","translations":{"sahih_international":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan","pickthall":"That is he who repelleth the orphan,","yusuf_ali":"Then such is the (man) who repulses the orphan (with harshness),","urdu":"وہی تو ہے جو یتیم کو دھکّے دیتا ہے،","turkish":"Öksüzü kakıştıran, yoksulu doyurmaya yanaşmayan kimse işte odur.","indonesian":"Maka itulah orang yang menghardik anak yatim,","french":"C’est bien lui qui repousse l’orphelin,","german":"Das ist derjenige, der die Waise zurückstößt","bengali":"সেতো সে, যে পিতৃহীনকে রূঢ়ভাবে তাড়িয়ে দেয়,","spanish":"Es quien rechaza al huérfano","malay":"Orang itu ialah yang menindas serta berlaku zalim kepada anak yatim,","bosnian":"Pa to je onaj koji grubo odbija siroče,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/2"}},{"verse_key":"107:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","transliteration":"Wala yahuddu AAalataAAami almiskeen","translations":{"sahih_international":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.","pickthall":"And urgeth not the feeding of the needy.","yusuf_ali":"And encourages not the feeding of the indigent.","urdu":"اور مسکین کا کھانا دینے پر نہیں اُکساتا۔","turkish":"Öksüzü kakıştıran, yoksulu doyurmaya yanaşmayan kimse işte odur.","indonesian":"dan tidak mengajak memberi makan orang miskin.","french":"et qui n’encourage point à nourrir le pauvre.","german":"und nicht zur Speisung des Armen anhält.","bengali":"এবং সে অভাবগ্রস্তকে খাদ্য দানে উৎসাহ প্রদান করেনা,","spanish":"y no exhorta a alimentar al pobre.","malay":"Dan ia tidak menggalakkan untuk memberi makanan yang berhak diterima oleh orang miskin.","bosnian":"i koji da se nahrani siromah – ne podstiče."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/3"}},{"verse_key":"107:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"فَوَيْلٌ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","transliteration":"Fawaylun lilmusalleen","translations":{"sahih_international":"So woe to those who pray","pickthall":"Ah, woe unto worshippers","yusuf_ali":"So woe to the worshippers","urdu":"پھر تباہی ہے اُن نماز پڑھنے والوں کے لیے","turkish":"Vay o namaz kılanların haline ki:","indonesian":"Maka celakalah orang yang salat,","french":"Malheur donc, à ceux qui prient.","german":"Wehe nun den Betenden,","bengali":"সুতরাং পরিতাপ সেই সালাত আদায়কারীদের জন্য –","spanish":"¡Ay de los orantes","malay":"(Kalau orang yang demikian dikira dari bilangan orang-orang yang mendustakan ugama), maka kecelakaan besar bagi orang-orang Ahli Sembahyang -","bosnian":"A teško onima koji, kada molitvu obavljaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/4"}},{"verse_key":"107:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","transliteration":"Allatheena hum AAan salatihimsahoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer -","pickthall":"Who are heedless of their prayer;","yusuf_ali":"Who are neglectful of their prayers,","urdu":"جو اپنی نماز سے غفلت برتتے ہیں،","turkish":"Onlar kıldıkları namazdan gafildirler.","indonesian":"(yaitu) orang-orang yang lalai terhadap salatnya,","french":"tout en négligeant (et retardant) leur prière (As-Salât),","german":"denjenigen, die auf ihre Gebete nicht achten,","bengali":"যারা তাদের সালাতে অমনোযোগী,","spanish":"que son negligentes en sus oraciones [realizándolas fuera de su horario],","malay":"(laitu) mereka yang berkeadaan lalai daripada menyempurnakan sembahyangnya;","bosnian":"molitvu svoju kako treba ne izvršavaju,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/5"}},{"verse_key":"107:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","transliteration":"Allatheena hum yuraoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Those who make show [of their deeds]","pickthall":"Who would be seen (at worship)","yusuf_ali":"Those who (want but) to be seen (of men),","urdu":"جو ریا کاری کرتے ہیں","turkish":"Onlar gösteriş yaparlar.","indonesian":"yang berbuat riya`,","french":"qui sont pleins d’ostentation,","german":"denjenigen, die dabei (nur) gesehen werden wollen;","bengali":"যারা লোক দেখানোর জন্য ওটা করে।","spanish":"y solo las realizan para hacerse ver,","malay":"(Juga bagi) orang-orang yang berkeadaan riak (bangga diri dalam ibadat dan bawaannya),","bosnian":"koji se samo pretvaraju"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/6"}},{"verse_key":"107:7","ayah":7,"arabic":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","transliteration":"WayamnaAAoona almaAAoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"And withhold [simple] assistance.","pickthall":"Yet refuse small kindnesses!","yusuf_ali":"But refuse (to supply) (even) neighbourly needs.","urdu":"اور معمولی ضرورت کی چیزیں (لوگوں کو)دینے سے گریز کرتے ہیں","turkish":"Onlar basit şeyleri dahi vermezler.","indonesian":"dan enggan (memberikan) bantuan.","french":"et refusent l’ustensile (à celui qui en a besoin).","german":"und die Hilfeleistung verweigern!","bengali":"এবং গৃহস্থালীর প্রয়োজনীয় ছোট খাট সাহায্য দানে বিরত থাকে।","spanish":"y se niegan a prestar hasta la mínima ayuda!","malay":"Dan orang-orang yang tidak memberi sedikit pertolongan (kepada orang yang berhak mendapatnya).","bosnian":"i nikome ništa ni u naruč ne daju!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/107007.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/107/7"}}]}},{"number":108,"data":{"surah":{"number":108,"name_arabic":"الكوثر","name_english":"Al-Kawthar","name_translation":"The Abundance","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":15,"verses_count":3,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/108.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/108.mp3"}],"total_verses":3,"verses":[{"verse_key":"108:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","transliteration":"Inna aAAtaynakaalkawthar","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muḥammad], al-Kawthar.","pickthall":"Lo! We have given thee Abundance;","yusuf_ali":"To thee have We granted the Fount (of Abundance).","urdu":"(اے نبیؐ) ہم نے تمہیں کوثر عطا کر دیا۔","turkish":"Doğrusu sana pek çok nimet vermişizdir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, Kami telah memberimu (Muhammad) nikmat yang banyak.","french":"Nous t’avons certes, accordé l’Abondance.","german":"Wir haben dir ja al-Kautar gegeben.","bengali":"আমি অবশ্যই তোমাকে কাওছার দান করেছি,","spanish":"[¡Oh, Muhámmad!] te he agraciado con la abundancia.","malay":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah mengurniakan kepadamu (wahai Muhammad) kebaikan yang banyak (di dunia dan di akhirat).","bosnian":"Mi smo ti, uistinu, Kevser dali!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/108001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/108/1"}},{"verse_key":"108:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","transliteration":"Fasalli lirabbika wanhar","translations":{"sahih_international":"So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].","pickthall":"So pray unto thy Lord, and sacrifice.","yusuf_ali":"Therefore to thy Lord turn in Prayer and Sacrifice.","urdu":"پس تم اپنے ربّ ہی کے لیے نماز پڑھو اور قربانی کرو۔","turkish":"Öyleyse Rabbin için namaz kıl, kurban kes.","indonesian":"Maka laksanakanlah salat karena Tuhanmu, dan berkurbanlah (sebagai ibadah dan mendekatkan diri kepada Allah).","french":"Accomplis la Ṣalāt pour ton Seigneur et sacrifie.","german":"So bete zu deinem Herrn und opfere.","bengali":"সুতরাং তোমার রবের উদ্দেশে সালাত আদায় কর এবং কুরবানী কর।","spanish":"Reza a tu Señor y sacrifica [los animales en Su nombre].","malay":"Oleh itu, kerjakanlah sembahyang kerana Tuhanmu semata-mata, dan sembelihlah korban (sebagai bersyukur).","bosnian":"zato se Gospodaru svome moli i kurban kolji,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/108002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/108/2"}},{"verse_key":"108:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","transliteration":"Inna shani-aka huwa al-abtar","translations":{"sahih_international":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","pickthall":"Lo! it is thy insulter (and not thou) who is without posterity.","yusuf_ali":"For he who hateth thee, he will be cut off (from Future Hope).","urdu":"تمہارا دُشمن ہی جَڑ کٹا ہے۔","turkish":"Doğrusu adı sanı ortadan kalkacak olan, sana kin tutan kimsedir.","indonesian":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang membencimu dialah yang terputus (dari rahmat Allah).","french":"Celui qui te hait sera certes, sans postérité.","german":"Gewiß, derjenige, der dich haßt, - er ist vom Guten abgetrennt .","bengali":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমার প্রতি বিদ্বেষ পোষণকারীইতো নিবংর্শ।","spanish":"Porque a quien te desdeñe y odie le privaré de todo bien.","malay":"Sesungguhnya orang yang bencikan engkau, Dia lah yang terputus (dari mendapat sebarang perkara yang diingininya).","bosnian":"onaj koji tebe mrzi sigurno će on bez spomena ostati."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/108003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/108/3"}}]}},{"number":109,"data":{"surah":{"number":109,"name_arabic":"الكافرون","name_english":"Al-Kafirun","name_translation":"The Disbelievers","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":18,"verses_count":6,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/109.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/109.mp3"}],"total_verses":6,"verses":[{"verse_key":"109:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" قُلْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"Qul ya ayyuha alkafiroon","translations":{"sahih_international":"Say, \"O disbelievers,","pickthall":"Say: O disbelievers!","yusuf_ali":"Say: O ye that reject Faith!","urdu":"کہہ دو کہ اے کافرو،","turkish":"De ki: \"Ey inkarcılar!\"","indonesian":"Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Wahai orang-orang kafir!","french":"Dis : \"Ô vous les infidèles !","german":"Sag: O ihr Ungläubigen,","bengali":"বলঃ হে কাফিরেরা!","spanish":"Di: “¡Oh, incrédulos!","malay":"Katakanlah (wahai Muhammad): \"Hai orang-orang kafir!","bosnian":"Reci: \"O vi nevjernici,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/1"}},{"verse_key":"109:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"La aAAbudu ma taAAbudoon","translations":{"sahih_international":"I do not worship what you worship.","pickthall":"I worship not that which ye worship;","yusuf_ali":"I worship not that which ye worship,","urdu":"میں اُن کی عبادت نہیں کرتا جن کی عبادت تم کرتے ہو،","turkish":"\"Ben sizin taptıklarınıza tapmam.\"","indonesian":"aku tidak akan menyembah apa yang kamu sembah,","french":"Je n’adore pas ce que vous adorez.","german":"ich diene nicht dem, dem ihr dient,","bengali":"আমি তার ইবাদাত করিনা যার ইবাদাত তোমরা কর,","spanish":"No adoro lo que adoráis.","malay":"\"Aku tidak akan menyembah apa yang kamu sembah.","bosnian":"ja se neću klanjati onima kojima se vi klanjate,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/2"}},{"verse_key":"109:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَـٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona maaAAbud","translations":{"sahih_international":"Nor are you worshippers of what I worship.","pickthall":"Nor worship ye that which I worship.","yusuf_ali":"Nor will ye worship that which I worship.","urdu":"اور نہ تم اُس کی عبادت کرنے والے ہو جس کی عبادت میں کرتا ہوں۔","turkish":"\"Benim taptığıma da sizler tapmazsınız.\"","indonesian":"dan kamu bukan penyembah apa yang aku sembah,","french":"Et vous n’êtes pas adorateurs de ce que j’adore.","german":"und ihr dient nicht Dem, Dem ich diene.","bengali":"এবং তোমরাও তাঁর ইবাদাতকারী নও যাঁর ইবাদাত আমি করি,","spanish":"Ni vosotros adoráis a Quien yo adoro.","malay":"\"Dan kamu tidak mahu menyembah (Allah) yang aku sembah.","bosnian":"a ni vi se nećete klanjati Onome kome se ja klanjam;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/3"}},{"verse_key":"109:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٌ مَّا عَبَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"Wala ana AAabidun maAAabadtum","translations":{"sahih_international":"Nor will I be a worshipper of what you worship.","pickthall":"And I shall not worship that which ye worship.","yusuf_ali":"And I will not worship that which ye have been wont to worship,","urdu":"اور نہ میں اُن کی عبادت کرنے والا ہوں جن کی عبادت تم نے کی ہے","turkish":"\"Ben de sizin taptığınıza tapacak değilim.\"","indonesian":"dan aku tidak pernah menjadi penyembah apa yang kamu sembah,","french":"Je ne suis pas adorateur de ce que vous adorez.","german":"Und ich werde (auch) nicht dem dienen, dem ihr gedient habt,","bengali":"এবং আমি ইবাদাতকারী নই তার যার ইবাদাত তোমরা করে আসছ,","spanish":"Y jamás adoraré lo que adoráis.","malay":"\"Dan aku tidak akan beribadat secara kamu beribadat.","bosnian":"ja se nisam klanjao onima kojima ste se vi klanjali,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/4"}},{"verse_key":"109:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَـٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona maaAAbud","translations":{"sahih_international":"Nor will you be worshippers of what I worship.","pickthall":"Nor will ye worship that which I worship.","yusuf_ali":"Nor will ye worship that which I worship.","urdu":"اور نہ تم اُس کی عبادت کرنے والے ہو جس کی عبادت میں کرتا ہوں۔","turkish":"\"Benim taptığıma da sizler tapmıyorsunuz.\"","indonesian":"dan kamu tidak pernah (pula) menjadi penyembah apa yang aku sembah.","french":"Et vous n’êtes pas adorateurs de ce que j’adore.","german":"Und ihr werdet nicht Dem dienen, Dem ich diene.","bengali":"এবং তোমরা তাঁর ইবাদাতকারী নও যাঁর ইবাদাত আমি করি।","spanish":"Ni adoraréis vosotros a Quien yo adoro.","malay":"\"Dan kamu pula tidak mahu beribadat secara aku beribadat.","bosnian":"a i vi se niste klanjali Onome kome se ja klanjam,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/5"}},{"verse_key":"109:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ دِينِ","transliteration":"Lakum deenukum waliya deen","translations":{"sahih_international":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion.\"","pickthall":"Unto you your religion, and unto me my religion.","yusuf_ali":"To you be your Way, and to me mine.","urdu":"تمہارے لیے تمہارا دین ہے اور میرے لیے میرا دین۔","turkish":"\"Sizin dininiz size, benim dinim banadır.\"","indonesian":"Untukmu agamamu, dan untukku agamaku.\"","french":"A vous votre religion, et à moi ma religion.\"","german":"Euch eure Religion und mir meine Religion.","bengali":"তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের কর্মফল এবং আমার জন্য আমার কর্মফল।","spanish":"Vosotros tenéis vuestra religión y yo la mía”.","malay":"\"Bagi kamu ugama kamu, dan bagiku ugamaku\".","bosnian":"vama – vaša vjera, a meni – moja!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/109006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/109/6"}}]}},{"number":110,"data":{"surah":{"number":110,"name_arabic":"النصر","name_english":"An-Nasr","name_translation":"The Divine Support","revelation_place":"madinah","revelation_order":114,"verses_count":3,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/110.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/110.mp3"}],"total_verses":3,"verses":[{"verse_key":"110:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" إِذَا جَآءَ نَصْرُ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْفَتْحُ","transliteration":"Itha jaa nasru Allahiwalfath","translations":{"sahih_international":"When the victory of Allāh has come and the conquest,","pickthall":"When Allah's succour and the triumph cometh","yusuf_ali":"When comes the Help of Allah, and Victory,","urdu":"جب اللہ کی مدد آجائے اور فتح نصیب ہو جائے","turkish":"Allah'ın yardımı ve zafer günü gelip, insanların Allah'ın dinine akın akın girdiklerini görünce, Rabbini överek tesbih et; O'ndan bağışlama dile, çünkü O, tevbeleri daima kabul edendir.","indonesian":"Apabila telah datang pertolongan Allah dan kemenangan,","french":"Lorsque vient le secours d’Allah ainsi que la victoire,","german":"Wenn Allahs Hilfe kommt und der Sieg","bengali":"যখন আসবে আল্লাহর সাহায্য ও বিজয়,","spanish":"[¡Oh, Muhámmad!] Cuando llegue el socorro de Dios y la victoria,","malay":"Apabila datang pertolongan Allah dan kemenangan (semasa engkau wahai Muhammad berjaya menguasai negeri Makkah), -","bosnian":"Kada Allahova pomoć i pobjeda dođu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/110001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/110/1"}},{"verse_key":"110:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"وَرَأَيْتَ ٱلنَّاسَ يَدْخُلُونَ فِى دِينِ ٱللَّهِ أَفْوَاجًا","transliteration":"Waraayta annasa yadkhuloonafee deeni Allahi afwaja","translations":{"sahih_international":"And you see the people entering into the religion of Allāh in multitudes,","pickthall":"And thou seest mankind entering the religion of Allah in troops,","yusuf_ali":"And thou dost see the people enter Allah's Religion in crowds,","urdu":"اور (اے نبیؐ) تم دیکھ لو کہ لوگ فوج در فوج اللہ کے دین میں داخل ہو رہے ہیں","turkish":"Allah'ın yardımı ve zafer günü gelip, insanların Allah'ın dinine akın akın girdiklerini görünce, Rabbini överek tesbih et; O'ndan bağışlama dile, çünkü O, tevbeleri daima kabul edendir.","indonesian":"dan engkau melihat manusia berbondong-bondong masuk agama Allah.","french":"et que tu vois les gens entrer en foule dans la religion d’Allah,","german":"und du die Menschen in Allahs Religion in Scharen eintreten siehst,","bengali":"এবং তুমি মানুষকে দলে দলে আল্লাহর দীনে প্রবেশ করতে দেখবে,","spanish":"y veas a la gente ingresar en masa a la religión de Dios,","malay":"Dan engkau melihat manusia masuk dalam ugama Allah beramai-ramai, -","bosnian":"i vidiš ljude kako u skupinama u Allahovu vjeru ulaze –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/110002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/110/2"}},{"verse_key":"110:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"فَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ تَوَّابًۢا","transliteration":"Fasabbih bihamdi rabbika wastaghfirhuinnahu kana tawwaba","translations":{"sahih_international":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of Repentance.","pickthall":"Then hymn the praises of thy Lord, and seek forgiveness of Him. Lo! He is ever ready to show mercy.","yusuf_ali":"Celebrate the praises of thy Lord, and pray for His Forgiveness: For He is Oft-Returning (in Grace and Mercy).","urdu":"تو اپنے رب کی حمد کے ساتھ اُس کی تسبیح کرو، اور اُس سے مغفرت کی دُعا مانگو، بے شک وہ بڑا توبہ قبول کرنے والا ہے","turkish":"Allah'ın yardımı ve zafer günü gelip, insanların Allah'ın dinine akın akın girdiklerini görünce, Rabbini överek tesbih et; O'ndan bağışlama dile, çünkü O, tevbeleri daima kabul edendir.","indonesian":"maka bertasbihlah dengan memuji Tuhanmu dan mohonlah ampunan kepada-Nya. Sungguh, Dia Maha Penerima tobat.","french":"alors, par la louange, célèbre la gloire de ton Seigneur et implore Son pardon. Car c’est Lui le grand Accueillant au repentir.","german":"dann lobpreise deinen Herrn und bitte Ihn um Vergebung; gewiß, Er ist Reue-Annehmend.","bengali":"তখন তুমি তোমার রবের কৃতজ্ঞতা মূলক পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর এবং তাঁর সমীপে ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর; তিনিতো সর্বাপেক্ষা অধিক অনুতাপ গ্রহণকারী।","spanish":"glorifica alabando a tu Señor y pide Su perdón; Él es Indulgente.","malay":"Maka ucapkanlah tasbih dengan memuji Tuhanmu dan mintalah ampun kepadaNya, sesungguhnya Dia amat menerima taubat.","bosnian":"ti veličaj Gospodara svoga hvaleći Ga i moli Ga da ti oprosti, On je uvijek pokajanje primao."},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/110003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/110/3"}}]}},{"number":111,"data":{"surah":{"number":111,"name_arabic":"المسد","name_english":"Al-Masad","name_translation":"The Palm Fiber","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":6,"verses_count":5,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/111.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/111.mp3"}],"total_verses":5,"verses":[{"verse_key":"111:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍ وَتَبَّ","transliteration":"Tabbat yada abee lahabin watab","translations":{"sahih_international":"May the hands of Abū Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","pickthall":"The power of Abu Lahab will perish, and he will perish.","yusuf_ali":"Perish the hands of the Father of Flame! Perish he!","urdu":"ٹوٹ گئے ابو لہب کے ہاتھ اور نامراد ہوگیا وہ۔","turkish":"Ebu Leheb'in elleri kurusun; kurudu da!","indonesian":"Binasalah kedua tangan Abu Lahab dan benar-benar binasa dia!","french":"Que périssent les deux mains d’Abû-Lahab et que lui-même périsse.","german":"Zugrunde gehen sollen die Hände Abu Lahabs, und zugrunde gehen soll er (selbst)!","bengali":"ধ্বংস হোক আবু লাহাবের হস্তদ্বয় এবং ধ্বংস হোক সে নিজেও।","spanish":"¡Maldito sea Abu Lahab y que perezca!","malay":"Binasalah kedua-dua tangan Abu lahab, dan binasalah ia bersama!","bosnian":"Neka propadne Ebu Leheb, i propao je!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/111001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/111/1"}},{"verse_key":"111:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ","transliteration":"Ma aghna AAanhu maluhuwama kasab","translations":{"sahih_international":"His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained.","pickthall":"His wealth and gains will not exempt him.","yusuf_ali":"No profit to him from all his wealth, and all his gains!","urdu":"اُس کا مال اور جو کچھ اس نے کمایا وہ اُس کے کسی کام نہ آیا۔","turkish":"Malı ve kazandığı kendisine fayda vermedi.","indonesian":"Tidaklah berguna baginya hartanya dan apa yang dia usahakan.","french":"Sa fortune ne lui sert à rien, ni ce qu’il a acquis.","german":"Was nützt ihm sein Besitz und das, was er erworben hat?","bengali":"ওর ধন সম্পদ ও ওর উপার্জন ওর কোন উপকারে আসেনি।","spanish":"No le servirán de nada su poder ni sus bienes materiales.","malay":"Hartanya dan segala yang diusahakannya, tidak dapat menolongnya.","bosnian":"Neće mu biti od koristi blago njegovo, a ni ono što je stekao,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/111002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/111/2"}},{"verse_key":"111:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"سَيَصْلَىٰ نَارًا ذَاتَ لَهَبٍ","transliteration":"Sayasla naran thatalahab","translations":{"sahih_international":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame","pickthall":"He will be plunged in flaming Fire,","yusuf_ali":"Burnt soon will he be in a Fire of Blazing Flame!","urdu":"ضرور وہ شعلہ زن آگ میں ڈالا جائے گا","turkish":"Alevli ateşe yaslanacaktır.","indonesian":"Kelak dia akan masuk ke dalam api yang bergejolak (neraka).","french":"Il sera brûlé dans un Feu plein de flammes.","german":"Er wird einem Feuer voller Flammen ausgesetzt sein","bengali":"অচিরেই সে শিখা বিশিষ্ট জাহান্নামের আগুনে প্রবেশ করবে,","spanish":"Será arrojado en el fuego llameante","malay":"Ia akan menderita bakaran api neraka yang marak menjulang.","bosnian":"ući će on, sigurno, u vatru rasplamsalu,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/111003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/111/3"}},{"verse_key":"111:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلْحَطَبِ","transliteration":"Wamraatuhu hammalata alhatab","translations":{"sahih_international":"And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood.","pickthall":"And his wife, the wood-carrier,","yusuf_ali":"His wife shall carry the (crackling) wood - As fuel!-","urdu":"اور (اُس کے ساتھ) اُس کی جورُو بھی، لگائی بُجھائی کرنے والی،","turkish":"Karısı da, boynunda bir ip olduğu halde ona odun taşıyacaktır.","indonesian":"Dan (begitu pula) istrinya, pembawa kayu bakar (penyebar fitnah).","french":"de même sa femme, la porteuse de bois,","german":"und (auch) seine Frau, die Brennholzträgerin.","bengali":"এবং তার স্ত্রীও-যে ইন্ধন বহন করে।","spanish":"junto con su mujer, la que acarreaba espinas,","malay":"Dan juga isterinya, seorang perempuan pemunggah kayu api. -","bosnian":"i žena njegova, koja spletkari;"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/111004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/111/4"}},{"verse_key":"111:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"فِى جِيدِهَا حَبْلٌ مِّن مَّسَدٍۭ","transliteration":"Fee jeediha hablun min masad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber.","pickthall":"Will have upon her neck a halter of palm-fibre.","yusuf_ali":"A twisted rope of palm-leaf fibre round her (own) neck!","urdu":"اُس کی گردن میں مونجھ کی رسّی ہو گی۔","turkish":"Karısı da, boynunda bir ip olduğu halde ona odun taşıyacaktır.","indonesian":"Di lehernya ada tali dari sabut yang dipintal.","french":"à son cou, une corde de fibres.","german":"Um ihrem Hals ist ein Strick aus Palmfasern.","bengali":"তার গলদেশে খেজুর বাকলের রজ্জু রয়েছে।","spanish":"que llevará en su cuello una cuerda de fibras de palmera.","malay":"Di lehernya sejenis tali, dari tali-tali yang dipintal.","bosnian":"o vratu njenu biće uže od ličine usukane!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/111005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/111/5"}}]}},{"number":112,"data":{"surah":{"number":112,"name_arabic":"الإخلاص","name_english":"Al-Ikhlas","name_translation":"The Sincerity","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":22,"verses_count":4,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/112.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/112.mp3"}],"total_verses":4,"verses":[{"verse_key":"112:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Qul huwa Allahu ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Say, \"He is Allāh, [who is] One,","pickthall":"Say: He is Allah, the One!","yusuf_ali":"Say: He is Allah, the One and Only;","urdu":"کہو، وہ اللہ ہے، یَکتا۔","turkish":"De ki: O Allah bir tektir.","indonesian":"Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Dialah Allah, Yang Maha Esa.","french":"Dis : \"Il est Allah, Unique.","german":"Sag: Er ist Allah, Einer,","bengali":"বলঃ তিনিই আল্লাহ, একক/অদ্বিতীয়।","spanish":"Di: “Él es Al-lah, Uno.","malay":"Katakanlah (wahai Muhammad): \"(Tuhanku) ialah Allah Yang Maha Esa;","bosnian":"Reci: \"On je Allah – Jedan!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/112001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/112/1"}},{"verse_key":"112:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","transliteration":"Allahu assamad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Allāh, the Eternal Refuge.","pickthall":"Allah, the eternally Besought of all!","yusuf_ali":"Allah, the Eternal, Absolute;","urdu":"اللہ سب سے بے نیاز ہے اور سب اس کے محتاج ہیں۔","turkish":"Allah her şeyden müstağni ve her şey O'na muhtaçtır.","indonesian":"Allah tempat meminta segala sesuatu.","french":"Allah, Le Seul à être imploré pour ce que nous désirons.","german":"Allah, der Überlegene.","bengali":"আল্লাহ কারও মুখাপেক্ষী নন।","spanish":"Al-lah es el Absoluto.","malay":"\"Allah Yang menjadi tumpuan sekalian makhluk untuk memohon sebarang hajat;","bosnian":"Allah je Utočište svakom!"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/112002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/112/2"}},{"verse_key":"112:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","transliteration":"Lam yalid walam yoolad","translations":{"sahih_international":"He neither begets nor is born,","pickthall":"He begetteth not nor was begotten.","yusuf_ali":"He begetteth not, nor is He begotten;","urdu":"نہ اس کی کوئی اولاد ہے اور نہ وہ کسی کی اولاد۔","turkish":"O doğurmamış ve doğmamıştır.","indonesian":"(Allah) tidak beranak dan tidak pula diperanakkan.","french":"Il n’a jamais engendré, n’a pas été engendré non plus.","german":"Er hat nicht gezeugt und ist nicht gezeugt worden,","bengali":"তাঁর কোন সন্তান নেই এবং তিনিও কারও সন্তান নন,","spanish":"No engendró ni fue engendrado.","malay":"\"Ia tiada beranak, dan Ia pula tidak diperanakkan;","bosnian":"Nije rodio i rođen nije,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/112003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/112/3"}},{"verse_key":"112:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","transliteration":"Walam yakun lahu kufuwan ahad","translations":{"sahih_international":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\"","pickthall":"And there is none comparable unto Him.","yusuf_ali":"And there is none like unto Him.","urdu":"اور کوئی اُس کا ہمسر نہیں ہے۔","turkish":"Hiçbir şey O'na denk değildir.","indonesian":"Dan tidak ada sesuatu yang setara dengan Dia.\"","french":"Et nul n’est égal à Lui.\"","german":"und niemand ist Ihm jemals gleich.","bengali":"এবং তাঁর সমতুল্য কেহই নেই।","spanish":"Y no hay nada ni nadie que sea semejante a Él”.","malay":"\"Dan tidak ada sesiapapun yang serupa denganNya\".","bosnian":"i niko Mu ravan nije!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/112004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/112/4"}}]}},{"number":113,"data":{"surah":{"number":113,"name_arabic":"الفلق","name_english":"Al-Falaq","name_translation":"The Daybreak","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":20,"verses_count":5,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/113.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/113.mp3"}],"total_verses":5,"verses":[{"verse_key":"113:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلْفَلَقِ","transliteration":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alfalaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak","pickthall":"Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of the Daybreak","yusuf_ali":"Say: I seek refuge with the Lord of the Dawn","urdu":"کہو، میں پناہ مانگتا ہوں صبح کے ربّ کی","turkish":"De ki: \"Yaratıkların şerrinden, bastırdığı zaman karanlığın şerrinden, düğümlere nefes eden büyücülerin şerrinden, hased ettiği zaman hasedcilerin şerrinden, tan yerini ağartan Rabbe sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"Katakanlah, \"Aku berlindung kepada Tuhan yang menguasai subuh (fajar),","french":"Dis: \"Je cherche protection auprès du Seigneur de l’aube naissante,","german":"Sag: Ich nehme Zuflucht beim Herrn des Tagesanbruchs","bengali":"বলঃ আমি আশ্রয় চাচ্ছি ঊষার স্রষ্টার।","spanish":"Di: “Me refugio en el Señor del amanecer,","malay":"Katakanlah (wahai Muhammad); \"Aku berlindung kepada (Allah) Tuhan yang menciptakan sekalian makhluk,","bosnian":"Reci: \"Utječem se Gospodaru svitanja"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/113001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/113/1"}},{"verse_key":"113:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"مِن شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Min sharri ma khalaq","translations":{"sahih_international":"From the evil of that which He created","pickthall":"From the evil of that which He created;","yusuf_ali":"From the mischief of created things;","urdu":"ہر اُس چیز کے شر سے جو اُس نے پیدا کی ہے","turkish":"De ki: \"Yaratıkların şerrinden, bastırdığı zaman karanlığın şerrinden, düğümlere nefes eden büyücülerin şerrinden, hased ettiği zaman hasedcilerin şerrinden, tan yerini ağartan Rabbe sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dari kejahatan (makhluk yang) Dia ciptakan,","french":"contre le mal des êtres qu’Il a créés,","german":"vor dem Übel dessen, was Er erschaffen hat,","bengali":"তিনি যা সৃষ্টি করেছেন উহার অনিষ্টতা হতে।","spanish":"de todo el mal que existe en lo que Él creó,","malay":"\"Dari bencana makhluk-makhluk yang Ia ciptakan;","bosnian":"od zla onoga što On stvara,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/113002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/113/2"}},{"verse_key":"113:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri ghasiqin ithawaqab","translations":{"sahih_international":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles","pickthall":"From the evil of the darkness when it is intense,","yusuf_ali":"From the mischief of Darkness as it overspreads;","urdu":"اور رات کی تاریکی کے شر سے جب کہ وہ چھا جائے،","turkish":"De ki: \"Yaratıkların şerrinden, bastırdığı zaman karanlığın şerrinden, düğümlere nefes eden büyücülerin şerrinden, hased ettiği zaman hasedcilerin şerrinden, tan yerini ağartan Rabbe sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dan dari kejahatan malam apabila telah gelap gulita,","french":"contre le mal de l’obscurité quand elle s’approfondit,","german":"und vor dem Übel der Dunkelheit, wenn sie zunimmt,","bengali":"অনিষ্টতা হতে রাতের, যখন ওটা অন্ধকারাচ্ছন্ন হয়।","spanish":"del mal de la oscuridad de la noche cuando se extiende,","malay":"\"Dan dari bahaya gelap apabila ia masuk;","bosnian":"i od zla mrkle noći kada razastre tmine,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/113003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/113/3"}},{"verse_key":"113:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَـٰتِ فِى ٱلْعُقَدِ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri annaffathatifee alAAuqad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots","pickthall":"And from the evil of malignant witchcraft,","yusuf_ali":"From the mischief of those who practise secret arts;","urdu":"اور گِرہوں میں پُھونکنے والوں (یا والیوں)کے شر سے،","turkish":"De ki: \"Yaratıkların şerrinden, bastırdığı zaman karanlığın şerrinden, düğümlere nefes eden büyücülerin şerrinden, hased ettiği zaman hasedcilerin şerrinden, tan yerini ağartan Rabbe sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dan dari kejahatan (perempuan-perempuan) penyihir yang meniup pada buhul-buhul (talinya),","french":"contre le mal de celles qui soufflent (les sorcières) sur les nœuds,","german":"und vor dem Übel der Knotenanbläserinnen","bengali":"এবং ঐ সব নারীর অনিষ্টতা হতে যারা গ্রন্থিতে ফুৎকার দেয়,","spanish":"del mal de las [hechiceras] sopladoras de nudos,","malay":"\"Dan dari kejahatan makhluk-makhluk yang menghembus-hembus pada simpulan-simpulan (dan ikatan-ikatan);","bosnian":"i od zla onih koje u čvorove pušu"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/113004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/113/4"}},{"verse_key":"113:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri hasidin itha hasad","translations":{"sahih_international":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies.\"","pickthall":"And from the evil of the envier when he envieth.","yusuf_ali":"And from the mischief of the envious one as he practises envy.","urdu":"اور حاسد کے شر سے جب کہ وہ حسد کرے۔","turkish":"De ki: \"Yaratıkların şerrinden, bastırdığı zaman karanlığın şerrinden, düğümlere nefes eden büyücülerin şerrinden, hased ettiği zaman hasedcilerin şerrinden, tan yerini ağartan Rabbe sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dan dari kejahatan orang yang dengki apabila dia dengki.\"","french":"et contre le mal de l’envieux quand il envie.\"","german":"und vor dem Übel eines (jeden) Neidenden, wenn er neidet.","bengali":"এবং অনিষ্টতা হতে হিংসুকের, যখন সে হিংসা করে।","spanish":"y del mal del envidioso cuando envidia”.","malay":"\"Dan dari kejahatan orang yang dengki apabila ia melakukan dengkinya\".","bosnian":"i od zla zavidljivca kad zavist ne krije!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/113005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/113/5"}}]}},{"number":114,"data":{"surah":{"number":114,"name_arabic":"الناس","name_english":"An-Nas","name_translation":"Mankind","revelation_place":"makkah","revelation_order":21,"verses_count":6,"bismillah_pre":true},"audio":[{"reciter_id":1,"reciter":"Mishary Rashid Alafasy","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/mishaari_raashid_al_3afaasee/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":2,"reciter":"Abdul Rahman Al-Sudais","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdurrahmaan_as-sudais/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":3,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_murattal/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":4,"reciter":"Abdul Basit Abdul Samad (Mujawwad)","style":"Mujawwad","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdul_basit_mujawwad/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":5,"reciter":"Maher Al Muaiqly","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/maher_al_muaiqly/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":6,"reciter":"Saad Al-Ghamdi","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":7,"reciter":"Hani Ar-Rifai","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/hani_ar-rifai/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":8,"reciter":"Abu Bakr Al Shatri","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":9,"reciter":"Yasser Al-Dosari","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":10,"reciter":"Saud Al-Shuraim","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3ood_al-shuraym/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":11,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Juhany","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdullaah_3awwaad_al-juhaynee/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":12,"reciter":"Bandar Baleela","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/bandar_baleela/complete/114.mp3"},{"reciter_id":13,"reciter":"Abdullah Al-Buajan","style":"Murattal","surah_audio":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/buajan/114.mp3"}],"total_verses":6,"verses":[{"verse_key":"114:1","ayah":1,"arabic":" قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi annas","translations":{"sahih_international":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind,","pickthall":"Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind,","yusuf_ali":"Say: I seek refuge with the Lord and Cherisher of Mankind,","urdu":"کہو، میں پناہ مانگتا ہوں انسانوں کے رب","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"Katakanlah, \"Aku berlindung kepada Tuhannya manusia,","french":"Dis : \"Je cherche protection auprès du Seigneur des hommes.","german":"Sag: Ich nehme Zuflucht beim Herrn der Menschen,","bengali":"বলঃ আমি আশ্রয় চাচ্ছি মানুষের রবের,","spanish":"Di: “Me refugio en el Señor de los seres humanos,","malay":"Katakanlah (wahai Muhammad): \"Aku berlindung kepada (Allah) Pemulihara sekalian manusia.","bosnian":"Reci: \"Tražim zaštitu Gospodara ljudi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114001.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/1"}},{"verse_key":"114:2","ayah":2,"arabic":"مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Maliki annas","translations":{"sahih_international":"The Sovereign of mankind,","pickthall":"The King of mankind,","yusuf_ali":"The King (or Ruler) of Mankind,","urdu":"انسانوں کے بادشاہ","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"Raja manusia,","french":"Le Souverain des hommes,","german":"dem König der Menschen,","bengali":"যিনি মানবমন্ডলীর বাদশাহ বা অধিপতি।","spanish":"en el Rey Soberano de los seres humanos,","malay":"\"Yang Menguasai sekalian manusia,","bosnian":"Vladara ljudi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114002.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/2"}},{"verse_key":"114:3","ayah":3,"arabic":"إِلَـٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Ilahi annas","translations":{"sahih_international":"The God of mankind,","pickthall":"The God of mankind,","yusuf_ali":"The God (or Judge) of Mankind","urdu":"انسانوں کے حقیقی معبُود کی","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"sembahan manusia,","french":"Dieu des hommes,","german":"dem Gott der Menschen,","bengali":"যিনি মানবমন্ডলীর উপাস্য।","spanish":"en el [único] Dios de los seres humanos,","malay":"\"Tuhan yang berhak disembah oleh sekalian manusia,","bosnian":"Boga ljudi,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114003.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/3"}},{"verse_key":"114:4","ayah":4,"arabic":"مِن شَرِّ ٱلْوَسْوَاسِ ٱلْخَنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Min sharri alwaswasi alkhannas","translations":{"sahih_international":"From the evil of the retreating whisperer -","pickthall":"From the evil of the sneaking whisperer,","yusuf_ali":"From the mischief of the Whisperer (of Evil), who withdraws (after his whisper),-","urdu":"اُس وسوسہ ڈالنے والے کے شر سے جو بار بار پلٹ کر آتا ہے،","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dari kejahatan (bisikan) setan yang bersembunyi,","french":"contre le mal du mauvais conseiller, furtif,","german":"vor dem Übel des Einflüsterers, des Davonschleichers,","bengali":"আত্মগোপনকারী কু-মন্ত্রণাদাতার অনিষ্টতা হতে।","spanish":"de la maldad del [demonio] susurrador que huye [cuando el nombre de Dios es mencionado],","malay":"\"Dari kejahatan pembisik penghasut yang timbul tenggelam, -","bosnian":"od zla šejtana-napasnika,"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114004.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/4"}},{"verse_key":"114:5","ayah":5,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى يُوَسْوِسُ فِى صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Allathee yuwaswisu fee sudoori annas","translations":{"sahih_international":"Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind -","pickthall":"Who whispereth in the hearts of mankind,","yusuf_ali":"(The same) who whispers into the hearts of Mankind,-","urdu":"جو لوگوں کے دلوں میں وسوسے ڈالتا ہے","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"yang membisikkan (kejahatan) ke dalam dada manusia,","french":"qui insuffle des mauvaises pensées dans les poitrines des hommes,","german":"der in die Brüste der Menschen einflüstert,","bengali":"যে কু-মন্ত্রণা দেয় মানুষের অন্তরে,","spanish":"que susurra en los corazones de los seres humanos,","malay":"\"Yang melemparkan bisikan dan hasutannya ke dalam hati manusia, -","bosnian":"koji zle misli unosi u srca ljudi –"},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114005.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/5"}},{"verse_key":"114:6","ayah":6,"arabic":"مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"Mina aljinnati wannas","translations":{"sahih_international":"From among the jinn and mankind\".","pickthall":"Of the jinn and of mankind.","yusuf_ali":"Among Jinns and among men.","urdu":"خواہ وہ جِنّوں میں سے ہو یا انسانوں میں سے۔","turkish":"De ki: \"İnsanlardan ve cinlerden ve insanların gönüllerine vesvese veren o sinsi vesvesecinin şerrinden, insanların Tanrısı, insanların Hükümranı ve insanların Rabbi olan Allah'a sığınırım.\"","indonesian":"dari (golongan) jin dan manusia.\"","french":"qu’il (le conseiller) soit un djinn, ou un être humain\".","german":"von den Ginn und den Menschen.","bengali":"জিনের মধ্য হতে অথবা মানুষের মধ্য হতে।","spanish":"y existe entre los yinn y entre los seres humanos”.","malay":"\"(Iaitu pembisik dan penghasut) dari kalangan jin dan manusia\".","bosnian":"od džina i od ljudi!\""},"audio":{"ayah_audio":"https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/114006.mp3","all_reciters":"/api/quran/audio/114/6"}}]}}]}